(35, 'Luxury on Waves 🌅', 23, 'A power-packed jet ski ride near Burj Al Arab — bold, stylish, and full of summer energy.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic cinematic of a couple driving a jet ski near Burj Al Arab, sea splashing around them the men is sitting behind the women\r\nThe girl wears a Fendi sporty swimsuit, Prada life vest, and a Louis Vuitton waterproof sling bag.the men is wearing a sando blie with black short\r\nThe sun glows on the water as they smiles confidently.\r\nThe mood is energized, daring, and high-end sporty.\r\n–style ultra-realistic lighting daylight –mood bold and fun –texture water and light –ar 3:2 –high resolution\r\nMake it real face the photo uploaded.dont change the face and hairstyle\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity, proper padding, and an elegant, unobtrusive design that complements the overall aesthetic without distraction.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761731604_d9a3860dedf3.png', NULL, '[\"AIArt\",\"GeminiAI\",\"PicPose\",\"LuxuryVibes\",\"JetSkiLife\",\"BurjAlArab\",\"CinematicEdit\",\"AIPhoto\",\"GeminiPrompt\",\"HighEndStyle\",\"SummerEnergy\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"BoldAndFun\",\"FashionAdventure\",\"LuxuryLifestyle\",\"AIEditor\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-29 09:53:24', NULL, 0, 1),
(36, 'agical Christmas Portrait: Love, Style & Winter Glow ❄️', 23, 'A joyful, fashion-forward winter fantasy featuring a young couple on a rustic sled surrounded by glowing Christmas trees and snowy charm. Styled with elegance — her red dress and his Santa outfit bring warmth, romance, and festive spirit to a dreamlike snowy night.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Using the attached image as a reference, replicate the face of the couple with long, semi-wavy black hair to create a professional camera photograph:\r\nThis is a very joyful and stylized portrait, set in a fantasy winter or Christmas-themed scene.\r\nSubject: The central focus is a young cpuple sitting on a wooden sled. They poses with a big smile, looking directly at the camera, conveying happiness and confidence.\r\nOutfit: the girl wears an elegant and modern short red dress. The dress has an off-the-shoulder neckline and long puffed sleeves, giving it a trendy look. She completes the outfit with knee-high leather boots with thick heels.the men is wearing sa red Santa outfit\r\nAccessories & Details: the girl wears delicate gold necklaces, and her nails are painted a vibrant pink, adding a pop of color to her red outfit.\r\nSetting & Decorations: The environment is a professional photo studio designed to simulate a magical snowy landscape.\r\n• Sled: they seated on a two rustic, vintage-style wooden sled.\r\n• Snow & Background: The floor is fully covered in artificial snow. The background is a mural depicting a winter night scene with a large full moon.\r\n• Christmas Trees: Surrounding her are several white or “flocked” Christmas trees, decorated with warm string lights that add a cozy glow to the scene.\r\n• Other Elements: Near the sled are a white lantern and pinecones, enhancing the rustic winter aesthetic.\r\nLighting & Atmosphere: The lighting is bright and professional, highlighting the subject. The lights on the trees create a festive and magical ambiance. The contrast between her black dress and the predominantly white set makes her stand out even more.\r\nSummary: This is a carefully produced Christmas portrait that combines chic fashion style with a whimsical winter fairy-tale setting, resulting in a joyful and visually appealing image.dont change the face and hairstyle\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity, proper padding, and an elegant, unobtrusive design that complements the overall aesthetic without distraction.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761731908_adcb098265c1.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CouplePhotography\",\"ChristmasVibes\",\"SnowyAesthetic\",\"EditorialShoot\",\"DigitalArt\",\"GeminiPrompt\",\"FestiveMood\",\"StudioPhotography\",\"WinterWonderland\",\"CreativePortrait\",\"AestheticEdit\",\"FashionInWinter\",\"AIPhoto\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-29 09:58:28', NULL, 1, 2),
(37, 'Magic of Childhood ✨', 19, 'A whimsical, ultra-realistic 8K portrait of a joyful 1½-year-old surrounded by plush friends and warm sunlight.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra high-resolution, hyper-realistic yet whimsical portrait of a 1½-year-old boy sitting and playing joyfully among a delightful collection of plush stuffed animals — soft elephants, bears, piglets, puppies, kittens, lions, and tigers arranged playfully around him. At his side stands a giant oversized teddy giraffe, towering gently above, adding a sense of wonder and fantasy.\r\nThe little boy has chubby cheeks, bright expressive eyes, and a soft gentle smile that radiates innocence. He wears a cobalt-blue denim jacket, a crisp white Nike T-shirt with the classic swoosh logo, light blue jeans, and tiny matching Nike sneakers. His hair is short and slightly tousled, giving him a natural, lively baby charm.\r\nThe environment is dreamy and softly lit — warm diffused sunlight filtering through a nursery-like background with pastel walls, fluffy rug, and a cozy wooden floor. The composition captures a magical sense of childhood discovery.\r\nCinematic lighting and shallow depth of field, creamy bokeh in the background, and subtle floating dust motes give the image an ethereal, storybook tone. Every plush toy has detailed fabric texture and soft highlights, while the boy’s skin and outfit look naturally tactile and true to life.\r\nStyle references: Annie Leibovitz children’s fantasy portrait meets Pixar-level charm.\r\nColor palette: soft warm tones, gentle contrast, pastel blues and golden sunlight.\r\nRender in 8K Ultra HD, hyper-detailed, photorealistic yet whimsical aesthetic — perfectly balanced between realism and dreamlike imagination.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761732254_031940657cfa.png', NULL, '[\"AIArt\",\"GeminiAI\",\"PicPose\",\"WhimsicalPortrait\",\"ChildPhotography\",\"FantasyArt\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"DreamyVisuals\",\"PixarVibes\",\"AnnieLeibovitzInspired\",\"8KResolution\",\"PhotoRealistic\",\"DigitalArt\",\"AIPhoto\",\"GeminiPrompt\",\"MagicalChildhood\",\"CreativePhotography\",\"SoftTones\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 1, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-29 10:04:14', NULL, 0, 1),
(38, '🐻 Magical Birthday Moment with Bear', 19, '🎂 A joyful 5-year-old boy celebrating his special day in a dreamy forest with his big furry friend.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an 8K ultra-photorealistic birthday portrait of a 5-year-old boy, keeping his exact facial features from the uploaded photo — including his expressive eyes, natural smile, and unique face shape.\r\nHe radiates pure happiness and playful excitement, wearing a blue Masha & the Bear–inspired outfit — a soft light-blue smock-style shirt with rolled sleeves, denim overalls, and a cute blue cap slightly tilted for a charming, carefree look.\r\n\r\nIn one hand, he holds a bright, colorful lollipop, gazing directly at the viewer with a big, joyful grin and sparkling eyes full of wonder.\r\nBeside him stands a hyper-realistic Bear from Masha and the Bear, smiling warmly while holding a honey jar wrapped with a golden ribbon — a perfect birthday gift.\r\n\r\nIn front of them sits a rustic wooden table filled with a two-tier blue-and-white frosted cake topped with a glowing number “5” candle, surrounded by cupcakes, fruit baskets, and wrapped presents at the Bear’s feet.\r\nA shiny metallic blue “5” balloon floats in the background, with forest-themed party banners and decorations adding to the festive feel.\r\n\r\nThe scene takes place in a sunlit forest clearing near Bear’s cozy log cabin, glowing with soft golden-hour light (3000K). Sun rays filter through the trees, creating dreamy rim lighting and gentle shadows on the boy and Bear.\r\n\r\nShot with an 85mm portrait lens, f/1.8 aperture, capturing a shallow depth of field — the boy and Bear in crisp focus, background softly blurred. Every texture — the Bear’s fur, frosting details, wood grain, and the boy’s eyes — appears in hyper-detailed 8K clarity.\r\n\r\nMood: Bright, heartwarming, nostalgic, and full of childhood magic — evoking innocence, joy, and wonder.\r\n\r\nBranding: Add a subtle “PicPose” seal or logo at the bottom-left corner, neatly aligned and padded. ', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761732500_0fb73db2b839.jpg', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"BirthdayMagic\",\"MashaAndTheBear\",\"8KPortrait\",\"ChildhoodWonder\",\"CuteBoy\",\"BirthdayJoy\",\"PhotoRealisticArt\",\"PicPoseKids\",\"FantasyPortrait\",\"DreamyLighting\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 1, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-29 10:08:20', NULL, 1, 3),
(39, 'Festive Glow: A Christmas Moment ✨', 19, 'A warm, nostalgic holiday scene — a young man smiling as he decorates the Christmas tree under golden fairy lights.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'The boy is standing beside a tall Christmas tree, reaching up to hang a golden ornament with both hands.\r\nHe looks toward the camera mid smile, with fairy lights glowing softly around him.\r\nOutfit: green sweater vest over a white shirt, red bowtie, khaki pants, and brown boots.\r\nProps: presents, garland, glowing bokeh lights in background.\r\nLighting: warm golden fairy lights, natural contrast.\r\nMood: festive, nostalgic, and heartwarming.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761732665_23cb6d10135a.png', NULL, '[\"AIArt\",\"GeminiAI\",\"PicPose\",\"ChristmasMagic\",\"FestiveVibes\",\"HolidayGlow\",\"AIPhoto\",\"GeminiPrompt\",\"WarmLights\",\"DigitalArt\",\"HolidayMood\",\"AestheticEdit\",\"ChristmasSpirit\",\"HeartwarmingScene\",\"AIeditor\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-29 10:11:05', NULL, 0, 2),
(40, 'Little Legend: Power Meets Confidence 🐾', 19, 'A cinematic portrait of a fearless 3-year-old standing tall among loyal canine companions — styled in Nike streetwear and framed with bold, dramatic lighting for a high-end campaign look.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A powerful cinematic portrait of a confident 3 year old kid standing in the center, wearing a white Nike t-shirt, black joggers, and Kobe 6 off white sneakers. He is surrounded by a group of dogs of different breeds: a giant Tibetan Mastiff, a Husky, a Rottweiler, two Golden Retrievers (one with its paw resting on his leg), a Doberman, and a tiny French Bulldog puppy near his feet. The background has a dramatic gradient lighting split into warm orange on the left and cool blue on the right, creating a studio poster effect. The overall look is sharp, modern, and vibrant, resembling a high-end sportswear campaign poster.\r\n\r\nAlso add a very small text overlay for branding of \"PicPose\" at the top and right corner with minimum 80 pixels padding or margin from top and right', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761733002_41e69c13f21c.jpg', NULL, '[\"AIArt\",\"GeminiAI\",\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"DigitalArt\",\"AIPhotography\",\"SportswearStyle\",\"NikeKids\",\"LittleLegend\",\"CreativePhotography\",\"HighEndEdit\",\"GeminiPrompt\",\"StudioPoster\",\"PhotoComposition\",\"ModernAesthetic\",\"AIInspiration\",\"PowerfulVisuals\",\"DogLovers\",\"UrbanPhotography\",\"FashionEdit\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 1, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-29 10:16:42', NULL, 0, 8),
(41, 'Cinematic Crossover: Real Meets Mario World 🌈', 20, 'An ultra-realistic 8K masterpiece blending reality and fantasy — a serene moment on a rocky meadow shared between a real-world soul, Princess Peach, Bowser, Mario, and Luigi. Vivid colors, cinematic lighting, and timeless friendship vibes\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic 8K cinematic scene featuring the uploaded person exactly as they look, wearing a red hoodie and beige cargo pants, relaxing on a natural rock with small patches of grass and tiny, colorful wildflowers.\r\n\r\nPrincess Peach (3D) sits next to them, smiling and relaxed, clearly showing best-friend vibes.\r\nBowser (3D) stands slightly taller behind them, looking menacing but not overshadowing the scene.\r\nMario and Luigi (3D) are also visible in the background, adding depth and fun to the scene.\r\n\r\nLighting & Style: Bright lighting, vibrant colors, cinematic ultra-realistic rendering, detailed textures, natural shadows, realistic environment.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting. ', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761735468_b2cc2c8f59c6.png', NULL, '[\"AIArt\",\"GeminiAI\",\"PicPose\",\"CinematicRender\",\"8KUltraRealistic\",\"MarioUniverse\",\"PrincessPeach\",\"Bowser\",\"MarioAndLuigi\",\"FantasyCrossover\",\"DigitalArt\",\"AestheticEdit\",\"RealisticScene\",\"PhotoEditing\",\"AIPhoto\",\"GeminiPrompt\",\"CreativeShot\",\"VibrantVisuals\",\"AIInspiration\",\"CinematicVibes\",\"RealAndFantasy\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 1, 1, '2025-10-29 10:57:48', NULL, 0, 7),
(42, 'Battle of Cravings: The Girl, The Lion & The Lay’s 🍟', 20, 'An ultra-realistic 8K cinematic portrait capturing a dramatic tug-of-war between man and lion — bound by hunger, humor, and golden temptation. Styled in vibrant yellow, shot with a fisheye lens, and lit to perfection for a surreal yet powerful storytelling effect.', 'Create an ultra-realistic 8K portrait-format photo in fisheye perspective, perfectly preserving my original face, skin tone, hairstyle, beard, and expression (no facial modifications).\r\n\r\nI’m wearing a crisp white shirt layered under a vibrant yellow tailored suit, extending my arm dramatically toward a packet of Lay’s India – Classic Salted chips placed on a wooden dining table.\r\n\r\nBehind me, a majestic yellow lion — equally fierce yet playful — tugs from the opposite side of the frame, both of us caught in a dynamic tug-of-war over the golden chips.\r\nOur faces show strong emotion, humor, and hunger, emphasizing the power of craving in a cinematic, storytelling tone.\r\n\r\nThe setting is a stylized, minimalist forest with soft, diffused sunlight filtering through sleek, artistic tree silhouettes.\r\nCamera angle: a low-edge shot from the table’s corner, accentuating depth and energy.\r\nLighting is bright, soft, and cinematic, ensuring vivid textures of the chips, suit fabric, and lion’s fur.\r\n\r\nAdd a PicPose seal at the bottom-left corner with clean padding for branding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761735994_051ca4cc3b52.png', NULL, '[\"AIArt\",\"GeminiAI\",\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"8KPhotography\",\"FisheyeLens\",\"AIRealism\",\"StorytellingArt\",\"CreativePhotography\",\"DigitalArt\",\"AIPhoto\",\"GeminiPrompt\",\"EpicShot\",\"Lay’sIndia\",\"BattleOfCravings\",\"YellowAesthetic\",\"ModernArt\",\"VisualStorytelling\",\"FashionInFocus\",\"AIInspiration\",\"SurrealEdit\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-29 11:06:34', NULL, 0, 1),
(43, 'Magical Moments at Disneyland: A Dream Come True ✨', 20, 'An ultra-realistic portrait of an 8-year-old girl surrounded by beloved Disney characters — Mickey, Minnie, Donald, Goofy, and Pluto — captured in a glowing Disneyland scene filled with fireworks, joy, and childhood wonder.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'An ultra-realistic photograph captures a happy portrait of a 8-year-old girl in the photo surrounded by Disney characters Mickey Mouse, Minnie Mouse, Donald Duck, Pluto, and Goofy (in their iconic dress) The girl with the same looks and smile in the inserted photo is positioned in the middle, looking natural and 100% real as in the reference photo. She is wearing a denim jacket, denim pants, wearing a white shoes. The background depicts a realistic Disneyland setting with vibrant Disney fireworks illuminating the sky above a grand castle. The lighting is soft and magical, enhancing the joyful atmosphere.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761736250_2ed7de750de9.jpg', NULL, '[\"AIArt\",\"GeminiAI\",\"DisneyMagic\",\"DisneylandVibes\",\"PicPose\",\"AestheticEdit\",\"DreamComeTrue\",\"AIPhoto\",\"GeminiPrompt\",\"MagicalMoments\",\"DisneyCharacters\",\"DigitalPortrait\",\"FantasyArt\",\"PhotoEditing\",\"ChildhoodDreams\",\"WholesomeArt\",\"CreativePhotography\",\"AIInspiration\",\"DisneyPhotography\",\"MagicalEdit\",\"PicPoseBrand\",\"RealisticAI\",\"VibrantVisuals\",\"8KRealism\",\"AIEditor\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 1, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-29 11:10:50', NULL, 0, 1),
(44, 'The Dragon Rider of Eldoria: Rise of the Elven Warrior 🐉', 31, 'An epic, hyperrealistic fusion of The Lord of the Rings and Eragon — showcasing a fierce elf with the soul of a warrior, riding a colossal, dark-scaled dragon through realms of fire and legend. Every detail tells a story of power, destiny, and cinematic grandeur.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Epic, cinematic, and hyperrealistic image — a fusion between The Lord of the Rings and Eragon. A dynamic close-up of the person from the reference photo (keep all facial features exactly as in the reference), now transformed into an elf with pointed ears and an intense gaze, riding with mastery and ferocity atop a colossal dragon with dark scales and twisted horns, its size and wingspan comparable to Balerion the Black Dread.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761802753_3a2e1915b843.png', NULL, '[\"AIArt\",\"GeminiAI\",\"PicPose\",\"FantasyPortrait\",\"ElvenRider\",\"CinematicArt\",\"8KRender\",\"AIPhoto\",\"GeminiPrompt\",\"MysticForest\",\"EpicFantasy\",\"AIEditor\",\"DigitalArt\",\"VisualMasterpiece\",\"fantasyworld\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 05:39:13', NULL, 0, 0),
(45, 'Ride of Laughter & Adventure 🌤️', 31, 'A joyful man riding a cartoon-style rabbit across a sunny field — pure fun, motion, and laughter captured in one frame.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A joyful man with a salt-and-pepper beard and dark hair is depicted mid-ride on the back of a large, cartoon-style rabbit. Both the man and the rabbit have wide-open mouths, conveying extreme excitement and laughter. The man is dressed in a dark blue short-sleeved shirt and green pants, with dark sneakers. His arms are bent at the elbows, holding onto the rabbit, and his eyes are wide with exhilaration.\r\n​The wolf has exaggerated, comical features, including very large, round white eyes with small black pupils, prominent eyebrows, and a huge, pink tongue hanging out of its mouth. Its fur is a mix of brown and tan, and it has large, pointed ears. The rabbit\'s legs are in mid-stride, suggesting rapid motion.\r\n​They are outdoors in what appears to be a sunny field under a blue sky with fluffy white clouds. The foreground shows a dirt path with hints of green grass and small yellow flowers, indicating motion blur as if they are speeding along. There are a few leaves or debris flying in the air around them, further emphasizing the sense of movement. In the background, green trees and more fields are visible under the bright sky. The overall impression is one of unbridled fun and adventure.\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity, proper padding, and an elegant, unobtrusive design that complements the overall aesthetic without distraction.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761802814_cc79f2da2977.png', NULL, '[\"AIArt\",\"PicPose\",\"CartoonAdventure\",\"FunEdit\",\"GeminiPrompt\",\"DigitalArt\",\"JoyfulVibes\",\"CreativeIllustration\",\"FantasyScene\",\"WhimsicalArt\",\"OutdoorAdventure\",\"AIPhoto\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 05:40:14', NULL, 0, 0),
(46, 'Tiny Terror: The Chase Within the Giant House 🐭', 31, 'A hyper-realistic, cinematic depiction of a six-inch man fleeing for his life across a colossal wooden floor, pursued by a monstrous house mouse — captured in breathtaking 8K realism and dramatic lighting. A visual masterpiece blending scale, fear, and storytelling through lens-perfect detail.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A breathtaking, hyper-realistic, cinematic shot captured at a terrifying scale.\r\nA tiny man, appearing no more than six inches tall, is captured mid-stride, desperately scrambling across the massive, glossy dark wood floor of a gigantic house. He is dressed in simple casual wear a slightly torn red t-shirt and faded jeans—conveying vulnerability. His face, which must be rendered using the provided photo reference, is a mask of pure, sweat-drenched terror and exhaustion.\r\nHe is being relentlessly pursued by a colossal, terrifyingly giant house white mouse. The mouse is captured in motion, its massive pink paws barely inches from the man. Its beady black eyes reflect the ambient light, and its long, dark whiskers quiver with predatory focus.\r\nThe scene is dominated by the terrifying scale of the domestic environment: the man is running past the base of a massive, intricately carved wooden table leg, and the deep, dusty grain of the floorboards appears like canyons beneath him.\r\nCinematography & Style: Shot at a low-angle, eye-level perspective relative to the tiny man, creating a dramatic, immersive viewpoint. Use hard, dramatic cinematic lighting with deep shadows cast by the colossal furniture and the mouse itself. Ultra-detailed, photorealistic, 8K.\r\nCamera Specification: Shot on a Canon EOS camera with a 50mm prime lens, emphasizing realistic depth of field and sharp focus on the man and the approaching mouse.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity, proper padding, and an elegant, unobtrusive design that complements the overall aesthetic without distraction.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761803263_33b778dfd954.png', NULL, '[\"AIArt\",\"GeminiAI\",\"PicPose\",\"MiniWorld\",\"CinematicShot\",\"PhotoRealism\",\"TinyAdventure\",\"CreativePhotography\",\"DigitalArt\",\"HyperDetailed\",\"ToyCarScene\",\"CatChase\",\"MacroPhotography\",\"AIPhoto\",\"GeminiPrompt\",\"DynamicLighting\",\"ActionShot\",\"VFXStyle\",\"MiniatureWorld\",\"EpicChases\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 05:47:43', NULL, 0, 1),
(47, 'The Rose Within 🌹', 18, 'A surreal portrait of calm introspection — a figure emerging gracefully from a blooming red rose.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A surreal and poetic conceptual artwork depicting a person with the facial features of the provided image, dressed in deep red garments, sitting pensively nestled inside a giant, open rosebud. The figure’s posture is calm and introspective, with their head slightly bowed and hands resting gently on their knees, appearing to emerge from within the petals. Their loose, layered outfit flows naturally with soft folds, matching the rich red tones of the rose surrounding them.\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761803893_d9c825f6157d.png', NULL, '[\"AIArt\",\"SurrealPortrait\",\"ConceptualArt\",\"PicPose\",\"DigitalArt\",\"GeminiPrompt\",\"PoeticVisuals\",\"ArtisticExpression\",\"RedAesthetic\",\"ElegantDesign\",\"AIPhoto\",\"DreamyVibes\",\"VisualArt\",\"CreativeConcept\",\"therosewithin\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 05:58:13', NULL, 0, 0),
(48, 'The Little Pharaoh: Majesty in Miniature ✨', 19, 'A smiling young boy reigns over an ancient Egyptian temple — seated on a golden throne with blue wings and cobra crest, captured in ultra-realistic 8K cinematic detail.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A smiling little boy, dressed as a pharaoh or ancient Egyptian king, sits on a majestic golden throne. The throne has large wings decorated in blue and gold, and is surmounted by a cobra. The boy wears a gold and blue Egyptian costume, a large beaded collar, and a pharaonic crown/headband. The backdrop is an ancient Egyptian temple, its walls adorned with hieroglyphs and burning torches creating a dramatic lighting effect. The lighting is ultra-high-definition, 8K cinematic.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761804433_2be0fc98c356.png', NULL, '[\"AIArt\",\"GeminiAI\",\"PicPose\",\"EgyptianArt\",\"PharaohVibes\",\"AncientEgypt\",\"AIPhotography\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"DigitalArt\",\"AestheticEdit\",\"CreativePhotography\",\"AIPhoto\",\"GeminiPrompt\",\"RoyalPortrait\",\"HistoricalAesthetic\",\"8KResolution\",\"FantasyArt\",\"ArtisticVision\",\"CulturalEdit\",\"PhotoComposition\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 06:07:13', NULL, 0, 1),
(49, '🎀 Dreamy Birthday Portrait', 20, '🎈 Celebrate innocence and charm in soft pink cinematic vibes ✨\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an ultra-realistic, cinematic film portrait of a little girl, preserving her exact facial features from the uploaded photo. She is seated on a pastel-colored chair surrounded by a soft cloud of balloons in complementary pastel shades. She wears a pink ruffled dress and elegant white boots with pink laces, combining charm and elegance. Her long wavy black hair is adorned with delicate pink butterflies, enhancing the dreamy, whimsical vibe.\r\nIn her hand, she holds a large golden “7” shaped birthday balloon that glows subtly, reflecting light from the surrounding pastel balloons. Lighting is soft and professional, in the style of high-end fashion photography, with vibrant pink tones that enhance the magical and joyful atmosphere. The composition should feel balanced, playful, and cinematic, emphasizing textures, fabric details, and the cheerful environment.\r\nAdd a small text overlay for branding of “PicPose” at the top-right corner with at least 80 pixels padding from top and right. Aspect ratio 9:16 vertical cinematic framing.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761804546_0edc5fbd03c2.jpg', NULL, '[\"BirthdayPortrait\",\"LittlePrincess\",\"PicPose\",\"AIPhotoEdits\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"DreamyVibes\",\"FashionPhotography\",\"AIPhotography\",\"CutePortrait\",\"AIPoses\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 06:09:06', NULL, 0, 11),
(50, 'The Digital Awakening ⚙️', 32, 'An ultra-realistic 8K cinematic still of a glowing humanoid standing on a microchip — where life meets technology.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic 8K close-up film still of a futuristic humanoid man translucent and glowing with intricate circuit patterns visible beneath its skin, standing centered on a luminous microchip. The man, reflective eyes gaze forward with a sense of wonder and apprehension. The surrounding motherboard is alive with intricate, illuminated pathways and glowing data streams, depicting a complex digital landscape. Focus on extreme detail: the texture of the child\'s translucent skin, the microscopic connections on the chip, the subtle light reflections on metallic surfaces. The depth of field is shallow, emphasizing the man and its immediate platform, with a soft bokeh in the background revealing an expansive, highly complex server room environment. Cinematic lighting, dramatic shadows, no 3D rendering, no cartoon style, purely photographic realism, captured with a high-end cinema camera.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity, proper padding, and an elegant, unobtrusive design that complements the overall aesthetic without distraction.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761804714_9391bd97f35b.png', NULL, '[\"AIArt\",\"PicPose\",\"CinematicRealism\",\"FuturisticVision\",\"DigitalHuman\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"8KPhotography\",\"AIPhoto\",\"GeminiPrompt\",\"TechAesthetic\",\"SciFiArt\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"GlowingCircuit\",\"AIInspiration\",\"ModernFuturism\",\"CyberVisuals\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 06:11:54', NULL, 0, 0),
(51, 'Celestial Glow: The Luminous Queen ✨', 18, 'A mesmerizing portrait of a woman in a glowing, star-lit gown — elegance, grace, and magic in one radiant frame.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Use the facial feature in the attached image. A breathtaking portrait features a woman with  striking features, looking directly at the viewer with a confident and serene expression. Her brown and blonde wavy hair is styled in neatly that frames her face elegantly. Her makeup is subtle yet luminous, with a focus on glowing skin, defined brows, and soft, glossy lips.\r\nShe is wearing an extraordinary, strapless ball gown that appears to be made of sheer, sparkling fabric, possibly tulle or organza, heavily embellished with glitter that create an iridescent effect. The most magical aspect of the dress is that it is internally lit with numerous small, warm-toned lights, making it glow from within and creating a magical, starry effect on her entire skirt. Delicate, ruffled off-the-shoulder sleeves add to the ethereal charm. :Zi24:\r\nThe background is a soft, dark, blurred setting, possibly a night sky or a dark room, which allows the brilliant glow of her dress to stand out dramatically. Scattered around her in the background are numerous bokeh lights or floating luminous particles, reinforcing the magical and celebratory atmosphere. The lighting is primarily emanating from her dress, casting a warm glow on her skin and creating a truly captivating visual. The overall impression is one of grandeur, celestial beauty, and luminous magic, as if she is embodying a constellation. Rendered in 8k resolution.\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761804798_5433bf435c17.png', NULL, '[\"AIArt\",\"PicPose\",\"LuminousPortrait\",\"CelestialBeauty\",\"GlowDress\",\"GeminiPrompt\",\"EtherealVibes\",\"8KArt\",\"DigitalGoddess\",\"ElegantStyle\",\"StarryMagic\",\"AIPhoto\",\"FantasyFashion\",\"DreamyAesthetics\",\"VisualArt\",\"RadiantCharm\",\"cinematicportrait\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 06:13:18', NULL, 0, 0),
(52, 'Whispers of the Bioluminescent Forest ✨', 33, 'A dark princess sits by a mystical clock, surrounded by glowing spores and ethereal creatures — where fantasy meets alien elegance.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', ' Photorealistic group selfie in New York with [user\'s uploaded image] holding up a smartphone to take the photo. Surrounding him are the Marvel Heroes-\r\nDaredevil woman, Deadpool woman, Hulk, wonderwoman, and lronwoman-all smiling and casually posing like friends. The selfie has a fun, happy vibe, with everyone close together in the frame, some characters playfully leaning on each other. Bright daylight, cinematic quality, natural colors, high detail.\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity, proper padding, and an elegant, unobtrusive design that complements the overall aesthetic without distraction.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761804989_d691831b8138.png', NULL, '[\"AIArt\",\"PicPose\",\"DarkFantasy\",\"MysticalPortrait\",\"FantasyArt\",\"GeminiPrompt\",\"BioluminescentBeauty\",\"DigitalFantasy\",\"EtherealVibes\",\"AlienJungle\",\"FantasyAesthetic\",\"SurrealArt\",\"AIPhoto\",\"MagicalRealism\",\"VisualWonder\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 1, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 06:16:29', NULL, 1, 5),
(53, 'Street Style Meets Pokémon Magic ✨', 33, 'A cinematic street-style portrait of a man among giant Pokémon — Pikachu, Lucario, and Greninja — keeping the face real and natural.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a photo of me without changing my real face. A man. Wearing a Blue ash jacket, cargo jeans, a red Casio watch, and white shoes. Create a candid street-style photo, referencing the original portrait to create a 100% cinematic look. The real man is stend among the giant pokemon,small pikachu, a giant lucario, and a giant greninja. Surreal, whimsical, bright, editorial vibes, natural neutral lighting.\r\nAdd a small “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner, with clean, balanced padding and subtle opacity for a professional branded finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761805305_67787572c3a1.png', NULL, '[\"AIArt\",\"PicPose\",\"StreetStyle\",\"PokemonCrossover\",\"CinematicPhoto\",\"GeminiPrompt\",\"SurrealArt\",\"EditorialVibes\",\"DigitalArt\",\"WhimsicalScene\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"AIPhoto\",\"ModernPortrait\",\"FantasyMeetsReality\",\"creativephotography\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 06:21:45', NULL, 0, 2),
(54, 'Run of Magic: The Banana Chase ✨', 18, 'A cinematic 9:16 portrait of a young Asian woman running through a vast banana field — smiling faintly as a banana monster chases her in a magical world.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt', 'Create an ultra-realistic and cinematic photo with a 9:16 ratio. A young Asian woman with white skin (use the uploaded photo), 160 cm tall and 60 kg, 20 years old, long black and purple hair, wearing a jacket, a long-sleeved white, trousers, and shoes. She smiles faintly at the camera and runs while holding a banana, with a vast banana field in the background and a banana monster chasing her, creating a magical atmosphere.\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761805433_7dda3599d7c1.png', NULL, '[\"AIArt\",\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"FantasyEdit\",\"BananaField\",\"GeminiPrompt\",\"MagicalScene\",\"AIPhoto\",\"DigitalArt\",\"CreativePhotography\",\"AdventureVibes\",\"SurrealVisuals\",\"FantasyWorld\",\"RunningShot\",\"VisualStorytelling\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 06:23:53', NULL, 0, 0),
(55, 'Elegant White & Gold Wedding Invitation — Modern Romance in Watercolor Style', 25, 'Create a stunning AI-generated wedding invitation featuring Daniel & Olivia — a blend of elegance, modern minimalism, and soft blue floral charm. Perfect for couples seeking timeless sophistication.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an invitation card with Here\'s a description of the invitation card, based on the elements you requested: 1. CARD STYLE & THEME:  Overall design style: The card presents a blend of elegant and modern styles. It is clean and sophisticated, with a touch of romanticism.  Color scheme: The main colors are white and gold, with accents of blue and muted tones. The background is a textured white that resembles watercolor paper. Gold is used as accents and detailing. Blue hues are used in the flowers.  Theme: The card is designed for a wedding. 2. LAYOUT & COMPOSITION:  The elements are mostly centered. The photo is at the top, with the text block centered below.  The visual hierarchy prioritizes the couple\'s names, followed by the invitation text and then the date/time details. The photo is a very important element of the design  The card is balanced with floral elements in both the upper-left and lower-right corners. There is enough spacing between elements to give the design a clean and uncluttered feel. 3. TEXT ELEMENTS: * ★Daniel & Olivia★ at the center and top of the card, written in a large, elegant, golden script font. * ★Request the pleasure of your company at the ceremony of their wedding★, centered below the names, in a simple, modern serif font, black color. * ★MARCH★, centered below the previous text, in a bold sans-serif font and black color. * ★SUNDAY★, left-aligned and below a decorative line, in a small, sans-serif font and black color. * ★27★, centered between decorative lines and below the previous text, in a larger, bolder serif font and black color. * ★09:00 AM★, right-aligned and below a decorative line, in a small, sans-serif font and black color. * ★2024★, centered below the number \"27\", in a smaller, sans-serif font and black color. * ★123 Anywhere ST., Any City★, centered at the bottom of the card in a standard, smaller serif font, black color. 4. DECORATIVE ELEMENTS:  The card has a thin, rectangular gold frame with rounded corners. Also, gold speckles are all over the card with subtle curves.  Watercolor-style blue floral arrangements decorate the upper-left and lower-right corners of the card, adding a touch of nature and color.  There are small, thin horizontal lines underlining the date details. 5. CHARACTER/COUPLE STYLE:  Real photo style: A realistic photograph of the couple is placed at the top of the card inside a white circle. The man is kissing the woman on the forehead.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity, proper padding, and an elegant, unobtrusive design that complements the overall aesthetic without distraction.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761806052_55d2c84a52ef.png', NULL, '[\"weddinginvitation\",\"AIart\",\"GeminiAI\",\"AIdesign\",\"invitationdesign\",\"weddingcard\",\"modernwedding\",\"elegantdesign\",\"digitalart\",\"creativeinvites\",\"PicPose\",\"weddinginspo\",\"aestheticdesign\",\"weddingstyle\",\"AIcreations\",\"floralinvitation\",\"romanticdesign\",\"whiteandgold\",\"AIgraphics\",\"AIgeneratedart\",\"invitationideas\",\"designinspiration\",\"bluefloral\",\"watercolorart\",\"wedding2024\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 06:34:12', NULL, 0, 0),
(56, 'Elegant Indian Wedding Invitation Card with Royal Burgundy Theme 💍', 25, 'A beautifully crafted traditional wedding invitation featuring deep burgundy tones, gold accents, floral decor, and ornate lanterns — symbolizing grace, culture, and timeless love.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an invitation card with This invitation card exudes an elegant, traditional aesthetic suitable for a wedding or similar formal event. 1. CARD STYLE & THEME: - The overall design style is traditional with Indian influences. - The color scheme is dominated by a deep burgundy background, complemented by cream, gold, and green accents. The background behind the burgundy is a lighter creamy color with a subtle pattern. - The theme appears to be a wedding or engagement, based on the phrase ★cordially invite you to join the occasion of their joyous commitment on★. 2. LAYOUT & COMPOSITION: - Elements are primarily centered. The text is centered within a large burgundy shape. - The visual hierarchy prioritizes the names of the couple, followed by the date. The location and RSVP information are at the bottom. - The design achieves balance through symmetrical placement of floral arrangements and lantern illustrations. The spacing is well-managed, creating a clean and uncluttered appearance. 3. TEXT ELEMENTS: - ★Together with their families★: Positioned at the top of the burgundy section, in a serif font, smaller size, cream color. - ★Prerna Singh★: Larger text, centered in the burgundy area. It uses a cursive script font, cream color. - ★&★: Below Prerna Singh name, smaller size than the names, cursive script font, cream color. - ★Samit Gupta★: Similar in style and positioning to \'Prerna Singh\' below the \"&\" symbol. Cursive script font, cream color. - ★cordially invite you to join the occasion of their joyous commitment on★: Centered below the names, in a serif font, smaller size, cream color. - ★JULY★: Above the number, serif font, cream color. - ★SUNDAY★: Left of the number with a line separator on each side of the text, serif font, cream color. - ★28★: Large, bold number centered between the day of the week and the time. Serif font, cream color. - ★AT 8AM★: Right of the number with a line separator on each side of the text, serif font, cream color. - ★2024★: Centered below the date, serif font, cream color. - ★at★: Centered above the address, serif font, cream color. - ★123 ANYWHERE ST, ANY CITY, ST 12345★: Centered below \'at\', serif font, cream color. - ★Kindly RSVP before 17th June on★: Centered near the bottom, serif font, cream color. - ★+123-456-7890★: Centered below the RSVP text, serif font, cream color. 4. DECORATIVE ELEMENTS: - The card features a decorative border along the top and bottom with gold Indian-inspired patterns. - White roses with green leaves and hints of yellow flowers are arranged along the left and right sides, creating a floral frame. - Ornate gold lanterns hang from the top of the burgundy area, adding a touch of elegance and tradition. - The burgundy background shape is a custom shape. 5. CHARACTER/COUPLE STYLE: - There are no images of the couple. The card relies on floral and decorative elements.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity, proper padding, and an elegant, unobtrusive design that complements the overall aesthetic without distraction.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761806336_9658b45b54e6.png', NULL, '[\"weddinginvitation\",\"AIArt\",\"InvitationDesign\",\"IndianWedding\",\"RoyalBurgundy\",\"ElegantDesign\",\"TraditionalStyle\",\"AIgeneratedArt\",\"WeddingCard\",\"LuxuryInvitation\",\"CulturalDesign\",\"GoldAccents\",\"AIInvitation\",\"CreativeDesign\",\"GeminiAI\",\"AestheticDesign\",\"FloralFrame\",\"LuxuryWedding\",\"PicPose\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 06:38:56', NULL, 0, 0),
(57, 'Elegant Wedding Invitation Design with Watercolor Floral Charm 🌿✨', 24, 'A timeless blend of tradition and modern elegance — soft hues, graceful typography, and a romantic floral frame that captures love’s pure essence.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an invitation card with Here\'s a breakdown of the invitation card based on your specified criteria: 1. CARD STYLE & THEME:  Overall Design Style: Elegant and Modern with a touch of traditional. The watercolor floral elements soften the more structured text layout.  Color Scheme: The main colors are off-white (background), a muted green, and a subtle gold/tan for accents. The overall feel is soft and natural.  Theme: Wedding Invitation 2. LAYOUT & COMPOSITION:  The text elements are primarily centered, creating a symmetrical and formal appearance. * The visual hierarchy places the couple\'s names (★Daniel & Marceline★) as the focal point, followed by the invitation announcement (★You Are Invited To The Wedding Of★) and then the date and time.  The design maintains good balance. The floral elements frame the text without being overwhelming, and the spacing provides a clean and uncluttered look. 3. TEXT ELEMENTS:  ★بسم الله الرحمن الرحيم★: Located at the top, centered. This is in an elegant, decorative Arabic script. The color is black. * ★You Are Invited To The Wedding Of★: Positioned beneath the top script, centered. The font is a simple, modern serif in dark green. * ★Daniel★: Centered below the invitation line. The font is a flowing, elegant script in dark green, larger than the other text elements. * ★&★: Centered between the two names, in dark green, smaller than the names and in a similar script font. * ★Marceline★: Centered below the ampersand, mirroring the style of \"Daniel\" - elegant script in dark green. * ★DECEMBER★: Centered above the date, in a modern serif font, smaller and lighter than the names. * ★SATURDAY★: Left-aligned to the date, in a modern serif font, smaller and lighter than the names. * ★14★: Centered between two vertical gold lines. The font is a bold, modern sans-serif in dark green, and is the most prominent text element of the date. * ★AT 07:00 PM★: Right-aligned to the date, in a modern serif font, smaller and lighter than the names. * ★2024★: Centered below the date number. The font is a modern serif font, smaller and lighter than the names. * ★123 Anywhere St., Any City, ST 12345★: Centered below the date and year. The font is a small, simple serif in dark green. * ★Reception to follow★: Centered at the bottom. The font is a similar script style to the couple\'s names but slightly smaller and in dark green. 4. DECORATIVE ELEMENTS:  The card features a watercolor-style floral border. Green foliage and white flowers are arranged in the top left, top right, and bottom left corners, creating a frame.  There are no visible borders or frames other than the flowers.  The floral elements add a touch of natural elegance and a slightly rustic feel. 5. CHARACTER/COUPLE STYLE:  There are no character or couple illustrations or photos present on the card. The focus is on typography and floral decoration.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity, proper padding, and an elegant, unobtrusive design that complements the overall aesthetic without distraction.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761806717_1fb6e993041f.png', NULL, '[\"weddinginvitation\",\"AIart\",\"invitationdesign\",\"GeminiAI\",\"PicPose\",\"floraldesign\",\"weddingaesthetic\",\"watercolorart\",\"digitalinvitation\",\"modernwedding\",\"elegantstyle\",\"invitationcard\",\"weddingstationery\",\"AIcreativity\",\"weddingvibes\",\"artificialintelligence\",\"AIprompt\",\"designinspiration\",\"floralwedding\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 06:45:17', NULL, 0, 0);
