(58, 'Elegant Wedding Invitation Design — Classic Meets Modern Romance', 25, 'A beautifully balanced invitation card blending vintage charm with contemporary style — featuring soft brown and cream tones, peach & burgundy florals, and gold accents for a timeless wedding announcement.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an invitation card with This invitation card presents a blend of classic and modern design elements, perfectly suited for a wedding announcement. 1. CARD STYLE & THEME: The overall design is elegant and contemporary, with a touch of vintage charm. The color scheme centers around a soft brown background with a cream interior that forms a frame, complimented by peach and burgundy floral accents. The theme is undoubtedly a wedding, indicated by the ★Mr & Mrs★ banner, gold wedding ring graphics, and the presence of bride and groom illustrations. 2. LAYOUT & COMPOSITION: The card features a centered layout, creating a sense of balance and formality. A soft gold frame surrounds the central text area. The visual hierarchy is clear, with the couple\'s names prominently displayed, followed by the invitation details. The spacing is well-managed, providing a clean and uncluttered look. 3. TEXT ELEMENTS: * ★Mr & Mrs★: Located at the very top, in a simple, hand-drawn style font, in gold. * ★YOU ARE INVITED TO★: Positioned above the couple\'s names, using a serif font in a dark green. * ★Torgan★: Presented in a large, flowing script font, in black, and centered. * ★&★: Situated between the names in a slightly smaller black serif font. * ★Lomia★: Presented in a large, flowing script font, in black, and centered below the ampersand. * ★May love, laughter, and beautiful memories always brighten your journey together★: A heartfelt message in a smaller serif font, centered beneath the names.  Horizontal dotted line: Between the message and the time/date section.  ★WEDNESDAY★: Above the date in a centered, sans-serif, capitalized font. * ★MARCH★: Placed to the left of the date in a centered, sans-serif, capitalized font. * ★05★: The date itself, large and bold, centered. * ★AT 10:00 PM★: To the right of the date, in a sans-serif, capitalized font. * ★2025★: Placed below the date, centered.  Horizontal dotted line: Between the date section and the location section.  ★123 Anywhere st., Any City★: At the bottom, centered, in a simple serif font. 4. DECORATIVE ELEMENTS: The card is adorned with peach and burgundy floral arrangements at the top and sides. Gold wedding rings are placed above the names of the couple. A decorative banner reading \"Mr & Mrs\" is displayed at the very top. The gold frame creates a window effect. 5. CHARACTER/COUPLE STYLE: The bride and groom are depicted in a flat, digital art style with minimal shading. The bride is on the left side, holding a bouquet, while the groom is on the right. The style is simple and modern, consistent with the overall design of the card.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761807383_a573974410bd.png', NULL, '[\"weddinginvitation\",\"AIArtDesign\",\"InvitationCard\",\"WeddingAesthetics\",\"ModernClassicDesign\",\"AIWeddingCard\",\"ElegantDesign\",\"DigitalInvitation\",\"AIArtPrompt\",\"GeminiAI\",\"PicPose\",\"WeddingAnnouncement\",\"CreativeDesign\",\"WeddingGraphics\",\"InvitationInspiration\",\"FloralInvitation\",\"GoldAccents\",\"DesignWithAI\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 06:56:23', NULL, 0, 0),
(59, 'Elegant Lavender Wedding Invitation Design with AI 🎨', 25, 'A romantic watercolor-inspired wedding card featuring delicate lavender florals, elegant typography, and a modern layout — designed to capture timeless love and sophistication. Perfectly branded with PicPose for a polished finish.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an invitation card with This invitation card embodies an elegant and romantic style, perfect for a wedding. 1. CARD STYLE & THEME: The overall design style is elegant and modern with a watercolor aesthetic. The color scheme is predominantly lavender, shades of purple, and white. The theme is a wedding. 2. LAYOUT & COMPOSITION: The elements are mostly centered. The names of the couple take the visual prominence. The design has a good balance, using floral accents in the corners and along the central ellipse to create visual interest without overwhelming the text. Ample white space ensures readability. 3. TEXT ELEMENTS: * ★TOGETHER★ centered at the top in a small, modern sans-serif font. * ★WITH THEIR FAMILIES★ centered below the above text in a small, modern sans-serif font. * ★Sainic & Murad★ in the center, using a large, flowing script font in deep purple. * ★INVITE YOU TO JOIN THEIR WEDDING CELEBRATION ON★ centered below the floral ellipse in a smaller, modern sans-serif font in deep purple. * ★Sunday, 08 July 2025★ centered below the above text in a larger, bolder, modern sans-serif font in deep purple. * ★AT FOUR O\'CLOCK IN THE AFTERNOON★ centered below the date in a smaller, modern sans-serif font in deep purple. * ★Larana Hotel★ centered near the bottom in a slightly larger, modern sans-serif font in deep purple. * ★123 ANYWHERE ST., ANY CITY, ST 12345★ centered below the hotel name in a smaller, modern sans-serif font in deep purple. 4. DECORATIVE ELEMENTS: A double lined ellipse frame in deep purple encompasses the couple\'s names, decorated with watercolor floral elements predominantly in shades of lavender and purple. The corners of the card also feature watercolor floral arrangements that mirror the style of the ellipse. The background has a very subtle mottled watercolor wash effect in light grey. 5. CHARACTER/COUPLE STYLE: There is no character or couple depiction.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761807714_213a82e9925d.png', NULL, '[\"weddinginvitation\",\"AIArt\",\"PicPose\",\"GeminiAI\",\"InvitationDesign\",\"ElegantInvitation\",\"LavenderTheme\",\"WatercolorAesthetic\",\"WeddingCardDesign\",\"AIInvitation\",\"CreativeDesign\",\"ModernRomance\",\"AIInspiration\",\"DigitalArt\",\"WeddingStyle\",\"LuxuryWedding\",\"FloralDesign\",\"AestheticDesign\",\"WeddingStationery\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 07:01:54', NULL, 0, 0),
(60, 'Create Your Professional Full-Body Portrait with AI 📸', 28, 'A step-by-step prompt to create an elegant, full-body interview-style image using Gemini AI.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create mine photo with Full body portrait of [your gender], [your approximate age], wearing a dark blue button-down shirt and light-wash jeans, sitting casually in a chair in a black studio. [Describe your hair style and color]. [Describe your facial features/presence of beard or mustache]. Smiling warmly and looking to the right. The chair is a light beige color with a wooden frame. The floor is a dark gray or black. Simple, clean lighting with soft shadows. Professional, interview-style photography.\" **Optional additions for more control:** * **Specific details about your shoes:** (e.g., \"wearing white sneakers\") * **Pose adjustments:** (e.g., \"with hands clasped in lap\", \"one leg crossed over the other\") * **Expression specifics:** (e.g., \"genuinely happy expression,\" \"slightly amused smile\") **Important considerations:** * **\"Professional, interview-style photography\"**: This helps guide the AI towards the correct aesthetic. * **Experiment**: You might need to tweak the prompt several times to get the precise result you want. Try adding or removing details. * **AI Limitations**: AI image generators are not perfect. Don\'t expect an exact replica, but this should get you very close in style and composition. Good luck! Let me know if you\'d like any adjustments to the prompt.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761808234_bc3eb8441918.png', NULL, '[\"AIPhotography\",\"GeminiAI\",\"AIPrompt\",\"PicPose\",\"AIArt\",\"StudioPortrait\",\"AIEditing\",\"FullBodyPortrait\",\"GeminiPrompt\",\"PhotographyTips\",\"VisualDesign\",\"AIInspiration\",\"PhotoRealistic\",\"AIEditor\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 07:10:34', NULL, 0, 1),
(61, 'Chill Vibes on the Move 🚗✨', 28, 'A relaxed mid-shot portrait capturing soft light, warm tones, and effortless style — perfect for lifestyle or editorial aesthetics.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A mid-shot portrait of a man with a beard, wearing dark orange tinted sunglasses and a navy polo shirt, sitting in the back seat of a car. The lighting is soft and interior, giving a relaxed mood. Background shows car and outside elements, slightly blurred.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761808565_901ce6092c6e.png', NULL, '[\"AIPhotography\",\"GeminiAI\",\"PicPose\",\"AIPortrait\",\"CreativePrompt\",\"LifestyleVibes\",\"EditorialLook\",\"CinematicShot\",\"AIPhotoArt\",\"BeardStyle\",\"SunglassesMood\",\"CarPhotography\",\"AestheticEdit\",\"VisualMood\",\"DigitalPortrait\",\"AIArtistry\",\"RelaxedVibes\",\"GeminiPrompt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 07:16:05', NULL, 0, 0),
(62, 'Winter Elegance: Portrait in the Snowfall ❄️', 28, 'A cinematic portrait of a stylish man in a snow-covered setting — soft light, natural charm, and timeless winter vibes captured perfectly.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A portrait of a handsome man outdoors in a heavy snowfall. He is wearing a dark, fur-collared winter coat over a light colored sweater. He has dark hair and a beard, and wears a gold watch. Natural, soft light with overcast skies. Composition is medium close-up, with snow falling around him and coating his hair and coat. Blurred background shows a building and trees.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761808775_eca60bc563a5.png', NULL, '[\"AIArt\",\"GeminiAI\",\"AIPortrait\",\"WinterVibes\",\"SnowfallPhotography\",\"PicPose\",\"AestheticPortrait\",\"AIPhoto\",\"GeminiPrompt\",\"FashionPortrait\",\"WinterStyle\",\"AIEditing\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"SnowPortrait\",\"OutdoorPortrait\",\"AIPhotography\",\"CreativePortraits\",\"DigitalArt\",\"PortraitInspiration\",\"AIVisuals\",\"WinterMood\",\"MensStyle\",\"PicPoseBrand\",\"ModernAesthetic\",\"FrostyVib\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 07:19:35', NULL, 0, 1),
(63, 'Elegant Engagement Invitation Card with Romantic Watercolor Florals', 24, 'A modern yet heartfelt engagement card design featuring soft peach tones, blush florals, and a golden wreath framing the couple — perfect for announcing love in style.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an invitation card with Here\'s a description of the invitation card, focusing on the requested elements: The invitation card showcases an elegant and romantic style, perfect for announcing an engagement party. The overall design leans towards a modern aesthetic while incorporating delicate, romantic touches. The color scheme is soft and gentle. The background is a muted, creamy peach, providing a warm and subtle backdrop. The main text and decorative elements feature a deeper reddish-brown, offering a refined contrast. Watercolor florals in shades of blush pink, peach, burgundy, and green provide softer accents. The layout is well-balanced, with the central image and text elements taking precedence. A photo of the couple is encased in a circular frame, which is itself part of the overall rounded shape of the invitation, slightly curved at the top and bottom. The visual hierarchy places the couple\'s photo and names as the most important elements, followed by the event details. The arrangement creates a visually pleasing and easy-to-read composition. Text Elements: * ★ENGAGEMENT PARTY★: Positioned centrally above the names, written in a bold, serif font. The color is a reddish-brown. * ★Eleanor & Bailey★: Positioned centrally below \"ENGAGEMENT PARTY\", written in a script-style font, also in reddish-brown, and larger than the above text. * ★Saturday, 11 May 2024★: Centrally positioned below the names in a slightly smaller, sans-serif font, and the same reddish-brown. * ★At 6pm | Borcelle Hotel & Resto 123 Anywhere ST., Anycity., ST 12345★: Located centrally at the bottom, also in a sans-serif font. Decorative Elements: The card is adorned with watercolor floral elements. Large blush pink roses with green leaves occupy the top right and bottom left corners, creating a visually appealing frame. The photo of the couple is encircled by a golden leafy wreath with a subtle glitter effect, adding a touch of elegance. This wreath also includes watercolor flowers matching the overall theme. Character/Couple Style: The couple is captured in a real photo style. The image seems to be a candid shot of them embracing, creating a personal and intimate feel. The photo is not manipulated to fit a stylized or cartoon style; instead, it presents a realistic depiction of the couple, enhancing the card\'s authenticity and emotional appeal.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity, proper padding, and an elegant, unobtrusive design that complements the overall aesthetic without distraction.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761809730_e4ecc8a35bd5.png', NULL, '[\"AIArt\",\"AIDesign\",\"InvitationCard\",\"EngagementCard\",\"RomanticDesign\",\"WatercolorFlorals\",\"ElegantInvitation\",\"PicPose\",\"GeminiAI\",\"CreativePrompt\",\"DigitalDesign\",\"WeddingInvite\",\"EngagementAnnouncement\",\"CardDesignIdeas\",\"AestheticDesign\",\"ModernInvitation\",\"AIInspiredArt\",\"EngagementParty\",\"LoveInDesign\",\"CoupleInvite\",\"AIPhotoDesign\",\"DesignWithGemini\",\"FloralInvitation\",\"LuxuryInvite\",\"CreativeConcept\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 07:35:30', NULL, 0, 0),
(64, 'Elegant Traditional Indian Wedding Invitation Card Design 🕊️', 24, 'A timeless Indian wedding invitation with cream, gold, and maroon tones — featuring Ganesh blessings, floral motifs, and intricate borders that celebrate love, culture, and tradition.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an invitation card with Here\'s a breakdown of the invitation card\'s design elements: 1. CARD STYLE & THEME:  Overall design style: Traditional Indian wedding invitation with a touch of elegance.  Color scheme: The main background color is a pale cream or off-white. Accents are in shades of gold/yellow, deep reds/maroons, and greens.  Theme: Wedding invitation. 2. LAYOUT & COMPOSITION:  Elements are mostly centered. The text is centered vertically.  Visual hierarchy: The names of the couple and the date are the most prominent elements. The Ganesh symbol and blessing are also important. The decorative elements are balanced around the card\'s perimeter.  Balance and spacing: The card is visually balanced with floral arrangements at the top and bottom. Spacing is well-managed, avoiding a cluttered feel. 3. TEXT ELEMENTS: * ★॥ श्री गणेशाय नमः ॥★ - Centered below Ganesh symbol, likely a script font, possibly Devanagari, in dark green. * ★Maanvita & Darsh★ - Centered, large size, elegant script font, in dark green. * ★are inviting for their wedding ceremony★ - Centered below the names, simpler font (serif or sans-serif), smaller size, in dark green. * ★March★ - Centered, serif font, smaller size, dark green. * ★Monday 20 At 03PM★ - Centered, sans-serif font, larger and bolder for \"20,\" date underlined with line, in dark green * ★2028★ - Centered below the date, sans-serif font, smaller size, in dark green. * ★123 Anywhere St., Any City, ST 12345★ - Centered, sans-serif font, smaller size, in dark green. * ★Kindly RSVP before 5th March on +123-456-7890★ - Centered at the bottom, sans-serif font, smallest size, in dark green. 4. DECORATIVE ELEMENTS:  Borders/Frames: A gold/yellow ornate border frames the central text area, creating a distinct shape.  Flowers/Illustrations: The top and bottom of the card feature decorative floral arrangements, including lotuses, roses, and other blooms in shades of pink, yellow, and green. There are hanging lanterns at the top left and right. At the bottom is a couple in traditional Indian dress. There is also a peacock, a pavilion, and an elephant.  Special Effects: None appear to be present based on the image. 5. CHARACTER/COUPLE STYLE:  A couple is drawn at the bottom left of the card. They appear to be depicted in digital art, in a more realistic style. The rendering of the clothes and shadows suggests a carefully-executed digital illustration rather than cartoonish or anime style.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity, proper padding, and an elegant, unobtrusive design that complements the overall aesthetic without distraction.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761810054_1618ef1f04e4.png', NULL, '[\"WeddingInvitation\",\"IndianWeddingCard\",\"TraditionalDesign\",\"InvitationCardDesign\",\"AIInvitation\",\"GeminiAI\",\"PicPose\",\"AestheticDesign\",\"WeddingVibes\",\"GaneshBlessings\",\"LuxuryInvitation\",\"DigitalArt\",\"WeddingInspiration\",\"IndianCulture\",\"ElegantDesign\",\"WeddingAesthetics\",\"CreativeCardDesign\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 07:40:54', NULL, 0, 0),
(65, 'Venice City – The Perfect Place for a Perfect Beginning', 21, 'Luxury 3 & 4 BHK Villas Near ORR Exit 2 & 3, Hyderabad | Starting from ₹2.8 Crores | 247 Villas | 20,000 Sq. Ft. Clubhouse | 30+ World-Class Amenities\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', '★★Header Section★★\r\nthe text: ★VENICE CITY★ (small, stylized font, top left)\r\nthe text: ★Your Company Logo★ (small, stylized font, top right)\r\n\r\n★★Main Headline Section★★\r\nthe text: ★PERFECT PLACE FOR A PERFECT BEGINING★ (large, bold sans-serif font, centered left)\r\n\r\n★★Price Section★★\r\nthe text: ★PRICE STARTS AT★ (smaller, slightly lighter font, above price)\r\nthe text: ★2.8 Crores★ (very large, bold sans-serif font, below price, centered left)\r\n\r\n★★Location Section★★\r\nthe text: ★NEAR ORR EXIT NO : 2 & 3,★ (smaller, sans-serif font, above location)\r\nthe text: ★Hyderabad★ (larger, sans-serif font, below location)\r\n\r\n★★Secondary Text Section★★\r\nthe text: ★3 & 4 BHK | 247 VILLAS | 2230-2599 SFT UNIT SIZES | 20,000 SFT CLUBHOUSE 30+ WORLD CLASS AMENITIES★ (small, sans-serif font, centered near the bottom)\r\n\r\n★★Contact Section★★\r\nthe text: ★[Phone Number]★ (large, sans-serif font, bottom left)\r\nthe text: ★[Website URL]★ (large, sans-serif font, bottom right)\r\nthe text: ★#[Brand Name]★ (small, faint, right side of image and above last text line)\r\n\r\n★★Main Image★★\r\nUltra-realistic image of a modern, two-story house with a white exterior and gray stone accents. The house features a balcony with glass railings. A well-manicured lawn and two lush, round trees frame the house. A luxury car is parked in the driveway. A small decorative tree is on the side of the house.\r\n\r\nOverall Design Style\r\nClean, modern design with a color palette of white, gray, and red-brown. The lighting is bright and sunny, creating a welcoming mood. The composition is balanced, with the text and image elements arranged symmetrically. The textures are smooth and polished. The perspective is wide-angle, capturing the entire house and its surroundings.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761811156_1596d6aa6817.png', NULL, '[\"VeniceCity\",\"LuxuryVillas\",\"HyderabadHomes\",\"RealEstateIndia\",\"DreamHome\",\"ModernVilla\",\"LuxuryLiving\",\"HyderabadRealEstate\",\"HomeDesign\",\"VillaForSale\",\"LuxuryProperty\",\"HouseGoals\",\"ModernArchitecture\",\"RealEstateMarketing\",\"HomeBuyers\",\"SmartInvestment\",\"HyderabadLuxury\",\"UrbanLiving\",\"PropertyLaunch\",\"LuxuryLife\",\"NewProject\",\"VillaCommunity\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 07:50:57', NULL, 0, 1),
(66, 'Dream Plots Near International Airport – Own Your Future Home Today!', 21, 'Modern living meets perfect location. Premium residential plots from 60 to 250 SqYds with easy EMI starting at just ₹7,250/-. Book Now and step closer to your dream address!\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A Professional Real Estate Advertisement\r\n\r\n★★Header Section★★\r\nthe text: ★Plots Size★ (green rectangle, top right)\r\nthe text: ★60 to 250 SqYds★ (below the above text, smaller font, green rectangle)\r\n\r\n★★Main Headline Section★★\r\nthe text: ★Dream★ (large, white, flowing script, left side)\r\nthe text: ★Plots★ (below the above text, slightly smaller, white, left side)\r\nthe text: ★Very low Price★ (smaller, green, right of \"Plots\")\r\nthe text: ★Best Location In [Location] International Airport Near★ (green text, below headline)\r\nthe text: ★[Company Name]★ (large, green text, below the above text)\r\nthe text: ★EMI Starts With★ (green text, below the above text)\r\nthe text: ★7250/-★ (large, bold, green text, below the above text)\r\nthe text: ★BOOK NOW!★ (white text on green rectangle, bottom left)\r\n\r\n★★Main Image★★\r\nUltra-realistic image of a planned real estate development with neatly divided plots of land. Roads and sidewalks are lined with trees. Several people are seen walking on the sidewalks. A black car drives on the road. An airplane is visible in the sky, taking off or landing. In the bottom right corner, a modern airport terminal building is visible.\r\n\r\n★★Contact Section★★\r\nthe text: ★[Address]★ (small green text, bottom left)\r\nthe text: ★[Website URL]★ (small green text, left side)\r\n\r\n★★Your Company Logo★★ (top left corner)\r\n\r\nOverall Design Style\r\nA modern and inviting advertisement for a real estate development. The color palette is dominated by greens and whites, creating a fresh and natural feel. The lighting is bright and sunny, conveying a sense of optimism. The composition is well-balanced, with the headline and main image working together to draw the viewer\'s eye. A wide-angle lens is suggested.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761810955_48c6881a6e12.png', NULL, '[\"RealEstateAd\",\"PropertyInvestment\",\"DreamPlots\",\"AffordableHousing\",\"AirportPlots\",\"PicPose\",\"AIRealEstate\",\"ModernLiving\",\"SmartInvestment\",\"LuxuryPlots\",\"RealEstateIndia\",\"HomeGoals\",\"EMIPlans\",\"GreenLiving\",\"PropertyForSale\",\"InvestmentOpportunity\",\"PlotNearAirport\",\"AIAdvertising\",\"PropertyDesign\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 07:55:55', NULL, 0, 1),
(67, 'Luxury Awaits at PALM JEBEL ALI 🌴 — Where Dreams Meet the Sea', 21, 'Experience Ultra-Modern Villas & Premium Plots Starting from AED 18.7M — The Long Wait Is Over.\r\nBook Now and Own a Piece of Dubai’s Most Iconic Island.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A Real Estate Advertisement\r\n\r\n★★Top Headline★★\r\nthe text: ★PALM JEBEL ALI★ (large, gold, centered at the top)\r\nthe text: ★VILLAS & PLOTS★ (smaller, gold, centered below the headline)\r\n\r\n★★Main Image★★\r\nUltra-realistic image of a luxurious, modern villa located on a man-made island in a palm tree-shaped archipelago. The villa features floor-to-ceiling windows, a flat roof with greenery, and a private pool facing the ocean. Palm trees are on the property and on nearby island plots. The sky is bright blue, and the water is clear. The image is framed in a gold border.\r\n\r\n★★Call to Action★★\r\nthe text: ★Book Now★ (gold letters on a painterly, textured gold background, placed over the main image)\r\n\r\n★★Bottom Text★★\r\nthe text: ★The long wait is Over★ (cursive font, golden color, positioned diagonally across the lower midsection of the image.)\r\nthe text: ★Villas★ (centered, above price)\r\nthe text: ★starting from★ (small, centered above price)\r\nthe text: ★AED 18.7M★ (large, gold letters on a dark gold rectangle)\r\nthe text: ★Plots★ (centered, above price)\r\nthe text: ★starting from★ (small, centered above price)\r\nthe text: ★AED 40M★ (large, gold letters on a dark gold rectangle)\r\n\r\nOverall Design Style\r\nThe design is opulent and luxurious, with a color palette of golds, blues, and browns. The lighting is bright and sunny. The composition focuses on the grandeur of the location and the modern architecture. The lens appears to be a wide-angle lens to capture the full scope of the island and villa. The overall mood is aspirational and conveys exclusivity.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761815674_93e33fadbf74.png', NULL, '[\"PalmJebelAli\",\"DubaiLuxuryLiving\",\"LuxuryVillas\",\"IslandLife\",\"DreamHomeDubai\",\"ExclusiveProperty\",\"RealEstateDubai\",\"LuxuryRealEstate\",\"ModernVillaDesign\",\"SeasideLiving\",\"DubaiInvestment\",\"ArchitecturalDesign\",\"EliteLifestyle\",\"LuxuryHomes\",\"PremiumPlots\",\"DubaiVillas\",\"PropertyForSale\",\"RealEstateAd\",\"LuxuryLifestyle\",\"PicPoseBrand\",\"AIEdited\",\"AIRealEstateAd\",\"GeminiPrompt\",\"GoldenDesign\",\"DubaiDreams\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 09:14:34', NULL, 0, 0),
(68, 'Luxurious Commercial Space Advertisement Design with Gemini AI', 21, 'Create a premium real estate poster showcasing modern architecture, prime location, and business-ready ambiance — designed to impress your clients instantly\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A Professional Real Estate Advertisement Poster\r\n\r\n★★Logo Section 1★★\r\nthe text: ★Your Company Logo★ (top left)\r\n\r\n★★Logo Section 2★★\r\nthe text: ★Your Company Logo★ (top right)\r\n\r\n★★Headline Section★★\r\nthe text: ★COMMERCIAL SPACE★ (large, center)\r\nthe text: ★PRIME LOCATION, HIGH FOOTFALL-SET UP FOR SUCCESS!★ (smaller, centered below headline)\r\n\r\n★★Text Section★★\r\nthe text: ★The future of your business begins here.★ (centered, in a gold-colored rectangle)\r\nthe text: ★[Location]\'s best commercial space awaits!★ (large, centered below the rectangle)\r\n\r\n★★Main Image★★\r\nUltra-realistic image of modern commercial buildings. Multiple buildings of varying heights and designs. Some buildings have glass facades and others have balconies with colorful accents. The base of the buildings features a parking garage structure and landscaping with palm trees. Buildings are viewed at dusk with warm lighting inside.\r\n\r\n★★Website Section★★\r\nthe text: ★Website★ (bottom, centered)\r\n\r\nOverall Design Style\r\nThe poster uses a dark blue background with gold and white text. The lighting is warm and inviting, creating a sense of luxury and opportunity. The composition is centered, drawing the eye to the image of the buildings. Textures are smooth and professional. The lens creates a wide-angle shot capturing all of the buildings.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761816567_7b22bde34c06.png', NULL, '[\"RealEstateDesign\",\"CommercialSpace\",\"LuxuryProperty\",\"AIPoster\",\"AIArt\",\"PicPose\",\"GeminiAI\",\"RealEstateMarketing\",\"BusinessGrowth\",\"ArchitecturalDesign\",\"ModernBuilding\",\"PropertyPromotion\",\"DesignInspiration\",\"AIDesign\",\"CreativePoster\",\"VisualBranding\",\"AIVisuals\",\"MarketingCreatives\",\"PropertyAd\",\"ProfessionalPoster\",\"GeminiPrompt\",\"CommercialProperty\",\"AIRealEstate\",\"LuxuryDesign\",\"BusinessOpportunity\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 09:29:27', NULL, 0, 0),
(69, 'KEBAB TURKEY – Taste the Perfection in Every Bite!', 22, 'Freshly wrapped flavor loaded with juicy turkey, crisp veggies, and creamy sauces — a visual feast crafted for your cravings!\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A Professional Restaurant Food Advertisement Poster\r\n\r\n★★Title Text★★\r\nthe text: ★KEBAB★ (large, white sans-serif font with 3D effect, top center)\r\nthe text: ★TURKEY★ (large, white sans-serif font with 3D effect, below \"KEBAB\")\r\n\r\n★★Descriptive Text★★\r\nthe text: ★Tasty★ (cursive font, upper right of the kebab)\r\nthe text: ★Delicious★ (cursive font, left side of the kebab)\r\nthe text: ★Yummy★ (cursive font, lower right of the kebab)\r\n\r\n★★Main Image★★\r\nUltra-realistic image of a delicious turkey kebab wrap. The kebab is filled with sliced turkey meat, lettuce, tomato, red onion, shredded cheese, mustard, and white sauce, all wrapped in a soft flatbread. The wrap is positioned vertically in the center of the frame. Other kebab wraps are blurred in the background.\r\n\r\n★★Contact Section★★\r\nthe text: ★[Phone Number]★ (white text, bottom left)\r\nthe text: ★[Website URL]★ (white text, bottom left, below phone number)\r\n\r\n★★Social Media Section★★\r\nthe text: ★FOLLOW US NOW★ (white text, bottom right)\r\nThe image also contains generic social media icons (Facebook, Twitter, Youtube, Instagram) to the left of a generic QR code. (bottom right)\r\n\r\n★★Logo★★\r\nthe text: ★Your Company Logo★ (small, top center, above the title)\r\n\r\nOverall Design Style\r\nThe poster features a vibrant orange background. Lighting is bright and even, highlighting the freshness of the kebab ingredients. The composition is clean and focuses the eye on the central kebab wrap. There is a slight depth of field.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761821292_42c1eab182a9.png', NULL, '[\"FoodAdvertisement\",\"RestaurantPoster\",\"KebabLovers\",\"TurkeyKebab\",\"FoodPhotography\",\"FoodAdDesign\",\"PicPose\",\"AIArt\",\"AIPrompt\",\"FoodPosterDesign\",\"DeliciousWrap\",\"CreativeFoodAd\",\"TastyVisuals\",\"FlatLayFood\",\"FoodieArt\",\"CulinaryDesign\",\"BrandPromotion\",\"VisualMarketing\",\"AIPhotoEdit\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 10:48:12', NULL, 0, 1),
(70, 'Mouth-Watering Burger Ad Design with AI — Create Your Own Food Poster!', 22, 'Design a professional restaurant advertisement poster that grabs attention and boosts your brand. Perfect lighting, bold typography, and an irresistible burger visual — all crafted with Gemini AI or your favorite design tool.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A Professional Restaurant Food Advertisement Poster\r\n\r\n★★Top Left★★\r\nthe text: ★SPECIAL TASTY★ (red, slanted slightly upwards)\r\nthe text: ★HUMBURGER★ (black, bold, large font)\r\n\r\n★★Discount Cloud★★\r\nthe text: ★Discount★ (small font, above the percentage)\r\nthe text: ★20%★ (large, bold, inside a cloud-shaped line drawing)\r\n\r\n★★Bottom Left Contact Section★★\r\nthe text: ★FOR FREE DELIVERY★ (small font, above phone number)\r\nthe text: ★[Phone Number]★ (below delivery text, larger font)\r\n\r\n★★Bottom Right Order Section★★\r\nthe text: ★ORDER NOW★ (white text on black rounded rectangle)\r\nthe text: ★[Website URL]★ (below order now, white text)\r\n\r\n★★Main Image★★\r\nUltra-realistic image of a large, delicious-looking hamburger. The burger features a sesame seed bun, a thick beef patty, melted cheese, tomato slice, lettuce, red onion rings, and a sauce dripping out. A tomato and basil leaf are to the right of the burger. A red chili pepper and additional basil leaf are to the left of the burger. Red streaks emanate from the left and right side of the burger.\r\n\r\n★★Bottom★★\r\nthe text: ★IMAGE NOT INCLUDED★ (gray text, centered)\r\n\r\nOverall Design Style\r\nThe poster has a modern and eye-catching design with a primarily red, white, and black color scheme. Lighting is bright and focused on the hamburger to emphasize its appeal. The background is a crumpled white texture overlaid with a black organic shape in the top left and a red rounded shape in the bottom. Composition is balanced, with text and visual elements carefully arranged. Lens is close-up to highlight the textures and details of the hamburger. The mood is appetizing and inviting.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761821513_44556a043c7d.png', NULL, '[\"FoodAdvertisement\",\"AIArt\",\"PosterDesign\",\"RestaurantBranding\",\"FoodPhotography\",\"PicPose\",\"AIPrompt\",\"GeminiAI\",\"BurgerLovers\",\"CreativeDesign\",\"FoodPoster\",\"AIPhotoEdit\",\"FoodAdDesign\",\"MarketingVisuals\",\"FoodStyling\",\"TastyBurger\",\"AIEditing\",\"DigitalPoster\",\"AdDesign\",\"CreativeBranding\",\"FoodVisuals\",\"RestaurantPromo\",\"AIDesignInspiration\",\"ModernAdDesign\",\"FlatLayFood\",\"FoodCreatives\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 10:51:53', NULL, 0, 1),
(71, 'PISTACHIO BAKLAVA — A Taste of Tradition, Perfected', 22, 'Where Crunch Meets Sweet — Pistachio Baklava Perfection\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A Professional Restaurant Food Advertisement Poster\r\n\r\n★★Title★★\r\nthe text: ★PISTACHIO★ (large, centered, textured, top)\r\nthe text: ★BAKLAVA★ (large, centered, textured, below \"PISTACHIO\")\r\n\r\n★★Main Image★★\r\nUltra-realistic image of numerous squares of pistachio baklava stacked on a decorative silver tray. Each piece is topped with roughly chopped pistachios. In the background, a small glass bowl of honey and scattered pistachios.\r\n\r\nOverall Design Style\r\nWarm, inviting, close-up shot. Soft, diffused lighting with highlights emphasizing the glaze and layers of baklava. The colors are primarily golden, beige, and green. The lens mimics a macro lens, emphasizing the textures and details of the pastry and pistachios. The background is softly blurred to keep focus on the baklava.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761821962_a9cb4acfce9d.png', NULL, '[\"Baklava\",\"PistachioBaklava\",\"FoodPhotography\",\"FoodAdvertisement\",\"BaklavaLovers\",\"DessertTime\",\"MiddleEasternDessert\",\"SweetDelight\",\"FoodArt\",\"PastryPerfection\",\"FoodDesign\",\"FoodStyling\",\"DessertLovers\",\"FoodieGram\",\"LuxuryDessert\",\"BaklavaLove\",\"DeliciouslySweet\",\"GourmetDessert\",\"FoodAdPhotography\",\"GoldenLayers\",\"PistachioLovers\",\"BaklavaAddict\",\"FoodVisuals\",\"SweetCravings\",\"PicPoseCreative\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 10:59:22', NULL, 0, 1),
(72, 'Instagram Dream Shot — The Yellow Vibe with PicPose', 27, 'Turn your photo into a high-fashion, lifestyle-inspired masterpiece 📸\r\nWatch yourself become the face of your own Instagram world — bright, confident, and stylish! 💛\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A photorealistic, high-detail lifestyle photo blending the exact same woman’s face, hair, skin tone, and expression from the uploaded image into a modern real-world Instagram-inspired setup.\r\nThe entire color palette remains bright and cheerful, dominated by yellow, white, orange, and green tones.\r\n\r\nIn the center foreground, the same woman (with her exact face, hairstyle, and expression from the uploaded photo) is sitting casually on a bright orange cube that has a white Instagram logo embossed on the front.\r\nShe wears a vibrant yellow fitted pantsuit, a white V-neck top, black high-heeled sandals, and large, round, bright yellow sunglasses.\r\nShe holds a black smartphone in her right hand, angled slightly upward as if taking a selfie, smiling naturally and joyfully toward the phone’s camera.\r\nHer face must match the uploaded photo exactly — same features, same lighting direction, same expression — blended perfectly into the scene with realistic textures, shadows, and lighting.\r\n\r\nBehind her stands a large upright realistic smartphone screen, resembling an iPhone, displaying her Instagram profile page in detail.\r\nThe screen shows:\r\n\r\nA circular profile picture of the same woman (identical face and outfit) at the top left.\r\n\r\nBelow it, three bold statistics in black text: ★298 posts★, ★5,840 followers★, ★732 Following★.\r\n\r\nThe main content area of the screen displays two vertically aligned photo thumbnails, each showing the same woman posing confidently in her yellow pantsuit against a sunny yellow background.\r\n\r\nThe top bar of the phone screen shows subtle interface icons: ★9:41★ time, Wi-Fi, battery, and signal indicators.\r\n\r\nThe background environment is a bright, minimalist outdoor scene with a vibrant yellow wall or building behind her, evoking an urban summer feel.\r\nTo the left side, include a lush green bush or plant, adding natural contrast.\r\nThe ground should be a clean, light-gray pavement or sidewalk, softly reflecting sunlight.\r\n\r\nLighting is bright, evenly diffused, and natural, casting soft realistic shadows under the cube and around the subject.\r\nTextures on her clothing, sunglasses, and skin must appear real and tactile, while maintaining the glossy, influencer-aesthetic clarity of a professional brand shoot.\r\n\r\nBoth the seated woman and her profile picture on the smartphone screen must use the same exact face and expression from the uploaded image — identical in every detail.\r\nThe overall mood is cheerful, modern, and fashion-inspired, perfectly combining real-world photography with Instagram-themed visual design.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761822267_f903608091df.png', NULL, '[\"AIArt\",\"GeminiAI\",\"PicPose\",\"AestheticEdit\",\"InstagramStyle\",\"AIPhotoEdit\",\"LifestylePhotography\",\"DigitalInfluencer\",\"AIinspiration\",\"GeminiPrompt\",\"AestheticAI\",\"BrightVibes\",\"YellowMood\",\"AIEditing\",\"ModernAesthetic\",\"CreativePortrait\",\"PhotoRealisticEdit\",\"InfluencerLook\",\"FashionAI\",\"ContentCreatorStyle\",\"VisualDesign\",\"AIPhotography\",\"SummerVibes\",\"PicPoseStyle\",\"GeminiMagic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 11:04:27', NULL, 0, 3),
(73, 'Dual Reality: The Real You vs. The Digital You ✨', 27, 'Step into both worlds — the real and the digital 🌐\r\nThis conceptual portrait blends realism and identity, showing how we exist both in life and online.\r\nCreated with precision, photorealism, and influencer-style aesthetics 💫\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A photorealistic, high-detail conceptual portrait showing the same man twice — once as a real person in the scene and once inside a digital Instagram-style profile frame — both faces adapted from the uploaded photo.\r\n\r\nAt the center of the image, a large 3D white Instagram-style post frame floats upright in mid-air.\r\n\r\n Inside the frame is a close-up portrait of the same man (using the uploaded image for face, hair, and skin tone) wearing a crisp white shirt, sleeves rolled to the elbows, looking directly at the camera with a calm, confident expression and natural lighting on his face.\r\n\r\nThe Instagram frame layout must exactly replicate the original style:\r\n\r\nCircular profile picture of the same man at the top left.\r\nUsername ★Akmal_Ansari★ in bold black sans-serif font.\r\nSub-header ★Delhi, India★ in smaller gray text below it.\r\nThree small gray dots aligned horizontally on the top-right corner.\r\nFloating 3D red social icons around the frame — a heart with ★1★, a comment bubble with ★1★, and a paper-plane share icon.\r\nBottom bar showing black interface icons for heart, comment, and send, followed by ★193 likes★ and ★Akmal_Ansari★.\r\nIn the foreground, on the right side, the same man appears again (same facial features from the uploaded photo), sitting casually on a tall black stool, wearing the same white shirt, blue jeans, and black casual shoes, holding a silver laptop open on his lap and smiling confidently toward the camera.\r\n\r\n Both faces — the one inside the Instagram frame and the real one — must perfectly match in identity and expression.\r\n\r\nThe background should remain a softly blurred modern indoor environment with warm yellow lighting, cozy decor, and bokeh lamp effects for cinematic depth.\r\n\r\n Lighting is soft, even, and photorealistic, highlighting facial details and reflections naturally.\r\n\r\nMaintain the same proportions, composition, and spacing between both versions of the man.\r\n\r\n The overall image style must be clean, professional, influencer-aesthetic, and identical in layout and lighting to the original female reference — only the face, expression, and gender appearance adapt from the uploaded photo.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity, proper padding, and an elegant, unobtrusive design that complements the overall aesthetic without distraction.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761822666_72cd9f4b5e85.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"AIArt\",\"ConceptPortrait\",\"GeminiAI\",\"AIPrompt\",\"DigitalReality\",\"DualIdentity\",\"InfluencerStyle\",\"PhotorealisticEdit\",\"AIPhotography\",\"VisualConcept\",\"CreativePortrait\",\"AIInspiration\",\"AestheticDesign\",\"DigitalArtistry\",\"PortraitIdeas\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"ModernAesthetic\",\"PhotoRealism\",\"AIVisuals\",\"PicPosePortrait\",\"GeminiPrompt\",\"RealVsDigital\",\"CreativeFusion\",\"PhotographyConcept\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 11:11:06', NULL, 1, 3),
(74, 'Elegant Sufi Night Invitation Card Design', 26, 'A modern yet traditional invitation card capturing the soulful essence of a South Asian Sufi Night — blending deep blue and gold tones with cultural elegance, featuring a beautifully dressed couple beneath golden lanterns and starry skies.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an invitation card with This invitation card exudes an elegant and festive theme, likely for an event with a South Asian cultural influence. 1. CARD STYLE & THEME: The overall design is modern with traditional elements. The color scheme is primarily a deep blue and gold, with accents of white, green, and grey. The background is a dark, starry blue. The theme appears to be a \"Sufi Night\", suggesting a cultural celebration. 2. LAYOUT & COMPOSITION: The layout is vertically oriented. Visual hierarchy places the event title prominently at the top, followed by the date and venue, and then the illustration of a couple. The design employs a balanced composition with decorative elements on the top and bottom. 3. TEXT ELEMENTS: * ★Sufi Night★ is at the top, in a decorative script font, likely in a gold or yellow color. * ★NOVEMBER★ is below the title, in a sans-serif font, also in yellow. * ★SUNDAY 27 8:30 PM★ is located below the month, in a simple sans-serif font, likely in yellow. * ★2022 JAYPEE PALACE, AGRA★ is at the bottom of the text section, in a simple sans-serif font, likely in yellow. * Phrases related to the image authoring are repeated on both sides in a vertical arrangement. ★weddingartinvite - shubhamart★ is displayed multiple times, in a thin sans-serif font. 4. DECORATIVE ELEMENTS: The top of the card features a decorative border with leaves and string lights. Behind the couple is a geometric gold latticework pattern with hanging lanterns. The bottom of the card has tall grass illustrations and candle imagery in the corners. 5. CHARACTER/COUPLE STYLE: The couple illustration is in a digital art style with smooth lines and shading. The style resembles a semi-realistic, modern cartoon rendering. The woman has henna on her hands. The characters are dressed in traditional clothing. The man is wearing a blue Kurta and the woman is in a gray/silver Lehenga style outfit.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761823157_776430630b29.png', NULL, '[\"SufiNight\",\"InvitationCardDesign\",\"ElegantInvites\",\"SouthAsianCulture\",\"WeddingArtInvite\",\"SufiVibes\",\"BlueAndGoldTheme\",\"CulturalCelebration\",\"DigitalArtDesign\",\"ModernTradition\",\"AIInvitation\",\"FestiveCard\",\"LuxuryDesign\",\"PicPose\",\"IndianWeddingDesign\",\"GoldAesthetics\",\"StarryNightTheme\",\"AIArtCreation\",\"DesignInspiration\",\"ShubhamArt\",\"ElegantGraphics\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 11:19:17', NULL, 0, 2);
