(75, 'Sadiq Aur Talat — Hamesha Ke Liye', 26, 'A Whimsical Twilight Wedding Invitation — where love meets elegance under the moonlight.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an invitation card with This invitation card presents a whimsical and illustrated style, seemingly for a wedding event. The color scheme is dominated by purples and blues against a twilight backdrop, and the illustrations use a digital art style. The overall layout is vertically oriented, with the text and decorative elements arranged around a central illustration of a couple. The visual hierarchy places the couple and their names at the forefront, while the background elements provide context. The balance is somewhat asymmetrical, favoring the left side with the building illustration. The text elements include: ★MAJOR★, at the top-left in a small, simple sans-serif font, white in color. ★Sadiq aur Talat★, centrally positioned below \"MAJOR\" in a larger, flowing script font, in a light bluish-white color. ★HAMESHA KE LIYE★, centrally positioned directly below the names, in a smaller sans-serif font, white in color. The words ★CADET 1 COLLEGE★ are located on the top of the building, using a small, simple sans-serif font. The text ★EST | 2025★ is located on top of the decorative element at the bottom-right in a small, simple sans-serif font, black in color. The text ★CREATES★ is located at the bottom-right in a script font, black in color. The decorative elements include crescent moon shapes with dangling lights at the top, lending a festive air. A large moon sits behind the couple, illuminating them. A building illustration is situated to the left, while a floral heart motif is at the bottom-right. The character illustration depicts a couple in a digital art style, the bride wears an ornate blue dress and the groom wears a dark military uniform. The style is detailed, creating a personalized feel, set against an outdoor environment with the illustrated building, a possible college, in the background.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761823367_bdb3f8caa464.png', NULL, '[\"WeddingInvitation\",\"WhimsicalArt\",\"DigitalIllustration\",\"TwilightTheme\",\"PurpleBlueAesthetic\",\"CouplePortrait\",\"IndianWedding\",\"SadiqAurTalat\",\"MoonlitLove\",\"RomanticDesign\",\"WeddingCardDesign\",\"CreativeInvite\",\"LoveIllustration\",\"ModernTradition\",\"CrescentLights\",\"IllustratedWedding\",\"FairytaleWedding\",\"DigitalArtStyle\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 11:22:47', NULL, 0, 3),
(76, 'Elegant Winter Night Reception Invitation', 26, 'A modern and romantic invitation design featuring a semi-realistic couple under starlit skies, celebrating love amidst elegance and charm.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an invitation card with The invitation card exhibits a modern and elegant design style with a soft, romantic theme. The color scheme is primarily composed of dark blues and whites. The layout is vertically oriented and balanced. The visual hierarchy places the event details prominently in the upper-middle section, followed by the illustration of the couple at the bottom. There\'s ample spacing above and around text elements to enhance readability. The text elements are arranged as follows: - ★Reception★ at the top, in an elegant cursive font. - ★JAN | 29 | 2023★ is directly beneath, in a serif font. \"JAN\" and \"2023\" are smaller than \"29\" and placed on either side of the number - ★7:30 PM ONWARDS★ below the date, in a smaller serif font. - ★Satya Sa Convention★ below the time, in a similar serif font but slightly larger. - ★Dress Code: Formal★ at the bottom of the text cluster, in a similar serif font, similar size as the time text. All text is white against the dark background, with the script fonts being noticeably larger than the serif fonts. The decorative elements include strings of lights and hanging greenery above. The background appears to be a snowy night scene with a forest silhouette. The couple is standing in front of a reception stage decorated with white flowers and greenery. The stage is a modern geometric design with off-white panels. In the foreground, there are lanterns and flower arrangements. The couple is rendered in a digital art style that resembles a portrait. The style is semi-realistic. The male figure is wearing a black tuxedo, and the female is wearing a detailed white gown with a long train. They are illustrated from the knees up and are the focal point of the lower portion of the card.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1761823604_30eccfa7aad8.png', NULL, '[\"ElegantInvitation\",\"ModernWeddingCard\",\"ReceptionInvite\",\"RomanticDesign\",\"BlueAndWhiteTheme\",\"DigitalWeddingCard\",\"SemiRealisticArt\",\"WinterReception\",\"WeddingAesthetic\",\"CouplePortrait\",\"LuxuryWeddingInvite\",\"ElegantDesign\",\"ModernElegance\",\"WeddingReception\",\"InvitationDesign\",\"StarryNightTheme\",\"WeddingInspo\",\"StylishInvite\",\"RomanticEvening\",\"LoveInArt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 11:26:44', NULL, 0, 12),
(77, 'Focused Frame — The Moment Before the Roll', 18, 'A cinematic capture of determination and grace — where style meets the thrill of the game. Shot in stunning 8K realism with natural tones and perfect depth.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A young woman (upload image) preparing to bowl in a modern bowling alley, holding a red bowling ball with both hands, focused expression, slightly bent posture before rolling the ball. She wears a casual white t-shirt and light blue ripped jeans and white sneakers. The background shows colorful bowling balls on racks (green, yellow, orange, purple), a bowling lane with polished wooden floor reflecting the lights, and warm ambient lighting with hanging string lights. The scene is well-lit, cinematic depth of field, realistic skin tones, soft background blur (bokeh), ultra high detail, 8K resolution, natural color grading, professional photography style, shot with 85mm lens, aperture f/1.8, ISO 200, shutter speed 1/125s.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762074144_dfb88167a337.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"BowlingMood\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"FocusedFrame\",\"ModernVibes\",\"LifestylePhotography\",\"BowlingAlleyAesthetic\",\"RealisticPortrait\",\"85mmMagic\",\"NaturalLightPhotography\",\"DepthOfField\",\"BokehDream\",\"ProfessionalPhotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-02 09:02:24', NULL, 0, 0),
(78, 'Inferno Reign: The Last Flame', 31, 'A lone warrior stands against an onslaught of fire-born nightmares — where every spark is survival, and every breath, a battle against extinction.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A close-up, ultra-realistic 8K film still captures a harrowing scene. In the foreground, a determined man (use uploaded photo don\'t alter the face), face grim with concentration, kneels and fires a stream of fire from a high-tech flamethrower. The flames erupt with blinding intensity, illuminating the terror in their eyes and the fine details of their combat-worn attire. The air shimmers with heat, and the acrid scent of smoke seems to cling to the image.\r\nIn the midground, monstrous, fire-infused spiders, their carapaces a obsidian black with glowing, molten cracks, advance relentlessly. Their multiple eyes reflect the inferno, and their hairy legs are poised to strike. One colossal spider, a fiery titan, dominates the frame, its form wreathed in actual flames, its fangs dripping with a viscous, molten substance.\r\nIn the background, chaos unfolds as more of these arachnid nightmares swarm across a vast, desolate landscape under a smoke-choked, blood-red sky. Distant explosions light up the horizon, and the faint, panicked forms of other survivors can be seen fleeing, their silhouettes against the inferno. The entire scene is rendered with an excruciating level of detail, from the singed grass to the individual pores on the human skin, creating a visceral and terrifying sense of being in the heart of an apocalyptic battle. No 3D, no cartoon; this is a raw, unyielding depiction of a desperate fight for survival.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762074963_3b9313a3d877.png', NULL, '[\"InfernoReign\",\"PicPose\",\"CinematicArt\",\"8KRealism\",\"ApocalypticVision\",\"FireAndFear\",\"EpicBattleScene\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"AIPhotography\",\"FlamethrowerFury\",\"MoltenMonsters\",\"DarkFantasy\",\"SurvivalArt\",\"RealisticAI\",\"AIArtistry\",\"PicPoseCreations\",\"DesolateWorld\",\"ApocalypseIn8K\",\"CinematicAI\",\"aivisuals\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-02 09:16:03', NULL, 0, 1),
(79, 'Elegance in Motion — The Satin Muse', 18, 'A cinematic studio portrait where grace meets glamour — captured in soft light, draped in flowing chiffon, and framed with timeless sophistication.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a hyper realistic photo of me in a dark gray satin gown with slit, standing confidently in a studio with flowing black and white chiffon fabric swirling dramatically around her, cinematic lighting, soft shadows, neutral gray backdrop, glamorous makeup, long wavy blonde hair, poised hand on head, fashion editorial style, high-resolution photography, Vogue magazine aesthetic, ultra-detailed, hyperrealistic, depth of field, 85mm lens photography, studio portrait perfection –ar 2:3 –v 6 –style raw –q 2 8k resolution\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762075542_dcbee9bee4ac.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"VogueStyle\",\"FashionEditorial\",\"HyperRealisticPortrait\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"StudioPhotography\",\"SatinGown\",\"LuxuryFashion\",\"ChiffonElegance\",\"BlondeBeauty\",\"8KPhotography\",\"HighFashionShoot\",\"GlamorousLook\",\"PhotoPerfection\",\"FashionInFocus\",\"ModernMuse\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-02 09:25:42', NULL, 0, 0),
(80, 'Soaring Smiles Above the Tropics', 17, 'An ultra-realistic aerial adventure moment — capturing pure exhilaration as he glides high above the stunning tropical coastline, framed by sunlit skies and vibrant ocean hues.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic, vibrant aerial adventure photograph captures a joyful man (same face as reference image, 100% accuracy) paragliding high above a breathtaking tropical coastline. He is seated comfortably in his black and orange harness, legs dangling freely, facing the camera with a wide, excited smile, teeth showing, conveying pure exhilaration. He sports dark brown hair and a light beard,\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity, proper padding, and an elegant, unobtrusive design that complements the overall aesthetic without distraction.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762075752_0c263342f514.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"AerialAdventure\",\"ParaglidingVibes\",\"TropicalEscape\",\"AdventurePhotography\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"VibrantShots\",\"SkyHighSmile\",\"PureExhilaration\",\"NatureFromAbove\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"TravelInspiration\",\"AdrenalineRush\",\"OceanView\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-02 09:29:12', NULL, 0, 0),
(81, 'Urban Venom: The Last Stand', 17, 'A hyper-real 8K cinematic moment — a lone warrior in full armor faces a colossal, mutated spider amidst the ruins of a decaying metropolis. Every detail screams survival, grit, and beauty in chaos.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A dramatic ultra-realistic 8K close-up film still of a person (use uploaded photo don\'t alter the face) with an full weapon armour and a fancy rifle, aiming at a colossal, mutated spider with a purple abdomen and pink fangs, scaling a skyscraper in a decaying urban landscape. Focus on the grimy details of the city and the monstrous texture of the spider\'s exoskeleton. The scene is devoid of any 3D rendering or cartoonish elements, capturing a raw, highly detailed, photorealistic moment of intense urban combat.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762076996_7c56048f16fe.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"UrbanVenom\",\"CinematicArt\",\"8KRealism\",\"PhotoRealistic\",\"AIArtistry\",\"SciFiWarrior\",\"MutantSpider\",\"PostApocalyptic\",\"EpicBattle\",\"UltraDetailed\",\"FuturisticWarfare\",\"AIPhotography\",\"HyperReal\",\"DarkCinematic\",\"UrbanDecay\",\"WeaponArmor\",\"ArtOfSurvival\",\"PicPoseCreation\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-02 09:49:56', NULL, 0, 0),
(83, 'The Dragon of Obsidian Peaks 🐉', 31, 'A fierce warrior faces a colossal mechanical dragon in a dark fantasy world of fire, steel, and storm.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A voluptuous warrior in tiny armor, staring at a colossal mechanical dragon, its scales forged from obsidian and eyes burning with ethereal blue fire, stands atop a jagged mountain shrouded in clouds. Below, small villages nestle in valleys, emphasizing the dragon\'s immense size. The style is a dark fantasy concept art piece, with sharp, dynamic lines and a dramatic, high-contrast lighting scheme.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity, proper padding, and an elegant, unobtrusive design that complements the overall aesthetic without distraction.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762078341_3c2ea5fb56ef.png', NULL, '[\"AIArt\",\"DarkFantasy\",\"ConceptArt\",\"PicPose\",\"FantasyIllustration\",\"EpicBattle\",\"DragonArt\",\"DigitalPainting\",\"GeminiPrompt\",\"FantasyWorld\",\"CinematicArt\",\"MythicVibes\",\"ObsidianDragon\",\"AIArtwork\",\"FantasyAesthetics\",\"EpicVisuals\",\"AIPhoto\",\"CreativeDesign\",\"HeroicArt\",\"FantasyWarrior\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-02 10:12:21', NULL, 0, 0),
(84, 'Anime Squad Selfie: Real Meets Reel!', 33, 'A fun fisheye fusion of me with Shinchan, Doraemon, Naruto, Nobita, Gojo, Sung Jin-Woo & Ash — all captured in ultra-realistic cinematic style.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic 9:16 vertical format fisheye selfie of me with [shinchan, Doraemon, Naruto, Nobita, Satoru Gojo, Sung Jin who, Ash from pokimon]. We\'re all making silly, exaggerated faces. Set in a small, bright living room with white tones. High camera angle. Extreme fisheye distortion. Realistic, cinematic lighting, anime characters integrated with stylized realism.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity, proper padding, and an elegant, unobtrusive design that complements the overall aesthetic without distraction.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762079279_93be06009c32.jpg', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"AnimeSelfie\",\"FisheyeFun\",\"RealisticAnime\",\"Naruto\",\"Shinchan\",\"Doraemon\",\"Nobita\",\"SatoruGojo\",\"SungJinWoo\",\"AshKetchum\",\"AIPhotography\",\"AnimeInRealLife\",\"CinematicArt\",\"9x16Portrait\",\"AnimeCrossover\",\"EpicSelfie\",\"PicPoseCreations\",\"AnimeFans\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-02 10:27:59', NULL, 0, 1),
(85, 'Golden Moments of Love ✨', 23, 'A timeless portrait of affection — where elegance meets emotion in every detail.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A portrait of a smiling couple embracing affectionately, wearing traditional South Asian clothing in shades of gold and peach with intricate embroidery and jewelry. The lighting is soft and natural, creating a bright and cheerful mood. They are tightly framed from the waist up, with a slightly blurred outdoor background.\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762238340_03e91df1d110.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CouplePortrait\",\"SouthAsianStyle\",\"GoldenLove\",\"PeachElegance\",\"TraditionalVibes\",\"CoupleGoals\",\"CandidLove\",\"EthnicCharm\",\"TimelessPortrait\",\"CulturalBeauty\",\"ElegantCouple\",\"LoveInDetails\",\"IndianAttire\",\"WeddingInspiration\",\"SoftLighting\",\"NaturalGlow\",\"RomanticFrames\",\"PicPosePortraits\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-04 06:39:00', NULL, 0, 0),
