(87, 'Be Your Own Trend — Bold, Bright, and Unapologetically You.', 27, 'Confidence isn’t about filters — it’s about owning your real self.\r\nStay original. Stay iconic. #picposestyle\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A photorealistic, high-resolution photo composition featuring the exact same face, hairstyle, skin tone, and expression from the uploaded male image — without any artistic modification, beard addition, smoothing, or retouching.\r\nThe goal is to blend the original face perfectly and naturally into a modern Instagram-inspired scene, keeping all lighting, pose, and design identical to the reference layout.\r\nIn the center foreground, the same man (with his real, unaltered face from the uploaded photo) is seated on a bright orange cube that has a white Instagram logo embossed on its front.\r\nHe is wearing a vibrant yellow blazer, a white T-shirt, black trousers, and white sneakers.\r\nHe also wears round yellow-tinted sunglasses that match the scene color palette.\r\nHe holds a black smartphone in one hand, tilted slightly upward as if taking a selfie, and looks at the phone with a confident, natural expression.\r\nEnsure his facial features — eyes, skin, hair, facial hair (or lack of it) — remain exactly as in the uploaded image, blended seamlessly with correct lighting and shadow but untouched otherwise.\r\nBehind him, a large upright realistic smartphone screen (like an iPhone) displays his Instagram profile page.\r\nThe interface on the screen must show:\r\nA circular profile picture of the same man (identical face and outfit) at the top left.\r\nBelow the photo, black text displaying: ★298 posts★, ★5,840 followers★, ★732 Following★.\r\nTwo square thumbnail photos stacked vertically in the feed area, each showing him standing and posing in the same yellow blazer against a bright yellow wall.\r\nA subtle top bar with ★9:41★ time, signal, Wi-Fi, and battery icons.\r\nThe background remains minimal and vivid: a bright yellow wall or building fills the scene, with a lush green bush or plant on the left side for contrast.\r\nThe ground is a smooth light-gray pavement, softly lit with realistic reflections and daylight tone.\r\nLighting is bright, evenly diffused, and natural, creating soft, accurate shadows without overexposure.\r\nAll materials — skin, clothing, and background — should appear real and tactile, with consistent tone and perspective.\r\nBoth the real seated man and his Instagram profile image must retain the exact face and expression from the uploaded image, perfectly matched in identity and lighting — no AI reinterpretation, no added beard, no change in hairstyle or structure.\r\nThe final scene must appear realistic, influencer-styled, cinematic, and clean, preserving the uploaded photo’s authentic facial detail while embedding it naturally in the Instagram-inspired yellow aesthetic.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762239269_2cee303c6936.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"InstaVibe\",\"BoldLook\",\"YellowAesthetic\",\"ModernMood\",\"NoFilterNeeded\",\"ConfidenceGoals\",\"StreetStyleShoot\",\"FashionFrame\",\"InstaInfluencer\",\"VibrantVibes\",\"CleanComposition\",\"RealIsRare\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"SelfMadeStyle\",\"MinimalBackdrop\",\"brightandreal\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-04 06:54:29', NULL, 0, 1),
(88, 'Between Reality & The Frame', 27, 'Aarohi Verma — The Real Me and the Digital Reflection.\r\nA photorealistic mirror between presence and pixels — where confidence meets creation.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A photorealistic, high-detail conceptual portrait showing the same woman twice — once in real life and once inside a digital Instagram frame — both faces and features adapted directly from the uploaded image.\r\nIn the center of the scene, a large 3D white Instagram-style post frame floats upright in the air.\r\nInside the frame appears a close-up portrait of the same woman (using the uploaded person’s face, skin tone, and hairstyle) wearing a crisp white shirt, softly touching her hair, and gazing confidently at the camera.\r\nHer expression is gentle and natural, perfectly matching the uploaded image.\r\nThe Instagram interface on the frame must be identical to the reference:\r\nCircular profile picture (same woman’s face) on the top left.\r\nUsername ★Aarohi_Verma★ in bold black font.\r\nSub-header ★Bengaluru, India★ in smaller gray text below.\r\nThree small gray dots aligned horizontally in the top-right corner.\r\nFloating red 3D social icons: a heart with ★1★, a comment bubble with ★1★, and a paper-plane share icon.\r\nBottom bar showing a heart, comment, and send icon with the text ★193 likes★ and ★Aarohi_Verma★.\r\nIn the foreground at the right side, the same woman appears again (same face and expression from the uploaded photo), seated on a tall black stool, wearing the same white shirt, blue jeans, and black heels, holding a silver laptop on her lap and smiling gently toward the camera.\r\nBoth faces must match perfectly — same identity, same features, realistic lighting continuity.\r\nThe background shows a softly blurred, modern indoor room with warm golden lamps and bokeh lights, producing a cozy, cinematic depth of field.\r\nLighting is soft, warm, and balanced across both versions of the woman.\r\nMaintain the exact framing, proportions, and spacing between the real subject and her digital Instagram version.\r\nThe overall tone is clean, influencer-style, photorealistic, high-resolution, and identical in composition to the reference image — only the face and expression should adapt from the uploaded photo.\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762239996_d9996e41632b.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"AarohiVerma\",\"DigitalReflection\",\"BetweenRealityAndTheFrame\",\"InfluencerVibes\",\"ModernMuse\",\"DualIdentity\",\"InstaLife\",\"Photorealism\",\"ConceptualPortrait\",\"AIPhotography\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"VisualStorytelling\",\"VirtualAndReal\",\"DreamInFocus\",\"Hyperrealism\",\"CreativePortrait\",\"BangaloreModel\",\"InstaArt\",\"RealVsDigital\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-04 07:06:36', NULL, 0, 0),
(89, 'Abdullah & Maira — A Fairytale Ride of Love', 26, 'A dreamy celebration of two hearts, riding together toward forever.\r\n21 December 2025 | A Whimsical Wedding Story\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an invitation card with This invitation card presents a whimsical and romantic theme, likely for a wedding celebration. 1. CARD STYLE & THEME: The overall design style is modern with a touch of fairytale charm. The color scheme includes a soft, blended background of peach, yellow, and blue, creating a dreamy atmosphere. Accents of pink, green, and gold can also be observed in the decorative elements. The theme is romantic and celebratory. 2. LAYOUT & COMPOSITION: The layout is visually balanced, with the illustrated couple and bicycle placed centrally. The visual hierarchy leads the eye from the names at the top, to the couple, and down to the date. The card has a good balance between text and imagery. 3. TEXT ELEMENTS: * ★Abdullah & Maira★: Positioned at the top, this text is in a decorative, flowing script font in a vibrant red color. Small floral accents flank the name. * ★21 December 2025★: Located beneath the names, the date is presented in a simpler, sans-serif font in a dark color. 4. DECORATIVE ELEMENTS: The card features a hand-drawn illustration of a couple with a bicycle adorned with an abundance of pink and orange flowers. String lights are illustrated hanging from the top. The background has a watercolor-like texture. 5. CHARACTER/COUPLE STYLE: The couple is illustrated in a cartoon/animated style. The style is detailed, and the characters have realistic proportions.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762240997_3939eed7170f.png', NULL, '[\"AbdullahAndMaira\",\"PicPoseInvites\",\"WhimsicalWedding\",\"FairytaleLove\",\"RomanticVows\",\"CoupleGoals\",\"DreamyWeddingCard\",\"BicycleOfLove\",\"PeachAndBlueTheme\",\"ElegantInvitation\",\"WatercolorRomance\",\"ModernWeddingDesign\",\"PicPoseMagic\",\"LoveInFullBloom\",\"ForeverBeginsHere\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-04 07:23:17', NULL, 0, 2),
(90, 'Whispers of Spring', 19, 'Where innocence meets magic — under the cherry blossoms, even dreams come alive.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, cinematic photo of the same person from the uploaded image, kneeling under blooming pink cherry blossom trees in soft golden sunlight. The person is gently touching a small animated baby deer (Bambi-style), surrounded by softly falling petals. The scene has a dreamy, fairytale atmosphere with warm natural light, soft shadows, and ultra-detailed depth of field. The background shows glowing pink blossoms, a peaceful park ambiance, and light haze for a magical look. The expression of joy and innocence is clearly visible on the face, perfectly blending realism with a hint of animation. The colors are pastel and balanced peach, pink, beige, and gold tones.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762241828_55dea219b41b.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CherryBlossomMagic\",\"FairytaleVibes\",\"DreamyPortrait\",\"HyperRealisticArt\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"SpringWhispers\",\"GoldenHourGlow\",\"FantasyMeetsReality\",\"SoftLightAesthetics\",\"BambiMoments\",\"PastelDreamscape\",\"NatureAndEmotion\",\"ArtOfImagination\",\"magicalrealism\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-04 07:37:08', NULL, 0, 2),
(91, '🌮 TACO TUESDAY DELIGHT!', 22, 'Get 2 Irresistible Tacos for Just $5 — Every Tuesday, Every Bite Worth It!\r\n(Crisp, flavorful, and crafted fresh — because Tuesdays deserve a treat!)\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A Professional Restaurant Food Advertisement Poster\r\n\r\n★★Title Section★★\r\nthe text: ★TACOS★ (large, bold, yellow, slightly angled)\r\nthe text: ★Tuesday★ (script, white, under \"TACOS\", overlapping slightly)\r\n\r\n★★Price Section★★\r\nthe text: ★PRICE★ (small, white, above the price)\r\nthe text: ★5$★ (larger, black and white with black shadow, inside yellow circle)\r\n\r\n★★Offer Section★★\r\nthe text: ★GET 2 TACOS FOR $5★ (yellow banner, bold)\r\nthe text: ★EVERY TUESDAY★ (yellow banner, bold, beneath the previous line)\r\n\r\n★★Main Image★★\r\nUltra-realistic image of three tacos on a black plate, garnished with lime wedges. The tacos are filled with shredded meat, avocado chunks, and cilantro. There is a blurred avocado half floating in the background, along with a blurred red pepper.\r\n\r\n★★Restaurant Information Section★★\r\nthe text: ★Your Company Logo★ (logo placeholder, top left)\r\nthe text: ★[Address]★ (small, white, address)\r\n\r\nOverall Design Style\r\nThe poster uses a square format with a deep red, textured background with orange gradients near the top. The lighting highlights the tacos, making them appear appetizing. The composition is dynamic, with the text and images arranged to capture attention. The style is modern and slightly rustic. The overall mood is inviting and promotes a special offer. The food photography is crisp with a shallow depth of field, blurring the background and emphasizing the tacos.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762243197_b3abd0fbbe40.png', NULL, '[\"TacoTuesdayDelight\",\"PicPoseDesign\",\"TacoLovers\",\"FoodieDelight\",\"TacoTime\",\"MexicanVibes\",\"StreetFoodMagic\",\"TacoDeal\",\"EatFreshStayHappy\",\"TuesdaySpecial\",\"TacoFiesta\",\"YummyTacos\",\"DeliciousOffer\",\"FoodAdvertisement\",\"TasteTheJoy\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-04 07:59:57', NULL, 0, 1),
(92, 'Snow Scream Express', 33, 'A hilarious winter ride of chaos, courage, and cozy cuteness — where fear meets fluff in a swirl of snow and laughter.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A digital caricature painting of a terified little girl with wild red hair sledding down a snowy hill, holding a fluffy fawn-colored dachshund puppy. Both scream in horror as snow swirls around them. The winter forest background glows softly in the pale sunlight, creating a cozy yet humorous atmosphere. Highly detailed, expressive, and full of motion. The storybook style illustration, soft lighting, painterly textures, distorted perspective.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762255235_c96fe0a802ed.png', NULL, '[\"SnowScreamExpress\",\"PicPoseArt\",\"WinterWhirl\",\"CuteCaricature\",\"SnowDayFun\",\"DigitalIllustration\",\"StorybookMagic\",\"WhimsicalArt\",\"FrozenFury\",\"RedHairedAdventure\",\"PuppyPanic\",\"CreativeJourney\",\"PicPoseGallery\",\"ArtThatSmiles\",\"ChillAndThrill\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-04 11:20:35', NULL, 0, 4),
(93, 'The Frostborn King', 27, 'An ultra-realistic cinematic portrait of power and ice — where a cold empire bows before its ruler and his dragon of frost.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic 8K close-up film still of a stern-faced man (use uploaded photo don\'t alter the face) with dark gold hair, clad in intricate black leather and fur armor, seated majestically atop a colossal, glowing blue ice dragon. The dragon\'s scales are sharp and crystalline, emanating an ethereal blue light and frost. Its breath billows out as a frozen mist. The scene is set against a dramatic, snow-laden mountain landscape with a frozen lake reflecting the icy sky. Highly detailed, no 3D rendering, no cartoon, photo-realistic, cinematic lighting.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity, proper padding, and an elegant, unobtrusive design that complements the overall aesthetic without distraction..', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762330164_b500b63bf040.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"IceDragon\",\"FrostbornKing\",\"8KRealism\",\"EpicFantasyArt\",\"PhotoRealistic\",\"LegendaryWarrior\",\"IceRealm\",\"FantasyPhotography\",\"DragonRider\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"VisualEpic\",\"MythicRealism\",\"ArcticMajesty\",\"EpicVisuals\",\"fantasyportrait\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-05 08:09:24', NULL, 0, 3),
(94, 'Whispers of the Forest Queen', 27, 'A mystical bond between grace and nature — where elegance meets enchantment in every detail.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A striking fantasy portrait depicts a young woman with long, dark hair, with distinct sections of white streaks near her face. She has pale skin, defined eyebrows, dark-rimmed eyes, and full lips painted a deep red-brown. She is slim with a generous chest and long legs, dressed in an elaborate green and white outfit. She wears a white hooded cape and a green dress with a flowing skirt. Her arms and legs are intricately decorated with swirling green patterns, resembling vines and lilies. She stands gracefully, with a pointing finger raised to her lips, and is accompanied by a majestic silver fox, with closed eyes, nestling next to her. The background is blurred, creating a strong contrast that makes the green and white elements stand out. The overall aesthetic is elegant and mystical, with a strong emphasis on detailed ornamentation and play of color.\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762330680_2694018c11ed.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"FantasyPortrait\",\"MysticalBeauty\",\"ForestQueen\",\"SilverFox\",\"ElegantArt\",\"DigitalFantasy\",\"NatureGoddess\",\"EnchantedAesthetic\",\"GreenMagic\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"ArtOfGrace\",\"WhispersOfNature\",\"FantasyPhotography\",\"DreamlikeArt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-05 08:18:00', NULL, 0, 1),
(95, 'Selfie in the Multiverse', 31, 'A hyper-realistic 4K HDR moment where Akmal unites with legendary heroes, anime icons, and cartoon stars in a magical jungle selfie — a fusion of fantasy, nostalgia, and cinematic realism.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an Ultra hyper realistic HDR Photo of a old 25 year man akmal wearing a purple hoodie and jeans, holding a smartphone to take a selfie with a diverse group of famous cartoon characters and superheroes. The characters should include Doraemon, Pikachu, Ben 10, Pokemon, Motu-Patlu, Ninja, Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtle (like Michelangelo or Donatello), a realistic lion character (like the one from The Lion King), and several animated human characters (including a girl, a boy with glasses, and two muscular superheroes). All characters are standing together in a lush, sun-dappled jungle or forest setting. Vibrant colors, cinematic lighting, photorealistic kid. 4k highly detailed.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity, proper padding, and an elegant, unobtrusive design that complements the overall aesthetic without distraction..', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762331342_b36d6fdf7b8c.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"AIArt\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"4KRender\",\"FantasySelfie\",\"CartoonCrossover\",\"AnimeFusion\",\"Doraemon\",\"Pikachu\",\"Ben10\",\"PokemonWorld\",\"MotuPatlu\",\"TMNT\",\"SuperheroUniverse\",\"RealisticArt\",\"HDRPhotography\",\"DigitalMasterpiece\",\"JungleVibes\",\"aiphotography\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-05 08:29:02', NULL, 0, 0),
(96, 'The King of Hearts Walks the Runway', 17, 'A bold fusion of streetwear elegance and luxury — where confidence meets charisma on the red runway. Captured in 4K DSLR brilliance.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Generate a 4k DSLR Photography of Create an ultra-stylish fashion portrait of a young male(same person in image, exactly same facial feature, same moustache and he is 6.1 feet Tall) model walking on a glossy red runway at a high-end fashion show. He wears a bold, black and white designer sweater featuring a large \"King of Hearts\" playing card graphic, red heart motifs, and ornate patterns. His pants are relaxed black joggers with a decorative keychain clipped on one\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity, proper padding, and an elegant, unobtrusive design that complements the overall aesthetic without distraction..', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762331574_e472c18f1787.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"FashionPortrait\",\"RunwayStyle\",\"KingOfHearts\",\"LuxuryFashion\",\"DSLRPhotography\",\"HighFashionShoot\",\"MensStyle\",\"RedRunway\",\"DesignerWear\",\"StreetwearLuxury\",\"PortraitPhotography\",\"ModelVibes\",\"CinematicLook\",\"4KPhotography\",\"EditorialPortrait\",\"MensFashionEditorial\",\"FashionInFocus\",\"PicPosePhotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-05 08:32:54', NULL, 0, 1),
(97, 'Skyline Vision: Capturing the City from Above', 17, 'A seamless blend of man, machine, and modern perspective — where passion for photography meets the freedom of flight.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'black DSLR camera with a large telephoto lens. Drone: white consumer quadcopter with visible camera/gimbal, rotors spinning mild motion blur on propellers only. Background: aerial view of a modern city skyline in the mid-distance tall glass towers, lush green park and residential area in the foreground, rolling hills of trees, bright blue sky with large fluffy white clouds. Lighting: bright midday sunlight, soft cinematic rim light on subject, natural shadows consistent with sun position. he siting on dron\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity, proper padding, and an elegant, unobtrusive design that complements the overall aesthetic without distraction.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762341305_632fda4fda9a.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"DronePhotography\",\"AerialCinematography\",\"CityscapeShots\",\"PhotographyPassion\",\"SkylineView\",\"TelephotoLens\",\"CreativeVision\",\"ModernAesthetics\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"DroneLife\",\"VisualStorytelling\",\"UrbanExplorer\",\"PhotoArtistry\",\"LensAndWings\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-05 11:15:05', NULL, 0, 0),
(98, 'Bloom in the Glow', 19, 'A cozy indoor vibe where innocence meets style — a radiant boy lost in colors, lights, and calm moments of charm.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A vibrant indoor lifestyle photo of a handsome 7-year-old boy sitting in a circular wooden nook On wall with hanging plants and neon lights with big white ball,, wearing a colorful pink rose colour fullSleeve sweetshirt, light white trousers, White Apple Watch, Wight socks, and chunky white sports shoes, Full Body View casual relaxed pose looking down, One Hand holding a flower bookey, bright soft lighting, cozy modern cafe vibe\" with flowers in background eyes on camera. Keep my face 100% uploaded\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762342062_b15b71567184.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"LifestylePhotography\",\"IndoorPortrait\",\"CinematicKidsShoot\",\"ModernCafeVibes\",\"ChildModel\",\"CreativePortrait\",\"NeonAesthetic\",\"SoftLighting\",\"BloomInTheGlow\",\"CozyVibes\",\"ChicStyle\",\"PhotographyArt\",\"PoseWithGrace\",\"DreamyPortrait\",\"FashionInnocence\",\"PicPoseMagic\",\"ElegantAesthetics\",\"NaturalCharm\",\"photoinspiration\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-05 11:27:42', NULL, 0, 3),
(99, 'Last Sniper: Rise from the Ruins', 31, 'A lone special forces warrior stands defiant atop a shattered skyline — humanity’s final line against the cyber-mutant apocalypse.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Transform the uploaded person into a battle-hardened special forces soldier positioned on a damaged skyscraper rooftop in a post-apocalyptic city.\r\nA massive cyber-mutant gorilla (half flesh, half mechanical muscle) towers in the background, roaring amidst destroyed buildings and smoke-filled skies.\r\nThe soldier wears modern military camouflage gear, tactical vest, helmet or green beret, and holds a high-tech sniper rifle with glowing digital scope.\r\nLighting is cinematic and moody, with a gray cloudy sky, dust particles, and subtle orange sparks from destruction.\r\nAdd realistic film-grade textures, dynamic depth of field, epic scale contrast, and futuristic war atmosphere.\r\n— cinematic lighting, ultra-realistic, 8k, dramatic tone, concept art, high detail, volumetric smoke, movie poster style.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity, proper padding, and an elegant, unobtrusive design that complements the overall aesthetic without distraction.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762407372_1e354b883052.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"GymPortrait\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"UHDPhotography\",\"MirrorlessShot\",\"AthleteFocus\",\"FitnessArt\",\"SportsPhotography\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"WorkoutVibes\",\"GymMotivation\",\"PortraitOfStrength\",\"PumaStyle\",\"AdidasFit\",\"RealismArt\",\"AIPhotography\",\"ModernGym\",\"CinematicDepth\",\"PhotoRealism\",\"PicPoseStyle\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-06 05:36:12', NULL, 0, 1),
(100, 'Echoes of the Last Dawn', 27, 'An elite warrior rises from the ruins — humanity’s final guardian beneath the wings of a cyber eagle.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Transform the uploaded person into an elite futuristic soldier kneeling on a destroyed skyscraper rooftop in a post-apocalyptic city.\r\nThe person is wearing modern camouflage uniform, tactical vest, combat boots, gloves, and a green beret or helmet, holding a high-tech assault rifle with a digital scope and silencer.\r\nA massive, fierce cyber–eagle with glowing metallic feathers and fiery eyes spreads its wings dramatically above the soldier, creating tension and scale.\r\nThe background shows crumbling buildings, smoke, ash in the air, and muted golden cinematic lighting (dusty sunlight breaking through clouds).\r\nAdd high realism, 8K ultra-detailed texture, volumetric lighting, depth of field, and epic movie poster composition.\r\nThe atmosphere should feel intense, heroic, and cinematic, with embers and debris flying through the air.\r\n— dramatic tone, film-grade lighting, ultra-realistic, photoreal, post-apocalyptic, concept art, cinematic war fantasy, detailed environment, professional color grading.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity, proper padding, and an elegant, unobtrusive design that complements the overall aesthetic without distraction..', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762407526_485e79cd3989.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"FuturisticSoldier\",\"PostApocalypticArt\",\"CyberEagle\",\"CinematicWarrior\",\"EpicConceptArt\",\"HeroInRuins\",\"UltraRealisticPortrait\",\"8KFantasy\",\"DigitalWarfare\",\"MoviePosterVibes\",\"VolumetricLighting\",\"DustAndEmbers\",\"WarriorOfTomorrow\",\"PicPoseLegends\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-06 05:38:46', NULL, 0, 0);
