(101, 'Leap of Fire: The Red Escape', 27, 'A high-octane cinematic still capturing Bilal in mid-leap — power, dust, and golden-hour glory frozen in time.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an 8K ultra-realistic cinematic action portrait of a man jumping off a vintage red convertible car, caught mid-motion with dust and smoke around.\r\n⚡ Face & Identity:\r\n\r\nUse Bilal’s exact real face — same beard, hairstyle, and skin tone.\r\n\r\nExpression serious, focused, powerful.\r\n\r\nNo stylization, 100% realistic facial match.\r\n👕 Outfit & Styling:\r\n\r\nDark green casual shirt (same as green car photo).\r\nBlack fitted trousers.\r\nShirt slightly open at collar.\r\nBlack leather gloves.\r\nAviator sunglasses.\r\nWatch on left wrist.\r\nSlight motion in shirt fabric due to wind.\r\n🚗 Action Scene Setup:\r\n\r\nMan jumping off a vintage red convertible with car doors open.\r\nDust and debris flying under his shoes for dramatic motion effect.\r\nSlight smoke or light haze behind the car.\r\nBackground blurred slightly for focus on the man.\r\n🌤️ Lighting & Mood:\r\n\r\nCinematic golden-hour light (sunset orange + shadow contrast).\r\nBacklight glow on edges of face and clothes.\r\nSubtle lens flare for realism.\r\n🌆 Environment & Atmosphere:\r\n\r\nOpen road or coastal pier location.\r\nDynamic wind effect visible on hair and clothes.\r\nOptional faint reflection of sunlight on car body.\r\n🎥 Composition & Quality:\r\n\r\nCaptured mid-action (motion freeze).\r\nSlight slow-motion energy — dust, fabric, smoke all frozen clearly.\r\nFull body visible.\r\nUltra-detailed 8K realism, cinematic tone, rich shadows.\r\nShould look like a movie still frame from an action thriller\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity, proper padding, and an elegant, unobtrusive design that complements the overall aesthetic without distraction..', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762410042_95b25f20597d.png', NULL, '[\"BilalActionFrame\",\"PicPoseCinematic\",\"LeapOfFire\",\"RedConvertibleThrill\",\"GoldenHourShot\",\"8KRealism\",\"MovieStillVibes\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"AdrenalineFreeze\",\"PicPoseMagic\",\"HeroInMotion\",\"ActionPhotography\",\"EpicVisuals\",\"ThrillInFocus\",\"DustAndDrama\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-06 06:20:42', NULL, 0, 1),
(102, 'City Brewed Expressions', 17, 'A 3D caricature of personality and humor — where style meets caffeine in the sparkling city lights.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'From the uploaded photo, create a highly stylized 3D caricature, featuring a man (pictured) wearing an Indian jersey, ripped jeans, and white sneakers. A cup of coffee sits on a small table, with a large head, expressive facial features, and exaggerated humor. The caricature is drawn in a subtle dipole style, using clean materials and soft ambient lighting. The background is a sparkling city, with a bokeh effect.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity, proper padding, and an elegant, unobtrusive design that complements the overall aesthetic without distraction..', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762411131_dfb9c7070668.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"3DCaricature\",\"CityVibes\",\"CoffeeMood\",\"StylizedPortrait\",\"IndianJerseyStyle\",\"DigitalArtMagic\",\"UrbanGlow\",\"DipoleStyle\",\"ArtWithHumor\",\"PicPoseCreations\",\"ExpressiveDesign\",\"BokehDreams\",\"ModernIllustration\",\"CaricatureArt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-06 06:38:51', NULL, 0, 0),
(103, 'Gloves & Giggles: The Ultimate Showdown', 33, 'A hyper-real Olympic boxing clash where reality meets cartoon chaos — when a real champion faces Bugs Bunny under the blazing arena lights of laughter and power.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A super-realistic cinematic image of a real male boxer in red Olympic uniform and red gloves, facing off against Bugs Bunny in classic blue boxing uniform, inside an Olympic arena lit by daylight. The Olympic logos are visible in the background. The camera finds their faces and highly efficient and expressive details with precision. The man throws a powerful punch at Bugs, who dodges it with a playful smile. He touches the man\'s face while Bugs, with his funny cartoon expressions, makes mutual contact and looks at the punch with wide eyes and an open mouth in a comical expression. The audience in the stands consists of famous cartoon characters such as Daffy Duck, Sylvester, and Tweety, cheering wildly. Lively and laughing in a real Olympic sports program with cinematic effects infused with a cartoonish touch. (Close-up shot, daylight, cinematic blend of realism + classic animation, Ultra HD, 16K)\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity, proper padding, and an elegant, unobtrusive design that complements the overall aesthetic without distraction.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762418568_42ed9c18978a.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"GymPortrait\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"UHDPhotography\",\"MirrorlessShot\",\"AthleteFocus\",\"FitnessArt\",\"SportsPhotography\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"WorkoutVibes\",\"GymMotivation\",\"PortraitOfStrength\",\"PumaStyle\",\"AdidasFit\",\"RealismArt\",\"AIPhotography\",\"ModernGym\",\"CinematicDepth\",\"PhotoRealism\",\"PicPoseStyle\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-06 08:42:48', NULL, 0, 1),
(104, 'Neverland Selfie Magic', 19, 'A one-year-old’s enchanting moment in Peter Pan’s moonlit world — where fairy dust, friendship, and imagination come alive in a cinematic fantasy frame.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Use the uploaded photo of the 1-year-old girl as the base. Transform it into a photo-realistic Peter Pan inspired fantasy scene.\r\nThe little girl should appear smiling and holding a smartphone as if taking a selfie. Surround her with life-sized, semi-realistic versions of Peter Pan, Tinker Bell, Wendy, Captain Hook, Lost Boys, and the crocodile — all with expressive, magical details but rendered in a realistic cinematic style.\r\nBackground: a dreamy night sky filled with clouds and a glowing full moon, with Captain Hook’s pirate ship floating in the background. Soft sparkles of fairy dust from Tinker Bell should surround the girl, making her part of the magical world.\r\nLighting: moonlight glow mixed with soft fairy dust illumination, highlighting her natural skin tones with realistic texture and a gentle magical shimmer.\r\nCamera angle: selfie perspective with the girl in central focus, surrounded by the characters in playful poses.\r\nLens: 24mm wide-angle for immersive framing with dreamy shallow depth of field.\r\nFinal output should appear like a Canon EOS R5 cinematic capture, professionally graded in Lightroom with cool moonlit tones, glowing highlights, and realistic textures, blending the uploaded girl seamlessly into the Peter Pan fantasy world.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762421175_13fd8e8b94de.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseFantasy\",\"NeverlandDreams\",\"PeterPanMagic\",\"TinkerBellGlow\",\"FairyDustMoments\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"FantasyPhotography\",\"MoonlitWonder\",\"MagicalChildhood\",\"CreativePhotoArt\",\"ImaginativeWorld\",\"CanonCinematicLook\",\"LightroomMagic\",\"PicPoseEdit\",\"DreamyVisuals\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-06 09:26:15', NULL, 0, 2),
(105, 'Elegance in Every Sip', 18, 'A timeless fine art portrait capturing the serene grace of a Victorian lady at afternoon tea — where light, lace, and luxury meet in golden harmony.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic fine art portrait of a graceful Victorian lady enjoying afternoon tea in an elegant 19th-century parlor. She sits beside a lace-covered table set with delicate porcelain teacups, a silver teapot, and a plate of scones and pastries. Sunlight filters through sheer embroidered curtains, casting a warm golden glow across the room. She wears an ornate pastel silk gown with intricate lace trim, puffed sleeves, and a corseted bodice, accessorized with pearl jewelry and soft gloves. Her hair is styled in an elaborate updo with gentle curls framing her face, adorned with small silk flowers. Her expression is serene and poised, eyes gazing softly toward the window. Background filled with antique furniture, floral wallpaper, and a faint wisp of steam rising from her teacup.\r\n(Ultra-realistic lighting, cinematic depth of field, timeless elegance, fine details in textures of fabric and porcelain,\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity, proper padding, and an elegant, unobtrusive design that complements the overall aesthetic without distraction.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762424606_95ecebe7c984.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"FineArtPortrait\",\"VictorianElegance\",\"AfternoonTea\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"TimelessBeauty\",\"GoldenEraVibes\",\"ClassicArtistry\",\"ElegantAesthetics\",\"VintageLuxury\",\"RealisticPortrait\",\"VictorianStyle\",\"SoftLightMagic\",\"ArtOfGrace\",\"HeritageCharm\",\"picposeart\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-06 10:23:26', NULL, 0, 0),
(106, 'The Spaghetti Couture', 18, 'Where Culinary Art Meets High Fashion — A surreal blend of elegance, flavor, and imagination.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'ransform the uploaded person into a surreal high-fashion portrait. The person should be standing gracefully inside a warmly lit kitchen or dining area, wearing an elegant gown entirely made of long spaghetti noodles. The noodles should flow naturally from the body like a real fabric, detailed and glossy, with chili slices, lime pieces, cherry tomatoes, and green beans artistically embedded in the dress. The lighting should be cinematic with soft sunlight entering from the window. The face and expression of the original person should remain realistic and beautiful. Add a shallow depth of field and premium photo-realistic texture.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762425830_eca3fd7e61a6.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseCreations\",\"SpaghettiCouture\",\"FashionMeetsFood\",\"SurrealElegance\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"GourmetGlamour\",\"ArtisticPhotography\",\"CreativeVision\",\"HighFashionEdit\",\"foodinspiredfashion\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-06 10:43:50', NULL, 0, 1),
(107, 'Hearts of Twilight', 17, 'Where desert dreams glow with love and light — a serene moment wrapped in velvet hues and crystal warmth.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A young man with her black hair. sits gracefully on smooth, dark desert sand at twilight. He is wearing an blue velvet shirt and white cargo jeans, and white top shoes. He is smiling naturally and looking directly at the camera.\r\nThe surreal environment features **large, glowing heart sculptures** made of intricate white crystal or textured stone, emitting a soft, warm, diffused light onto the sand. A vibrant river of **highly reflective, wet-look pink and red pebbles** flows behind her.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity, proper padding, and an elegant, unobtrusive design that complements the overall aesthetic without distraction.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762426646_7ffe9ccbb01d.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"HeartsOfTwilight\",\"DesertDreamscape\",\"TwilightGlow\",\"EtherealPortrait\",\"CrystalHearts\",\"VelvetVibes\",\"AestheticPhotography\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"DreamyDesert\",\"SoftLightMagic\",\"ArtisticMood\",\"VisualPoetry\",\"GoldenAura\",\"modernportraits\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-06 10:57:26', NULL, 0, 0),
(108, 'Snowy Smile – A Cozy Winter Portrait', 20, 'Capturing the joy of winter with soft light, snowy charm, and a heartwarming smile — where every flake tells a story.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a high-quality winter portrait of the uploaded person sitting happily in snow. The person should wear a red puffer jacket, gray pants, brown winter boots, green woolen cap with pom-pom, and colorful gloves. Background should be full of white snow, pine trees covered with snow, and softly falling snowflakes. Lighting should be bright, soft, and cinematic — giving a cozy, cheerful winter vibe. The person should be smiling naturally. Add depth of field and a slightly dreamy winter atmosphere.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762427789_20b7d2abace0.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"WinterPortrait\",\"SnowPhotography\",\"CozyVibes\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"SnowfallMagic\",\"WinterMood\",\"RedJacketStyle\",\"DreamyWinter\",\"SnowySmile\",\"SoftLightPortrait\",\"PicPoseOfficial\",\"WinterWonderland\",\"PineForestSnow\",\"ChillAndCheer\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 1, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-06 11:16:29', NULL, 7, 19),
(109, 'The Alpha’s Shadow', 31, 'A mysterious man and his fierce wolf — intellect meets instinct in a world where power and darkness collide.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Keep the facial features the same to create a hyper-realistic, dramatic and stylized portrait featuring a man and a large, fierce wolf, set against a dark, textured stone background.\r\nThe man is the central human figure, seated on a tall, uneven stack of vintage books. he has purple hair and is wearing black shade, black shirt with PicPose logo, green cargo pants and black vans shoes. Hia posture is relaxed but commanding. he is looking directly at the viewer with a serious, intense expression.\r\nthe wolf standing sideview in his back. The wolf has thick, shaggy fur and a highly menacing expression, with its mouth partially open in a snarl, revealing its teeth. Its eyes are a striking, intense yellow or amber. The wolf\'s paws are resting near the woman on the stack of books. The contrast between the woman\'s composed, elegant appearance and the wolf\'s savage intensity is a key element of the composition.\r\nThe setting is moody and dark. The background is a rough, dark grey stone or brick wall. The lighting is lowkey, creating deep shadows, which adds to the overall mysterious and slightly gothic atmosphere of the image. The stack of old, leather-bound books she is sitting on adds a scholarly or perhaps magical/literary element to the scene.\r\nOverall, the image seems to evoke themes of power, duality, and perhaps a connection to the wild or the supernatural.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762428908_86d4e2e5a376.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"AlphaBond\",\"DarkAesthetic\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"WolfSpirit\",\"PowerAndMystery\",\"DualityOfMan\",\"GothicVibes\",\"HyperRealisticArt\",\"FantasyRealism\",\"MoodyPortrait\",\"TheBeastWithin\",\"StylizedPhotography\",\"AIArtistry\",\"WildElegance\",\"VisualAlchemy\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-06 11:35:08', NULL, 0, 5),
(110, 'The Hoverboard Chase', 17, 'A fearless rider defies gravity and destiny, chased by the DeLorean through golden mountain trails — where speed meets the future.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic cinematic scene of a fearless man image above left (preserve facial features 100% for face reference) riding a sleek black hoverboard without wheels from the back to the Future movie without helmet on a winding mountain road at high speed. Behind him, a powerful deLeoran time machine from back to the future flies low and fast, chasing through the rugged valley. The golden hour sunlight casts dramatic highlights and long shadows across the landscape, emphasizing the adrenaline and intensity of the moment. The man wears a blue red sleeveless puff jacket with white jike cortez sneakers and blue jeans. He is focused and determined. The environment features tall pine trees, sharp turns, and distant mountain peaks fading into a warm haze. The image evokes the energy and style of Top Gun, with motion blur and depth that enhance the realism and thrill.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762577508_c82ede93b740.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"RacingTime\",\"HoverboardChase\",\"BackToTheFutureVibes\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"HyperRealism\",\"FutureRide\",\"DeLoreanChase\",\"GoldenHourGlow\",\"TopGunEnergy\",\"AdrenalineArt\",\"MotionInFocus\",\"DigitalRealism\",\"TimeTraveller\",\"EpicVisuals\",\"AIArtistry\",\"PicPoseCreation\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-08 04:51:48', NULL, 0, 1),
(111, 'Whispers of Steam – The PicPose Morning', 33, 'A surreal fusion of art and fantasy — where a cup of hot tea breathes life into mist, forming a soulful reflection surrounded by cartoon wonder.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A stunning 8K image of a transparent glass teacup imprinted with \"PicPose.\"\r\nThe cup is filled with hot tea. A fine mist rises from the cup, transforming into a graceful, smoky form of a handsome young man. His entire body is made of steam and mist—no skin, no clothes, no visible solid form—yet his face is perfectly rendered and identical to the images shown, identifiable without any alterations or modifications. The steam figure stands serenely above the cup, naturally in harmony with the rising vapors. Surrounding him are the cartoon characters Bugs Bunny and Daffy Duck.\r\nThe scene is set on a cozy kitchen table with scattered coffee beans and warm morning sunlight filtering through the background. The atmosphere is cinematic, artistic, and dreamlike, with meticulous detail, realistic reflections on the glass, and a natural depth of field. Add a small letter in the upper left corner of the image that reads.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762577612_088608a2aab7.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"DigitalArt\",\"AIArt\",\"CinematicRender\",\"FantasyPortrait\",\"SteamMan\",\"8KArtwork\",\"TeaArt\",\"DreamlikeVisuals\",\"SurrealPhotography\",\"CartoonFusion\",\"BugsBunny\",\"DaffyDuck\",\"MorningVibes\",\"ArtisticComposition\",\"CreativeImagination\",\"VisualStorytelling\",\"RealisticReflections\",\"PicPoseLogo\",\"CinematicMood\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 1, '2025-11-08 04:53:32', NULL, 0, 3),
(112, 'Love by the Shoreline', 23, 'A cinematic fashion editorial capturing a couple’s serene walk along the crystal waters of Manuel Antonio Beach — where elegance meets paradise under the golden sun.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Reimagine A stunning couple walking along the crystal blue shoreline of Manuel Antonio Beach in Costa Rica, white sand, gentle waves, luxury tropical paradise, golden hour glow, cinematic wide shot, fashion magazine style.full body shot of the couple with zoom in focus on the couple\r\nOOTD:\r\nFlowy sage green resort dress with high slit, gold anklet, layered jewelry, luxury straw hat, , designer tote bag, barefoot on sand, effortless glam.lingsleeve sage green with white short\r\nVibe:\r\nSoft sun, rich traveler energy, Vogue travel editorial, ultra high definition.\r\nMake it real face the photo uploaded dont change the face and hairstyle\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762577879_e4a8eb9803f1.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"GoldenHourGlow\",\"LuxuryCoupleShoot\",\"TropicalEditorial\",\"VogueStyle\",\"CostaRicaParadise\",\"ManuelAntonioBeach\",\"FashionEditorial\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"ResortVibes\",\"TravelInStyle\",\"BeachRomance\",\"OOTDInspo\",\"EffortlessGlam\",\"CouplePhotography\",\"SunKissedElegance\",\"LuxuryLifestyle\",\"RealisticEdit\",\"HighDefinitionArt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-08 04:57:59', NULL, 0, 0),
(113, 'Golden Trails of Costa Rica', 23, 'Where Luxury Meets the Wild — A Vogue-Inspired Outdoor Editorial Capturing Elegance, Adventure, and Timeless Beauty Amidst Costa Rica’s Most Iconic Landscapes.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Reimagine A stunning couple posing in an iconic luxury spot in Costa Rica (choose one: overlooking the Arenal Volcano from a scenic viewpoint, standing on a white-sand cliff above Manuel Antonio Beach with crystal blue water, on a private trail inside a lavish eco-resort surrounded by lush rainforest, or on a hanging bridge in Monteverde with misty clouds), golden hour lighting, cinematic wide shot, fashion magazine style, realistic face copied 100% from the uploaded photo.\r\nHiking OOTD (luxury outdoor fashion):\r\nDesigner performance leggings or tailored hiking pants, fitted tech-fabric top or stylish sports bra with lightweight windbreaker jacket tied around waist or worn open, premium hiking boots (clean and fashionable), layered subtle gold jewelry (small hoops, necklace), sleek high ponytail or braided hairstyle, natural glowing makeup, luxury mini backpack or crossbody bag, confident pose, high-fashion editorial look.men wear there perfectly fit in the surrounding\r\nVibe & Quality:\r\nUltra high definition, Vogue outdoor travel shoot, luxury adventure lifestyle, sophisticated but athletic, glamorous explorer, rich traveler energy, soft natural lighting, vibrant colors, breathtaking background, professional photography.dont change the face and hairstyle\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762578130_7509168e17f2.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"LuxuryTravelShoot\",\"CostaRicaVibes\",\"VogueEditorial\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"GoldenHourGlow\",\"LuxuryAdventure\",\"HighFashionHike\",\"TravelInStyle\",\"GlamExplorer\",\"ArenalVolcanoView\",\"MonteverdeMist\",\"ManuelAntonioBeach\",\"EcoResortLuxury\",\"FashionEditorial\",\"CoupleGoals\",\"NatureAndStyle\",\"LuxuryOOTD\",\"PicPosePhotography\",\"VogueTravelSeries\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-08 05:02:10', NULL, 0, 2),
