(127, 'Zero Gravity Duel', 29, 'A gravity-defying cinematic still capturing the perfect moment of motion, precision, and power — where elegance meets chaos.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'An ultra-realistic 8K close-up film still, captured with an Arri Alexa LF, showing a man in a black luxury suit mid-air, defying gravity with incredible agility. His body is perfectly horizontal, arm extended upwards gripping a hand gun, as if frozen in a dynamic martial arts leg kickoff pose to one figures face. Several other figures in identical black suits are blurred in the background, caught in various states of action and impact, suggesting\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762674875_55c3504bf780.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicArt\",\"UltraRealism\",\"8KPhotography\",\"ActionStill\",\"GravityDefying\",\"FilmLook\",\"ArriAlexaLF\",\"DynamicPose\",\"MotionFreeze\",\"StylizedAction\",\"LuxurySuit\",\"EpicMoment\",\"VisualMasterpiece\",\"hyperrealisticart\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-09 07:54:35', NULL, 0, 1),
