(147, 'The Jungle Sovereign', 27, 'Commanding presence meets wild elegance — a man and his black panther in perfect harmony within the misty depths of nature.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A man posing like a boss in a misty jungle beside a powerful black panther sitting calmly. Wearing an olive-green jacket, cargo pants, black boots, digital watch, and dark sunglasses. Slight fog and morning sunlight filtering through trees. Hyper-realistic forest background with natural shadows, cinematic 32K ultra-HD quality, detailed facial texture, animal fur detail visible, dramatic lighting for powerful look.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762854985_3da4de15796a.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"JungleSovereign\",\"BossVibes\",\"PantherPower\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"MistyJungle\",\"UltraHDShot\",\"NatureDominance\",\"WildElegance\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"CinematicMood\",\"PowerAndCalm\",\"32KPhotography\",\"MajesticFrame\",\"NatureAesthetics\",\"EpicPose\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-11 09:56:25', NULL, 0, 1),
(148, 'Luxury Morning on the Icon of the Seas', 17, 'A cinematic full-body portrait of a man enjoying a serene ocean-view breakfast on a private cruise balcony — captured in stunning daylight realism with ultra-HD Canon detail and perfect color grading.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Edit the uploaded photo (face based on the reference photo). Ensure the face remains consistent with the person in the uploaded image, without changing facial structure, skin tone. A realistic daylight photo of a man sitting on the private balcony of her VIP suite aboard the “Icon of the Seas” cruise ship. A man , is sitting on a balcony or deck overlooking the ocean. he is holding a white cup of coffee smiling towards to the camera. wearing a black polo shirt , a khaki shorts and a white on cloud sneakers. The scene is set during daytime with bright, natural sunlight illuminating the setting. In the foreground, a round table is set with a white tablecloth, featuring an assortment of breakfast items including a plate with fried chicken, assorted fresh fruit (kiwi, watermelon, cantaloupe, berries), two glasses of orange juice, a stainless steel thermal coffee pot, and a small basket of bread or pastries. There is also a large bouquet of colorful flowers in a white vase on the table, adding a vibrant touch to the scene. The setting exudes a peaceful, luxurious morning vibe with a stunning ocean view and a bright, serene atmosphere. Using a Canon EOS R camera with a 50mm f/1.8 lens, f/2.2 aperture, shutter speed 1/200s, ISO 100 and natural light, Full Body, Hyper Realistic Photography, Cinematic, Cinema, Hyper detail, Ultra hd, Color Correction, ultra hd, hdr, color grading, 8k.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762923274_6033cba3c14e.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"LuxuryLifestyle\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"CruiseVibes\",\"IconOfTheSeas\",\"MorningGlow\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"CanonEOSR\",\"BalconyView\",\"OceanBreakfast\",\"8KPhotography\",\"ColorGraded\",\"LuxuryLiving\",\"TravelPortrait\",\"RealisticLight\",\"SereneVibes\",\"EditorialLook\",\"DaylightPhotography\",\"UltraHDShot\",\"ModernElegance\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-12 04:54:34', NULL, 0, 0),
(149, 'Golden Sentinel: The Guardian of the Valley', 27, 'A photo-realistic cinematic portrait of a young warrior clad in futuristic gold armor, standing strong against a breathtaking mountain backdrop — a fusion of elegance, power, and realism.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A photo-realistic image of a handsome young man use the uploaded photo, age 27 years old, with brown hair and serious eyes, wearing a highly detailed, futuristic suit of armor.\r\n​The armor should be predominantly polished metallic gold with silver accents on the shoulders, arms, and chest plating. The suit should have a sleek, segmented, superhero or sci-fi design, suggesting advanced technology and power. The underlying suit visible beneath the armor should be dark grey or black.\r\n​He is standing outdoors on a rocky ledge, looking directly at the viewer. The background is a lush, vibrant mountain valley with scattered small villages or buildings nestled among the hills. The lighting is bright and natural daylight, emphasizing the metallic sheen of the suit.\r\n​Style: Cinematic lighting, highly detailed, photo-realistic, concept art quality.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762923522_4a156eb8b283.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"FuturisticArmor\",\"GoldenSentinel\",\"PhotoRealisticArt\",\"ConceptArt\",\"SciFiHero\",\"EpicVisuals\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"DigitalArtMasterpiece\",\"ModernMyth\",\"HeroicAura\",\"UltraDetail\",\"ArtOfFuture\",\"VisualElegance\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-12 04:58:42', NULL, 0, 2),
