(155, 'Whispers of Morning Calm', 17, 'A hyper–ultra–realistic 64K cinematic portrait capturing serene confidence amidst nature’s quiet beauty — styled with elegance, composed with soul.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Hyper–ultra–realistic 64K cinematic portrait, face 100% same as reference. A stylish, fit young man with a calm, simple smile, wearing a casual neavy blue oversized shirt with jeans. His right arm rests naturally on a gnarled tree branch, while his left hand is in his pocket. Soft morning mist rises gently around him as he gazes thoughtfully to his right. Several vibrant green parrots and peacock perch on nearby branches and some fly.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762930964_3f082289d54e.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"64KPhotography\",\"MorningMist\",\"NaturalElegance\",\"FashionPortrait\",\"SereneVibes\",\"PeacockAndParrots\",\"NatureInspired\",\"CalmEnergy\",\"VisualPoetry\",\"ArtOfStillness\",\"PhotoRealism\",\"AestheticMood\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-12 07:02:44', NULL, 0, 1),
(156, 'Trainer’s Bond: A Hyper-Realistic Pokémon Encounter', 17, 'A cinematic editorial portrait capturing the serene connection between a Pokémon and its trainer — where realism meets fantasy, framed with a soft glow and finished with an elegant PicPose touch.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a hyper-realistic editorial portrait of a man (same face, hairstyle, and expression as the reference). He is in a natural pose - sitting, - with his face clearly visible to the camera, crouching next to a large Pokemon whose bulb opens slightly releasing glowing pollen. The man holds a Pokéball in one hand and gently pats Pokemon head. The man wears a hooded jacket, jogger\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762933981_61a40f139522.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"PokemonPortrait\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"HyperRealism\",\"EditorialStyle\",\"FantasyMeetsReality\",\"PokeballMoment\",\"DigitalArtPortrait\",\"RealisticRendering\",\"CreativeVisuals\",\"TrainerAndPokemon\",\"ArtisticFusion\",\"AIPhotography\",\"VisualStorytelling\",\"PhotoRealArt\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-12 07:53:01', NULL, 0, 1),
(157, 'Smoke & Speed: Neon Fury', 27, 'A hyper-realistic cinematic shot of rebellion, style, and power — where blue smoke meets street legends under moody headlights.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic cinematic portrait in 8K resolution. A man is crouching in the foreground, holding a blue smoke flare in each hand. Thick vibrant blue smoke swirls dramatically around him, illuminating the dark scene. Behind him stands a green Nissan GTR styled like in Need for Speed, its headlights glowing intensely, cutting through the smoke and adding a dramatic light effect. The man is wearing a black Raiders NFL jersey, black skinny jeans, and black and red Nike SB high-tops (Miles Morales style). The dark outfit contrasts with the glowing blue smoke and the car’s headlights. The background is dark and moody, with the main highlights on the smoke effects and the shining car headlights. The overall aesthetic is hyper-realistic, cinematic, gritty, and high-contrast, with detailed textures, sharp reflections, and atmospheric depth. \r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762934511_5c7706d153b0.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"8KVisuals\",\"BlueSmoke\",\"NeedForSpeedVibes\",\"StreetLegend\",\"NissanGTR\",\"MilesMoralesStyle\",\"MoodyLighting\",\"HyperRealism\",\"SmokeEffect\",\"CreativePortrait\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"PhotoArtistry\",\"urbannVibes\",\"VisualCinematics\",\"AIPhotography\",\"PicPoseEdit\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 1, '2025-11-12 08:01:51', NULL, 0, 6),
(158, 'Rise of the Fireborne Titan', 29, 'A hyper-realistic cinematic masterpiece capturing the power, precision, and heroism of a futuristic warrior amidst chaos and light.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, ultra-cinematic digital artwork of a powerful figure hovering above a fractured metropolitan street with advanced mechanical exoskeleton boots extending to the knees, blasting massive jets of fire and compressed air downward. The figure’s body is tall, athletic, and well-proportioned, with a lean muscular build that radiates agility and strength. The stance is dynamic and heroic — chest lifted, shoulders squared, arms steady while gripping a futuristic energy weapon, exuding dominance and combat readiness.\r\nThe figure’s facial features are preserved with precision — long hair, trimmed beard, intense eyes full of focus and determination. His jacket and tactical gear flow naturally with the turbulence, adding realism and cinematic depth. The cracked asphalt glows with molten light under the thrusters, scattering dust, sparks, and debris, while pedestrians recoil in fear and awe.\r\nThe cinematic atmosphere blends warm orange firelight with cold blue neon reflections of skyscrapers. Ultra-detailed rendering, perfectly balanced proportions, heroic athletic silhouette, museum-grade masterpiece at 16K resolution.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762936216_57a195edf5ab.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicArt\",\"HyperRealism\",\"DigitalMasterpiece\",\"FuturisticWarrior\",\"SciFiHero\",\"16KRender\",\"EpicLighting\",\"HeroicSilhouette\",\"UltraCinematic\",\"FireAndSteel\",\"NeonCityVibes\",\"DigitalArtwork\",\"NextGenArt\",\"MuseumGradeVisuals\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-12 08:30:16', NULL, 0, 0),
(159, 'Campfire Strings: The Melody of Solitude', 17, 'A rustic moment of passion — a musician lost in his tune beneath the glow of embers and evening light.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an image that features a man sitting outdoors, playing an acoustic guitar.\r\n📸 Description Details\r\nSubject: A man uploaded photo, likely a musician, wearing a sunglasses, a dark olive or grey t-shirt, and jeans.\r\nAction: He is focused on playing the wooden acoustic guitar he is holding.\r\nSetting: He is sitting in an outdoor environment, which appears to be wooded or rustic, with an intentionally blurry background.\r\nForeground Element: The most prominent foreground element is a campfire or small fire with visible flames and glowing embers, partially obscuring the bottom of the guitar and the man\'s hands. This adds a warm, moody atmosphere.\r\nMood/Style: The lighting and setting suggest a rustic, intimate, or country-music vibe, perhaps a performance or moment of songwriting around a campfire.Farrukh Suri.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762945979_08a1af17aed0.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CampfireVibes\",\"AcousticSoul\",\"GuitarMood\",\"RusticMelody\",\"MusicianPortrait\",\"EveningGlow\",\"MoodyPhotography\",\"NatureSession\",\"CinematicTone\",\"CountrySoul\",\"WarmLight\",\"CandidMusic\",\"OutdoorAesthetic\",\"FarrukhSuri\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-12 11:12:59', NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `ai_posts` (`id`, `title`, `category_id`, `short_description`, `prompt_text`, `image_url1`, `image_url2`, `tags`, `external_id`, `status`, `moderation_flags`, `reviewed_by`, `reviewed_at`, `priority`, `is_popular`, `is_featured`, `tier`, `premium_unlock_cost_points`, `premium_pack`, `likes`, `favorites`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `copies`, `views`) VALUES
(160, 'Dual Tone Diva — Urban Cinematic', 18, 'A bold fusion of color and monochrome — capturing confidence, street-style grace, and editorial drama in one timeless frame.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Using the attached reference photo (keep her exact face, hairstyle, and natural features 100% identical):  \r\nCreate an 8K ultra-realistic, cinematic vertical portrait of a young woman in her late 20s, with long wavy hair and a casual confident pose. She stands slightly turned to her left, facing the camera, one hand raised near her face as if adjusting her deep red sunglasses.\r\nShe wears slightly distressed dark denim overalls over a light top, exuding effortless street style confidence. The background is an abstract urban mix of grunge and graphic elements — resembling distorted architecture, ink splashes, and textured paint layers with a high-end fashion editorial feel.\r\nLighting: Dramatic and moody with balanced highlights and deep shadows, illuminating her skin and creating soft reflections on the glasses.  \r\nCamera angle: eye-level, full-body framing (4:5 vertical).  \r\nDepth of field: Shallow — crisp focus on the subject, soft bokeh in the background.  \r\n✨ Special Effect: Make 50% of the entire image black and white and the other 50% in full vibrant color — randomly blended across the frame, so both tones intermingle naturally on her skin, outfit, and the urban background.  \r\nHer sunglasses lenses are deep red — glowing slightly for cinematic contrast.  \r\nAspect Ratio and Encadré: Vertical / Portrait (approx. 4:5) 8K resolution, full-frame, cinematic studio tone.  \r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1762947022_828e3639550b.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"8KPhotography\",\"UrbanEditorial\",\"DualToneArt\",\"ColorAndMonochrome\",\"StreetStyleVibes\",\"MoodyLighting\",\"CinematicFashion\",\"CreativePortrait\",\"RedSunglasses\",\"ArtisticBlend\",\"HighFashionMood\",\"VerticalFrame\",\"BokehMagic\",\"StylizedPortrait\",\"PicPoseStyle\",\"RealisticArtistry\",\"CinematicGlow\",\"VisualElegance\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-12 11:30:22', NULL, 0, 1),
(161, 'Little Artist in the Making', 20, 'A heartwarming cinematic portrait of a young schoolgirl lost in her world of colors and creativity, framed in ultra-realistic 8K detail with a soft daylight charm.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Realistic photo of an 8-year-old girl painting in art class, wearing her school uniform and apron, colorful art supplies around, soft daylight from window, cinematic 8K ultra detail.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763009515_caad720b7b33.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"ArtClassMagic\",\"LittleArtist\",\"CreativeChild\",\"SchoolDays\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"8KRealism\",\"SoftDaylight\",\"InnocentSmiles\",\"ArtLover\",\"ChildPhotography\",\"PhotoRealism\",\"PicPosePortraits\",\"ColorfulMoments\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-13 04:51:55', NULL, 1, 7),
(162, 'Classy Cinematic Boy Portrait – 8K Luxury Full-Body Shot', 19, 'A stylish 7-year-old boy captured in ultra-detailed 8K, dressed in cream shirt, denim jeans and Hermès loafers, posing confidently beside an open car door under bright natural sunlight — finished with a clean, minimal PicPose logo.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra detailed 8k full-body photo of a classy handsome 7 year old boy , wearing a light cream shirt tucked into denim jeans, Hermès loafers, standing near open car door on bright sunny day, vivid natural tones, relaxed pose and cinematic daylight\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763010220_b3618061c460.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"8KUltraRealistic\",\"LuxuryPhotography\",\"KidFashionShoot\",\"FullBodyPortrait\",\"NaturalDaylight\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"StylishKid\",\"EditorialLook\",\"PremiumPortrait\",\"HermesStyle\",\"OutdoorShoot\",\"RealisticRender\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-13 05:03:40', NULL, 1, 6),
(163, 'Christmas Magic in Leavenworth – A Cinematic Travel Portrait', 17, 'A wide-angle ultra-realistic 8K drone-style portrait capturing a traveler admiring the glowing Bavarian village of Leavenworth, wrapped in festive Christmas lights and soft snowfall — finished with a minimal PicPose signature.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A traveler admiring the dazzling Christmas lights of Leavenworth, Washington — the Bavarian-style village glowing with thousands of festive bulbs. Snow falls softly on alpine rooftops. He’s dressed in a cozy flannel-lined jacket, jeans, winter scarf, and brown leather boots. Wide angle, ultra-realistic, cinematic lighting, 8K resolution, full body shot, drone shot revealing the entire village shining like a Christmas postcard.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763020921_74cc5a193c93.png', NULL, '[\"Leavenworth\",\"ChristmasLights\",\"BavarianVillage\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"8KUltraRealistic\",\"TravelPhotography\",\"WinterVibes\",\"DroneShot\",\"SnowfallMagic\",\"HolidaySeason\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"PicPose\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-13 08:02:01', NULL, 0, 0),
(164, 'Cinematic Jungle Ranger Adventure Portrait', 33, 'Ultra-Realistic 3D Safari Scene with Pixar–DreamWorks Style Animals & Magical Forest Lighting\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an ultra-realistic cinematic 3D jungle scene where he is standing as a zoo ranger / jungle officer wearing a khaki uniform. Surround him with friendly stylized cartoon animals — a lion, a zebra, a hippo, and a tall giraffe.\r\nThe style should be a mix of Pixar + DreamWorks quality: soft lighting, warm color tone, detailed foliage, sun rays entering from above, and a magical rainforest background.\r\nMake sure the person looks naturally integrated into the scene, with proper shadows, matching light direction, and realistic texture blending.\r\nFull-body shot, symmetrical composition, 8K resolution, crisp details, clean environment, adventure-movie atmosphere.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763021399_bbd41f246425.png', NULL, '[\"CinematicPortrait\",\"3DJungleScene\",\"PixarStyle\",\"DreamWorksVibes\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"SafariRanger\",\"KhakiUniformLook\",\"StylizedAnimals\",\"NatureMagic\",\"SunRayLighting\",\"Crisp8K\",\"AdventureAtmosphere\",\"PicPose\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-13 08:09:59', NULL, 0, 2),
(165, 'Mini Hero Strawberry Ride – Cinematic 8K Transformation', 27, 'A super-realistic, full-body miniature adventure shot featuring a 1 cm-tall young man riding a giant strawberry inside a refrigerator, captured with dynamic motion blur, bright colors, and PicPose-style cinematic realism.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Turn the photo into a super-realistic natural shot, showing the whole body, with a clear and precise background in 8K resolution and cinematic lighting.\r\nThe young man appears to be one centimeter tall, a miniature version of himself, riding a giant strawberry like a roller coaster, and rolling on a refrigerator shelf.\r\nOutfit: black t-shirt wih PicPose AI, comfortable shorts, and shoes.\r\nPosture: Exaggeratedly funny - arms raised high like a roller coaster, screaming and laughing at the same time.\r\nTools: a giant strawberry, a trace of whipped cream, splashes of spilled juice, and reflections on the refrigerator shelf.\r\nThe background: a refrigerator from the inside with fruits, bottles and snacks adds depth and a sense of speed.\r\nStyle: very realistic, cinematic, dynamic motion blur, natural lighting, bright colors, and comedic energy.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763021809_d6c70b2cf0bc.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"MiniatureAdventure\",\"StrawberryRide\",\"CinematicEdit\",\"8KRealism\",\"PhotoTransformation\",\"CreativeAIArt\",\"DynamicMotionBlur\",\"InsideFridgeScene\",\"UltraRealisticShot\",\"FunnyCinematicPose\",\"MiniWorldConcept\",\"GiantStrawberry\",\"AIPhotoMagic\",\"PicPoseCreation\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-13 08:16:49', NULL, 0, 7),
(166, 'Cinematic Junk-Food Duo Portrait', 23, '8K Hyper-Realistic Editorial Shot of a Stylish Couple with Vibrant Snacks & PicPose Branding.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', '8K hyper-realistic cinematic editorial portrait of a stylish young couple (same as uploaded) at a rustic wooden table under warm light. The man with stylish sunglasses, mustard T-shirt, and average build, holds a Big unique juice glass. The woman poses with a large red Lays packet in one hand, showing a chip with the other. Colorful junk food on the table adds a vibrant, commercial, and brand-attractive vibe.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763023332_5344b2fdb78d.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"8KRealistic\",\"EditorialStyle\",\"StylishCouple\",\"FoodPhotography\",\"SnackVibes\",\"CreativeShoot\",\"CommercialLook\",\"PortraitMagic\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"MoodyLighting\",\"BrandShot\",\"RusticVibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-13 08:42:12', NULL, 0, 2),
(167, 'Pixar Family Kitchen Transformation Portrait', 33, 'Turn any real person into a warm, cinematic Pixar-style character enjoying a cozy Italian kitchen moment with family.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Using the uploaded person’s photo (keep his face, skin tone, hairstyle, age, and expression 100% identical), turn him into a Pixar-style 3D character. Place him in a warm Italian kitchen scene, sitting at a rustic wooden table with two friendly stylized cartoon kids beside him.\r\nHe is eating spaghetti from a large bowl, smiling naturally, with soft golden sunlight entering from a window.\r\nCreate a cinematic, cozy, family-friendly atmosphere with warm tones, detailed kitchen props, hanging copper pans, bread basket, olive oil bottle, and steam rising from the pasta.\r\nEnsure the person integrates perfectly into the Pixar world — soft shadows, smooth textures, expressive stylized eyes, and gentle rim lighting.\r\nUltra-realistic Pixar quality, 8K, full scene composition, warm storytelling vibe.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763024315_37baf03251ae.png', NULL, '[\"PixarStylePortrait\",\"3DCharacterTransform\",\"PixarMagic\",\"FamilyKitchenScene\",\"ItalianKitchenVibes\",\"CinematicWarmTone\",\"8KUltraRealistic\",\"CartoonCharacterEdit\",\"PixPoseRender\",\"CozyAtmosphere\",\"CharacterConversion\",\"StorytellingPortrait\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-13 08:58:35', NULL, 1, 6),
(168, 'Cinematic Jungle Ranger Adventure Portrait', 27, 'An Elegant High-Fashion Lifestyle Shot Featuring a Purple Couture Look with a Scenic Outdoor Ambience\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Using my photo without making changes to my face creates a fashion and lifestyle photograph that captures a woman posing elegantly in a luxurious and dramatic outdoor environment, likely at sunset or dusk.\r\nModel and dressing room: The protagonist is a tall woman with long darkbrown and slightly wavy strands. She wears a spectacular purple long dress. The dress has long sleeves, a pronounced V-neckline and strategic contours along the and waist, showing lots of skin. The fabric appears to be lightweight, sheer gauze or tulle that falls into a fluid skirt with high openings.\r\nAccessories: Share your outfit with a small, bright black structured handbag and purple high-heeled sandals adorned with what appear to be crystals or stones.Scenario: The woman is slightly recharged on the outdoor white stone staircase, which appears to be part of a luxury villa or resort built into a cliff or rocky slope. There are lighting elements.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763025432_28d5f68a5c0c.png', NULL, '[\"FashionPhotography\",\"LuxuryPortrait\",\"SunsetVibes\",\"HighFashionLook\",\"CoutureDress\",\"GlamPortrait\",\"PicPose\",\"FashionEditorial\",\"OutdoorShoot\",\"ElegantStyle\",\"DesignerWear\",\"EveningGlamour\",\"LifestyleShoot\",\"PremiumFashion\",\"FashionInspiration\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-13 09:17:12', NULL, 0, 4),
(169, 'Barbie DreamGlow Cinematic Portrait – PicPose Edition', 18, 'Ultra-realistic 8K pastel boutique portrait with playful charm, Korean beauty glow, and a soft Barbie-style aesthetic.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A joyful ultra-realistic 8K cinematic portrait of a young woman (identical face to uploaded image) standing in a pastel Barbie boutique, glowing in warm sunlight. She wears a hot-pink tulle dress with puff sleeves, a satin bow, and “PicPose” embroidered on the chest. Her caramel-brown hair flows softly, styled in a Korean glass-skin look — rosy lips, gentle blush, natural lashes. She poses playfully, one hand extended with a pink seashell accessory, the other making a mini-heart gesture. Dreamy, colorful, and sweetly cinematic.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763029130_e10a15160c07.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"BarbieAesthetic\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"8KUltraRealistic\",\"GlassSkinLook\",\"PastelBoutique\",\"BarbieVibes\",\"KoreanBeauty\",\"DreamyPortrait\",\"AestheticEdit\",\"StylizedPhotography\",\"GlamourPortrait\",\"PinkTheme\",\"AIPhotoArt\",\"ProfessionalEditing\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-13 10:18:50', NULL, 0, 6),
(170, 'Cinematic Sci-Fi Jungle Metamorph', 18, 'Ultra-Realistic Alien Swamp Portrait With Bioluminescent Creature & 100% Face Accuracy\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Transform the uploaded person into an ultra-realistic cinematic sci-fi jungle scene. Keep their exact facial features, age, expression, skin texture and identity unchanged. Place the person standing waist-deep in a glowing alien swamp, wearing a tactical futuristic explorer suit with camouflage patterns, wet fabric details, metallic buckles, and utility gear.\r\nBeside them, create a giant bioluminescent reptile-like creature with intricate scales, glowing blue cracks, amber eyes, and massive size. The creature should be leaning close to the person as if communicating—tense but respectful interaction. Surround them with dense alien vegetation: large teal bioluminescent flowers, tall twisted vines, floating spores, mist, and soft volumetric light.\r\nRender in 8K ultra-realistic cinematic quality, dramatic lighting, shallow depth of field, detailed reflections on water, realistic skin highlights, and movie-grade atmosphere. Keep the uploaded person’s face 100% accurate.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763182412_85503b5f35ef.png', NULL, '[\"SciFiPortrait\",\"CinematicEdit\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"AlienJungle\",\"BioluminescentBeast\",\"8KRender\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"FaceAccuracy\",\"PicPoseEdit\",\"FuturisticExplorer\",\"AIArtPrompt\",\"SciFiVibes\",\"FantasyWorld\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-15 04:53:32', NULL, 0, 3),
(171, 'Filipino Couple Dining – Ultra Photorealistic PicPose Portrait', 23, 'Authentic identity-locked restaurant moment with warm cinematic lighting and intimate dining vibes\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra photorealistic fashion portrait of the same man and woman from the reference photo, identity locked (do not alter facial features).\r\nUse the exact same face and keep this signature: man on the left side\r\nPreserve the original person\'s identity, face, and physical features with high likeness. Do not alter their face. Apply the following style:\r\nA beautiful Filipino couple inside the restaurant sitting in front of the table while eating. The woman has the same hairstyle above wearing a white shirt, smiling while holding a piece of raw beef with chopsticks over a spicy dipping sauce. She is sitting at a rustic wooden table filled with a large platter of raw beef, liver, tripe, herbs, and fresh vegetables. The man has the same hairstyle above wearing a couple outfit with her, sitting right her while holding a chop sticks and eating with her. At a Laab Koi restaurant, surrounding are groups of people laughing and chatting at nearby tables, decorated with kitchenware in the background. Warm lighting creates a cozy and appetizing atmosphere, shot with a 50mm lens, shallow depth of field. Both looking at the camera.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763183119_176f1404f6fd.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"UltraPhotorealistic\",\"IdentityLocked\",\"FilipinoCouple\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"RestaurantVibes\",\"FoodPhotographyStyle\",\"WarmLighting\",\"50mmLensLook\",\"RealismArt\",\"AIPhotography\",\"CouplePortrait\",\"DiningAesthetics\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-15 05:05:19', NULL, 0, 2),
(172, 'Urban Dual-Tone Cinematic Portrait', 18, 'A hyper-realistic street-art–inspired full-body portrait blending bold colors, monochrome textures, and confident modern style.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Use the attached photo for reference (face must remain 100% unchanged). Create a hyper-realistic, medium full-body portrait of a young woman (20s–30s) with long, wavy hair, dressed in dark denim overalls with subtle wear/distress details over a lighter tank top. She stands upright, angled slightly to her left, left hand near her face adjusting or touching her sunglasses. The glasses lenses are deep red. \r\nThe background is an abstract urban environment with distorted architectural elements, lines, and shapes suggesting buildings or cityscapes, featuring gritty textures, splattered paint/ink, and mixed-media elements. \r\nLighting is dramatic, high-contrast, emphasizing her skin and outfit with strong shadows and highlights. The woman is in sharp focus, while the background is softly blurred (shallow to moderate depth of field). \r\nArt style combines photorealistic portraiture for the subject with graphic-novel or street-art-inspired textures for the background. Randomly apply 50% black-and-white and 50% full vibrant color throughout the image in a scattered, artistic manner. Mood is stylish, casual, confident, and visually striking. \r\nAspect Ratio and Encadré: Vertical / Portrait (approx. 4:5), 8K resolution, full-frame, cinematic studio lighting.  \r\n📌 Note: No hashtags, tags, or extra text should appear inside the photo — only the signature.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763190369_0cc24e07f113.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"UrbanVibes\",\"DualToneArt\",\"HyperRealisticEdit\",\"StreetArtTexture\",\"ModernAesthetic\",\"GraphicNovelStyle\",\"PortraitMagic\",\"CreativeBlend\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-15 07:06:09', NULL, 0, 5),
(173, 'Symbiote Stride: Cinematic 8K Realism', 27, 'A confident young man fused with glossy black Venom energy, captured in high-key motion with luxury drift aesthetics — enhanced for night-mode depth and PicPose signature styling.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a 8k realistic, cinematic character photography of a confident Young man wearing black bomber jacket, black jeans, gloves, and white shoes,walking forward with one hand in his pocket and an intense gaze.A dynamic,glossy black symbiote venom with electric streaks wraps around his body,extending tendrils that form a grinning venom head behind him,mid‑air.The background is a bright,high key scene with a luxury car blurred in smoky drift,creating depth and motion. don\'t change face, convert the night mode\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763191133_4d15b7296028.png', NULL, '[\"CinematicPortrait\",\"8KUltraRealistic\",\"SymbioteVenom\",\"DynamicEnergyShot\",\"NightModePhotography\",\"PicPoseCreation\",\"EpicCharacterArt\",\"RealisticCharacterDesign\",\"HighKeyMotionBlur\",\"LuxurySceneEdit\",\"VenomAesthetic\",\"UltraDetailPortrait\",\"AIArtPrompt\",\"CreativePhotoEdit\",\"CinematicVibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-15 07:18:53', NULL, 0, 4),
(174, 'Sunset Cliffside Boho Adventure Portrait', 17, 'A hyper-realistic drone-shot travel photoshoot featuring a casually chic bohemian man overlooking the Mediterranean Sea at golden sunset, with accurate facial match and elegant PicPose branding.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic outdoor scene featuring a man in casual chic\r\nbohemian style-flowy linen shirt,distressed chinos, layered necklaces, and espadrilles-lounging on a rocky cliffside overlooking the Mediterranean\r\nSea during sunset. Capture with a side wide-angle lens from a drone\r\nperspective to include crashing waves and wildflowers, using high dynamic\r\nrange (HDR) technology for vibrant colors and natural textures in a relaxed\r\nadventure travel photoshoot, Match the face 100% accurately.\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763194139_705db36b8e73.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"BohoTravelPortrait\",\"SunsetAdventure\",\"MediterraneanVibes\",\"DronePhotographyLook\",\"HDRRealism\",\"UltraRealisticPortrait\",\"CinematicLook\",\"TravelPhotoshoot\",\"GoldenHourMagic\",\"WildflowerAesthetic\",\"OutdoorCinematicPortrait\",\"fashionbohostyle\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-15 08:08:59', NULL, 0, 6),
(175, 'Autumn Vintage Elegance Portrait', 27, 'A DSLR-style cinematic transformation blending Victorian charm, steampunk fashion, and warm golden autumn tones—crafted with perfect face matching and PicPose signature styling.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Edit the uploaded image (face based on a reference photo). Ensure the face matches the person in the photo. A handsome, smiling young man with a happy expression stands confidently on an old wooden bridge covered with fallen orange and yellow autumn leaves. He is dressed smartly in Victorian or steampunk style: a stylish black hat, thin-rimmed sunglasses, a long dark coat (black or dark gray) with wide lapels, a burnt orange or gold waistcoat, a white shirt with a black tie, dark brown or gray trousers, and brown boots. His hands rest on the dark wooden railing of the bridge. His black hair is neatly styled under his hat. The lighting is warm and golden, suggesting a sunny autumn day. The background shows lush autumn trees in vibrant orange and yellow hues, with fallen leaves scattered in the air. In the sky, an orange and white striped hot air balloon with a small basket floats by. The outlines of old buildings or towers appear on the horizon, adding depth to the scene. This scene evokes a sense of charm, adventure, and vintage elegance in a captivating autumnal setting.\r\nThe scene was shot with a DSLR camera using a 50mm f/1.8 simulated lens, providing sharp focus and a shallow depth of field with a subtle background bokeh effect.\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763194877_e244632932d8.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseMagic\",\"AutumnPortrait\",\"VintageElegance\",\"SteampunkStyle\",\"CinematicDSLR\",\"GoldenHourGlow\",\"AutumnVibes\",\"FashionPortrait\",\"PhotoTransformation\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"BokehMagic\",\"AutumnAesthetics\",\"VictorianStyle\",\"creativeportraits\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-15 08:21:17', NULL, 0, 0),
(176, 'Regal Fantasy Muse', 18, 'A high-fashion East Asian fantasy portrait featuring elaborate royal adornments, vibrant hues, and ethereal dramatic lighting.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Using the uploaded image, create a captivating fashion art photography depicts the subject in a close-up to medium shot, she pose playful and cheerful expression. She features soft pink blush, and subtle red eyeliner, and flowing long hair. She is adorned in an incredibly ornate and elaborate East Asian-inspired headdress and garment, rich with flowing sheer fabric with intricate patterns, gold accents, dangling ornaments, and stylized floral and cloud motifs in vibrant shades of blue, teal, and orange. The headdress dynamically extends, framing her face with flowing forms. The abstract background is a decorative composition of vertical panels, featuring swirling patterns in complementary blues, teals, golds, and oranges, with stylized East Asian characters on the far left. The scene is rendered with dramatic lighting and high contrast, creating an ethereal glow and a mystical atmosphere, showcasing intricate details, vibrant colors, and a high fantasy aesthetic in an epic, regal concept photograpy.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763201450_32a681fb54c4.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"FantasyFashionArt\",\"RegalPortrait\",\"EpicAesthetic\",\"HighFantasyVibes\",\"EtherealGlow\",\"AsianInspiredArt\",\"FashionPhotography\",\"OrnateHeaddress\",\"MythicBeauty\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"VibrantColors\",\"ArtisticElegance\",\"DreamlikeVisuals\",\"FantasyArtistry\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-15 10:10:50', NULL, 0, 1),
(177, 'High-Speed Escape Through Chaos', 17, 'A low-angle cinematic chase with explosive visuals, Spiderman’s heroic leap, and a dramatic city backdrop — featuring the original rider’s true look.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'The man in the attached photo, retaining his original features and hair, speeds down a modern avenue on a black motorcycle. The shot is dynamic, taken from a low angle close to the front of the bike, conveying speed and action. In the background, a gigantic fiery explosion illuminates the scene, sending banknotes and debris flying. Near the explosion, a tall, modern cable-stayed bridge stands out against the blue, partly cloudy sky. In mid-air, near the explosion, Spiderman leaps spectacularly through the debris, striking a heroic pose. In the background, a police patrol car with its lights flashing pursues the motorcyclist. The atmosphere is intense, chaotic, and cinematic, with a realistic style and well-defined details. Vivid, contrasting colors create a strong sense of movement and danger.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763203420_13113b99fd75.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicEdit\",\"ActionScenePrompt\",\"MotorcycleChase\",\"EpicExplosion\",\"DynamicShot\",\"HeroicLeap\",\"SpiderVerseVibes\",\"RealisticVFX\",\"AIPhotoEdit\",\"UltraCinematic\",\"HighSpeedDrama\",\"CreativePrompt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-15 10:43:40', NULL, 0, 1),
(178, 'Hyper-Cinematic Futuristic AI Lab Portrait', 32, 'Ultra-realistic 8K sci-fi transformation with robotics, holograms, and advanced AI ambience.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an ultra realistic, high-detail futuristic portrait using the uploaded photo. Keep the person’s original facial features exactly the same. Transform the scene into a high tech AI robotics laboratory with advanced humanoid robots, robotic arms, holographic screens, and glowing blue UI panels.\r\nThe person is wearing a clean white futuristic suit, holding a digital tablet emitting holograms of social media icons. Add dramatic sci-fi lighting, volumetric light beams from the ceiling, reflective metallic surfaces, and cyber-industrial background depth.\r\nMake the image hyper-cinematic, 8K sharp, photorealistic, with advanced technology vibes, glowing HUDs, robotics assembly lines, and immersive sci-fi atmosphere.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763205530_9b7c782e7412.png', NULL, '[\"FuturisticPortrait\",\"AIPortrait\",\"SciFiArt\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"8KRender\",\"RoboticsLab\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"HologramEffects\",\"TechVibes\",\"DigitalFuturism\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"CyberLab\",\"AITransformation\",\"RoboticFuture\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-15 11:18:50', NULL, 0, 3),
(179, 'Falling Through Fire: The Last Grip', 27, 'A hyper-real apocalyptic survival portrait with intense emotion, chaos, and a breathtaking low-angle perspective — crafted for PicPose transformations.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'The central focus is a man (uploaded photo for 100.999% facial reference) who appears to be in distress and danger. He is seen from a low angle, dramatically clutching the edge of a wrecked structure with his large, dirty hand.\r\nAppearance: He has a serious, intense, and somewhat panicked expression on his face, looking directly out at the viewer. His face and clothing (sunglasses and a ripped, light-colored hooded shirt or jacket) are streaked with dirt and grime, suggesting he has been through a struggle. There are apparent injuries or debris visible on his forearm.\r\nSetting & Atmosphere: The setting is overwhelmingly apocalyptic and chaotic. The background is filled with intense orange and red flames, smoke, and debris, suggesting a massive fire or explosion in a large, ruined urban area.\r\nThe perspective is disorienting—the cityscape in the far background appears upside down or tilted, emphasizing the feeling of falling, destruction, and disorientation.\r\nThe foreground structure he is holding onto is metallic and broken, adding to the sense of immediate peril.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763206328_b3f343a247a9.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"ApocalypticScene\",\"SurvivalMode\",\"EpicDisasterArt\",\"HyperRealism\",\"FireAndRuins\",\"ActionVisuals\",\"AIPhotoArt\",\"UltraRealisticEdit\",\"FallingScene\",\"DramaticLighting\",\"8KVisuals\",\"CreativeTransformations\",\"aiimagery\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-15 11:32:08', NULL, 0, 1),
(180, 'Golden Serenity in Rose Shadows', 18, 'A timeless, photorealistic portrait blending soft golden light with elegant red-black aesthetics.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a calm, finely composed full body image of a young woman against a black-red, blurry background. The woman is wearing a flowing white blouse, plus a red-black checkered mini skirt and black knee stockings. She sits on a black bench with her legs crossed. Her hair blows in the wind and shines seductively in the light. She has hazelnut green eyes. She\'s holding a bouquet of red roses, smelling them softly. With a calm, relaxed expression, she looks at the camera and radiates in the warm light. The filigree black-red rose pattern in the background creates a rich texture that adds depth and cultural character to the scene. The lighting is soft and golden overall, emphasizes natural skin tones and creates a timeless, photorealistic atmosphere.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763269055_0aa958442e3f.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"GoldenAura\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"RoseAesthetics\",\"ElegantVibes\",\"ArtisticPhotography\",\"SoftGoldenLight\",\"PhotorealisticArt\",\"CalmComposure\",\"VisualElegance\",\"FashionPortrait\",\"AIArtMagic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-16 04:57:35', NULL, 0, 0),
(181, 'Mini Superhero Impact Pose', 19, 'A dynamic, cinematic superhero landing shot with dramatic lighting and dust effects — featuring a young hero in perfect sharp focus with a clean PicPose signature.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', '8-year-old boy in casual clothes doing a powerful superhero landing pose, cracked dust effect under hands, cinematic smoke behind him, dramatic lighting, sharp focus, heroic vibe.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763269672_26efbab6c484.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"SuperheroPose\",\"CinematicKidsShot\",\"HeroLanding\",\"DustImpactEffect\",\"DramaticLighting\",\"EpicPortrait\",\"KidsPhotography\",\"AIArtPrompt\",\"UltraRealistic\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-16 05:07:52', NULL, 0, 5),
(182, 'Cherry Blossom Violin Muse', 18, 'A dreamy DSLR portrait blending elegance, music, and springtime serenity.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A realistic, high-quality portrait photograph of a charming young woman with long, brown hair, sitting on a stone ledge beneath a beautiful cherry blossom tree with vibrant pink flowers. She is looking gently at the camera with a sweet, serene smile, resting her chin on her hand. She is holding a classic wooden violin. She is wearing a pink-the-shoulder top with puffy sleeves, light blue jeans, and colorful sneakers. The background features the stunning blurred pink blossoms of the tree and a hint of an urban park setting. The image is shot with a DSLR camera to achieve a professional, soft-focus, and naturally lit portrait with beautiful, ethereal light. Maintain her exact facial features and gentle expression from the reference image, ensuring she has a high-quality, natural-looking makeup applied, featuring clear, dewy skin, subtle eyeliner, soft eyebrows, and a natural pink lip tint. Do not change her face.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763269879_d5dc3c082c54.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CherryBlossomPortrait\",\"ViolinGirl\",\"AestheticPhotography\",\"SpringVibes\",\"DreamyPortrait\",\"SoftFocusLook\",\"DSLRShot\",\"NaturalMakeup\",\"PinkBlossoms\",\"OutdoorPortrait\",\"RealisticPhotoArt\",\"8KPortrait\",\"PhotographyInspiration\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-16 05:11:19', NULL, 0, 1),
(183, 'Skyborne Elegance: The Private Jet Portrait', 17, 'A cinematic ultra-realistic portrait capturing confidence, luxury, and modern European aesthetics — crafted exclusively with PicPose finesse.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic cinematic portrait of the man (exact facial features from the attached photo) sitting inside a luxurious private jet. He is reclining casually in a fully leather Biverd-style armchair, one leg stretched forward comfortably. On a nearby polished wooden table sits an elegant sushi platter, while a second table holds a sleek MacBook Pro. He looks directly at the camera with a confident, slightly proud smile, exuding charisma and authority.\r\nHe wears a tailored navy velvet blazer over a crisp white shirt, cream tailored trousers, and polished brown leather loafers. Soft ambient lighting filters through the jet’s panoramic windows, casting subtle highlights on his face, hair, and clothing. The cabin is ultra-modern — cream leather seats, gold accents, and glossy wooden panels. The background shows the sky with a faint golden sunset, adding warmth and depth. Shot with ARRI Alexa Mini LF, 50mm lens, shallow depth of field, ultra-realistic textures on skin, fabrics, and cabin surfaces, cinematic editorial fashion style, modern European luxury aesthetic, ultra-detailed and photorealistic.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763270341_e20990a8001f.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"DubaiMarina\",\"JetSkiLifestyle\",\"LuxuryTravelVibes\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"WaterSportsPhotography\",\"UltraRealisticEdit\",\"CityscapeAdventure\",\"ModernLuxuryStyle\",\"TravelCinematicShot\",\"PremiumPhotoArt\",\"DubaiSkylineMagic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-16 05:19:01', NULL, 0, 2),
(184, 'Sky-High Attitude Power Shot', 27, 'Dynamic low-angle portrait with bold streetwear energy, expressive sky backdrop, and a confident pointing pose — enhanced with a subtle PicPose signature.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Creat a picture A highly dynamic, low-angle shot looking up at a young man ( face on the attached photo), seated on a white ledge or wall against an expressive,cloudy sky. He is wearing a white graphic t-shirt and grey cargo pants with bold orange-red reflective stripes on the calves. Silver bracelets, g shock black watch and earrings,and is pointing directly at the camera with a confident, slightly mischievous expression. In the extreme foreground, out of focus but dominant,is the sole of a large.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763270550_76e8c21f4b7f.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"DynamicPortrait\",\"LowAngleShot\",\"AttitudePose\",\"StreetwearVibes\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"ExpressiveSky\",\"CreativePhotography\",\"AIPhotoPrompt\",\"DynamicEnergy\",\"MensFashionShoot\",\"PointingPose\",\"UrbanAesthetic\",\"moodysky\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-16 05:22:30', NULL, 0, 2),
(185, 'Cinematic Hyper-Real Coca-Cola Studio Portrait', 27, 'A bold, stylish full-body editorial shot blending oversized product realism with confident fashion aesthetics.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A full-body hyper-realistic studio portrait of a man from attached photo [red bomber jacket, white t-shirt, black jeans, red sneakers ] in a [relaxed] pose, leaning gracefully beside a large [ can of coca cola] positioned [vertical] on a smooth [red] floor. The object appears oversized and realistic, perfectly integrated with the subject — not floating. Its surface shows accurate texture, reflections, and material depth. The pose defines the subject’s attitude and interaction with the object — natural, stylish, and expressive. The character is balanced and confident, matching the object’s tone and style. Background is seamless, same color for wall and floor, slightly lighter below with soft reflections. Lighting: clean professional studio setup — diffused key from front-left, mild fill from right, subtle rim for separation, evenly balanced exposure. Mood: cinematic luxury editorial with minimal composition and photorealistic realism.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763273278_dc11c19cbbeb.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"HyperRealPortrait\",\"StudioCinematic\",\"CocaColaEdit\",\"FashionEditorialLook\",\"OversizedPropArt\",\"RedAesthetic\",\"Realistic3DLook\",\"CreativePortraitEdit\",\"AIStudioShot\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-16 06:07:58', NULL, 0, 3),
(186, 'Underwater Elegance: Ocean Mop Fantasy', 27, 'A surreal underwater portrait of grace, beauty, and whimsical imagination.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Beautiful woman [use attached image of same man or female and ensure 100% accuracy in facial detail] underwater in a flowing teal dress, smiling while mopping the ocean floor, bright turquoise water, coral reef, colorful tropical fish, whimsical surreal scene, high clarity.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763273817_1b9ddb16a558.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"UnderwaterFantasy\",\"SurrealPortrait\",\"TealDressVibes\",\"OceanAesthetic\",\"CinematicArt\",\"DreamyVisuals\",\"UltraRealisticEdit\",\"FantasyPhotography\",\"CreativeImagination\",\"CoralReefMagic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-16 06:16:57', NULL, 0, 1),
(187, 'Snowy Christmas Morning Couple – Ultra-Realistic Cinematic Portrait', 23, 'Warm, glowing festive half-body portrait of a stylish young couple catching snowflakes on a cozy Christmas morning.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a close-up, ultra-realistic photograph (not a cartoon or fantasy image) based on the original attached face. A half-body portrait of a beautiful young couple on a snowy Christmas morning. She has very long wavy black hair in a modern butterfly cut with voluminous, soft layers framing her face, slightly messy with a few loose strands covering her cheeks. Warm golden-pink morning sunlight gently touches her hair and face, creating a glowing highlight. She wears a pastel pink faux-fur coat with white fluffy trim, a wide collar revealing a white turtleneck knit underneath, and a cream wool skirt embroidered with subtle silver snowflakes. She accessorizes with a tiny silver snowflake brooch and small dangling star earrings. men wear a couple outfit of the girl\r\nTheirr pose: standing slightly sideways, one hand raised gently to catch falling snowflakes while the other holds a cup of hot cocoa close to her chest, her face tilted upward with a soft smile as morning sunlight shines from the upper left. The background features a wooden café balcony decorated with a large Christmas tree, pastel gift boxes in pink, white, and gold, Christmas wreaths, and warm golden fairy lights. Soft snow falls around her, creating a dreamy, romantic, and cozy festive mood.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763276164_9e2998baeddf.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"ChristmasPortrait\",\"WinterCoupleShoot\",\"UltraRealisticPhoto\",\"ButterflyHairCut\",\"SnowfallAesthetic\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"FestiveGlow\",\"MorningSunlight\",\"CouplePhotoshoot\",\"CozyWinterVibes\",\"HolidayPortrait\",\"PastelAesthetic\",\"RealisticAIArt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-16 06:56:04', NULL, 0, 1),
(188, 'Winter Boss Aura – Cinematic Luxury Power Shot', 17, 'A hyper-realistic wide-angle winter portrait capturing dominance, elegance, and high-end alpine luxury beside a matte-black Aston Martin DB12.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, cinematic wide shot of a powerful, sharply dressed man (upload face as reference) standing beside a matte-black Aston Martin DB12 parked in front of a luxury alpine hotel surrounded by fresh snow.\r\nIt’s early morning - the sky a soft mix of silver, blue, and golden hues, snowflakes falling. He wears a dark wool overcoat, charcoal turtleneck, tailored trousers, leather gloves, and polished Chelsea boots.\r\nRight hand rests on the car roof, left holds an espresso. The hotel behind glows warmly against the crisp cold.\r\nLighting: morning natural light, soft shadows, subtle warm/cool balance.\r\nCamera: low wide-angle, ARRI Alexa LF, 35mm anamorphic lens.\r\nMood: calm dominance, winter luxury, total control.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763277791_54f6efc4ce5d.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"LuxuryVibes\",\"AstonMartinDB12\",\"WinterCinematic\",\"HyperRealisticShot\",\"PowerfulLook\",\"AlpineLuxury\",\"MorningGlow\",\"EliteAesthetic\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"FashionEditorial\",\"MenStyle\",\"LuxuryLifestyle\",\"PicPoseEdit\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-16 07:23:11', NULL, 0, 1);
