(189, 'Underwater Elegance at Ocean Restaurant – Singapore', 18, 'A breathtaking 8K ultra-realistic portrait set inside Resorts World Sentosa’s iconic aquarium dining experience.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Resorts World Sentosa Ocean Restaurant – Singapore\r\nTransform my photo into an ultra-realistic, full-body, natural shot with a not-blurred background, 8k resolution, and a refined image. The shot should be focusing on the breathtaking underwater restaurant interior, where elegant dining tables are set beside a massive aquarium window filled with graceful manta rays and tropical fish. Make sure my face has 100% accuracy with the uploaded photo.\r\nOutfit/shoes:\r\nHairstyle:\r\nPose: sitting gracefully at a dining table, smiling toward the camera while the marine life glows in the background.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763281455_391a62540d19.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"OceanRestaurantSingapore\",\"UnderwaterDining\",\"AquariumAmbience\",\"8KUltraRealistic\",\"FullBodyPortrait\",\"SingaporeVibes\",\"MantaRayMagic\",\"LuxuryDiningShot\",\"AestheticPhotography\",\"CreativePortraitEdit\",\"RealisticAIEdit\",\"PicPoseSignature\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-16 08:24:15', NULL, 0, 1),
(190, 'Classic Jeep Vibes – Ultra-Realistic Male Portrait', 17, 'A stylish 8K cinematic portrait capturing natural expression, perfect lighting, and true facial accuracy with a subtle PicPose signature.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic 8K portrait of a young Indian male in a classic open jeep, posed casually in the driver\'s seat with one arm resting on the edge and the other on the steering wheel. Outfit: white button-up shirt with rolled sleeves, black ripped jeans, white sneakers with red/yellow detail, black bracelet. Hairstyle: voluminous, side-swept. Background: residential outdoor setting with greenery, modern building, and soft daylight. Emphasize exact face likeness.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763284578_c0b254e3dac5.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"8KPortrait\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"IndianMalePortrait\",\"ClassicJeepShoot\",\"CinematicLook\",\"NaturalDaylight\",\"OutdoorPortrait\",\"MensFashion\",\"PhotographyPrompt\",\"AIPhotoStyle\",\"JeepAesthetic\",\"RealisticFace\",\"OpenJeepVibes\",\"ProfessionalEdit\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-16 09:16:18', NULL, 0, 2),
(191, 'Little Thunder Hero', 19, 'An 8-year-old rising as the chosen one, wielding a glowing hammer under Thor’s stormy protection.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A heroic 8-year-old boy lifting a glowing hammer while Thor stands behind releasing lightning. Dark storm clouds, bright blue electricity around them, powerful ground-level shot.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763290041_2c4b757746e4.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"ThunderHero\",\"MiniThor\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"HeroicVibes\",\"StormPower\",\"EpicLightningShot\",\"FantasyEdit\",\"8YearOldHero\",\"MythicTransformation\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-16 10:47:21', NULL, 0, 12),
(192, 'Epic Realism: Soldier Standby Portrait', 17, 'A powerful military stance blending strength, readiness, and a subtle human smile—captured in ultra-realistic cinematic detail.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a realistic photo of a soldier in a standby position, with a slight smile, standing outdoors. The soldier is me, wearing a camouflaged military uniform in green, brown, and beige, with an olive green tactical vest full of pockets and compartments. Your name is written on the vest. I am wearing a maroon beret with a metal badge, a green wool collar wrapped around the neck, and black gloves. On the right arm there is an emblem with the Indonesian flag. I am holding a modern black rifle, 5.56 mm caliber (M16), held in front of the body with both hands. The background shows green bushes and gray asphalt flooring. In the background, complete the scene with epic military backdrop, including battle tanks, military cars, fighter planes flying in the sky, and soldiers lined up in the distance. The lighting must be balanced and realistic, conveying the atmosphere of military operations. This scene should blend readiness and seriousness with the friendliness and humanity seen from those thin smiles.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763290719_64709c9ebde4.png', NULL, '[\"SoldierPortrait\",\"MilitaryRealism\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"EpicWarScene\",\"ArmyUniform\",\"PicPoseEdit\",\"BattlefieldAesthetic\",\"DefenseForces\",\"HeroicStance\",\"UltraRealisticEdit\",\"TacticalGear\",\"MilitaryVibes\",\"WarZoneBackdrop\",\"ArmyLifeCaptured\",\"EpicPortraitShoot\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 3, '2025-11-16 10:58:39', NULL, 0, 23),
(193, 'The Magic of Halo-Halo: A Cinematic Filipino Treat', 18, 'Gravity ko mita kar, Filipino flavors ki ek jadui kahani. Hyper-realistic photography mein summer indulgence aur cultural nostalgia ka perfect blend.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A cinematic, hyper-realistic food photography scene depicting a complete halo-halo assortment — sweetened red beans, sweetened white beans, sweetened jackfruit (langka), sweetened saba bananas, macapuno strings, nata de coco, kaong, ube halaya, sweet corn, sago pearls, and vibrant pandan jelly cubes — all dramatically suspended mid-air as if swirling above the frame in a magical, gravity-defying vortex, below is a transparent empty bowl of halo-halo.\r\nCaptured with a Canon EOS 5D Mark IV using an 85mm f/1.4 lens, the shallow depth of field isolates every floating ingredient in razor-sharp detail while keeping the background softly blurred.\r\nEach mix-in glistens with syrupy sheen: the ube halaya glowing with deep violet richness, the macapuno shimmering translucent white, the jackfruit strips glowing yellow, the sago pearls glimmering like tiny orbs, and the sweetened beans reflecting warm highlights. Tiny droplets of melted ube ice cream, streaks of condensed milk, shaved ice particles, and crumbling pinipig flakes drift around the scene to enhance the sense of motion and sweetness.\r\nIn the blurred background stands an Asian woman (apply identical facial structure, skin tone, hair, eye color, and expression consistently — the face must exactly match the uploaded reference image). She is inside a typical Filipino home kitchen with wooden cabinets, a tiled counter lined with a woven baskets, hanging metal utensils, and a traditional gas stove. Soft golden sunlight passes through capiz-shell windows, bathing the room in warm, nostalgic glow.\r\nThe woman raises both hand in a calm, spell-like gesture, smirking subtly as if he is conjuring the floating halo-halo ingredients with effortless mastery.\r\nCinematic lighting emphasizes the vivid tropical colors, glossy textures, and icy shimmer of the halo-halo components while blending realism with gentle fantasy — creating a scene that captures Filipino cultural warmth, summer indulgence, and magical storytelling.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763356249_e203ec882767.png', NULL, '[\"HaloHaloMagic\",\"CinematicFoodArt\",\"FilipinoCuisine\",\"PicPoseCreation\",\"HyperRealisticPhotography\",\"FoodVortexShot\",\"AsianKitchenVibes\",\"TropicalDessertDream\",\"UbeLove\",\"Canon5DMarkIV\",\"FoodStylingArt\",\"SummerSweetness\",\"GravityDefyingShot\",\"PinoyPride\",\"EpicFoodPhotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-17 05:10:49', NULL, 0, 0),
(194, 'Power Kick in the Spotlight', 19, 'A fearless 8-year-old athlete caught mid-air in a dramatic football action — frozen at the perfect moment with stadium lights blazing and dust flying.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'An 8-year-old boy performing a powerful football kick mid-air, ball frozen at the moment of impact, stadium lights glowing, flying dust from the ground, energetic action pose, ultra-sharp, dramatic sports angle.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763356472_9360a7437c7a.png', NULL, '[\"FootballAction\",\"KidAthlete\",\"PowerKick\",\"DramaticSports\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"SportsPortrait\",\"ActionPhotography\",\"StadiumLights\",\"EpicMoment\",\"PicPose\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-17 05:14:32', NULL, 0, 3),
(195, 'Cheerful Knitted Minion Wonderland', 20, 'A vibrant ultra-realistic yarn-crafted world featuring a joyful girl with playful Minions — cozy, colorful & creatively detailed.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A cheerful beautiful 10-year-old girl wearing a blue-and-yellow knitted sweater and yellow Nike sneakers with blue soles, sitting on a large banana-shaped knitted chair with \"ROXY\" embroidered in blue yarn. She hugs a big knitted Minion plush in her arms. Around her are multiple knitted Minions of various sizes some standing, some hanging playfully from oversized yellow and blue yarn balls scattered across the floor. The entire environment, including the background, floor, and banana props, is handcrafted from soft yarn threads in bright yellow, denim blue, and white tones, with subtle spiral knit textures. Studio lighting highlights the vivid color contrast and cozy yarn details, ultra-detailed 8K realism\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763358738_52dcb9b2ab42.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"KnittedWonderland\",\"YarnArt\",\"MinionVibes\",\"KidsPhotoshoot\",\"8KRealism\",\"CreativeStudio\",\"HandcraftedWorld\",\"CuteAndCozy\",\"BlueAndYellowMagic\",\"BananaChair\",\"UltraDetailed\",\"ArtisticPhotography\",\"PlayfulDesign\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-17 05:52:18', NULL, 0, 2),
(196, '✨ Dreamy Pastel Winter Romance ✨', 23, 'Ultra-realistic cinematic portrait of a young couple in a magical pastel snow forest — soft love, glowing snowflakes, and timeless winter beauty.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic portrait of a young couple (same face as uploaded photo) in the same pose and background, holding snow gently in their gloved hands close to their face while gazing softly at the camera. She’s wearing a pastel winter outfit — a cozy striped sweater in soft pink, lavender, and baby blue tones with matching pastel gloves and scarf. Her makeup is delicate yet glam: dewy skin, subtle blush, glossy pink lips, and softly defined eyes.men couple wear to the girl\r\nThe background remains the same snowy forest scene, but transformed into dreamy pastel hues — light pink and blue tones in the snow and soft bokeh lights glowing behind her. Snowflakes sparkle around their face as pastel light reflects on their hair, creating a magical, cinematic winter look.\r\n(ultra-realistic, 8K detail, pastel tones, soft cinematic lighting, same background and pose, glowing snowflakes, dreamy winter aesthetic, fashion editorial style)\r\nMake it real face the photo uploaded.\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763359183_ac7f2e212526.png', NULL, '[\"WinterCoupleShoot\",\"PastelSnowAesthetic\",\"PicPoseMagic\",\"CinematicLove\",\"CouplePortrait\",\"WinterPhotography\",\"SnowflakeGlow\",\"PastelFashion\",\"LoveInWinter\",\"UltraRealisticEdit\",\"DreamyAesthetic\",\"RomanticPortrait\",\"PicPoseCreation\",\"8KDetailArt\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-17 