(197, 'Birthday Glow: Ultra-Realistic Bedside Celebration', 18, 'Soft waves, pastel balloons & a magical birthday wish — captured in a cozy, cinematic moment.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Keep the same facial features and create an ultra realistic photo of a young woman lying on her stomach on a bed, slightly propped up on her elbows, facing the camera with a soft and happy expression as if she’s gently blowing out the candle on her birthday cake. She is wearing a soft-textured white bathrobe, and her long dark black hair falls in soft waves over her shoulders and down her back.\r\nWith her left hand, she holds a large bunch of balloons in various sizes and colors — mainly shades of pink, fuchsia, and silver. The bunch includes shiny reflective fuchsia balloons, metallic silver heart-shaped and round balloons, and transparent balloons with pink confetti or delicate pink inscriptions.\r\nThe bed is cozy, covered with a white duvet, surrounded by more\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763359728_904e60e59aac.png', NULL, '[\"BirthdayPortrait\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"BalloonAesthetic\",\"SoftGlow\",\"CozyVibes\",\"ElegantBirthday\",\"PicPose\",\"BedsidePortrait\",\"ConfettiMagic\",\"GlamCelebration\",\"AIPhotoArt\",\"SoftTexture\",\"happyvibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-17 06:08:48', NULL, 0, 5),
