(202, 'Fairytale Selfie: Snow White & The Seven Dwarfs Edition', 33, 'A magical forest selfie transformation — replace the original face with the reference person, while preserving pose, expression, clothing colors, lighting, and the enchanting fairytale mood.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Edit the uploaded image (face based on a reference photo). Ensure the face matches the person in the uploaded image. A magical scene of a fairytale forest, warm golden sunlight filtering through the tall trees. In front of a small cottage with a moss-covered roof and wooden windows, a man stands in the same pose as in the original photo: his right arm raised, holding a smartphone for a selfie, his face slightly turned towards the phone, with the same friendly expression and warm smile.\r\nHis medium-length hair falls naturally to the sides in a slightly tousled, masculine style, matching the direction and flow of the original photo.\r\nHe wears the same colors: a white shirt with writing on the front, orange trousers, a traditional long patterned scarf, and green sneakers. Next to him stands Snow White, in her classic blue bodysuit with red and blue sleeves and a yellow skirt. Around them are the seven dwarfs, standing in the same poses, with the same expressions, the same lighting, and the same warm, fairytale vibe.\r\nThe setting remains the same: a soft dirt path, small flowers, mushrooms, flickering lights, and a dreamy, enchanting atmosphere.\r\nThe lighting is warm, soft, and magical—just like the original. The entire composition, pose, distance, framing, and emotional feel are perfectly preserved, but the selfie\'s subject is replaced by a man with the same hair length, pose, direction, and expression.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/176