(203, 'Sea Breeze Elegance – Coastal Romance Portrait', 18, 'A breathtaking ultra-realistic 8K portrait featuring a graceful woman on a rugged coastline, glowing with glam beauty and holding a romantic bouquet.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Upload your forward-facing high-definition reference photo, then paste this prompt.\r\nUse the uploaded reference photo for accurate facial identity and alignment. Preserve her true features and natural beauty. Ultra-realistic 8K portrait with authentic skin micro-texture and soft highlights. Alluringly elegant expression with soft lips and a direct gaze.\r\nNica identity: grey-olive eyes, sculpted features, balanced figure with naturally full, well-proportioned bust, subtle skin luminosity, defined hair strands. Glam makeup: soft matte base, sculpted contour, warm bronze highlight, winged eyeliner, defined lashes, matte red lips, beige nail tint.\r\nWoman standing on a rugged coastline, holding a large bouquet of deep pink peonies or garden roses with eucalyptus. Shoulder-length dark brown hair in soft, wind-blown waves. Flowing resort-style dress in pink, coral, and red/orange tones with ruffled or wrap styling.\r\nTeal-to-deep-blue ocean, white foam on rocks, muted sky. Romantic, dramatic, elegant mood. Soft natural daylight, photoreal clarity, tactile realism.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763379221_74e69f905358.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CoastalPortrait\",\"CinematicBeauty\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"8KPortrait\",\"WindBlownHair\",\"RomanticVibes\",\"OceanBackdrops\",\"PeonyBouquet\",\"GlamMakeup\",\"RealisticSkin\",\"ElegantStyle\",\"FashionPortrait\",\"BeachPhotoshoot\",\"ArtisticPhotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-17 11:33:41', NULL, 0, 0),
