(211, 'Pastel Paradise with Giant Stitch', 23, 'A dreamy outdoor moment where a couple relaxes on Stitch’s soft belly amid flowers, butterflies, and a Stitch-themed fantasy home.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A couple in a pastel outfit are lying comfortably on the giant stomach of Stitch, who is resting playfully on a grassy garden field. Stitch is huge, fluffy, bright blue, and super adorable, with his big ears, round nose, and soft belly that the couple are lying on like a cozy cushion. Stitch has a wide happy grin, one arm behind his head in a relaxed pose, and the other paw resting gently beside them\r\nThe couple smiles as they relaxes on his tummy, enjoying the sweet moment.\r\nColorful flowers, bright green grass, and butterflies surround them, creating a cheerful outdoor vibe. In the background, a Stitch-themed three-story house with cute alien details is clearly visible under bright natural daylight.\r\nsame face of human-beings,\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763454806_ac1e784b8f83.png', NULL, '[\"StitchFantasy\",\"PastelAesthetic\",\"GiantStitchVibes\",\"CuteCoupleMoment\",\"OutdoorMagicScene\",\"DreamyGardenLook\",\"WhimsicalPortrait\",\"UltraRealisticArt\",\"CinematicVibes\",\"PicPoseSignaturehe\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-18 08:33:26', NULL, 0, 0),
(212, 'Magical Ribbon Duo Portrait', 19, 'A charming 7-year-old boy posing with animated Minnie Mouse as pink ribbons swirl in a bright cinematic setup.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A lively portrait of a handsome 7-year-old boy crouching beside a fully animated Minnie Mouse twirling a giant pink ribbon. His wears a tailored cream jacket, white tee, and sleek black trousers. Minnie\'s ribbon arcs around them in a vibrant swirl. The set has a bright white bounce backdrop with subtle golden confetti raining.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763461724_4c2692c0f234.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"MinnieMagic\",\"KidsPortrait\",\"RibbonArt\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"CreativePortrait\",\"FantasyEdit\",\"PhotoTransformation\",\"AIUltraRealistic\",\"PortraitMagic\",\"StudioAesthetic\",\"GoldenConfetti\",\"ElegantEdit\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-18 10:28:44', NULL, 0, 2),
(213, 'Red Storm Cosplay Guardian', 27, 'Ultra-Realistic Cinematic Portrait of a Silver-Haired Warrior With the Magatsu Kyubi — 9:16 Artistic Cosplay Fantasy\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Fotografi cosplayer ultra-realistis dari seorang pria muda(gunakan foto yang diunggah sebagai referensi wajah) dengan layered low fade/tekstur crop silver hair dan mata biru menatap ke kamera. Ia mengenakan kaos hitam ketat, rompi bomber merah tanpa lengan yang tidak diresleting, celana tactical hitam dengan aksen merah dan strap gantung, sarung tangan hitam dengan aksen merah, dan sepatu bot tinggi hitam dengan detail merah yang menyatu dengan pelindung lutut. Sebuah pedang besar mekanik berwarna silver, merah, dan hitam tersandang di punggungnya dengan tali melintang di dada. Ia berdiri dengan pose keren, bersandar pada makhluk kolosal mirip rubah besar kombinasi warna hitam dan merah, dengan bulu leher lebih tebal merah menyala, tiga ekor mengembang, dan mata merah tajam (Magatsu Kyubi dari game God Eater 2). Makhluk itu terlihat lembut, dan pria itu dengan santai meletakkan tangannya di badannya. Di sekitar makhluk itu terdapat partikel energi/aura dan orb-orb kecil kemerahan yang mengambang, bersinar, dan sedikit kilatan merah. Latar belakangnya adalah puing-puing gedung yang dramatis dengan langit badai kemerahan. Rasio aspek 9:16. Gaya potret artistik, emosional, dan ultra-realistis.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763461881_853f13f01827.png', NULL, '[\"CosplayPortrait\",\"UltraRealisticArt\",\"CinematicFantasy\",\"SilverHairAesthetic\",\"BlueEyesCosplay\",\"MagatsuKyubi\",\"GodEaterInspired\",\"FantasyBeastCompanion\",\"RedBlackTheme\",\"EpicCharacterDesign\",\"CosplayPhotographyStyle\",\"9x16Portrait\",\"PicPoseSignature\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-18 10:31:21', NULL, 0, 2),
(214, 'Little Style Icon at Burj Khalifa', 19, 'Ultra-realistic portrait of a 7-year-old boy radiating confidence, modern fashion, and Dubai’s iconic skyline — captured with crisp daylight detailing and clean reflections.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A 7-year-old boy posing confidently with Burj Khalifa behind him, wearing sunglasses and modern kids fashion, bright daylight, clean city reflections, ultra-sharp details.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763462362_1ba8a535f4b9.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"BurjKhalifaShoot\",\"KidsFashion\",\"DubaiPortrait\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"ModernKidsLook\",\"StylishKid\",\"DaylightPhotography\",\"CityReflections\",\"ProPortrait\",\"8KQuality\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-18 10:39:22', NULL, 0, 4),
(215, 'Dreamy Cloud Couture Portrait', 18, 'Ultra-Realistic High-Fashion Fantasy Shot with Clouds, Pastels & Ethereal Styling — Face 100% Preserved\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Preserve my exact face with zero modifications — identical facial features, proportions, skin tone, and identity. Maintain natural skin texture and beauty marks. Create a cinematic, ultra-realistic, high-fashion portrait with lifelike lighting, crisp detail, editorial clarity, and sharp focus. Only change hairstyle, outfit, styling, color palette, background, props, lighting, and artistic mood. Shot type: Close-up / Medium close-up / Half-body / Three-quarter body / Full-body. Expression may vary (soft, confident, dreamy, serene), pose harmonizes with theme and setting. Ultra-detailed textures, digital camera realism, high-resolution clarity, natural but elevated tones.\r\nArt Direction:\r\nFloating clouds, sky fantasy, or dreamy pastel backgrounds\r\nAiry, playful, and chic fashion poses\r\nFashion: flowing gowns, ethereal textures, light fabrics\r\nHair: wavy, floating, or gently styled for movement\r\nProps: balloons, floating flowers, or soft cloud-like props\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763464125_8930712a41dc.png', NULL, '[\"PicPosePremium\",\"CloudFantasyPortrait\",\"EtherealFashionShot\",\"DreamyAesthetic\",\"UltraRealisticPortrait\",\"HighFashionEdit\",\"PastelSkyVibes\",\"FloatingCloudsArt\",\"CinematicPortraitStyle\",\"EditorialBeautyLook\",\"LuxuryPhotoEdit\",\"PicPoseLogoReady\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-18 11:08:45', NULL, 0, 0),
(216, 'The Jungle Archer: Cloud Leopard Guardian', 17, 'A cinematic full-body adventure portrait of a rugged archer in a dense rainforest, poised for action with a cloud leopard watching from above.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A captivating and dramatic full-body portrait of a rugged man in a lush, dense jungle environment, equipped for an adventure. He is Caucasian, with a short, neatly trimmed dark beard and mustache, and intense, focused eyes. He wears a practical, dark olive green long-sleeved shirt and matching cargo pants, along with sturdy brown hiking boots.\r\nHe is positioned in a dynamic stance, one leg slightly forward, holding a traditional recurve bow with his left hand, and drawing an arrow from a quiver attached to his large, tan-brown hiking backpack with his right hand. The backpack is well-filled with a collection of arrows neatly bundled and protruding from the top. A leather holster with a knife is visible on his right hip.\r\nBehind him, perched on a thick, moss-covered tree branch, is a majestic cloud leopard with distinct spotted patterns, observing the scene intently. The jungle is rich with vibrant green foliage, including large leaves, vines, and tall trees, creating a sense of depth and immersion. Soft, natural light filters through the canopy, highlighting textures and casting subtle shadows. The overall mood is adventurous and slightly tense, suggesting a moment of anticipation or readiness\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763465279_b80eeb02c853.png', NULL, '[\"JungleArcher\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"AdventureWarrior\",\"EpicWildlifeShot\",\"CloudLeopard\",\"JunglePhotography\",\"HeroicPose\",\"PicPose\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"FantasyAdventure\",\"WildTerrain\",\"CinematicVibes\",\"SurvivalMode\",\"NatureAction\",\"portraitartwork\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-18 11:27:59', NULL, 0, 0),
(217, 'PicPose World Landmarks 3D Identity Portrait', 27, 'A hyper-realistic 3D blockbuster artwork featuring iconic world landmarks inside giant “PicPose” letters, with a natural upper-body pose and premium magazine-style aesthetics.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a hyper-realistic 3D artwork featuring large block letters spelling \"PicPose\"\r\nEach letter should be a detailed 3D structure filled with iconic world landmarks inside,\r\nsuch as theTONGKONAN HOUSE, LOLAI, JESUS STATUE AT BURAKE,etc.\r\nUse the attached photo of me and place my upper body leaning on the 3D letters,\r\narms resting naturally.\r\nMaintain my face exactly as in the attached image:\r\nSame identity, consistent facial structure across all scenes. Wearing an white tshirt,\r\nStudio-style gradient background, premium modern look.\r\nSoft studio lighting with realistic shadows, high depth, photorealistic textures.\r\nUltra HD 8K quality, magazine-style composition with strong visual impact.\r\nMake the letters visually dominant with me positioned on top naturally.\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763530304_2b174e718916.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"3DArtwork\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"LandmarkArt\",\"3DTypography\",\"WorldLandmarks\",\"8KRender\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"AIArtPrompt\",\"MagazineStyle\",\"PhotoRealistic\",\"StudioLighting\",\"ModernArtDesign\",\"CreativePortrait\",\"IdentityPreserved\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-19 05:31:44', NULL, 0, 0);
