(218, 'Snowfall Elegance: The Little Fashion Icon', 19, 'Ultra-Cinematic Winter Portrait With High-Fashion Aesthetics, Perfect Facial Fidelity & Editorial-Grade Styling\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A young child (3–5 years old) walking gracefully through softly falling snow, wearing a luxurious wool overcoat, soft cashmere scarf, and stylish branded boots. Ultra-cinematic lighting with gentle cold tones, subtle soft shadows, and high-fashion editorial polish. Snowflakes sparkling naturally around, slight depth of field for dramatic focus, rich color grading like a premium magazine cover. Ultra-realistic full-body rendering with perfect preservation of facial features and expressions (1000% face match), natural posture and proportions. Include the signature \"Ai-Abdullah\" artistically integrated into the scene. Aspect ratio optimized for full Facebook/portrait display, ready for social media, reels, or print use.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763531532_695a81d92d13.png', NULL, '[\"WinterFashionPortrait\",\"CinematicKidsShoot\",\"UltraRealisticEdit\",\"SnowfallAesthetic\",\"HighFashionChild\",\"LuxuryWinterLook\",\"EditorialStylePhoto\",\"PremiumColorGrading\",\"PicPoseEdit\",\"AiAbdullahArt\",\"FacebookPortrait\",\"ReelsReady\",\"MagazineStylePhotography\",\"KidsFashionEditorial\",\"SnowPortraitMagic\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 1, 1, '2025-11-19 05:52:12', NULL, 0, 2),
(219, 'Cinematic Kung Fu Panda Studio Portrait', 33, 'Ultra-Realistic Promo-Style Shot Featuring Your Photo with the Legendary Kung Fu Panda Team — Perfectly Lit, Professionally Composed\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic, high-end cinematic studio portrait — the man (from uploaded photo) stands confidently at the center, surrounded by the Kung Fu Panda team posed like a movie promo poster.\r\nBackdrop: gradient tones echoing each character’s color (red, gold, green, white, black, beige).\r\nEach character is lit with professional softbox lighting, shadows balanced perfectly for depth.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763531865_a691e957d191.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"MoviePosterStyle\",\"KungFuPandaEdit\",\"StudioLighting\",\"HighEndRetouch\",\"AIPhotoArt\",\"EpicCharacterShot\",\"CreativePortrait\",\"AIEditing\",\"CinematicVibes\",\"ProfessionalAI\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 1, 2, '2025-11-19 05:57:45', NULL, 0, 5),
(220, 'Autumn Bond: Man & Horse Cinematic Portrait', 17, 'A warm, golden-hour moment capturing the serene connection between a man and his majestic chestnut horse, surrounded by glowing autumn leaves.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Edit the uploaded image (face based on a reference photo). Ensure the face matches the person in the uploaded image. \"A high-resolution, finely detailed autumn scene of a man standing confidently beside a beautiful horse. The man leans lightly against a thick wall of autumn leaves in shades of orange, gold, and brown. His black hair is neatly styled, and his expression is calm and focused. He wears a long camel coat over an ivory knit sweater, with warm brown trousers and dark leather boots. His hands are gently clasped in front of him.\r\nBeside him stands a glossy chestnut horse with a soft, light blond mane. The horse gently inclines its head toward the man, touching his cheek. The ground is covered with fallen autumn leaves, while warm, golden sunlight from above casts a soft, glowing light. Some leaves flutter gently in the air, enhancing the peaceful and harmonious atmosphere between the man and the horse.\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763532250_02c3f080bde5.png', NULL, '[\"AutumnPortrait\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"HorseAndMan\",\"FallAesthetics\",\"GoldenHourGlow\",\"UltraRealisticEdit\",\"PicPoseStyle\",\"NaturePortrait\",\"ChestnutHorse\",\"HighDetailArt\",\"AutumnVibes\",\"PhotoManipulation\",\"ProfessionalEdit\",\"WarmTonePortrait\",\"elegantscene\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-19 06:04:10', NULL, 0, 0),
(221, 'Neon Racer Masterpiece in Alpine Mountains', 17, 'Ultra-Realistic 8K Motorcycle Racing Portrait with Exact Facial Identity & BMW S1000RR Neon Livery\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an ultra-realistic 8K photo of a man, copying the uploaded face and hair 100%, without altering any facial features. He is dressed as a professional motorcycle racer, crouching low next to his sportbike (BMW S 1000 RR). He wears a **full neon yellow and black racing suit**, with matching neon yellow gloves and boots. Logos are visible on his gear, including “shafree” on the sleeves and pants. The motorcycle has a **matching neon yellow and black livery**, with aftermarket upgrades including a black carbon-style windscreen, custom exhaust, gold forks, and upgraded brakes, with “shafree” visible on the bike.  \r\nThe subject leans slightly towards the bike’s front end, looking at it with serious pride and focus. The scene is set on a smooth asphalt road in a **scenic alpine mountain location**, with steep rocky cliffs behind the rider and bike. In the background to the right, a valley with rolling hills, a village, and distant hazy mountains are visible. Natural daylight illuminates the scene, slightly diffused but strong enough to make the neon yellow colors **vibrantly pop** against the darker background.  \r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.\r\n', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763532837_105c5356be9e.png', NULL, '[\"NeonRacer\",\"UltraRealistic8K\",\"BMWs1000RR\",\"MotoRacingShoot\",\"NeonYellowGear\",\"IdentityPerfect\",\"PicPoseCreation\",\"CinematicBikePortrait\",\"AlpineScenery\",\"CustomLivery\",\"ShafreeEdition\",\"MotorsportPhotography\",\"8KPortrait\",\"MotorcycleArt\",\"PicPoseOfficial\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-19 06:13:57', NULL, 0, 0),
(222, 'Amethyst Dream couture portrait in a crystal cavern', 18, 'Ultra-realistic full-body high-fashion shot with preserved facial identity, glowing violet ambience, and elegant PicPose watermark detailing\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Preserve my exact face with zero modifications — identical facial features, proportions, skin tone, and identity. Maintain natural skin texture and beauty marks. Create a cinematic, ultra-realistic, high-fashion portrait with lifelike lighting, crisp detail, editorial clarity, and sharp focus. Only change hairstyle, outfit, styling, color palette, background, props, lighting, and artistic mood. Full-body shot. I stand in a glowing amethyst cavern with soft mist and sparkling crystals, wearing an iridescent couture gown in violet and lilac tones, with flowing chiffon and gemstone jewelry. Expression: dreamy and confident, pose elegant and interacting with crystals. Ultra-detailed textures, digital camera realism, high-resolution clarity, natural but elevated tones. Add subtle watermark in lower-left corner:\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763537650_9443a4657fa9.png', NULL, '[\"AmethystCouturePortrait\",\"UltraRealisticFashionShot\",\"CrystalCavernAesthetic\",\"HighFashionEditorial\",\"PicPoseSignature\",\"VioletDreamscape\",\"CinematicFullBodyPortrait\",\"IridescentGownStyle\",\"CrystalAuraArt\",\"HyperRealPhotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-19 07:34:10', NULL, 0, 0),
(223, 'Joyful Bloom – Overhead Floral Portrait', 18, 'A natural, high-quality DSLR flat-lay portrait capturing pure happiness amidst lush green foliage and orange blossoms.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A realistic, high-quality overhead portrait photograph of a joyful young woman with long, dark hair, lying on the ground amidst dark green foliage and small orange flowers. She is smiling sweet with her eyes open, radiating happiness, and extending one arm towards the camera, pointing directly at the viewer. Her other arm is resting above her head. She is wearing a distressed blue denim jacket over a black lace top. The background is filled with the natural texture of the dark foliage and scattered orange blossoms, creating a serene and natural ambiance. The image is shot with a DSLR camera to achieve a professional, artistic, and beautifully lit flat lay portrait with natural light. Maintain her exact facial features and joyful expression from the reference image, ensuring she has a high-quality, elegant makeup look applied, featuring sharp winged eyeliner, defined eyebrows, subtle contour, and a vibrant red or berry lip color. Do not change her face.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763538609_c83d15e417f8.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"FloralPortrait\",\"OverheadShot\",\"DSLRPhotography\",\"NaturalLightPortrait\",\"JoyfulExpression\",\"ElegantMakeup\",\"DenimAesthetic\",\"CreativeFlatLay\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"PhotoRealistic\",\"PortraitInNature\",\"ArtisticPhotography\",\"OrangeBloomVibes\",\"lushgreenbackdrop\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 21, '2025-11-19 07:50:09', NULL, 14, 32),
(224, 'Golden Hour Couture: Ultra-Realistic High-Fashion Portrait', 27, 'A cinematic, identity-perfect portrait with warm studio glow, couture elegance, and PicPose signature finesse.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Preserve my exact face with zero modifications — identical facial features, proportions, skin tone, and identity. Maintain natural skin texture and beauty marks. Create a cinematic, ultra-realistic, high-fashion portrait with lifelike lighting, crisp detail, editorial clarity, and sharp focus. Only change hairstyle, outfit, styling, color palette, background, props, lighting, and overall artistic mood. Shot type: Half-body / Three-quarter body / Full-body. Expression may vary (soft, confident, dreamy, serene), pose harmonizes with theme and setting. Ultra-detailed textures, digital camera realism, high-resolution clarity, natural but elevated tones.\r\nArt Direction:\r\nStudio with golden-hour simulated lighting, warm highlights and soft shadows.\r\nBubbly, playful, chic, youthful editorial pose, perched slightly elevated, twisting gently to showcase gown and leg.\r\nFashion: Gradient couture gown with layered poppy petals, high slit, plunging neckline.\r\nHair: Long straight Gray Blonde, light waves, playful volume.\r\nNail art: red glossy nails with gemstone accents reflecting golden light.\r\nAccessories: subtle rings and gemstone earrings.\r\nProps: scattered petals, gentle shadow patterns.\r\nLighting: warm cinematic glow, soft rim highlights.\r\nCamera: full-body shot, shallow depth of field, cinematic focus on subject.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763545460_730cfa69ca2c.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"HighFashionPortrait\",\"CinematicGlow\",\"UltraRealisticPhoto\",\"GoldenHourLighting\",\"IdentityPreserved\",\"EditorialStyle\",\"CoutureGown\",\"DigitalCameraRealism\",\"FashionPhotography\",\"StudioPortrait\",\"ElegantAesthetics\",\"3DDetailing\",\"HyperRealism\",\"PhotographyPrompt\",\"AIPhotoMagic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-19 09:44:20', NULL, 0, 2),
