(226, 'Enchanted Winter Glow: A Cinematic Christmas Couture Portrait', 27, 'A high-fashion, ultra-realistic snow-forest portrait preserving true identity with glowing couture, dynamic pose, and magical twilight ambience.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Preserve my exact face with zero modifications — identical facial features, proportions, skin tone, and identity. Maintain natural skin texture. Create a cinematic, ultra-realistic, high-fashion portrait with lifelike lighting, crisp detail, editorial clarity, and sharp focus. Only change hairstyle, outfit, styling, color palette, background, props, lighting, and overall artistic mood. Shot type: Half-body / Three-quarter body / Full-body. Expression may vary (soft, confident, dreamy, serene), pose harmonizes with theme and setting. Ultra-detailed textures, digital camera realism, high-resolution clarity, natural but elevated tones.\r\nArt Direction:\r\nSetting: Snow-covered winter forest, soft twilight glow, path winding into distance, sparkling snow on evergreen branches. Christmas tree to the right decorated with warm lights.\r\nPose: Mid-twirl, gown flowing outward, head slightly tilted to the left looking off into distance, one hand brushing the skirt while the other slightly raised.\r\nFashion: Voluminous ball gown with sweetheart neckline and off-shoulder puff sleeves, embedded with hundreds of glowing warm lights. Adorned with red berries, green pine sprigs, shimmering snowflakes on sheer fabric.\r\nHair: Long flowing waves, slightly wind-swept for dynamic movement.\r\nNail Art: Icy white nails with subtle shimmer and tiny crystal snowflakes.\r\nJewelry: Small silver snowflake earrings, delicate silver rings.\r\nProps: Scattered snowflakes on gown and ground, Christmas tree, soft reflection from snow.\r\nLighting: Glow primarily from gown lights and Christmas tree, soft twilight ambient fill, warm romantic tones.\r\nCamera: Full-body shot, shallow depth of field, soft bokeh on trees and mountains, high-resolution cinematic clarity.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763549843_e41519ec048d.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"WinterCouture\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"ChristmasGlow\",\"HighFashionArt\",\"SnowForestShoot\",\"EditorialStyle\",\"TwilightMagic\",\"FashionPhotography\",\"GlowingGown\",\"HolidayAesthetic\",\"DreamyPortrait\",\"DigitalArtistry\",\"BokehMagic\",\"LuxuryVisuals\",\"PortraitMasterpiece\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-19 10:57:23', NULL, 0, 0),
(227, 'Divine Rainbow Mermaid — Ultra-Realistic Underwater Portrait', 27, '8K cinematic underwater beauty featuring a serene mermaid, radiant rainbow scales, flowing fins, and dreamy ocean-light ambiance.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'The face same as the original image. An ultra-realistic 8K photographic underwater portrait of a graceful female mermaid with a well-toned body and naturally sun-kissed skin. The camera angle is slightly low, looking upward to emphasize her noble and divine presence. She gently holds a large ornate conch horn in one hand, its surface carved with intricate marine motifs and faint golden iridescence, while her other arm rests relaxed beside her. She has soft feminine features, with a calm and serene expression.  \r\nShe wears realistic jewelry harmonized with her pearlescent theme — a finely detailed necklace, wide bracelets, and a crown designed with flowing curves and soft rainbow reflections that complement her scales. The transition from her human torso to her tail is smooth and natural, featuring subtle translucent fish-like skin blending seamlessly into elegant white scales with a **vivid, clearly visible rainbow gradient pattern**. Each scale reflects and refracts underwater light, producing **soft, dynamic prismatic gleams** — pink, blue, green, and gold tones shifting fluidly as the light moves. Her long, wide tail and flowing fins shimmer with enhanced rainbow reflections, gently curving and swaying in the surrounding water\r\nSoft, translucent silk-like fabric drifts and flows around her in the water, glowing faintly as it catches the light, enhancing the divine and dreamlike atmosphere.  \r\nThe scene is set deep beneath the ocean surface, captured with realistic lighting, depth of field, and natural photographic textures. Soft blue-green beams of light filter from above, creating subtle refractions and caustic patterns that dance across her skin, jewelry, and scales. Fine floating water particles and drifting bubbles add realism. A few small sea creatures — tiny fish and faint jellyfish — drift gracefully in the distance. The softly blurred background keeps full focus on her in a lifelike cinematic photographic style, not painting or illustration.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763551265_5618ea85a134.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"MermaidPortrait\",\"UnderwaterPhotography\",\"8KRealism\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"UltraRealisticArt\",\"FantasyMermaid\",\"RainbowScales\",\"PhotorealisticArt\",\"OceanDepths\",\"AquaCinematic\",\"MythicalBeauty\",\"FantasyPortrait\",\"DreamlikeArt\",\"UnderwaterMagic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-19 11:21:05', NULL, 0, 0),
(228, 'El Gran Tesoro de los Sueños', 19, 'Un niño y Rico McPato en una aventura épica entre montañas de monedas doradas, iluminadas con brillo cinematográfico.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Un niño (yo) junto a Rico McPato está sentado sobre una pila de monedas, contando monedas de oro en su almacén. El cuerpo se mueve con naturalidad y dinamismo mientras cuenta las monedas, que brillan con realismo. Mi expresión es alegre, Rico McPato sonríe satisfecho y juguetón mientras cuenta. La iluminación cinematográfica, con las luces del almacén reflejándose en las monedas, la pila de monedas y la caja de oro, crea un fondo vívido y lleno de detalles. Un plano general muestra todo el almacén y la atmósfera repleta de monedas; el ambiente es alegre y épico, con movimientos ultrarrealistas, fluidos e interactivos, y una perspectiva dramática como una escena de una película de fantasía de Disney.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763614208_787105e31602.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"FantasyCinematic\",\"DisneyStyle\",\"RichMcDuck\",\"GoldTreasureScene\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"EpicAdventure\",\"GoldenCoins\",\"MagicWarehouse\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"DynamicPose\",\"FantasyMovieLook\",\"ChildHeroScene\",\"8KUltraReal\",\"TreasureVibes\",\"EpicAtmosphere\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-20 04:50:08', NULL, 0, 0),
(229, 'Parisian Dawn Grace – Handsome Elegance at Sacré-Cœur', 17, 'A photorealistic, golden-hour portrait capturing refined charm, soft warmth, and a romantic Parisian aura — starring the model based on your uploaded photo, adorned with subtle elegance and the iconic “PicPose” signature.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Photorealistic medium close-up shot, handsome Indonesian man with athletic toned muscle build, rose gold and silver hair in a ponytail, a few loose strands of hair swept by the wind, small black ear stud, wearing a classic Parisian outfit (beige trench coat with a small embroidered \'Pame Dab\' patch on the lapel, black turtleneck, slim-fit trousers, leather ankle boots), holding bread crumbs in his palm with pigeons eagerly eating from his hand, some birds taking flight around him, gentle closed-lip smile, in front of the Sacré-Cœur Basilica, Montmartre, clear background showing the basilica architecture, sharp focus on face and background, morning golden hour, soft warm light, romantic and elegant atmosphere. Use my photo as the model.\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763614702_990f8aa59a39.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseSignature\",\"ParisianAesthetic\",\"SacréCoeurVibes\",\"GoldenHourPortrait\",\"UltraRealisticShot\",\"HandsomeModel\",\"IndonesianCharm\",\"WindBlownHair\",\"ElegantParisLook\",\"ClassicTrenchStyle\",\"PigeonsInFrame\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"MorningWarmLight\",\"PhotorealisticAI\",\"ParisPhotographyStyle\",\"MontmartreMagic\",\"AIArtPortrait\",\"StylishElegance\",\"8kdetailing\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-20 04:58:22', NULL, 0, 0),
(230, 'Urban Wink Vibes – Ultra-Realistic Full-Body Portrait', 27, 'Playful teen aesthetic with a giant ‘Thursday’ coffee cup, mini-heart gesture, and true-to-photo facial realism — finished with an elegant PicPose signature.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a candid, ultra-realistic, cinematic full-body image, 100% face copy, identical to the attached image of a tiny-bodied, big-headed teenage woman. Absolutely no cartoon face changes.\r\nShe has light brown makeup and dark brown hair styled in two messy braids with bangs.\r\nShe is wearing a bright orange tank top screen-printed with \'BOOM Style\' in colorful graffiti-style letters, loose-fitting black denim jeans with rips at both knees, casually cuffed at the ankles, and black sneakers. She is also wearing a cool matching silver necklace and bracelet.\r\nThere is a giant orange ceramic Thursday coffee cup with small white flowers and a tiny rabbit design on it. The cup has the words \"Good Morning\" and steam rising above it.\r\nA cute rabbit doll is placed next to the cup.\r\nShe is standing sideways, leaning against the cup, looking at the camera, giving a playful wink, and making a mini heart gesture with her hand towards the camera.\r\nThe background is a blurred urban city scene.\r\nThe image should be realistic like a photograph, with real lighting and real people; no drawings, cartoons, or anime.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763616052_9f2db2ddc72a.png', NULL, '[\"UltraRealisticPortrait\",\"CinematicPhotoStyle\",\"TeenAesthetic\",\"BigHeadTinyBody\",\"FullBodyShot\",\"UrbanBlurBackground\",\"CoffeeCupArt\",\"MiniHeartPose\",\"PlayfulWink\",\"RealisticLighting\",\"PicPoseSignature\",\"AIPhotoPrompt\",\"HyperRealLook\",\"RealFaceIdentity\",\"CreativePhotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-20 05:09:51', NULL, 0, 0),
(231, 'Cinematic Urban Fantasy Portrait with Ultra-Realistic Identity Preservation', 18, 'A dreamy, fashion-forward full-body artwork blending real-world cinematic lighting with playful fantasy elements — preserving the exact face identity with zero changes.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 (if using a model or subject)\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Preserve my exact face with zero modifications — identical facial features, proportions, skin tone, and identity. Maintain natural skin texture and beauty marks. Create a cinematic, ultra-realistic, high-fashion portrait with lifelike lighting, crisp detail, editorial clarity, and sharp focus. Only change hairstyle, outfit, styling, color palette, background, props, lighting, and artistic mood. Shot type: Close-up / Medium close-up / Half-body / Three-quarter body / Full-body. Expression may vary (soft, confident, dreamy, serene), pose harmonizes with theme and setting. Ultra-detailed textures, digital camera realism, high-resolution clarity, natural but elevated tones.\r\nArt Direction:\r\nFloating clouds, sky fantasy, or dreamy pastel backgrounds\r\nAiry, playful, and chic fashion poses\r\nFashion: flowing gowns, ethereal textures, light fabrics\r\nHair: wavy, floating, or gently styled for movement\r\nProps: balloons, floating flowers, or soft cloud-like props.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763620082_784c3054c868.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseStyle\",\"UltraRealisticAI\",\"IdentityPreserved\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"FashionFantasy\",\"UrbanDreamscape\",\"BigHeadStyle\",\"RealisticLighting\",\"EditorialAesthetic\",\"AIPhotoArt\",\"HighFashionVibes\",\"PastelSkyMood\",\"FloatingCloudTheme\",\"AIPhotographyMagic\",\"FullBodyCinematic\",\"DreamyUrbanLook\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11