(232, 'Magical Tom & Jerry Water Splash Scene', 33, 'Ultra-realistic character moment with playful motion, sparkling water effects, and exact facial identity adjustment\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Adjust the uploaded image (face based on the reference image). Ensure the face matches the person in the uploaded image. A man stands on a wooden ladder wearing a fitted orange shirt and dark jeans, with simple, elegant lines.\r\nHe leans forward dramatically, holding a bright red bucket in both hands, and pours a magical stream of water over the cartoon character Tom. The water curves beautifully, sparkling with tiny touches, and is lively, as if frozen in a playful moment.\r\nAt the bottom of the ladder, Jerry laughs joyfully, his eyes wide and bright, his arms raised excitedly, pointing at the drenched Tom. His fur is soft and fluffy, the background of the house door.\r\nWarm ambient lighting accentuates the edges of the characters. Soft, playful shadows.\r\nBright, saturated colors.\r\nDelicate, enchanting glows on the water droplets and around the characters.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763620233_6abe45450c7f.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"TomAndJerryArt\",\"UltraRealisticEdit\",\"CartoonMagic\",\"WaterSplashEffect\",\"CreativeScene\",\"CharacterInteraction\",\"AIArtPrompt\",\"RealFaceMatch\",\"VibrantColors\",\"CinematicCartoon\",\"FantasyPortrait\",\"PlayfulSparkle\",\"PicPoseLogo\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-20 06:30:33', NULL, 0, 0),
(233, 'Majestic Giant Eagle Encounter', 17, 'Photorealistic golden-hour scene of a man bonding with a towering bald eagle on a rocky peak\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A photorealistic, highly detailed image of a massive, gigantic bald eagle standing next to a man use the uploaded photo, on a rocky mountain peak. The eagle should be easily twice the height of the man. The man is wearing a denim shirt and khaki cargo pants, smiling slightly as he gently places his hand on the eagle\'s neck. Golden hour lighting, warm glow, blurred mountain range in the background.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763621432_0e5191fcc116.png', NULL, '[\"GiantEagle\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"PhotoManipulation\",\"CinematicArt\",\"EpicPortrait\",\"MountainVibes\",\"GoldenHourGlow\",\"NatureFantasy\",\"PhotorealisticEdit\",\"PicPose\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-20 06:50:32', NULL, 0, 1),
(234, 'Glamorous Christmas Portrait in Warm Festive Ambience', 18, 'Teal Sequin Elegance with Golden Holiday Magic — Professional Warm-Toned Christmas Scene\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Based on the uploaded image, without altering the facial features, Recreate a glamorous Christmas scene featuring a woman kneeling in front of a beautifully decorated Christmas tree. She is holding a large gold ornament. The background includes a fireplace with garland and lights. The lighting is warm and ambient, creating a festive atmosphere. The woman is wearing a teal sequin dress and silver heels. Use a standard lens with a shallow depth of field to keep the subject sharp while blurring the background slightly. The camera angle is slightly low, looking up at the subject. The scene should have a warm color grading with enhanced golds and teals. Post-process with skin smoothing and slight sharpening to achieve a professional quality image.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763623247_f36b7beb67e0.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"UltraPhotorealistic\",\"IdentityLocked\",\"FilipinoCouple\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"RestaurantVibes\",\"FoodPhotographyStyle\",\"WarmLighting\",\"50mmLensLook\",\"RealismArt\",\"AIPhotography\",\"CouplePortrait\",\"DiningAesthetics\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-20 07:20:47', NULL, 0, 0),
(235, 'Lotus Lake Cinematic Cool-Boy Portrait', 17, 'Hyper-Realistic Low-Angle 8K Shot with Water Splash, Autumn Mood & Perfect Face Matching\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Hyper-realistic vertical 9:16 low-angle shot of a young man sitting on a wooden boat in a lotus-filled lake. He leans forward splashing water toward the camera, droplets on the lens, wearing a black tee, beige cargo pants, Converse sheakers, glasses, and a rugged watch. Autumn forest and dramatic sky behind. Cinematic color grading, shallow depth of field, strong bokeh, hatural afternoon light, 8K detail. Cool boy 1/2 100% matching my face\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763627489_c7642a70fe1f.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"LotusLakeVibes\",\"CoolBoyAesthetic\",\"LowAngleShot\",\"8KRealism\",\"WaterSplashEffect\",\"AutumnMood\",\"CinematicColorGrade\",\"PortraitPhotography\",\"UnderLensDroplets\",\"BokehBackground\",\"OutdoorShoot\",\"ProfessionalLook\",\"UltraRealisticImage\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 1, '2025-11-20 08:31:29', NULL, 0, 1),
(236, 'Street King in Motion', 17, 'A cinematic overhead portrait of a lone gangster leaning on his black M3 GTR amid a rushing chaotic street — captured in moody 35mm film realism.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'An overhead cinematic shot of me a gangster leaning against the hood of a black M3 GTR parked on the street, wearing a sharp black suit .,wear a white chain, My left hand is in my pocket, and my right hand is holding a cigarette. I have a well defined gym physique.Around me, a blurry crowd of cars and people rushes through the street, adding a sense of chaos.The scene is captured with gloomy lighting, a 35mm film style, and a shallow depth of field with sharp focus on me.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763632364_f1bda57f7227.png', NULL, '[\"GangsterVibes\",\"CinematicShot\",\"35mmFilmLook\",\"StreetChaos\",\"BlackM3GTR\",\"SharpBlackSuit\",\"MoodyCinematics\",\"ShallowDepthOfField\",\"UrbanLegendLook\",\"PicPose\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-20 09:52:44', NULL, 0, 0),
(237, 'Neon Whisper: The Boy & The Glowing Miniature Muse', 19, 'Ultra-realistic portrait of a 7-year-old boy holding a luminous miniature girl, sharing a magical neon moment under a dark outdoor sky\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Convert the above image into ultra realistic portrait of only 7-year-old boy in brown anime hoodie and white denim pant and in elegant makeup and stylish hair style. Dark outdoor background. there should be full view of girl miniature glowing neon white lights standing in his hand giving flying kiss with heart shaped neon white glowing hearts flying towards his.both should look at each other. \r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763787581_eff1aebbca6c.png', NULL, '[\"NeonMagic\",\"UltraRealisticPortrait\",\"MiniatureGlow\",\"FantasyPortrait\",\"NeonHearts\",\"CinematicArt\",\"AnimeStyleBoy\",\"PicPoseEdit\",\"GlowingMiniature\",\"CreativePortrait\",\"AIArtPrompt\",\"FantasyAesthetics\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-22 04:59:41', NULL, 0, 0),
(238, 'Final Chords of Emotion — Ultra-Realistic Piano Transformation', 23, 'A full-body 8K cinematic portrait where your real facial identity is preserved with 100% accuracy, capturing an intense musical moment as the transparent glass piano dissolves into soft particles.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Transform my photo into an ultra-realistic, full-body, natural shot with a very clear not blurred background view shot, 8k resolution, and a refined image. The shot should be a focusing on a transparent glass piano exaggeratedly fading into soft particles along with the music book and floating musical notes as I intensely play the final chords. Their face should have 100% accuracy the same features with the photo uploaded.\r\nOutfit/shoes:\r\nHairstyle:\r\nPose: a girl seated at the piano,while facing the camera leaning forward with expressive intensity, men stands beside the girl her hands striking the keys as if pouring emotion into every note while the fading piano wraps.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763787837_377d0eadd3f1.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"UltraRealisticPortrait\",\"8KArt\",\"GlassPianoFX\",\"CinematicPhotoEdit\",\"EmotionalPortrait\",\"MusicMagic\",\"FloatingNotes\",\"FullBodyShot\",\"RealFaceAccuracy\",\"PhotoTransformation\",\"CreativeFX\",\"DigitalArtistry\",\"ElegantEdit\",\"picposeseal\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-22 05:03:57', NULL, 0, 0),
(239, 'Autumn Balcony Serenity – Hyper-Realistic 8K Portrait', 18, 'A calm, cinematic balcony moment featuring a young woman sipping tea in a misty autumn atmosphere—captured in ultra-realistic detail with natural textures, warm tones, and serene storytelling.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a hyper-realistic, full-frame 8K cinematic portrait/stylized scene using the uploaded face exactly 100% with zero changes.\r\nSubject: Young woman standing on a balcony, sipping tea from a red floral cup, wearing a cozy ivory knitted long dress with a high slit and draped in a warm blanket. Long wavy dark hair in a half-updo with bangs, natural makeup with brown eyeshadow, pink lips, and peach blush.\r\nFace Match: Use uploaded photo 100% (skin tone, features, hair texture)\r\nOutfit: Cozy knitted dress, soft blanket, warm textures\r\nEnvironment: Misty, rainy autumn lake in the background; dark wooden table nearby with matching red floral teapot, white lilies, and leather-bound books; blurred rainy forest beyond. Mood of calm, solitude, and connection with nature.\r\nLighting: Soft natural light, diffused, enhancing textures and serene atmosphere\r\nCamera Setup: Full-frame vertical 4:5 or 9:16, slight angle to capture balcony and props, shallow depth of field for blurred background\r\nUltra-realism: Skin pores, micro-details, natural tones, HDR, sharpness\r\nAspect Ratio & Encadré: Vertical 4:5 or 9:16, full-frame, 8K\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763788586_4e755f97b34c.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"8KPortrait\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"AutumnVibes\",\"RainyMood\",\"CozyAesthetic\",\"BalconyScene\",\"TeaMoment\",\"NaturalBeauty\",\"SoftLighting\",\"PortraitMagic\",\"HDRDetails\",\"RealSkinTexture\",\"StylizedScene\",\"CreativePortraits\",\"CalmAndCozy\",\"NatureMood\",\"PhotoRealism\",\"ArtisticPortrait\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-22 05:16:26', NULL, 0, 0),
(240, 'Monsoon Adventure: The Boy and the Golden Leap', 19, 'A cinematic ultra-realistic portrait of a young traveler connecting with nature’s monsoon magic.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A 7-year-old boy traveler crouches on a rain-drenched, moss-covered rock beside a fast-flowing monsoon river. Heavy droplets fall from the sky, creating countless ripples across the deep turquoise water. As he extends his hand toward the river, a vibrant golden-orange fish leaps upward toward him, captured mid-jump with rain and splash droplets frozen crisply in the air.\r\nHe wears monsoon-ready traveler gear: a soaked beige hoodie layered under a dark olive waterproof vest, trek-fit rain-resistant jeans, and black outdoor shoes with a light sole glistening with wet highlights. A compact brown backpack, slightly muddy and rain-soaked, rests beside him.\r\nThe entire rainforest vibrates with monsoon energy — dense tropical foliage, giant wet leaves, dripping vines, saturated greens, colorful orchids, red and purple monsoon flowers blooming along the river edge. Mist rises from the warm river as cool rain hits it, creating a soft fog around his silhouette. Behind him, towering rainforest trees sway lightly, their canopies darkened by storm clouds. A fallen mossy tree trunk bridges the river in the distance, with monsoon rain bouncing off its surface.\r\nSoft diffused storm lighting, rain streaks visible in motion, ultra-crisp moisture textures on skin and clothing, high-detail reflections on wet surfaces, dramatic atmosphere, cinematic monsoon realism inspired by natural rain photography techniques.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763788907_d6da7f4005d1.png', NULL, '[\"MonsoonAdventure\",\"CinematicRainPortrait\",\"PicPose\",\"UltraRealisticArt\",\"NatureMagic\",\"RainforestVibes\",\"AdventurePortrait\",\"GoldenFishLeap\",\"EpicMonsoonShot\",\"TravelKid\",\"8KUltraDetail\",\"RainPhotographyStyle\",\"MoistureTextureArt\",\"TropicalWildlifeMoment\",\"PicPoseOfficial\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-22 05:21:47', NULL, 0, 1),
(241, 'Cosmic Paintburst Elegance', 27, 'A neon-soaked expressionist explosion woven into a living dress of colors.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Action/Pose: Full body, arms slightly outstretched, against the background, with splashes of paint coming out of your hands. She has a calm look on her face.\r\nAttire: A voluminous, halter-style dress, entirely composed or covered by vibrant paint splashes.\r\nStyle/Effect: Paint splashes, ink droplets, abstract expressionism, spiral colors, high contrast, cosmic effect/starfield (for the thin splashes in the background).\r\nColor Palette: Vibrant neon colors (pink, blue, orange, yellow) against a black\r\nBackground: The background is composed of splashes of paint strewn across the black walls behind me and above me, as if magically they were coming out of the back of my dress in an explosion of different colors traveling like smoke.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763791482_ea2dced084a3.png', NULL, '[\"DreamyMorning\",\"RealisticAIArt\",\"TinyWomanConcept\",\"MistMorningVibes\",\"ScottishCat\",\"GoodMorningPopUp\",\"BlueNightdress\",\"HeartHeadband\",\"UltraRealisticPortrait\",\"PicPoseSignature\",\"AestheticAI\",\"CinematicStill\",\"CozyVibes\",\"BedtimeAesthetics\",\"AIPhotoMagic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-22 06:04:42', NULL, 0, 1),
(242, 'Cinematic Roadside Luxury Portrait – Stylish Man With Bugatti', 27, 'Ultra-realistic 16K commercial-grade shot with perfect identity match, premium car aesthetics, and PicPose signature branding.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Hyper-realistic 16K cinematic portrait: Stylish man in dark red t shirt and off white  casual trouser, dark red sports shoes  and sunglasses, stepping from or leaning on bonnet of a dark red buggati sports car with blue brake calipers. Subject\'s face 100% matches uploaded photo. Outdoor roadside with wooden railing, scenic backdrop, soft haze. Dramatic soft sunlight, crisp shadows, premium car-commercial mood, reflective highlights. Ultra-wide full-frame 4:5 shot, shallow DOF, clean asphalt. Visible skin pores, fabric texture, metallic reflections, HDR contrast.\r\n \r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763791573_3d612cf0fd25.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"LuxuryShoot\",\"BugattiStyle\",\"16KRealism\",\"StylishManShoot\",\"PremiumAesthetic\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"CarCommercialVibes\",\"MensFashionPortrait\",\"HDRLook\",\"FashionEditorial\",\"OutdoorShoot\",\"HighDetailPortrait\",\"IdentityPerfectMatch\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-22 06:06:13', NULL, 0, 0),
(243, 'The Dragon Commander of the Skies', 27, 'A fierce warrior riding a fire-breathing black dragon—an ultra-realistic fusion of fantasy power and modern military grit.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic cinematic scene of a fierce man image above (preserve facial features for face reference) riding a massive black dragon above the clouds, right hand gripping leather bridles, left hand holding an AK47. Wearing a windblown red trench coat underneath it is a black shirt with gold logo (image above right), khaki cargo pants, and red Doc Martens boots. Tactical garrison belt with AK magazines and grenades, on his back he also wears two samurai blades. Dragon has glowing red eyes, breathing fire downward at enemies below. Bright daylight sky, volumetric clouds, sparks and embers, dramatic lighting, motion blur, hyper-detailed fantasy + modern military style, 8K, wide angle.\r\n \r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763795579_99a352e6a901.png', NULL, '[\"DragonCommander\",\"EpicFantasyWarrior\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"UltraRealistic8K\",\"DragonRider\",\"ModernFantasyFusion\",\"FireBreathingDragon\",\"ActionCinematic\",\"FantasyMeetsModern\",\"PicPoseCreations\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-22 07:12:59', NULL, 0, 0);
