(244, 'Royal Gold Aura: Ultra-Realistic High-Fashion Close-Up Portrait', 18, 'A full-body 8K cinematic portrait where your real facial identity is preserved with 100% accuracy, capturing an intense musical moment as the transparent glass piano dissolves into soft particles.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an ultra-realistic 8K close-up portrait using the uploaded face 100% exactly with zero changes.\r\nSubject: High-fashion close-up of the uploaded woman with a soft, graceful expression. Skin naturally glowing with dewy highlights.\r\nFace Match: Preserve face exactly as uploaded — skin tone, features, eyebrows, eyes, and lips.\r\nOutfit & Styling: A **fully covered, high-neck royal gown** in gold–orange tones. Long sleeves with fine beadwork and elegant embroidery. No cleavage, no off-shoulder—clean, modest, classy, premium luxury fashion look.\r\nHair & Accessories: Platinum–gold blonde hair in soft waves with natural shine. Three fresh orange roses pinned neatly on one side. Gold chandelier earrings with realistic crystal reflections.\r\nMakeup: Copper–orange soft smoky eyes, thick natural lashes, neat brows, glossy terracotta-orange lips.\r\nEnvironment: Dark high-end studio backdrop with soft gradients and luxury portrait mood.\r\nLighting: Premium soft studio lighting with subtle spotlight. Gentle shadows, natural dimension, smooth highlights.\r\nCamera Setup: Full-frame close-up portrait, 85mm lens, shallow depth, crisp sharp focus.\r\nUltra-realism: Skin pores, micro textures, natural hair shine, lifelike roses, HDR-level clarity, premium editorial quality.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763796693_0d547d0befa4.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"UltraRealisticPortrait\",\"8KFashionPortrait\",\"HighFashionLook\",\"RoyalGoldGown\",\"LuxuryStudioShot\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"EditorialBeauty\",\"RealIdentityFace\",\"GoldenAesthetic\",\"CloseUpPhotography\",\"PremiumPortrait\",\"StudioLightingMagic\",\"FashionEditorialStyle\",\"PhotorealisticArt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-22 07:31:33', NULL, 0, 0),
(245, 'Duality of the Flame', 17, 'A Human–Demon Face-Off Captured in One Burning Moment\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, cinematic close-up profile shot. Split composition. On the left, a young Asian man with dark, tousled hair and a serious, intense expression. On the right, a terrifying demonic entity with dark, cracked, stone-like skin, curved horns, sharp fangs, and a glowing red eye, smiling menacingly. Between them, in the center, they are jointly holding a single lit matchstick; the human hand touches the clawed demonic hand. The small flame illuminates their faces in a dark void. High contrast chiaroscuro lighting, smoke tendrils, 8k resolution, detailed skin texture, dark fantasy concept art, dramatic atmosphere.\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763798148_a88792cd13af.png', NULL, '[\"CinematicPortrait\",\"DarkFantasyArt\",\"DualityConcept\",\"HumanVsDemon\",\"ChiaroscuroLighting\",\"8KRealism\",\"FantasyVisuals\",\"HighContrastArt\",\"CharacterDesign\",\"EpicMood\",\"picposeseal\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 1, '2025-11-22 07:55:48', NULL, 0, 2),
(246, 'Joyful River Escape with Forest Companions', 33, 'A hyper-realistic cinematic scene of a cheerful young man enjoying a sunlit river while playful, bucket-hat chimpanzee chefs grill fish on a forest rock — complete with fruits, firewood ambience, and a subtle PicPose signature.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A closed up, happy, fit young Asian man use the uploaded photo  with short black hair and a yellow t-shirt and light shorts is sitting in a clear, shallow river, splashing water with his hands and laughing joyfully. He is outdoors in a sunny, lush forest with mountains and a stream flowing behind him. On a large rock by the river bank, two anthropomorphic chimpanzees dressed in t-shirts (one blue, one white) and bucket hats (one tan, one black) are crouched over a small open fire, grilling fish. Next to them on the rock is a plate with an assortment of fresh fruits like mango and other tropical items, and a woven basket of sticky rice. Cinematic lighting, hyper-realistic,\r\n \r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763798839_4f6f343be54e.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"RiverVibes\",\"NatureEscape\",\"ForestAdventure\",\"AsianModel\",\"WaterSplashShot\",\"ChimpanzeeChefs\",\"TropicalScene\",\"GrillingFish\",\"SunnyForestMood\",\"UltraRealisticArt\",\"CreativeAIShot\",\"photorealisticscene\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-22 08:07:19', NULL, 0, 0),
(247, 'Mirror of Elegance', 18, 'A hyper-realistic close-up where beauty, light, and reflection meet in perfect harmony.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'dreamy, ultra-realistic extreme close-up shot of the subject lying gracefully beside white lilies, head resting gently on their arm and perfectly mirrored on a glossy black surface, illuminated by hyper-cinematic lighting that sculpts every contour of the face with luminous depth; skin tone rendered with ultra-intensive micro-detail—high-resolution pores, fine vellus hairs catching subtle highlights, realistic melanin patterns, natural texture variations across cheeks and jawline, micro-specular shine on hydrated areas, soft matte diffusion on drier zones, gentle redness around pressure points, translucent glow on thin-skinned regions, delicate subdermal hues, lifelike shadow gradients, and crisp edge definition for absolute photorealistic complexion; shadow interplay is rich and dimensional, with precise soft falloff and reflective contact shadows on the glossy surface; fabric textures remain ultra-detailed with intricate weave and light behavior; overall hyperrealistic, photorealistic, extreme-realism aesthetic. The subject’s face must remain 100% identical to the reference.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763876950_f9bdd77bb877.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"ExtremeCloseUp\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"PhotorealisticPortrait\",\"HyperRealism\",\"GlossyReflection\",\"WhiteLilies\",\"DetailedSkinTexture\",\"ProfessionalEdit\",\"AIPhotography\",\"PortraitMagic\",\"VisualArtistry\",\"ElegantAesthetics\",\"highendretouching\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 1, '2025-11-23 05:49:10', NULL, 0, 4),
(248, 'Snowfall Majesty: The Kashmiri Winter Portrait', 17, 'An ultra-realistic 8K cinematic portrait capturing the original face identity in a premium winter fashion look amidst the snowy beauty of Jammu & Kashmir.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create Utra-realistic 8K full-size cinematic portrait of a man in the uploaded photo (exact 1:1 facial resemblance and same hairstyle— no beautification or identity changes) sitting gracefully in the snowy landscapes of Jammu & Kashmir. He Wears Premium winter fashion-fur-lined puffer jacket, maroon t-shirt, baggy jeans, leather trekking boots, touch circle watch, iphone 16pro max in hand and sunglasses.He is seated on a snow-covered rock or bench one leg slightly\r\nbent, hands relaxed naturally, with a confident yet relaxed posture. Snow gently falls around him, with majestic.\r\nAdd Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763877002_bf89d80ff05e.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"WinterPortrait\",\"Cinematic8K\",\"SnowfallVibes\",\"KashmirMagic\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"FashionInSnow\",\"PremiumWinterLook\",\"PortraitArt\",\"FrostedElegance\",\"TravelAesthetic\",\"SnowyLandscape\",\"MalePortrait\",\"PhotoRealism\",\"CinematicPhotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 2, '2025-11-23 05:50:02', NULL, 1, 11),
(249, 'Red Morning Elegance', 20, 'A chic, ultra-realistic portrait of a young girl in red LV attire with refined morning ambience and subtle PicPose branding.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Edit using reference image beautiful 10-year-old girl (100% facial resemblance), wearing a red baseball cap with LV logo motif. She is wearing a plain red short-sleeved shirt that fits her body and has a white LV logo embroidered on the left chest and soft facial features, including full, natural pink lips. long brown hair, She poses casually, her head slightly tilted towards the camera, her slender fingers clearly visible. There is a brown hair band around her right wrist. and her left arm is wearing a maroon smartwatch. large gold hoop earrings The background of the photo is bright, implying that it was taken in the morning or on a coffee shop terrace. There is a faint white luxury building structure in the distance with some lights. The photo has a sharp focus on the female subject, while the background is slightly blurred.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763959586_7ef3f88a5d10.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"LVElegance\",\"RedAesthetic\",\"MorningGlowPortrait\",\"UltraRealisticEdit\",\"YouthfulCharm\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"HighDetailFace\",\"LuxuryVibes\",\"AestheticPhotography\",\"PortraitMagic\",\"SoftGlowEdit\",\"FashionInspiredPortrait\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-24 04:46:26', NULL, 0, 1),
(250, 'Dual Essence: The Laughing Contrast Portrait', 17, 'A vibrant seated portrait blending modern fashion and monochrome artistry, capturing joy and identity in one frame.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'edit this photo without changing the face, turning it into an artistic portrait. The man should be elegantly seated on the floor, wearing a modern black top, soft loose red trousers, and chunky gray and red sneakers. His facial expression is laughing while looking upwards. The background should be an artistic monochrome (black and white) composition featuring a soft close-up side profile of the same.\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763959954_5999342c63df.png', NULL, '[\"ArtisticPortrait\",\"ModernAesthetic\",\"DualExposureStyle\",\"CreativeEdit\",\"LaughingPose\",\"MonochromeBackground\",\"HighFashionLook\",\"PicposeEdit\",\"PortraitArt\",\"StylizedPhotography\",\"CreativeRetouch\",\"FashionPortrait\",\"digitalartist\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-24 04:52:34', NULL, 0, 0),
(251, 'Magical Princess Birthday Fantasy', 20, 'A dreamy pastel-world celebration with giant cake, fairy sparkles, and golden “7” charm\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A magical birthday photoshoot of a 7-year-old girl standing beside a giant birthday cake bigger than her.\r\nHuge pastel balloons, soft pink sparkles, and a floating golden number “7”.\r\nCute princess dress and glowing fairy effects.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763960388_7fbfc1ce5941.png', NULL, '[\"BirthdayMagic\",\"PrincessShoot\",\"PastelFantasy\",\"FairyGlow\",\"GiantCakeTheme\",\"KidsPhotoshoot\",\"BirthdayGirl\",\"GoldenSeven\",\"CuteAesthetic\",\"picposeofficial\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-24 04:59:48', NULL, 0, 1),
(252, 'Blue Burst Birthday Magic', 19, 'A stylish blue-themed celebration with modern kids fashion, floating shapes, sparkles, and a perfectly placed PicPose signature.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Blue-themed birthday setup for a little boy.\r\nBlue balloons, big number balloon, cake stand, and silver stars.\r\nAdd floating geometric shapes and sparkles.\r\nModern kids fashion outfit.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763960470_4e7bf91059de.png', NULL, '[\"BlueBirthdayTheme\",\"KidsPhotoshoot\",\"BirthdaySetup\",\"BlueAesthetic\",\"CreativeBackdrop\",\"ModernKidsFashion\",\"BalloonDecor\",\"SparkleEffects\",\"GeometricFloatingShapes\",\"PicPoseSignature\",\"BirthdayPhotography\",\"CinematicKidsShoot\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-24 05:01:10', NULL, 0, 1),
(253, 'Madagascar Wildlife Dance Crew', 17, 'Ultra-Realistic 8K Cinematic Shot of a Man With Alex, Marty, Melman & Gloria in an African Desert Setting\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Use the uploaded reference photo for accurate facial identity, hairstyle, skin tone, and body proportions. Do NOT beautify or change the person’s natural features.\r\nCreate an ultra-realistic 8K cinematic photo of the same person standing confidently in the African savannah during golden hour.\r\nHe is positioned in the center of the frame with a joyful, friendly expression, both arms slightly raised outward.\r\nSurround him with:\r\nA lion standing on his right, looking proud\r\nA giraffe towering behind him\r\nA hippopotamus beside the lion\r\nA zebra on his left, looking toward the camera\r\nEnsure:\r\nNatural lighting with warm tones\r\nSoft dust around their feet for realism\r\nDetailed fur, skin texture, and accurate shadows\r\nMajestic mountains and dry savannah in the background\r\nHyper-realistic rendering, crisp details, and depth-of-field\r\nColors and composition matching a wildlife adventure movie poster\r\nMake the final image vibrant, cinematic, and lifelike.\r\nMaintain the exact identity of the person from the uploaded photo without any modifications.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763961196_7a992866595b.png', NULL, '[\"MadagascarStyle\",\"UltraRealistic8K\",\"CinematicVibes\",\"AfricanWildlife\",\"PicPoseCreative\",\"MovieInspiredShot\",\"AlexTheLion\",\"MartyTheZebra\",\"MelmanTheGiraffe\",\"GloriaTheHippo\",\"DancePose\",\"VibrantColors\",\"FantasyPortrait\",\"CharacterFusion\",\"EpicSceneCreation\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-24 05:13:16', NULL, 0, 2),
(254, 'Dubai Night Vision: Elite Hyper-Real Cinematic Portrait', 27, 'A futuristic 8K ultra-realistic portrait featuring a confident male model with a Lykan Hypersport against the glowing Dubai skyline — preserved identity, premium styling, and Picpose signature branding.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a hyper-realistic, full-frame 8K cinematic portrait using the uploaded face exactly 100% with zero changes.  \r\nSubject: Male, standing confidently in front of a futuristic silver Lykan Hypersport, facing the camera. Wearing a navy blue 3-piece slim-fit suit, Onitsuka Tiger white sneakers with blue and red stripes, and a luxury watch. Expression: confident, stylish, and poised.  \r\nFace Match: Use uploaded photo 100% (skin tone, features, hair texture)  \r\nOutfit: Navy blue 3-piece suit, crisp white shirt, Onitsuka Tiger sneakers, luxury watch; preserve textures and details.  \r\nEnvironment: Modern Dubai boulevard at night, Burj Khalifa towering among illuminated skyscrapers, warm city lights reflecting on car’s metallic surface, street glow, sleek and luxurious cinematic vibe.  \r\nLighting: Night-time cinematic lighting, reflections on car and street, soft ambient glow, highlights on suit and sneakers.  \r\nCamera Setup: Medium full-body composition, slight low angle to emphasize car and skyline, 8K ultra-realistic, sharp focus on subject with subtle bokeh on background lights.  \r\nUltra-realism: Skin pores, fabric textures, hair, metallic car surfaces, city light reflections, HDR, micro-details. \r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763966042_d02f2eee124a.png', NULL, '[\"PicposeExclusive\",\"8KCinematicPortrait\",\"DubaiNightShoot\",\"LykanHypersportVibes\",\"UltraRealisticEdit\",\"FuturisticPortrait\",\"PremiumMalePortrait\",\"DubaiBoulevardNights\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"LuxuryAesthetic\",\"PicposeBranding\",\"HyperRealismArt\",\"FashionPortrait8K\",\"DubaiSkylineMagic\",\"UrbanNightVibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 1, 2, '2025-11-24 06:34:02', NULL, 0, 3),
(255, 'Shadowbound Alpha: The Electric Summoner', 17, 'Mystic energy, loyal dark wolves, and the guardian in shadows — a cinematic fantasy portrait of raw power.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A young man with dark hair, wearing a black collared shirt, stands in the middle of a smoky, ethereal blue and black mist. Behind him, a tall, hooded figure in a flowing dark robe looms in the shadows, creating a mysterious and powerful aura. Two black wolves with glowing blue eyes stand beside him, walking forward in sync. The man’s right hand glows with electric purple and blue energy, illuminating his face slightly. The entire scene has a dramatic fantasy tone, with cinematic lighting, moody .\r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763972857_ff9e0e22fa42.png', NULL, '[\"Shadowbound\",\"FantasyEdit\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"DarkAlpha\",\"MysticWolves\",\"EpicEnergy\",\"BlueAura\",\"FantasyVibes\",\"MoodyMagic\",\"PicposeEdit\",\"EpicScene\",\"ElectricPower\",\"DarkFantasyArt\",\"MysticSummoner\",\"PicposeBranding\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 1, 0, '2025-11-24 08:27:37', NULL, 0, 1),
(256, 'Golden Hour Swing Serenity', 17, 'Ultra-realistic joyful portrait on a rustic water-swing, koi fish, teal waters & warm sunshine glow\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A vibrant, ultra-realistic outdoor photograph capturing a full-body portrait of a young man (same face as reference image, 100% accuracy) seated joyfully on a rustic wooden swing over clear water. He wears a darkred oversized T-shirt, black shorts, and black sandals. His left foot is playfully splashing in the crystal clear, vibrant teal water, creating dynamic ripples, while his right footrests on the swing. He is smiling warmly, looking directly at the viewer with a happy an and relaxed expression. Beneath him and around his feet, numerous colorful Koi fish in striking shades of orange, white, black, and yellow swim gracefully.\r\n\r\nThe background features lush, out-of-focus green.pine trees, illuminated by a warm, golden sunlight filtering from the upper left, creating a soft lens flare and an ethereal glow. The overall mood is serene, joyful, and inviting, with a dominant color palette of vivid teals, emerald greens, and the striking oranges and whites of the fish, all highlighted by the warm golden hour light. \r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763973161_b689b150b490.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"GoldenHourVibes\",\"WaterSwingPortrait\",\"KoiFishMagic\",\"UltraRealisticShot\",\"TealAesthetic\",\"OutdoorPortrait\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"HappyMoodVibes\",\"NatureGlow\",\"PortraitInNature\",\"VibrantColors\",\"picposebranding\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 3, 2, '2025-11-24 08:32:41', NULL, 0, 4),
(257, 'The Rosy Ride of Elegance', 27, 'A hyper-realistic full-body portrait of a stylish young man posing confidently beside his vibrant Yamaha R15, blending charm, fashion, and cinematic flair.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper realistic full-body portrait of a handsome young man The man is handsome, with naturally fair skin,her hairstyle is same upload image. Square sunglasses, He\'s wearing an expensive change pink shirt and white tshirt, with an unbuttoned white shirt on top, black cargo and red, yellow, black, blue, white stylish shoes. His one hand holds of bouquet of vivid roses, and the other hand on pocket.He sat leaning on his cool,yellow colour yahmaha R15 bike, beautiful background, man looking him camera.\r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763975948_fed70729c6b0.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseStyle\",\"PicPosePortrait\",\"RosyRide\",\"CinematicLook\",\"StylishVibes\",\"R15FashionShot\",\"ModernPortraitArt\",\"BouquetPose\",\"HyperRealisticEdit\",\"PicPoseBranding\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 1, 2, '2025-11-24 09:19:08', NULL, 0, 3),
(258, 'Mistbound Elegance', 18, 'A hyper-realistic monochrome portrait wrapped in flowing mist-like fabric with PicPose signature styling.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic monochromatic portrait of a woman (upload image)surrounded by soft, flowing material resembling dense smoke, mist, or wind-swept translucent fabric. Realistic lighting and skin texture. The woman looks forward (or slightly to the side) with a calm yet intense expression, her high cheekbones and jawline naturally highlighted. Her lips show a subtle natural tint contrasting gently with the grayscale ambiance. Her body appears wrapped in ultra-thin layers of dark-to-light gray translucent material that behaves like real mist thickening around her form, creating a believable silhouette.\r\nAdd Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763976413_b6e189f67c90.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"MonochromeMagic\",\"MistPortrait\",\"HyperRealisticArt\",\"EtherealShadows\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"ArtisticMoodyShot\",\"TranslucentFabricFlow\",\"BlackAndWhiteAesthetics\",\"UltraRealisticTexture\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-24 09:26:53', NULL, 0, 0),
(259, 'The Scholar’s Cinematic Study', 17, 'An intimate low-key editorial portrait of a man immersed in knowledge, lit only by a warm vintage desk lamp.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'The man is seated at a vintage mahogany desk, leaning forward slightly, one hand resting on an open leather-bound book. Full outfit visible: mustard corduroy three-piece suit, wine red tie. Lighting: Only a warm, directional light from an adjustable desk lamp illuminates the desk and part of his face. Background: Deep shadows and the subtle detail of the academic lounge. Intimate portrait, cinematic mood, low-key lighting, editorial composition.\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763980777_48b417aac767.png', NULL, '[\"CinematicPortrait\",\"EditorialMood\",\"VintageAesthetic\",\"LowKeyLighting\",\"MahoganyDesk\",\"CorduroySuit\",\"WarmLampGlow\",\"AcademicLounge\",\"MoodyPortrait\",\"picpose\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-24 10:39:37', NULL, 0, 0),
(260, 'Baroque Serenity in Beige Elegance', 27, 'A dramatic, warm-toned editorial portrait blending romance, texture, and timeless grace — crafted with PicPose signature aesthetic.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a highly dramatic, moody, and romantic portrait of a woman seated, dressed in a voluminous, off-the-shoulder ballgown made of ruffled tulle in a shimmering beige color. She holds a single beige rose delicately near her chest, with her eyes looking at the camera in a moment of emotional repose. She wears long, glittering chandelier earrings. The background is heavily stylized, featuring a dense cluster of tall, beige dried grasses or pampas grass, creating a warm, earthy texture. The lighting is rich, and intensely warm, with a spotlight effect on the subject, reminiscent of a baroque painting or high-end editorial shoot. Use the uploaded photo as reference.\r\nAdd Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1763982333_7cfb2eab4465.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseExclusive\",\"BaroqueElegance\",\"BeigeRomance\",\"EditorialPortrait\",\"MoodyAesthetic\",\"WarmCinematicLight\",\"TulleGownMagic\",\"EmotionalRepose\",\"FineArtPortrait\",\"LuxuryEditorial\",\"PampasBackdrop\",\"CinematicMood\",\"DramaticPortraiture\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 1, 1, '2025-11-24 11:05:33', NULL, 0, 2),
(261, 'Mystic Forest Bond', 19, 'A serene moment between man and nature, captured in divine harmony.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A stylish handsome 7-year-old boy use the uploaded photo(keep my original face), wearing a monochrome yellow outfit including a yellow long-sleeved top, and cargo pants, with yellow and white chunky sneakers. he is sitting down, embracing a **massive, textured knitted Pikachu plush toy** which is the centerpiece. The setting is a visually rich, **monochromatic yellow background** with various textured elements, including stylized geometric shapes, and deep yellow shadows. Several other knitted Pokémon plushies (smaller Pikachu, Bulbasaur, Charmander, a gray/brown one) are surrounding him. The lighting is soft and warm, emphasizing the cozy, textured feel of the knitwork and the yellow theme. Full body shot, high-quality, studio photoshoot. Added orange cat.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764046772_aea843c508dc.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"MysticForest\",\"DivineAura\",\"IndianTraditionalLook\",\"SacredBond\",\"NatureHarmony\",\"PeacefulVibes\",\"ForestMagic\",\"AIArtPrompt\",\"SereneScene\",\"CulturalElegance\",\"MythicalFeeling\",\"TimelessMoments\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-25 04:59:32', NULL, 0, 0),
(262, 'Yacht Rise: Aqua Glamour Entry', 17, 'Ultra-realistic cinematic shot of a muscular man emerging from turquoise waters onto a luxury yacht, captured with bright natural lighting and crisp identity details — with PicPose branding.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a photo realistic-looking, use provided photo as reference face and body 100%, A muscular man with dark hair and sunglasses is emerging from the clear turquoise water, climbing a ladder onto a white yacht. He is shirtless, revealing a toned physique and intricate tattoos on both arms. He wears white swim shorts and a silver chain necklace. The background shows more boats anchored in a sunny bay with green hills. The lighting is bright and natural, highlighting the water\'s clarity and the man\'s wet skin.\r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding\r\n', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764047810_7b710d8656aa.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseExclusive\",\"YachtAesthetic\",\"AquaGlamour\",\"SunnyBayVibes\",\"LuxuryYachtShot\",\"WaterGlowEffect\",\"UltraRealisticPortrait\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"SummerSplashLook\",\"AIPhotographyMagic\",\"TattooedStyle\",\"OceanRiseAura\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-25 05:16:50', NULL, 0, 0),
(263, 'Clash Above the Clouds', 27, 'Ek hi chehre ki do roope—noor aur andhera—jab aasman ke upar takraate hain.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a high-resolution, hyper-realistic photograph. A person stands on a cliff above a vast sea of clouds, wearing clothing based on their gender:\r\nIf female: A long white flowing dress with airy, translucent layers; the hem gently fluffs like clouds; elegant and refined with soft, ethereal movement.\r\nIf male: A long white-gray fantasy cloak or robe with layered, flowing fabric; dramatic, wind-swept design that matches the epic atmosphere above the clouds.\r\nThe facial details must match the reference face 100%. The subject stands still, looking sideways to show a clear side profile, with hair blowing in the wind.\r\nBehind them, a massive dark-cloud demon emerges, its face identical to the reference face 100%, but formed from dense black smoke. It has long horns and a semi-human, semi-beast structure with highly detailed smoke textures.\r\nUse an eye-level camera angle, dramatic natural sky lighting with rays cutting through the clouds. Emphasize realistic shadows, textures, fabric, hair, and skin—pure photographic realism, not digital art.\r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764048654_45134f1c13ea.png', NULL, '[\"Picpose\",\"CloudCliffPortrait\",\"DualIdentityShot\",\"EpicRealism\",\"SmokeDemon\",\"HyperRealisticPhoto\",\"CinematicSideProfile\",\"WindBlownAesthetics\",\"FantasyAtmosphere\",\"AboveTheClouds\",\"PhotoRealMagic\",\"PicposeBranding\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-25 05:30:54', NULL, 0, 0),
(264, 'Majestic Eagle Aura Portrait', 27, 'A hyperrealistic fusion of Middle-earth and Alagaësia — where an elf warrior rises atop a colossal dragon.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create 8k resolution photo, uploaded man in a maroon shirt, white pants, and black loafer, sitting casually in a king chair. A small PicPose signature in left corner. He is smilling & sunglasses Behind him, there\'s a large, artistic rendering of a red and black eagle head with glowing eyes, against a dark background with some soft, warm light effects. Camera angle left side.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764049363_f8c78f050d8e.png', NULL, '[\"MajesticPortrait\",\"EagleAura\",\"Cinematic8K\",\"PicPoseStyle\",\"RegalLook\",\"PowerBackdrop\",\"ArtisticVibes\",\"CreativeComposition\",\"AIPhotoArt\",\"UltraRealisticPortrait\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-25 05:42:43', NULL, 0, 0),
(265, 'Cherry Garden Glamour – Vintage Coquette Portrait', 18, 'A dreamy ultra-realistic cinematic portrait featuring a young woman in a cherry-print cottagecore dress, vintage braid, brimmed floral hat, soft doll makeup, and romantic retro garden aesthetics — complete with Picpose branding.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create ultra-realistic cinematic glamour image 100% copy face of young woman wearing white and printed cherry,\r\na fit-and-flare or A-line silhouette, meaning it\'s fitted through the bodice and waist and flares out into a skirt.\r\nNeckline/Straps: It features a sweetheart or slightly straight neckline with tie-up shoulder straps (often called spaghetti straps when thin). The tie-up detail in a contrasting color (red) is a key feature.\r\nVibe/Aesthetic: It strongly aligns with the cottagecore, coquette, or feminine retro aesthetics. Long messy braid with vintage hairstyles with white big brim and big red flowers and red ribbon tie, doll make up and natural skin. She\'s sitting that full cherry fulling and holding a full cherry in the basket one hands other hands into hat, in the garden flowers .\r\nSoft, dramatic high-key lighting, beautiful skin texture, elegant, shallow depth of field.\r\nRetro shot, Realistic high detail HD shot and glamour shot.\r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764050315_5ad6d7a8b8d7.png', NULL, '[\"CherryGardenLook\",\"CoquetteAesthetic\",\"CottagecoreVibes\",\"VintageGlamourShot\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"UltraRealisticArt\",\"RetroBeautyStyle\",\"PicposePortrait\",\"GardenPhotoshoot\",\"CherryPrintFashion\",\"DreamyAesthetic\",\"GlamourPhotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 1, 0, '2025-11-25 05:52:32', NULL, 0, 0),
(266, 'Snowbound Street-Style Confidence', 17, 'A cinematic winter portrait of a 25-year-old standing confidently against snowy mountains, dressed in bold streetwear with soft snowfall and natural shadows — featuring subtle PicPose branding.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A 25-year-old boy, a fit slim body, standing confidently with one hand in his pocket in a snowy mountain area. He is wearing a blue puffer jacket, a white hoodie, black denim baggy jeans, and white sneakers. The background features soft winter sunlight, light snowfall, and cinematic tones with high-detail snowy mountain scenery and natural shadows. Don\'t change face.\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764054101_804794c6f8ae.png', NULL, '[\"PicPosePortrait\",\"WinterCinematicShot\",\"SnowyAesthetic\",\"StreetStyleVibes\",\"MountainBackdrop\",\"UltraRealisticLook\",\"WinterFashionEdit\",\"SnowfallScene\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"PicPoseBranding\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 2, 4, '2025-11-25 07:01:41', NULL, 0, 5),
(267, 'Moonlit Serenity on the Coastal Rocks', 18, 'A calm, ultra-realistic night portrait illuminated by soft full-moon light — capturing elegance, depth, and quiet emotion.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A highly realistic night portrait of a woman(upload image) sitting on rugged coastal rocks by the sea, illuminated softly by a large full moon.\r\nShe sits sideways with one knee bent, arms resting naturally over it, her gaze directed slightly upward to the right with a calm, reflective expression.\r\nShe wears a long-sleeved, high-neck evening dress made of opaque, slightly shimmering fabric, decorated with subtle fine beads and metallic threads in muted tones of silver and pale blue. The dress looks elegant, modest, and realistic—no fantasy elements, just soft sparkle reflecting moonlight.\r\nHer long wavy brown hair appears naturally tousled by the sea breeze.\r\nHer bare feet rest on the textured rocks, skin tones rendered naturally with gentle highlights from the moon.\r\nThe full moon appears large but realistic, with clear crater details and soft white-blue light.\r\nThe night sky is deep navy with a few small, natural-looking stars—not magical particles.\r\nThe sea below is calm with subtle ripples, reflecting faint moonlight in a natural way.\r\nThe rock formations are dark, rough, and realistic, with visible wet textures near the waterline.\r\nLighting is dominated by natural moonlight, creating soft shadows, realistic skin texture, and a cool nighttime mood.\r\nColor palette: cool blues, neutral tones, soft highlights.\r\nMood: quiet, serene, introspective, natural coastal night scene.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764058732_407af2fb5c70.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"MoonlitPortrait\",\"NightPhotography\",\"CinematicLook\",\"UltraRealisticArt\",\"CoastalMood\",\"MoonlightGlow\",\"SereneAesthetic\",\"ElegantPortrait\",\"NaturalLighting\",\"CoolToneEdit\",\"ShimmerDetails\",\"SeaBreezeVibes\",\"HighFashionPortrait\",\"artisticnightshot\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 1, 1, '2025-11-25 08:18:52', NULL, 0, 1),
(268, 'Golden Glow Portrait – PicPose Signature Style', 18, 'Ultra-realistic 8K cinematic rim-light portrait capturing natural beauty, luminous hair glow, and flawless facial authenticity.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create ultra-high-resolution 8K photorealistic images of the original person, maintaining 100% exact facial likeness with no alterations. She wears a simple sleeveless top in a light shade such as white or cream. The lower portion reveals dark blue denim jeans with a visible belt and belt loops, reflecting a casual, modern style.\r\nHer hair is long, thick, and voluminous, styled in soft, flowing waves with dark highlights intensified by warm backlighting. The hair glows beautifully, sweeping around her and dominating the frame. Captured in a three-quarter pose, she looks over her shoulder directly at the viewer with a relaxed yet engaging expression.\r\nShe wears a small, delicate gold earring—either square or diamond-shaped—adding subtle elegance. The lighting is essential: intense, warm, golden backlight resembling sunlight through a window or sunset, creating a radiant rim light around her hair and body while softly shadowing the foreground. Her face remains well-illuminated.\r\nThe background contrasts sharply—a dark, out-of-focus area on the left balances a bright, blown-out light source on the right, producing a soft, beautiful flare. This composition highlights her luminous presence with striking clarity.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764062279_517bba0ca5a6.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"GoldenGlowPortrait\",\"8KUltraRealistic\",\"CinematicRimLight\",\"PhotorealisticPortrait\",\"HairGlowEffect\",\"BacklightPhotography\",\"SunsetLightingVibes\",\"NaturalBeautyShot\",\"AuthenticFaceDetails\",\"denimfashionlook\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-25 09:17:59', NULL, 0, 0),
(269, 'Stormbound Souls: A Cinematic Love Portrait', 23, 'A hyper-realistic golden-hour cliffside moment of two united hearts, captured with dramatic atmosphere, flowing motion, and 8K cinematic depth.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic cinematic portrait of a young South Asian couple standing together on a high cliff during a dramatic stormy golden-hour sky. The woman has the exact same face and hairstyle as the reference image, long dark wavy hair blowing powerfully in the wind, wearing a flowing deep maroon chiffon dress that swirls around her legs. The young man beside her has the same face and hairstyle as his reference image, wearing a black fitted shirt, black cargo pants, and a dark jacket fluttering in the wind.\r\nThe couple stands close, the man\'s left hand gently holding the woman’s arm as they look out toward the horizon with intense expressions—determined, emotional, united. Lightning glows faintly behind the clouds, waves crash below the cliff, and the wind creates beautiful flowing motion in the fabrics and hair. Warm sunlight breaks through the clouds, casting a golden rim light on their silhouettes. Ultra-detailed 8K realism, dramatic atmospheric lighting, deep contrast, cinematic mood, ensure both faces stay 100% identical to the reference images.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764063281_6876dc65bf9c.png', NULL, '[\"CinematicPortrait\",\"8KRealism\",\"StormyGoldenHour\",\"DramaticAtmosphere\",\"WindBlownAesthetics\",\"SouthAsianCouple\",\"EpicRomanticShot\",\"CinematicMood\",\"UltraRealisticArt\",\"picposesignature\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-25 09:34:41', NULL, 0, 0),
(270, 'Autumn Symphony of Silence', 18, 'A melancholic violinist on golden shores, watched by silent guardians of the wild.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic photo of a stunningly beautiful young woman (upload image) with long, wavy brown hair, eyes closed or looking down with a focused, melancholic expression. She sits gracefully on the wet golden sand at the seaside during autumn, holding and playing a beautifully crafted wooden violin with highly realistic wood grain and glossy finish. She wears a floor-length pitch-black gown with intricate lace details on the sleeves and bodice.\r\nIn front of her stand two large vultures, calm and still, facing toward her. Around her, fallen autumn leaves in orange, yellow, and brown rest on the wet reflective sand. Behind her are calm turquoise-blue waves with soft foam, under a pale blue sky with wispy white clouds and a hazy horizon. Natural warm soft lighting, cinematic depth, ultra-sharp focus on the girl and vultures, shallow depth of field, photo-realistic texture, 8K high-resolution photography.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764069057_474e0b96880a.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"AutumnSymphony\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"ViolinArt\",\"GoldenShoreline\",\"MelancholicMood\",\"ArtisticVibes\",\"8KPhotography\",\"VisualPoetry\",\"NatureAndEmotion\",\"EpicVisuals\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-25 11:10:57', NULL, 0, 0),
(271, 'Cheesy Cuddles: The Little Jerry Dreamworld', 20, 'A warm, ultra-realistic portrait of a child in a playful Tom-and-Jerry inspired fantasy room, wrapped in cozy light, cartoon charm, and PicPose artistry.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A small child with their real facial structure preserved exactly, skin texture rendered naturally and realistically. The child wears a soft brown Jerry-style jumpsuit with a lighter beige tummy patch, a velvet mouse-ear headband, and a small plush velvet tail. The child appears warm, cute, and expressive.\r\nThe pose: sitting comfortably on a chair or on a giant cheese-shaped cushion, cuddling a plush “Tom” toy with both arms, smiling softly toward the camera. Body posture is relaxed, cozy, and natural.\r\nENVIRONMENT & COLOR THEME:\r\nA playful, cartoon-inspired living-room environment with a whimsical cheese theme. Warm light fills the room. The floor or rug uses soft pastel tones. Surround the scene with oversized cheese items, small cheese props, and child-friendly cartoon elements. Add subtle playful details like cartoon-shaped breadcrumbs, sparkles, or soft motion lines to hint at a Tom-and-Jerry-style world.\r\nAtmosphere should feel cozy, cute, warm, and imaginative.\r\nTECHNICAL SPECS:\r\nCinematic soft lighting, warm color temperature, clean lens, shallow depth of field to keep the subject clear and sharp.\r\nCamera angle: eye-level full-body portrait.\r\nArt style: ultra-realistic facial details with soft cartoon-inspired surroundings; natural textures; high-quality photorealistic render.\r\nTEXT & SIGNATURE:\r\nAdd a small artistic signature inside the scene: “Al-Hatem” (stylish, elegant, unobtrusive).\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764132546_a56e83b1706b.png', NULL, '[\"CheesyCuddles\",\"LittleJerryLook\",\"TomAndJerryInspo\",\"CuteKidsPortrait\",\"UltraRealisticChildArt\",\"CartoonFantasyRoom\",\"PicPoseMagic\",\"WarmCinematicLight\",\"CheeseThemePortrait\",\"AdorableChildPhotography\",\"CreativeKidsShoot\",\"FantasyPortraitArt\",\"JerryStyleOutfit\",\"SoftCinematicRender\",\"PicPoseBranding\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-26 04:49:06', NULL, 0, 0),
(272, 'Toy Store Glamour: A Candid Hug of Elegance', 18, 'Ultra-realistic cinematic portrait of a woman in a sweetheart-neck crop top and denim skirt, embracing a giant character inside a dreamy toy store—shot in soft high-key lighting with HD DSLR glamour detailing and a subtle PicPose signature.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create candid ultra-realistic cinematic glamour image 100% copy face ,identical to the attached image. A woman wearing blouse or Crop Top\r\nColor: color with accents\r\nNeckline: Sweetheart Neckline, which is shaped like the top half of a heart and is very flattering.\r\nSleeves: Puff Sleeves (short/mini), which are gathered at the shoulder and/or cuff to create a voluminous, rounded shape.\r\nFront Detailing: It features a line of decorative buttons down the center front.\r\nWaist/Hem: It has a fitted waist or hemline with a prominent, attached fabric tie/sash that is tied into a bow on the side (visible in the smaller inset picture and the main picture). This sash helps cinch the waist.\r\nFit: It appears to be a slim-fit or fitted style, especially around the bust and waist.\r\nMaterial: Based on the drape, it looks like it could be a polyester blend, or a similar structured, smooth fabric.\r\nBottom: denim short skirt.\r\nWear pastel strap heels.\r\nShe\'s hugging a large giant (character) and the background toy store.\r\nSoft, dramatic high-key lighting, beautiful skin texture, elegant, shallow depth of field.\r\nRealistic high detail HD DSLR shot and glamour shot.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764133186_d9f65bfcd88e.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicGlamour\",\"UltraRealisticPortrait\",\"CandidAesthetic\",\"SweetheartNeckline\",\"PuffSleeves\",\"DenimSkirtStyle\",\"PastelHeels\",\"ToyStoreVibes\",\"GiantCharacterHug\",\"HighKeyLighting\",\"HDDSLRShot\",\"GlamourPhotography\",\"RealisticDetails\",\"fashionportrait\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-26 04:59:46', NULL, 0, 0);
