(273, 'Sky Beast Ascendancy', 18, 'A hyper-realistic fusion of technology and nature, featuring a crocodile-shaped futuristic helicopter soaring above golden mountain horizons with the uploaded pilot seamlessly integrated.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an ultra-realistic cinematic image of a futuristic crocodile-shaped helicopter flying high above lush green mountains during sunset. The helicopter has a transparent glass cockpit with detailed controls inside. Insert the uploaded person as the pilot seated inside the cockpit — matching the same pose, angle, expression style, and lighting as the original pilot. The person should wear modern aviation headphones, sunglasses (if possible), and neutral-colored pilot attire.\r\nThe crocodile helicopter body must look highly detailed with realistic scales, textures, and mechanical parts. Background should show a winding river and soft golden sky. Maintain hyper-realistic lighting, soft reflections on the cockpit glass, and natural shadows on the face of the uploaded person.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764133296_b4d267e948df.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"FuturisticHelicopter\",\"CrocodileCopter\",\"CinematicVisuals\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"AerialCinematic\",\"PilotPortrait\",\"AIArtPrompt\",\"EpicScenery\",\"SunsetMountains\",\"AviationArt\",\"HyperRealism\",\"SciFiAircraft\",\"AIImagination\",\"NextGenVisua\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-26 05:01:36', NULL, 0, 0),
(274, 'Paris Sunset Couture Elegance', 27, 'A Luxe Fashion Portrait Blending Cinematic Warmth with Timeless Parisian Charm\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic full-body fashion portrait at sunset in Paris, featuring the Louvre Museum and its glass pyramid in the background. A beautiful woman with the same face, and Black hair styled in a high loose messy bun with soft strands framing her face. She stands elegantly, facing right, holding a small light blue quilted Chanel-style bag with both hands. She wears a long-sleeve steel blue feathered jacket fully covering the front, paired with steel blue jeans. Accessories include large square pearl earrings and brown rectangular sunglasses. The scene is bathed in warm golden-pink sunset light, casting a dreamy, cinematic glow over the architecture and enhancing the luxurious texture of the jacket. Do not change the face.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764134274_b924e6eda95a.png', NULL, '[\"ParisFashion\",\"SunsetGlow\",\"UltraRealisticPortrait\",\"LouvreVibes\",\"HighFashionLook\",\"CinematicStyle\",\"FeatherJacket\",\"SteelBlueAesthetic\",\"MessyBunBeauty\",\"LuxuryStreetStyle\",\"ChanelInspired\",\"ParisianElegance\",\"GoldenHourMagic\",\"picposesignature\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-26 05:17:54', NULL, 0, 0),
(275, 'Forest Guardians of Peace', 17, 'A serene cinematic moment capturing a man resting peacefully beside a majestic lion, illuminated by warm firelight in a mystical forest—enhanced with PicPose signature branding.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'realistic photography, a man sleeping peacefully with his head resting on the thick mane of a majestic male lion, a small warm campfire burning brightly in front of them, dense mystical forest background, lush green trees, earthy forest floor, soft natural overhead lighting, warm firelight illuminating the scene, glowing embers, subtle smoke, shallow depth of field, beautiful bokeh effect, serene atmosphere, tranquil mood, intimate bond, earthy color palette, deep greens, warm oranges, golden hour lighting, cinematic shot, highly detailed, professional photo, high resolution, intricate fur texture, olive green casual clothing, side profile of man, calm expression, peaceful slumber, powerful lion\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764136625_3409a108ea3c.png', NULL, '[\"ForestGuardians\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"RealisticPortrait\",\"ManAndLion\",\"PeacefulVibes\",\"MysticalForest\",\"GoldenHourMagic\",\"FirelightGlow\",\"NatureCinematicShot\",\"UltraRealisticPhoto\",\"PicPoseBranding\",\"EpicNatureScene\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-26 05:57:05', NULL, 0, 0),
(276, 'Guardians of the Sunlit Cliff', 17, 'A hyper-real 8K portrait capturing a human peacefully seated between two biologically realistic dragons under bright natural daylight, rendered with absolute photo accuracy and DSLR clarity.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic UHD 8K photograph of a person [user uploaded photo for face and outfit reference] sitting cross-legged between two massive, completely life-like dragons — one Chinese dragon and one Western dragon — on a rocky cliff on a sunny, clear, bright day. natural sunlight illuminates the entire scene with crisp, warm daylight, casting clean, soft-edged shadows and creating realistic highlights rocks, scales. the Chinese dragon is long, serpentine, and biologically convincing, its overlapping scales showing natural earthy tones: deep greens, muted golds, and warm browns. Sunlight catches the dragon\'s antler-like horns, whisker tendrils, and textured scales, giving them a natural sheen without any fantasy glow. The Western dragon on the other side stands like a powerful, spreading wings, its rugged scales colored in realistic charcoal, olive, and bronze hues. bright sunlight glints across its horns, wing edges, and muscular limbs, emphasizing real-world anatomical detail. — tiny sparkling in the sunlight, creating crisp, natural reflections. the man sits cross-legged confidently between them on sunlit wet rocks, wearing neutral outdoor clothing; his hand gently touches the Chinese dragon\'s side while the Western dragon lowers its head in calm acknowledgment. behind them, the waterfall cascades in brilliant daylight, with clear blue sky above, bright mist particles catching the sunlight, and detailed rock formations. The entire scene appears as if captured with a high-end DSLR camera using a 50mm lens, real-world daylight, authentic textures, zero CGI, zero stylization, no cartoonish elements. Only true biological realism, natural shadows, atmospheric depth, and bright sunny clarity.\",use reference photos precisely — without distortion.\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764143801_c0def936549e.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseOriginal\",\"UltraRealistic8K\",\"DragonRealism\",\"PhotorealPortrait\",\"CinematicSunlight\",\"DSLRQuality\",\"BiologicalDragons\",\"ChineseDragon\",\"WesternDragon\",\"MythicalRealism\",\"WaterfallBackdrop\",\"NaturalTextures\",\"NoCGIOnlyReality\",\"EpicFantasyFrame\",\"HighDetailScales\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-26 07:56:41', NULL, 0, 0),
(277, 'Red Fury Fashion Fusion', 27, 'Hyperrealistic studio portrait featuring a stylish young man, iconic Angry Birds ‘Red’ character, and vibrant monochrome aesthetics with PicPose branding.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A stylish, young Asian man use the uploaded photo(keep my original face), wearing round glasses, a red knitted sweater, red shorts, and red high-top sneakers, posing with his arm resting on a giant, photorealistic, 3D-rendered version of the Angry Birds character \"Red.\" The entire scene is against a seamless, solid, vibrant red background. Studio lighting, professional photography, high detail, hyperrealistic, fashion photoshoot. Added orange cat.\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764151111_5cddb3707bed.png', NULL, '[\"RedFashionShoot\",\"AngryBirdsFusion\",\"HyperRealisticPortrait\",\"AsianStyleEdit\",\"CharacterCrossover\",\"RedThemeAesthetic\",\"StudioLightingVibes\",\"PicPoseBranding\",\"CinematicFashionLook\",\"3DRenderFusion\",\"BoldMonochromeStyle\",\"UltraDetailShot\",\"CreativePortraitArt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 2, '2025-11-26 09:58:31', NULL, 0, 4),
(278, 'Golden Hour Serenity on Maldives Waters', 18, 'A photorealistic luxury portrait capturing tranquil elegance, flawless facial accuracy, and sunlit island beauty in a dreamy boat setting.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a photorealistic luxury portrait of a beautiful woman attached in the uploaded reference image ( Keep the face of the person 100% accurate from the reference image ) relaxing in a small boat on crystal-clear turquoise Maldives water during golden hour. She has long, softly wavy hair, glowing sun-kissed skin, and elegant warm-toned makeup. She wears gold hoop earrings, a stylish green wrap-style bikini top, and a flowing patterned sarong.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764153855_01d190f5d7a3.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"MaldivesMagic\",\"GoldenHourGlow\",\"LuxuryPortrait\",\"TropicalElegance\",\"PhotorealisticArt\",\"BoatPhotographyVibes\",\"IslandAesthetics\",\"SunKissedBeauty\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"OceanSerenity\",\"AIPhotography\",\"DreamyVisuals\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-26 10:44:15', NULL, 0, 0),
(279, 'Neon Heroic Glow', 19, 'A hyper-realistic 8K cinematic superhero portrait of a young child, styled with playful power and futuristic neon energy.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a hyper-realistic, full-frame 8K cinematic portrait using the uploaded child’s face exactly 100% with zero changes.\r\nSUBJECT:  \r\nA **7-year-old child** (use uploaded face) with **playful superhero hairstyle** — voluminous, slightly messy, spiky with fun streaks.  \r\nSitting confidently on a **bright neon-coloured futuristic scooty**, close-up portrait angle. Expression is heroic, playful, confident — perfect for a cinematic superhero poster for kids.\r\nSTYLE & AESTHETIC:  \r\nCinematic studio lighting with dramatic soft shadows, glowing rim light from the scooty.  \r\nUltra-detailed skin, shiny highlights on hair, vibrant scooty with glossy reflections.  \r\nDynamic superhero poster vibe, bold neon accents, photorealistic textures, premium editorial kids campaign energy.  \r\nBackground: softly blurred studio haze with subtle cinematic flares.\r\nCAMERA & QUALITY:  \r\nCanon R5 | 85mm f/1.2 | shallow depth of field | 8K ultra-HD | extreme sharpness | cinematic clarity.\r\nULTRA-REALISM:  \r\nPerfect skin texture, micro-details on hair and scooty, realistic glow on neon accents, hyper-realistic editorial finish.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764154522_342a318b0acf.png', NULL, '[\"NeonHeroPortrait\",\"CinematicKidHero\",\"8KUltraRealistic\",\"SuperheroStyleKids\",\"HyperRealismArt\",\"FuturisticScootyShot\",\"EditorialKidsPhotography\",\"CinematicPosterVibes\",\"PicPoseSignature\",\"StudioGlowPortrait\",\"SharpFocusMagic\",\"NeonRimLight\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 1, 1, '2025-11-26 10:55:22', NULL, 0, 1),
(280, 'Regal Glow: The Unchanged Beauty', 27, 'A timeless, hyper-realistic portrait capturing pure elegance, flawless detail, and the same unwavering identity.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'The same person, the same face, with no change in features. A meticulously crafted, hyper-realistic photograph, a medium shot, of a stunningly beautiful model with fair skin, long, sleek, and smooth blonde hair, green eyes, and full lips painted with glossy red lipstick. Professional makeup. She wears a delicate necklace in the shape of a small, sparkling heart and matching earrings. She wears an elegant champagne-colored satin evening gown with an off-the-shoulder neckline and dramatic pleat detailing at the bust. Her hands are raised in front of her chest, revealing her short, manicured fingers. The gown flows into a wide train. In the background, a pale green wall with vertical wooden details is prominent, and the soft shadows of leaves cast an artistic pattern on the wall. Soft lighting, directed slightly from the front, highlights the facial features and creates a subtle glow. The calm color palette leans towards shades of green and beige, with a sharp focus on the model and a gentle blur in the background. The image looks incredibly professional, 8K resolution, vibrant colors, meticulous detail, a regal look, and a dreamy atmosphere. neg_prompt: Distortion, dull colors, low quality, harsh shadows, inconsistent clothing, distracting background.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764155576_375de4d10e9c.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"LuxuryShoot\",\"BugattiStyle\",\"16KRealism\",\"StylishManShoot\",\"PremiumAesthetic\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"CarCommercialVibes\",\"MensFashionPortrait\",\"HDRLook\",\"FashionEditorial\",\"OutdoorShoot\",\"HighDetai