(282, 'Sunlit Citrus Charm Portrait', 19, 'A bright, cheerful, high-key summer studio shot capturing a fresh, youthful energy with citrus tones, vibrant yellow styling, and an elegant PicPose signature finish.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A person subject based on the reference image, keeping the exact same facial structure, hairstyle, and identity (100% identical to the reference, no alterations allowed).\r\nA tall, slender, and well-proportioned young boy with slight muscles. He has a handsome face, fair, smooth skin, and an elegant, youthful aura.\r\nCreate a Bright, cheerful studio portrait of a young person sitting at a yellow-themed fruit table. The subject has short, wavy, slightly tousled light-brown hair and a fresh, dewy complexion. He wear a vibrant yellow patterned short-sleeve shirt with orange and white floral design. \r\nThe subject is positioned at a table with a yellow checkered tablecloth, leaning slightly forward, holding a glass and sipping on a yellow straw while drinking from a tall glass of fresh orange juice. Expression is natural and slightly surprised, with relaxed eyes and parted lips.\r\nOn the table are neatly arranged citrus fruits—lemons, oranges, sliced lemons on a small wooden board—and a pineapple placed near a vintage white scale. To the right, a clear glass vase with water holds bright yellow sunflowers.\r\nBackground is a seamless solid pastel yellow studio backdrop, creating a monochromatic, summery aesthetic. Soft, even lighting with minimal shadows gives the scene a clean, commercial, high-key look.\r\nHighly saturated colors, smooth skin texture, and crisp detail throughout. Composition is centered, waist-up framing, playful and summery mood.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764219065_132894e462cb.png', NULL, '[\"CitrusGlowPortrait\",\"SummerStudioVibes\",\"BrightYellowAesthetic\",\"YouthfulCharmShot\",\"OrangeJuiceMoment\",\"PicPoseSignature\",\"VibrantCitrusTheme\",\"HighKeyStudioLook\",\"FreshDewyComplexion\",\"CheerfulPortraitStyle\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 1, '2025-11-27 04:51:05', NULL, 0, 0),
(283, 'Christmas Glow in Natural Light', 18, 'A festive full-body portrait capturing authentic beauty in a bright winter wonderland—sharp, natural, and true to every detail.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Full body portrait of a young woman (preserve my facial features, I should be recognizable) photographed on iPhone 17 Pro using the main wide camera in bright natural light, with no background blur.**\r\n**OUTFITS AND ACCESSORIES:**\r\nShe wears a festive Christmas outfit consisting of a cozy red knit sweater with subtle white snowflake details, paired with a white pleated skirt. She has a soft red-and-white Santa hat, simple stud earrings, and warm winter gloves. She also carries a small crossbody bag with a minimal holiday accent, such as a tiny bell or ribbon. Her hairstyle remains natural and neat, complementing the seasonal theme.\r\n\r\nThe background includes an outdoor Christmas setting, capturing the open layout and scenic holiday vistas—such as decorated pine trees, warm golden string lights, and a bright, clear winter sky. Everything must appear naturally lit and fully sharp, with no artificial depth effect and no background blur.\r\nThe image showcases accurate skin tones, detailed foreground and background, and high dynamic range typical of iPhone computational photography, rendering all elements sharply and authentically. Do not over-edit or enhance the face or expression in any way. Maintain a high degree of facial fidelity to the provided image. Avoid background blur.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764219728_6ac0ff767a2a.png', NULL, '[\"ChristmasPortrait\",\"FestiveFashion\",\"WinterWonderlandVibes\",\"NaturalLightPhotography\",\"iPhone17ProShot\",\"HolidayAesthetic\",\"FullBodyPortrait\",\"SharpAndDetailed\",\"SeasonalStyle