(284, 'Mirrored Souls: The Artist & His Muse', 23, 'A hyper-realistic twin-aura portrait where the couple shares identical faces and hairstyles—captured in a serene white room, painted through art and emotion, with soft PicPose branding.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'ultra realistic portrait of a couple .the girl is lying on the left side on the white bed .wearing a coctail white floral dress with rose print .the men is holding a brush of painting she paint a girl lying on the bed .the men wear a white tshirt with black short the couple are the same face and hairstyle above . background; light room with a painting dont change their face and hairtyle. they facing the camera.\r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764219809_4006ecb04123.png', NULL, '[\"PicPosePortrait\",\"UltraRealisticCouple\",\"TwinAuraConcept\",\"ArtisticLoveShot\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"MirrorFacesTheme\",\"CreativeCoupleArt\",\"HyperRealisticImage\",\"WhiteRoomAesthetic\",\"EmotionalVisuals\",\"PainterAndMuse\",\"DreamyArtPortrait\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-27 05:03:29', NULL, 0, 0),
(285, 'Epic Prehistoric Diorama: Dawn of the Dinosaurs', 23, 'A cinematic miniature world where ancient giants roam and creators sculpt life with precision and passion.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Highly detailed cinematic diorama of a prehistoric world: a lush jungle filled with gigantic ferns, waterfalls, and volcanic cliffs glowing with lava cracks. Towering dinosaurs like T-Rex, Triceratops, and long necked Brachiosaurus roam among the trees, while pterodactyls soar in the smoky sky above a distant erupting the workbench, a beautiful man and woman with the same hairstyle above are carefully placing miniature dinosaurs into the glowing jungle terrain, using tweezers with intense focus. The diorama is illuminated with warm golden sunlight mixed with fiery volcanic glow, creating an epic, adventurous atmosphere.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764220251_d48155945be0.png', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764220251_0395cf2d9da8.png', '[\"PrehistoricDiorama\",\"CinematicMiniature\",\"DinosaurWorld\",\"TRex\",\"Triceratops\",\"Brachiosaurus\",\"Pterodactyl\",\"VolcanicLandscape\",\"EpicAdventureArt\",\"MiniatureCreation\",\"DioramaArt\",\"HighlyDetailed\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"picpose\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 1, '2025-11-27 05:10:51', NULL, 0, 1),
(286, 'Underwater Harmony: A Selfie with the Sea Turtle', 18, 'Ultra-realistic underwater portrait of a woman capturing a playful, natural moment with a friendly turtle — styled with clean lighting, rich coral textures, and a minimal ‘PicPose’ signature.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A woman with short black hair wearing a black rash guard and black swim shorts takes a cute underwater selfie using a black waterproof smartphone with a clear underwater case. A sea turtle swims close to her, appearing to pose for the camera. Coral reef environment, natural lighting, ultra-realistic details.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764222174_84111e872fc2.png', NULL, '[\"UnderwaterSelfie\",\"SeaTurtleMoment\",\"AquaPortrait\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"OceanMagic\",\"CoralReefVibes\",\"CuteUnderwaterShot\",\"MarineLifePhotography\",\"PicPoseStyle\",\"CinematicUnderwater\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-27 05:42:54', NULL, 0, 0),
(287, 'Urban Alpha Vibes — Street-Side Cinematic Portrait', 17, 'A bold, ultra-realistic portrait of a man sitting on a street curb in full black attire, exuding confidence and style against a luxury SUV backdrop — featuring PicPose signature branding.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Use my image upload in Creata a portrait of a man (uploaded photo for 100.999% facial reference) sitting on the curb of a street.\r\nImage Description\r\nThe man uploaded photo is sitting casually on a stone curb, looking directly at the camera. He has sunglasses. He\'s wearing an entirely black outfit, giving him a stylish, edgy, and masculine look:\r\nOuterwear: A black leather motorcycle jacket with silver zippers and snaps.\r\nPants: Black, slim-fit jeans or trousers.\r\nFootwear: Black Vans Old Skool sneakers with white soles and white stripes.\r\nAccessories: He is holding a white Starbucks cup in his right hand and appears to be holding celfone in his left. He also has a watch or bracelet on his left wrist.\r\nThe background features a dark-colored BMW SUV parked directly behind him, which takes up a significant portion of the frame but is slightly out of focus. The setting appears to be a residential street with a paved road and some trees visible further down the street. The natural lighting suggests it is a bright, sunny day, creating a strong.\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764237997_c1438afa98af.png', NULL, '[\"PicPosePortrait\",\"UrbanCinematicLook\",\"StreetStylePhotography\",\"MasculineAesthetic\",\"BlackOutfitMood\",\"LuxurySUVVibes\",\"UltraRealisticEdit\",\"CurbsidePortrait\",\"LifestyleCinematicShot\",\"PicPoseBranding\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 3, '2025-11-27 10:06:37', NULL, 0, 4),
(288, 'Clash of Legends: The Warrior’s Final Stand', 27, '8K Hyper-Realistic Cinematic Battle of a Hero Facing a Mythic Beast — Raw Power, Drama & Fantasy Film Energy\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an 8K photo-realistic cinematic action scene of [main character] battling a [creature].\r\nCharacter:\r\n[warrior/hero], [muscular/athletic], in a [dynamic action pose], delivering a powerful strike. Worn/torn clothing or armor, dirt, sweat, and motion for realism. Preserve identity if using a real face.\r\nCreature:\r\n[dragon/beast/monster], huge and detailed with [scales/skin texture], glowing [eyes], and an aggressive pose (open jaws, roar, or attack).\r\nLighting:\r\nDramatic [sunset/fiery/stormy] lighting with dust, smoke, embers, or haze for cinematic depth.\r\nEnvironment:\r\nRugged [battlefield/rocky canyon/ruins], scattered debris, warm or dramatic color palette.\r\nStyle:\r\nUltra-detailed, hyper-realistic, AAA fantasy film/game energy.\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764238952_e0e4c1c5af80.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseCinematic\",\"EpicBattleScene\",\"FantasyWarrior\",\"MythicCreatureFight\",\"8KRealism\",\"HyperRealisticArt\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"ActionFantasyArt\",\"DragonVsWarrior\",\"EpicActionFrame\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-27 10:22:32', NULL, 0, 0),
(289, 'Shadow Strike Elegance', 18, 'A cinematic ultra-realistic glamour-action portrait blending strength, style, and hyper-detailed dramatic ambience.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a candid ultra-realistic full-frame cinematic glamour portrait using the uploaded face 100% identical. Full-body portrait of a stunning young woman standing in a dimly lit abandoned building hallway; wavy shoulder-length brown hair, bright expressive eyes, and a determined direct gaze. She wears a tactical vest/plate carrier over a black tank top showing a slight midriff, paired with fitted dark gray/black jeans, black tactical gloves, and wrapped compression sleeves on both arms. She holds a black assault rifle (AR-15/AK tactical hybrid with stock + foregrip) across her chest in a ready-for-action pose. Background shows a long derelict industrial hallway with cracked dusty walls and concrete floors, tall dirty windows on the left casting dramatic side light, deep shadows, drifting dust particles. Cinematic contrast, soft dramatic lighting, premium skin detail, elegant shallow DOF, hyper-real HD DSLR action-glamour look.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764239585_c0c1d2435a0d.png', NULL, '[\"ShadowStrikeElegance\",\"PicPoseEdition\",\"CinematicGlamour\",\"UltraRealisticPortrait\",\"ActionGlamourVibes\",\"TacticalBeauty\",\"HyperDetailShot\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"DSLRLook\",\"RealFaceSwapPrompt\",\"FullFrameAesthetic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-27 10:33:05', NULL, 0, 0),
(290, 'Jurassic Joyride: The Young Explorer’s Adventure', 19, 'A photorealistic, cinematic portrait of a boy running through a misty prehistoric jungle, meeting gentle giants and embracing pure adventure.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A photorealistic image of a young boy (preserving the user\'s facial features), smiling joyfully while running through a lush, misty prehistoric jungle. He is wearing a detailed tan safari explorer outfit, including a tan vest with a \'Jurassic Park\' style emblem, a long-sleeved white shirt, tan cargo pants with a green dinosaur patch, brown boots, and a tan baseball cap with the word \'PicPose\' embroidered on it. His body is in motion, dynamically running, with one arm slightly raised in an excited, explorative gesture. Beside him, a majestic, realistic Brachiosaurus with its long neck gently curved downwards, looks towards him with curiosity. In the background, a towering waterfall cascades down into the dense foliage, surrounded by other large, long-necked dinosaurs partially obscured by mist and trees. A Pterodactyl flies gracefully overhead in the misty sky. The scene is bathed in soft, atmospheric light, with shafts of sunlight piercing through the jungle canopy, creating a wondrous and adventurous mood. Cinematic, highly detailed, natural color grading. \r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764240660_bfb833cff3a6.png', NULL, '[\"JurassicAdventure\",\"YoungExplorer\",\"PrehistoricWorld\",\"DinoJourney\",\"CinematicAI\",\"PhotorealisticArt\",\"PicPose\",\"AIImagery\",\"EpicAdventure\",\"Brachiosaurus\",\"DinoMood\",\"FantasyRealism\",\"JungleExploration\",\"AIMagic\",\"AdventurePortrait\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 1, 9, '2025-11-27 10:51:00', NULL, 2, 10),
(291, 'The Goldfish Fairy Voyage', 20, 'A magical underwater fairytale — where innocence meets surreal beauty in hyper-real cinematic realism.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Edit the uploaded photo (face based on the reference photo). Ensure the face remains consistent with the person in the uploaded image, without changing facial structure, skin tone. A young girl smiling towards the camera wearing a delicate white dress riding a large, vibrant goldfish. The scene is magical and surreal, with the girl holding onto the fish gently as she floats in the water. Bubbles rise from above, creating a whimsical atmosphere. The background features a soft, out-of-focus underwater environment with other smaller goldfish swimming around. The lighting highlights the girl\'s face and the golden scales of the fish, emphasizing a fantasy-like, chherful mood. The overall composition evokes a fairytale scene, blending innocence and enchantment. Using a Canon EOS R camera with a 50mm f/1.8 lens, f/2.2 aperture, shutter speed 1/200s, ISO 100 and natural light, Full Body, Hyper Realistic Photography, Cinematic, Cinema, Hyper detail, Ultra hd, Color Correction, ultra hd, hdr , color grading, 8k. \r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764242142_6dbddd21155c.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseMagic\",\"FairytalePortrait\",\"GoldfishRide\",\"UnderwaterDreamscape\",\"HyperRealisticEdit\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"SurrealFantasyArt\",\"UltraHD8K\",\"ChildFantasyPortrait\",\"CanonEosRLook\",\"FantasyVisuals\",\"PicPoseSignature\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-27 11:15:42', NULL, 0, 1),
(292, 'Autumn Luxe on London Streets', 17, 'A charismatic young man exuding effortless wealth and style, posing beside a Bentley Continental GT Speed amidst elegant Georgian architecture and golden autumn leaves.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A wealthy young bearded man in his 20s, stylish and confident, wearing a cream oversized sweater and loose black high-waisted trousers, standing casually leaning against a light blue Bentley Continental GT Speed convertible, luxury British sports car, parked on a posh London street in autumn, elegant white Georgian townhouses with black railings in the background, large plane trees with yellow falling leaves, overcast soft daylight, cinematic photography,\r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764392115_7531e26fbe5d.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseExclusive\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"LuxuryVibes\",\"BentleyLifestyle\",\"LondonAesthetic\",\"AutumnMood\",\"RichElegance\",\"FashionAndLuxury\",\"UrbanPortrait\",\"HighEndPhotography\",\"FallSeasonVibes\",\"VisualCouture\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-29 04:55:15', NULL, 0, 0),
(293, 'PicPose Pokémon Cinematic Universe – Real-Life Trainer Entry', 33, 'A 16K Ultra-Realistic Full EST Scene Featuring a Real-Life Trainer, Pikachu on Shoulder, Surrounding Pokémon & Mewtwo Floating Behind – Welcome to PicPose AI\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a 16K Ultra Realistic Cinematic full EST (zoom out) shot of Man wearing Yellow and Black color combination open chain Jacket, inner T-shirt black color, Black and yellow color combination Loose Cargo Pant, Yellow, black and red color combination shoes, Standing in street of realistic Pokemon big City, big roads. facing front, with smile. The realistic real life Pikachu on his right shoulder, and others Pokemon standing around him, and Mewtwo floating behind him. Face and body. In Background peoples is with their different pokemon casually. Written text on top \"Welcome to PicPose AI\" Text \"Pokemon\" written big and same as like original Pokemon series. All Pokemon should look realistic insane like in real life. Face and body 100% Match with reference image I uploaded.\r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764392422_658dcc2be041.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"PokemonUniverse\",\"RealLifePokemon\",\"CinematicShot\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"AIArtCreation\",\"TrainerEdition\",\"PikachuVibes\",\"MewtwoScene\",\"16KRender\",\"BigCityPokemon\",\"PokemonCinematic\",\"EpicESTShot\",\"StreetStylePortrait\",\"AIEditing\",\"picposebranding\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-29 05:00:22', NULL, 0, 1),
(294, 'Western Luxe Muse in Denim Elegance', 27, 'A sharp, cinematic portrait capturing modern western glamour—denim, leather, sunlight, and an irresistible couture aura under the open sky.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Striking outstanding lady (emphasis on face and body) with long, brown hair, cascading down the shoulder, smooth, seductive western charm, she wears a cool denim bikini, highlighted by a structured bratop, brown leather strap, and matching tan leather high-waisted bikini. Adorned with a chic belt. A white brown patterned scarf with tassels artfully vent through the left hip. Fastened with a belt. A small navel piercing adds to the charm. She completes the look with a cap. A classic dark brown cowboy, which she is amusingly adjusting with both hands. A tiny necklace adorns a tiny pendant around the neck.\r\nThe background is a lively outdoor scene under a clear blue sky. The fluffy white clouds, inviting a vast landscape. Looking at the green mountains or hills in the distance, inviting a rustic yet beautiful atmosphere. Could be a steep place with an open atmosphere.\r\nLuminous natural light creates striking highlights on her skin, including the fabric of her denim dress and cowboy hat. The play of light and shadow accentuates the dimensional shape and details of her accessories. The overall tone combines perfectly between earthy browns, the cool blues of leather and sky, and the vivid greens of the distant landscape. This combination should evoke a luxurious and modern western aesthetic, inviting Dior editorials to mind. I am uniquely stand out.\r\nThe image needs to have extra sharpness and detail. Capturing every strand of her hair, the delicate stitching on leather, the texture of a cowboy hat, the patterns on a scarf, and the delicate details of her accessories. There should be no tattoos to show. The final image should have pure sharpness and beauty as commonly seen on the cover of high-end fashion magazines. directly looking at the camera please, use reference face and body\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764392753_e2cb1169fe3b.png', NULL, '[\"WesternLuxe\",\"DenimEditorial\",\"CowgirlGlamour\",\"HighFashionPortrait\",\"UltraSharpDetail\",\"CinematicBeauty\",\"VogueStyle\",\"DiorInspired\",\"LeatherAesthetic\",\"ModernWestern\",\"OutdoorEditorial\",\"PicPosePremium\",\"FashionMuse\",\"AIEditorialArt\",\"LuxuryAesthetic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-29 05:05:53', NULL, 0, 0),
(295, 'Emerald Silence: A Realistic Outdoor Portrait Study', 18, 'A deeply emotive ultra-realistic portrait of a young woman in a raw, natural outdoor setting — detailed textures, expressive mood, and professional PicPose finish.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create ultra-realistic portrait photo of a young woman(upload image) her hair tied into two messy pigtails, loose fringe and stray strands around her slightly dirty face. Her eyes are intense, serious gaze. the expression as if deep in thought. She wears an emerald-green fitted top under oversized dark blue ripped jeans rolled at the ankles, distressed knees with visible threads. Worn white and rust-brown canvas sneakers, slightly dirty. She is squatting with her arms resting gently over her bent knees, relaxed but guarded posture. Outdoor setting with uneven stone or concrete slabs, moss and dirt between them. Wild green weeds and foliage around her, natural outdoor ambiance. Soft directional lighting highlighting her vivid hair and bright eyes. Shallow depth of field, background gently blurred, high-detail textures, realistic skin tones, natural color grading, \r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764393399_27a864d4283f.png', NULL, '[\"PicPosePremium\",\"8KUltraRealistic\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"GoldenHourVibes\",\"YachtPhotography\",\"SkylineBackdrop\",\"LuxuryLifestyleShot\",\"50mmLensLook\",\"SharpFacialDetails\",\"ModernElegance\",\"HighEndPortrait\",\"SunsetAesthetics\",\"PicPoseBranding\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-29 05:16:15', NULL, 0, 0),
(296, 'Sunset Elegance on the Yacht', 17, 'A cinematic 8K portrait capturing modern luxury, timeless style, and the exact facial realism of the reference image\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', '8k ultra-realistic, 50mm lens. Man on a yacht with a modern skyline in the background, including tall buildings and urban architecture. Maintain the characteristics of the attached person, and the face appears sharp. Elegant casual look: light beige sweater, khaki pants, and a discreet metallic watch. One hand holding a drink and the other in the pocket. Soft natural light at sunset with blue and golden tones, cinematic depth of field, sophisticated and modern atmosphere. Do not alter the face of the reference, the output should have 100% exact facial features as the reference image. Ensure the output maintains 100% exact facial features as the reference image without any alterations.\r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764393507_dc770b0e472c.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseOriginal\",\"YachtPortrait\",\"UltraRealistic8K\",\"CinematicLook\",\"50mmLens\",\"GoldenHourGlow\",\"ModernSkyline\",\"MensFashionPortrait\",\"LuxuryVibes\",\"NaturalLightMagic\",\"RealFaceFeatures\",\"HighEndRetouching\",\"EditorialStyle\",\"SunsetPhotography\",\"PicposeBranding\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-29 05:18:27', NULL, 0, 1),
(297, 'Magic Moments at Disneyland', 19, 'A cinematic travel portrait capturing childhood wonder, adventure, and pure joy—shot in iconic Disneyland settings with ultra-realistic face accuracy.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Palitan mo lang yung poses and scene\r\nPara maiba amg mga lugar. Nandyn na din sa baba i eedit mo nalang\r\nPrompt (Universal Template):\r\nCreate a cinematic travel portrait of a 7-year-old boy at Disneyland, using the uploaded image as a face reference to make him look 100% identical (eyes, lips, nose, and facial features must match exactly). He should have a clean-cut, neat hairstyle, smooth skin, and a joyful natural expression that reflects childhood innocence.\r\nOutfit: Modern casual child’s outfit (T-shirt or hoodie with Disney graphics, shorts or jeans, sneakers, and fun accessories like a cap or glowing toy).\r\nPose & Scene (adjust per variation):\r\nHolding a Mickey balloon in front of the castle\r\nLaughing on the spinning teacup ride\r\nWatching the glowing parade with a toy wand\r\nStanding confidently in front of the castle during daytime\r\nGazing up at fireworks with awe\r\nMeeting Peter Pan (handshake)\r\nHugging Mickey Mouse\r\nSetting & Mood: Disneyland atmosphere with glowing lights, dreamy colors, and magical cinematic energy. The background should reflect the specific moment (castle, ride, parade, or fireworks). The mood should be vibrant, editorial, and full of wonder.\r\nTechnical details: Captured with a Canon EOS R5 + 85mm f/1.4 lens, hyper-realistic cinematic editorial style, sharp focus on the face, 8K resolution.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764394450_159f794cb42d.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"DisneylandMagic\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"TravelPortraits\",\"KidsPhotography\",\"PhotoPrompt\",\"MagicMoments\",\"CinematicKidsPhoto\",\"DisneyVibes\",\"FantasyPortrait\",\"8KRealism\",\"canonr5style\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-29 05:34:10', NULL, 0, 0),
(298, 'Pastel Dreams at the PicPose Café', 18, 'A whimsical blend of soft colors, delicate charm, and sweet elegance captured in a dreamy café moment.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A pastel-themed café interior, a young woman sitting elegantly on a wooden stool beside a glass display of colorful pastries and macarons. She wears a mint-green dress with floral embroidery and layered tulle skirt. Her hair is a stylish pixie-bob cut in soft light pink and light blue, adorned with a small white flower clip. Soft natural lighting, dreamy pastel colors, gentle expression, delicate makeup, high-detail skin texture, sweet and whimsical atmosphere, shallow depth of field, professional photography.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764395673_74846bdefac0.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseCreation\",\"SurrealPhotography\",\"SpriteMint\",\"WinterVibes\",\"PhotoRealisticArt\",\"CreativeProductShot\",\"MobileMagic\",\"ScreenToReality\",\"MintRefresh\",\"CoolAesthetic\",\"ConceptualArt\",\"DigitalSurrealism\",\"CinematicShot\",\"ModernVisuals\",\"PicPoseBranding\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-29 05:54:33', NULL, 0, 0),
(299, 'Crocodile Fisher: The Mechanical River Hunter', 17, 'A modified raft-boat fishing robot with a realistic crocodile head, diesel engine power, and a tropical riverside atmosphere — complete with PicPose signature branding.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create and edit a fishing robot using a Boat Machine. This robot Boat is shaped like a modified raft or flat-bottomed boat. In the rear, a diesel engine or large machine is visible, serving as the boat\'s propulsion, featuring a flywheel or large wheel. And it has a curved canopy roof made of fiberglass.\r\n​The front of the boat is fitted with a giant crocodile head sculpture with its mouth wide open. The crocodile head looks realistic with big teeth and detailed scales.\r\n​Action and Cargo: The crocodile\'s mouth functions as a net or fishing container made of wire, and it is full of newly caught small silver fish. Behind the crocodile, on the boat, there is a large net fish storage area also full of caught fish.\r\n​A man is sitting in the center of the boat, wearing a black-and-white patterned blangkon (Javanese traditional headwear) behind the crocodile head. He is wearing a white hoodie.\r\n​Background: The scene is set on a murky river (light brown in color). On the riverbank, there are houses, palm trees (likely coconut), and lush green foliage, showing a rural or riverside atmosphere in a tropical region.\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764397164_577e695f0308.png', NULL, '[\"CrocodileFishingRobot\",\"MechanicalRaftBoat\",\"DieselEngineBoat\",\"RiverFishingMachine\",\"CrocodileHeadBoat\",\"TropicalRiverside\",\"BoatEngineering\",\"FishHarvesting\",\"CreativeBoatDesign\",\"PicPoseBranding\",\"AIArtPrompt\",\"RealisticFishingScene\",\"RuralRiverLife\",\"CinematicAIArt\",\"picposeai\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-29 06:19:24', NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `ai_posts` (`id`, `title`, `category_id`, `short_description`, `prompt_text`, `image_url1`, `image_url2`, `tags`, `external_id`, `status`, `moderation_flags`, `reviewed_by`, `reviewed_at`, `priority`, `is_popular`, `is_featured`, `tier`, `premium_unlock_cost_points`, `premium_pack`, `likes`, `favorites`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `copies`, `views`) VALUES
(300, 'Rustic Robo-Safari in the Rambutan Orchard', 17, 'A smiling man seated on a scrap-metal robotic giraffe with a wicker basket full of apples, set against a sunlit rambutan orchard—captured with vibrant outdoor lighting and subtle PicPose branding.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A man wearing...\r\n​He is seen smiling at the camera.\r\n​The man sits on a saddle or seat mounted on the back of a Apple-picking robot giraffe, which is equipped with a brown shade or canopy.\r\n​The giraffe robot has a texture like scrap metal or pieces of metal joined together and appears rusted, giving it a unique and artistic appearance.\r\n​Behind the man\'s seat is a large basket made of wicker or rattan, filled with red Apple fruit.\r\n​The background is dominated by a fruit orchard or plantation.\r\n​The trees in the background are Apple trees, characterized by the abundant red rambutan fruit hanging from their branches.\r\n​The ground beneath them appears dry and light brown.\r\n​The lighting suggests a bright day with strong sunlight, likely outdoors.\r\n​​Overall, this image looks like a tourist or recreational photo in a rambutan orchard, using a metal Apple-picking giraffe robot as an interesting photo prop.\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764397484_704557ad234e.png', NULL, '[\"RoboSafari\",\"MetalGiraffe\",\"OrchardAdventure\",\"RambutanFarm\",\"CreativePortrait\",\"OutdoorFantasy\",\"RusticRobotics\",\"FruitHarvestRide\",\"PicPoseBranding\",\"TouristVibes\",\"AIArtPrompt\",\"SciFiCountryside\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-29 06:24:44', NULL, 0, 0),
(301, 'Whispers of the Shinigami Desk', 18, 'A surreal office moment where reality smiles, and Ryuk quietly watches creativity unfold.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A woman (image upload for reference) sits at a wooden office desk, calmly writing in a black notebook labeled “DEATH NOTE.” She is smiling softly while holding a pen in his right hand and supporting the notebook with his left. A white coffee mug and a small black mesh organizer sit on the desk in front of him. Behind him stands a hyper-realistic, full-body depiction of Ryuk, the Shinigami from the anime Death Note. Ryuk has pale gray skin, glowing yellow eyes, a wide sharp-toothed grin, spiky black hair, featherlike black shoulder textures, and long skeletal fingers. Ryuk’s left-hand rests on the man’s shoulder while his right hand holds a shiny red apple. The background is an office environment with soft lighting, blurred desks, and ceiling lights. The image is shot in high-resolution, realistic photography style, with perfect lighting, sharp details, and a slightly shallow depth of field. The overall mood blends humor, surrealism, and realism.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764398545_7cc1defdc448.png', NULL, '[\"DeathNoteVibes\",\"RyukInRealLife\",\"SurrealOfficeScene\",\"RealisticAnimeFusion\",\"CreativeFantasyShot\",\"DarkHumorAesthetic\",\"HyperRealisticEdit\",\"PicPoseCreation\",\"AnimePhotographyStyle\",\"ShinigamiPresence\",\"FantasyMeetsReality\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-29 06:42:25', NULL, 0, 0),
(302, 'The Ice-Blue Royal Strut', 27, 'Ultra-luxury couture runway portrait featuring a regal ice-blue embellished coat, elite fashion mood, and identity-locked realism with PicPose signature detailing.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-luxury couture portrait of a man wearing an extravagant ice-blue 3D-floral embellished royal coat, covered with high-detail beadwork, pearls, micro-flowers, lace appliqués, and crystal elements. Long dramatic cape effect with layered textures.\r\nInside: elegant icy-blue vest, structured suit, ruffled high-neck shirt, couture gloves.\r\nUse the uploaded reference face exactly 100% same (identity lock: do not change original face shape, skin tone, hair, eyes, or features).\r\nMood: runway couture, elite fashion show lighting, soft spotlight glow from above.\r\nBackground: premium fashion runway with soft blur, luxury ambience, elegant depth.\r\nColor tone: cool ice blue with hints of silver sparkle.\r\nPose: confident walk, hands relaxed, sunglasses allowed.\r\nDetailing: ultra-sharp textures, 16K embroidery detail, cinematic contrast.\r\nAdd small red MK watermark in lower right corner.\r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764407830_407b1e6f3d49.png', NULL, '[\"IceBlueCouture\",\"RoyalRunwayLook\",\"UltraLuxuryFashion\",\"CoutureMenswear\",\"HighFashionPortrait\",\"EliteRunwayVibes\",\"16KDetailing\",\"BeadworkAndPearls\",\"CinematicFashionArt\",\"PicPoseBranding\",\"MKWatermark\",\"IdentityLockPortrait\",\"LuxuryFashionEdit\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-29 09:17:10', NULL, 0, 0),
(303, 'Battlefront at Pig Castle: A Hero’s Cinematic Charge', 33, 'An ultra-realistic, game-inspired action portrait where a fearless young warrior storms the iconic Angry Birds pig fortress alongside lifelike Red, Chuck, Bomb, and Stella.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a completely new ultra realistic image of the same handsome, youthful, fit man with identical facial features, invading the legendary pig castle from Angry Birds.He kicks open a wooden gate while holding a giant slingshot over his shoulder. Red, Chuck, Bomb, and Stella charge in beside him.Pigs in armor helmets hide behind stone walls, golden treasure piles, and glass towers. The castle architecture is iconic Angry Birds style: stacked stone blocks, shaky wooden beams, floating platforms. and wobbling structures. Outfit: gamer-fit black T-shirt with small embroidered bird emblem, olive green tactical pants, and colorful white-red-yellow sneakers. Characters look absolutely real with feather layering, natural shadows, and expressive eyes. Lighting is dramatic afternoon sun hitting castle towers, with dust and particles in the air. Cinematic, heroic, nostalgic game energy shot on a 24 mm lens with crisp focus on the man and the frontline birds.\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764409286_8ea56323a9d2.png', NULL, '[\"UltraRealisticArt\",\"CinematicFantasy\",\"AngryBirdsWorld\",\"PigCastleInvasion\",\"GameInspiredArt\",\"EpicBattleScene\",\"HeroicPortrait\",\"RealisticCharacters\",\"ActionPackedVisual\",\"LegendaryCastle\",\"PicposeBranding\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-29 09:41:26', NULL, 0, 0),
(304, 'Steampunk Dreams in a Futuristic Slum', 17, 'A hyper-realistic 9:16 cinematic portrait of a young man and a 4D Homer Simpson, gazing upward amid a dystopian steampunk skyline—complete with tangled hair, skylight goggles, red hoodie, shabby backpack, and PicPose signature branding.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-detail, hyper-realistic, cinematic 9:16 ratio. A young man (face and hair 100% reference) and Homer Simpsons 4D character with amazing expressions looking up. She wore skylight steampunk goggles, tangled hair, a red hoodie, and a shabby backpack. Background: steampunk-style futuristic slum town full of outdated leaning buildings, interconnected high bridges.\r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764415670_5258dc27c9e1.png', NULL, '[\"SteampunkArt\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"UltraDetail\",\"4DCharacter\",\"HomerSimpson4D\",\"FuturisticSlum\",\"SciFiVibes\",\"9x16Art\",\"EpicDigitalArt\",\"PicPoseBranding\",\"AIArtIndia\",\"CreativeVisuals\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-29 11:27:50', NULL, 0, 0),
(305, 'Moonlit Lotus Queen of Ancient Egypt', 18, 'A photorealistic night-portrait blending Egyptian elegance, lotus symbolism, and cinematic 8K realism.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create photorealistic portrait of a young woman(upload image) in ancient Egypt, standing by the Nile at night; long wavy black hair, expressive dark eyes, natural pink lips; wearing a modest cyan gown (no cleavage), soft pleated fabric, subtle gold bead accents and fine gold embroidery on the bodice, and gold decorative patterns; adorned with realistic gold jewelry: multilayer necklace, dangling earrings, small braided hair ornament, thick gold arm cuffs and thin bracelets; holding a large bouquet of blooming pink lotus flowers\r\nenvironment: night-time riverside with shimmering water reflections, distant silhouettes of pyramids, floating pink lotus flowers in the foreground, dramatic clouds around a bright crescent moon; soft moonlight and natural backlighting illuminating the scene\r\nultra photorealistic, natural lighting, crisp depth of field, 8k quality.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764479588_b92048cc8289.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"EgyptianQueen\",\"MoonlitPortrait\",\"AncientEgyptVibes\",\"LotusBeauty\",\"NightPhotographyStyle\",\"8KRealism\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"DigitalArtPrompt\",\"UltraPhotorealistic\",\"LotusGoddess\",\"EgyptianAesthetic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-30 05:13:08', NULL, 0, 0),
(306, 'Pastel Garden Muse – Cinematic Realism Portrait', 18, 'A hyper-realistic, thigh-up floral garden portrait featuring a graceful woman in pastel waterpaint attire, glowing under soft backlight with a professional PicPose finish.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A very realistic, cinematic, thigh-up photo of a woman. Maintain 100% of original face features (no alteration). The lower left corner of the image features the Facebook logo and the text Nomahtan Kung. Subject has long, straight, voluminous hair, sharp Asian-style makeup (Cat Eye, glossy red lips). She wears a pastel pink/purple waterpaint floral bikini (double ruffles) and a sheer, flowing, diagonally tied ombre sarong (milky white to lavender, silver metallic trim, soft ruffles). Accessories include a Kunika necklace. Pose: Standing, gently twisting the body in a dynamic pose (natural movement), holding a pastel flower bouquet, sweet smile, looking at the camera. Scene: Pastel flower garden with soft backlighting, subtle glowing effect on the outfit, and soft bokeh background. Face is clear. Flashlight makes the face stand out.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764481357_3037ad3b1509.png', NULL, '[\"PastelGardenMuse\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"RealisticPhotography\",\"FloralAesthetic\",\"AsianMakeupStyle\",\"PastelBikiniLook\",\"OmbreSarong\",\"SoftBokehBackground\",\"FlowerBouquetPose\",\"PicPoseBranding\",\"HyperRealisticShot\",\"CinematicLook\",\"ProfessionalRetouch\",\"FashionPortrait\",\"GlowEffect\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-30 05:42:37', NULL, 0, 0),
(307, 'Timeless Elegance in Motion', 17, 'A hyper-realistic 8K portrait of a stylish man leaning on a dark blue Lamborghini, holding a vibrant bouquet with a confident, charismatic aura.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Hyper-realistic 8K hyper portrait of a man (same face, hairstyle, beard, and outfit, 100% match) holding a bouquet of red roses, white lilies, and blue hydrangeas, casually leaning on the rear of a dark blue Lamborghini car. He is checking his watch, wearing stylish rectangular shades, a dark blue suit, a black shirt, and matching formal shoes. The car features black alloy rims and red brake calipers. The man has a handsome look.\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764499290_2d06d59e419a.png', NULL, '[\"PicposeCreation\",\"HyperRealisticPortrait\",\"8KUltraDetail\",\"LuxuryLifestyleVibes\",\"LamborghiniMood\",\"StylishMenPhotography\",\"CinematicPortraits\",\"FashionEditorialStyle\",\"RealisticAIArt\",\"BouquetShoot\",\"PremiumAesthetic\",\"picposeofficial\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-30 10:41:30', NULL, 0, 0),
(308, 'Poolside Pink Luxe Elegance', 27, 'A haute-couture summer editorial featuring pastel glamour, refined accessories, and a fluffy Pomeranian in a sunlit luxury escape.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A medium shot, fashion editorial photograph features a young woman with fair skin, blonde hair, and full lips, wearing round, dark-lensed sunglasses. She is leaning against a white column, with her head tilted slightly and her gaze directed forward. She is adorned with delicate heart-shaped earrings and a matching pendant necklace, all sparkling with tiny stones. Around her neck, she wears a loosely draped white scarf, and her white dress is visible beneath a luxurious, fluffy pink faux fur coat that drapes over her shoulders and arms. She is holding a small, fluffy white Pomeranian dog, whose head is resting on her chest. The background is a vibrant, sunlit scene with a bright blue swimming pool, the sparkling ocean, and a clear blue sky, framed by architectural white columns. The lighting is bright and natural, casting soft shadows and highlighting the textures of the fur and fabric. The overall color palette is a harmonious blend of pastel pink, bright blue, and crisp white, with a high level of saturation and contrast. The depth of field is shallow, with the subjects in sharp focus and the background softly blurred, creating an impression of luxury and a summer vacation ambiance. Keywords: fashion photography, luxury, elegance, summer, poolside, Pomeranian, haute couture, vibrant, sharp focus, detailed texture, golden hour.\r\nneg_prompt: blurry, low quality, deformed, ugly, extra limbs, mutated hands, distorted features, noisy, grainy, text, watermark.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764499629_e759183bf9da.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"LuxeEditorial\",\"SummerElegance\",\"PoolsideFashion\",\"PastelAesthetic\",\"HauteCoutureVibes\",\"BlondeBeauty\",\"FauxFurFashion\",\"PomeranianStyle\",\"LuxuryPhotography\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"VibrantTones\",\"FashionInFocus\",\"GlamourShots\",\"HighEndAesthetic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-30 10:47:09', NULL, 0, 0),
(309, 'Golden Glimpse in the Vanity Mirror', 27, 'A modern-bathroom portrait capturing sophistication, sharp details, and charismatic beauty — enhanced with flawless lighting and subtle PicPose branding.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a portrait of a young woman using the uploaded picture, She is posing in what appears to be a modern bathroom. She has long, blonde hair with caramel highlights styled straight with a slight wave, parted down the middle. Her makeup includes defined eyebrows, winged eyeliner, and rosy pink lipstick. She\'s wearing small hoop earrings and a delicate gold heart shaped pendant necklace. Her outfit is a form-fitting black mini-dress with spaghetti straps. The dress features a cut-out design on the bust with silver chains draping across the bust. The side of the dress also has cut-outs with silver chains connecting the fabric, revealing parts of her thigh. She is leaning forward slightly, resting her hands on the edge of a white bathroom counter or sink. In the background, there\'s a large mirror reflecting a portion of the room and an overhead light. The lighting is bright and even, highlighting her features and the details of her dress. Catchlight reflects her eyes.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764499923_7ba11dcb33b5.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseCreation\",\"AIArtPortrait\",\"BathroomAesthetic\",\"ModernGlamour\",\"GoldenHighlights\",\"BlackMiniDress\",\"ElegantVibes\",\"VanityMirrorShot\",\"AIStylePortrait\",\"DigitalGlam\",\"ElegantLook\",\"HyperRealisticPortrait\",\"ModelPhotographyStyle\",\"AIPhotoMagic\",\"CaramelBlondeBeauty\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-11-30 10:52:03', NULL, 0, 0),
