(315, 'Icy-Blue Dream Muse', 18, 'A serene, ultra-realistic cinematic portrait in soft cool tones with elegant fashion-editorial styling and a signature PicPose finish.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic full-frame icy-blue studio portrait (upload face 100% match), soft cool lighting, dreamy ambience, flowing hair over shoulders, natural dewy makeup, pink-coral lips & cheeks, calm dreamy eyes looking into camera; elegant seated pose on white block, right hand supporting chin, graceful forward lean; wearing pale icy-blue/periwinkle tulle-lace mini dress with layered voluminous skirt, sheer neckline; gray knitted leg warmers to knees, metallic silver flats; thin ring with pale-blue/clear gemstone on right hand; icy blue/white illuminated backdrop, key light upper left, subtle right-side shadow, halo glow around head & shoulders, photorealistic 8K cinematic texture, fashion-editorial softness & sharp details.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764581505_2fe877e10e4c.png', NULL, '[\"IcyBluePortrait\",\"CinematicGlamour\",\"UltraRealisticArt\",\"EditorialAesthetic\",\"CoolToneBeauty\",\"DreamyPortrait\",\"FashionMuse\",\"PicPoseStyle\",\"8KPhotography\",\"StudioPortraitMagic\",\"TulleLaceDress\",\"SoftLightingArt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-01 09:31:45', NULL, 0, 0),
(316, 'Frozen Echoes of Silence', 17, 'A sorrowful figure trapped in crystalline ice, glowing in the void — frozen in time, frozen in emotion.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A man (use uploaded face) fully encased in crystalline ice, hunched forward in a sorrowful, resigned pose, sitting on a large glowing block of translucent ice in a vast, pitch-black frozen void. Ethereal blue-white light radiates from the ice, creating brilliant highlights and soft shadows, while the background remains pure black with faint drifting ice particles.\r\nHe wears a thick long-sleeve jacket, trousers, and sturdy boots — all transformed into shimmering, transparent ice. His messy, swept-back hair is frozen into sharp, spiked icy texture. Hands rest stiffly on his knees; body language expresses exhaustion, isolation, and stoic suffering.\r\nCamera is slightly low-angle, medium-full shot (head to feet), vertical frame. Eye-level perspective with sharp focus on the man and ice block; shallow depth of field fades into darkness. Photorealistic, ultra-detailed ice textures with glowing edges, broken shards around his feet, reflective icy ground.\r\nColor palette: luminous icy blues, whites, steel grays, deep blacks, faint desaturated skin tones. High contrast, no warm colors, dramatic sculptural lighting. Mood: melancholic, isolated, frozen in time — conceptual, cinematic, emotionally heavy.\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764587738_190c5181670e.png', NULL, '[\"FrozenSoul\",\"IceEncased\",\"CinematicVoid\",\"CrystalHuman\",\"FrozenInTime\",\"EmotionalFreeze\",\"IcyAesthetics\",\"DarkConceptArt\",\"PicposeCreation\",\"UltraRealisticArt\",\"MoodyVisuals\",\"AbstractEmotion\",\"GlowingIce\",\"DeepIsolation\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-01 11:15:38', NULL, 0, 0),
(317, 'Dreamy Disney Garden with Akmal', 17, 'Akmal enjoying a warm, ultra-realistic Disney-style moment with Mickey, Donald, and Goofy in a pastel, dreamy castle garden.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Realistic photo of Ajoy sitting on a bench in a Disney-style castle garden, wearing a pastel-colored sweatshirt and jeans, holding a coffee cup with Mickey Mouse, Donald Duck, and Goofy standing beside him laughing. Soft daylight with colorful flowers around — photo looks warm, dreamy, and ultra-HD realistic\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764588120_45a55a800be8.png', NULL, '[\"DisneyMagic\",\"AjoyInWonderland\",\"DreamyGarden\",\"UltraHDRealism\",\"DisneyStylePhoto\",\"PastelVibes\",\"PicposeEdit\",\"MagicCastleGarden\",\"MickeyDonaldGoofy\",\"FantasyPortrait\",\"AIRealism\",\"WhimsicalScene\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-01 11:22:00', NULL, 0, 0),
(318, 'The Vulture Guardian of the Ruins', 17, 'A hyper-real cinematic portrait of a young warrior resting on ancient steampunk rubble beside a majestic Bearded Vulture mech-beast — raw, detailed, and ultra-realistic.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-detail, hyper-realistic, super cinematic 9:16 ratio. A young man (face and hair 100% reference) with a fur collar jacket, black t-shirt, beige cargo pants, half gloves, Timberland boots, sitting on the rubble of an old mossy steampunk machine. Next to it is a giant Bearded Vulture monster bird with a retro-futuristic mechanical helmet, small cables, metal panels, and a stunning wing detail.\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764652595_d224ee6f788e.png', NULL, '[\"Picpose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"SteampunkVibes\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"UltraDetail\",\"MechBeast\",\"BeardedVulture\",\"FantasyArt\",\"CinematicEdit\",\"9x16Art\",\"DigitalArtMagic\",\"AIArtCreation\",\"EpicVisuals\",\"FuturisticFantasy\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-02 05:16:35', NULL, 0, 0),
(319, 'Golden Garden Portrait Glow', 17, 'Ultra-realistic DSLR shot with natural rim-light, dreamy bokeh leaves, and vibrant hanging flowers — featuring your exact face in a serene garden moment.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic DSLR portrait of me (use uploaded face 100% accuracy), seated on tree dali, leaning dali, legs on another dali, looking towards to viewer, front camera shot, from front shit some leaves are blurred by DSLR-quality lens blur, outdoors in a lush green garden. Soft sunlight filters through the trees, creating golden rim-light on my face. Bright flowers in blue, pink, and yellow hang above me.\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764652857_e76bb07aa236.png', NULL, '[\"Picpose\",\"UltraRealisticPortrait\",\"DSLRQuality\",\"GardenPhotography\",\"GoldenHourGlow\",\"BokehMagic\",\"NaturePortrait\",\"AestheticVibes\",\"CreativeShoot\",\"AIPhotography\",\"PicposeStudio\",\"DreamyPortrait\",\"OutdoorShoot\",\"HDDetail\",\"lensblureffect\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-02 05:20:57', NULL, 0, 0),
(320, 'Emerald Serenity on Stone Steps', 18, 'A fine art top-down portrait blending traditional elegance, rich teal tones, and serene natural beauty — featuring the same face as reference.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Fine art photography capturing a young woman in a traditional green floral blouse and cream skirt seated on stone steps. She wears gold jewelry and her wavy dark hair cascades. A turquoise water body and lush greenery are in the background. The top-down perspective features rich deep teal tones, soft contrast, and saturation. Face should be same as reference photo.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764653490_061724368f78.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"FineArtPortrait\",\"TopDownShot\",\"EmeraldAesthetic\",\"TraditionalLook\",\"ArtisticPhotography\",\"TealTones\",\"ElegantVibes\",\"CreativePortraits\",\"AIPhotoArt\",\"PhotographyInspiration\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-02 05:31:30', NULL, 0, 0),
(321, 'Shadowed Serenity: The Echo of Silent Peaks', 18, 'A hyper-realistic fusion of a lifelike female portrait and a cold, surreal East Asian mountainscape wrapped in fog, shadows, and haunting stillness.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a dark, hyper-realistic surreal composition combining a lifelike female (upload image)  portrait with a shadowy East Asian mountain landscape.\r\nTop-right: ultra-realistic side-profile of a young woman(upload image) facing right, dim cold lighting, pale smooth skin with subtle glossy highlights, deep reflective eyes, jet-black hair slicked back, high black coat collar blending seamlessly into the surrounding darkness.\r\nBottom left: ominous, realistic mountain cliffs covered in dense black conifer forests, heavy fog crawling across the slopes, deep shadows, high contrast.\r\nOn a narrow cliff stands a small solitary female figure in a long flowing robe, facing the vast landscape; beside her, an ancient twisted bonsai tree leaning over the edge.\r\nBelow: dark reflective water with jagged rocks emerging, rendered with fine realistic texture.\r\nCold monochrome palette: black, charcoal gray, steel blue, faint desaturated gold on the distant horizon.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764653534_a0ca4d7b7f8c.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"SurrealArt\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"DarkFantasyArt\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"MoodyAesthetics\",\"FantasyLandscape\",\"AsianMountains\",\"FoggyVibes\",\"MysticShadows\",\"CreativeImaging\",\"ultrarealism\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-02 05:32:14', NULL, 0, 0),
(322, 'Urban Duke Rider – Hyper-Realistic Cinematic Portrait', 17, 'A stylish full-body shot of a young man sitting confidently on a KTM Duke 250 with ultra-HD realism, vibrant tones, and a softly blurred urban backdrop. (Reference face supported)\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Cinematic, hyper-realistic full-body portrait of a stylish young man sitting on a KTM Duke 250 bike in the middle of an urban street. He is wearing a plain oversized red t-shirt, ripped grey jeans, and white sneakers. A black wristwatch is visible on his left wrist. A black helmet is placed on the bike\'s fuel tank. The background is softly blurred with buildings and trees, giving focus on the subject and bike. Natural daylight, sharp details, vibrant colors, ultra HD, 16k quality, realistic photography style.use reference face.\r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764663704_b20b22b5e7f4.png', NULL, '[\"Picpose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"UrbanRider\",\"KTM250\",\"FullBodyShot\",\"UltraHD\",\"16KQuality\",\"StreetPhotographyStyle\",\"MensFashionPortrait\",\"RealisticArt\",\"BikePhotography\",\"ReferenceFace\",\"CreativePortrait\",\"DigitalArtPrompt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-02 08:21:44', NULL, 0, 0),
(323, 'Enchanted Christmas Tree Queen Portrait', 18, 'A magical, ultra-realistic 8K fantasy Christmas transformation featuring a stunning pine-leaf gown, glowing fairy lights, and a dreamy snowy sunset ambiance — with the original face preserved flawlessly.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Transform the uploaded photo into a magical Christmas-themed fantasy portrait.\r\nKeep the same face, same features, and same identity from the uploaded image.\r\nCreate a hyper-realistic full-body scene where the person is wearing a stunning Christmas tree gown made of lush green pine leaves, red poinsettia flowers, glowing warm fairy lights, and elegant red ribbons.\r\nPlace the person inside a large circular Christmas wreath decorated with poinsettias, ribbons, berries, and golden lights.\r\nBackground should be a snowy winter landscape during sunset with soft falling snow.\r\nLighting should be cinematic, dreamy, soft, and warm.\r\nSkin tone, facial details, and hair from the uploaded image must remain realistic and unchanged.\r\nMake the final image ultra-realistic, 8K quality, festive, elegant, and magical.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764664480_f26acb4b3aca.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseMagic\",\"ChristmasQueen\",\"FantasyPortrait\",\"HolidayAesthetic\",\"8KRealism\",\"ChristmasPhotography\",\"FantasyEdit\",\"WinterWonderland\",\"HolidayVibes\",\"FestiveArt\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"CreativePortrait\",\"AIArtMagic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-02 08:34:40', NULL, 0, 1),
(324, 'Emerald Showgirl Glamour Transformation', 18, 'Ultra-Realistic Stage Performer Makeover with Luxurious Green Feathers, Crystals & Spotlight Drama\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic DSLR-quality portrait of a haunting young woman kneeling on one knee on the cracked deck of a ghostly shipwreck on a foggy ocean at night, her head tilted slightly upward toward the glowing moon. Dim moonlight reflects off misty waves, and tattered sails flutter in the wind. Her wet-look wavy hair has dark teal and black streaks, strands drifting as if underwater. She wears a layered flowing gown in dark teal and black, shredded at the ends to resemble sea foam, with a corset-style bodice and sheer trailing sleeves floating softly around her. Silver and pearl jewelry, including delicate anklets, complete her look. One hand presses gently against the deck while the other is lifted slightly near her chest, her gaze haunting and alluring. Dramatic cinematic lighting emphasizes the fog, flowing fabrics, wet hair texture, and ethereal maritime gothic atmosphere.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764667357_e8b8ed5e4a9b.png', NULL, '[\"EmeraldShowgirl\",\"GlamMakeover\",\"StagePerformerEdit\",\"FeatherCostume\",\"UltraRealisticPortrait\",\"ShowgirlTransformation\",\"LuxuryFashionEdit\",\"GreenGlamour\",\"CrystalCorset\",\"SpotlightPhotography\",\"FashionArtistry\",\"AIPhotoEdit\",\"PicposeMagic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-02 09:22:37', NULL, 0, 1),
(325, 'Emerald Showgirl Glam Transformation', 18, 'A luxurious, ultra-realistic stage-performer makeover with emerald feathers, crystal couture, cinematic lights & PicPose branding.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Transform the uploaded person into a glamorous showgirl / stage performer wearing an emerald-green luxury costume.\r\nGive them a sparkling, deep-green embellished corset dress with crystal beadwork and thigh-high slit.\r\nAdd large dramatic green feather sleeves and a grand feathered headpiece matching the costume.\r\nPut the person in golden high-heel stage shoes.\r\nAdd elegant diamond jewelry: necklace, earrings, and crown-like tiara.\r\nLighting should be cinematic and studio-stage style with glowing spotlights, bokeh lights, and dramatic green highlights.\r\nMaintain the person’s facial features exactly, but beautify lightly (makeup, smooth skin, enhanced stage look).\r\nHighly detailed, ultra-realistic, glamorous, full-body portrait, symmetrical pose, professional fashion photoshoot style.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764667755_f04bd7cfc014.png', NULL, '[\"EmeraldShowgirl\",\"StagePerformerEdit\",\"PicPoseMagic\",\"GlamourTransformation\",\"UltraRealisticPortrait\",\"ShowgirlMakeover\",\"FeatherCouture\",\"CrystalCorset\",\"StudioCinematicLook\",\"AIPhotoEdit\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-02 09:29:15', NULL, 0, 1),
(326, 'Urban Varsity Vibes', 17, 'A confident street-style portrait blending modern architecture, relaxed posing, and sleek varsity fashion — created using the user’s real face with PicPose signature styling.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A slimbody asian man “Use my uploaded image1, keeping my exact real face, skin tone and facial features unchanged.” sitting casually on a modern wooden bench in an urban outdoor setting, wearing a black and yellow UST varsity jacket see attached image2. white trouser, He’s sporting vibrant Black sneakers that stand out against the monochrome outfit and is wearing dark sunglasses and white hat, exuding confidence and cool modern street style. He holds a can of Coca Cola in one hand, resting his elbows casually on his knees. A black smartwatch is visible on his wrist. The background features modern architecture with glass and concrete structures, a clean minimalist plaza, and soft daylight casting natural shadows. The overall mood is relaxed, confident, and effortlessly fashionable — perfect for a lifestyle or streetwear editorial photo.\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764668827_8625aff59110.png', NULL, '[\"UrbanStyle\",\"VarsityLook\",\"AsianModelVibes\",\"StreetwearEditorial\",\"LifestyleShoot\",\"USTJacket\",\"PicposeCreation\",\"ModernAesthetic\",\"FashionPortrait\",\"CinematicStyle\",\"AIPhotoEdits\",\"StreetFashionVibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-02 09:47:07', NULL, 0, 1),
(327, 'Golden Star Moment – Ultra-Realistic Christmas Frame', 27, 'A magical 8K cinematic close-up of a man placing a glowing golden Christmas star on a frosted pine tree, captured in dramatic low-key lighting with soft snowfall and lifelike detail.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic 8K close-up film of a man (use uploaded photo don\'t alter the face) reaching up to place a glowing, intricate golden Christmas tree star on the top of a heavily frosted pine tree. The camera focuses on his hand and the star, capturing the fine detail of the star\'s texture and the light reflecting in his eyes. Shot in cinematic, dramatic low-key lighting, soft snowfall outside a window in the background. Highly detailed, unique composition, natural fibers, creative focus pull, no 3D, no cartoon, 70mm film\r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764669219_6b8ec7fafa66.png', NULL, '[\"Picpose\",\"ChristmasStar\",\"Cinematic8K\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"GoldenGlow\",\"FrostedTree\",\"FilmLook70mm\",\"WinterMagic\",\"CloseUpShot\",\"CreativeLighting\",\"SnowfallVibes\",\"HolidayPortrait\",\"RealisticEdit\",\"PhotographyAI\",\"FestiveFrame\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-02 09:53:39', NULL, 0, 0),
(328, 'Desert King of Strength', 27, 'A cinematic 8K ultra-realistic desert portrait featuring a powerful man, a majestic falcon, and a vigilant puma — captured in golden-hour perfection with authentic textures and volumetric light.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A majestic, ultra-realistic 8K cinematic photograph of a strong, muscular man (Upload face as reference) standing bare-chested in a vast golden desert during sunset. He wears flowing blue-grey trousers with natural fringe, a dark brown leather falconry glove on one arm, and a gleaming gold medallion that catches the warm light. His posture is confident and heroic, exuding timeless strength and calm authority.\r\nA real falcon perches on his extended gloved arm, wings fully spread, its feathers detailed and naturally illuminated by the golden-hour sun. Beside him, a real puma stands alert, muscles tensed, its fur catching the warm glow of the fading light. Both animals appear completely lifelike and physically present, interacting naturally with the man and environment.\r\nThe scene unfolds across sun-drenched dunes and faintly hazy distant mountains, bathed in the soft, cinematic radiance of late-afternoon light. The telephoto lens (85mm, f/2.😎 creates a shallow depth of field, with creamy bokeh that separates the subjects from the gently blurred background.\r\nEvery element — the texture of sand, fabric movement, animal fur, and skin tone — is rendered as authentically photographed, not stylized. The atmosphere feels cinematic yet grounded, with rich tones and volumetric light scattering through the desert air.\r\nThe composition evokes the grandeur of a Roger Deakins desert sequence combined with the portrait intimacy of Annie Leibovitz, shot on a real location with natural sunlight and a high-end cinema camera for true photographic realism.\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764670679_603e6bd2b5dc.png', NULL, '[\"Picpose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"DesertWarrior\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"8KPhotography\",\"GoldenHourMagic\",\"FalconryVibes\",\"PowerfulAesthetics\",\"WildlifeCompanion\",\"RealisticAIArt\",\"EpicVisuals\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"MajesticShots\",\"PhotoRealRender\",\"TimelessStrength\",\"DesertCinematics\",\"CreativeAI\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-02 10:17:59', NULL, 0, 0),
(329, '📝 Step-by-Step Guide: 1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini 2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷  3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 27, 'Two-pose combined cinematic portrait of a confident young boy in a dark room, grey studio background, striped shirt, silver chain, smartwatch, and Picpose branding.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic portrait of a young boy posing confidently bed dark room with a plain grey studio background. He is wearing a vertical black-and-grey striped collared shirt, unbuttoned halfway to reveal his chest. A thin silver chain with a black vertical pendant rests naturally., smartwatch on his wrist, and has the same hairstyle as the reference boy. Instead of one pose, show two combine dynamic style Here are two combined dynamic styles of the\r\nthe man has the same face, hairstyle, and beard.\r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764674659_7eeefb89e635.png', NULL, '[\"PicposePortrait\",\"DynamicStudioShot\",\"UltraRealisticEdit\",\"DualPosePortrait\",\"AIPhotoCreation\",\"CinematicLook\",\"StudioBackground\",\"HighDetailPortrait\",\"FashionPose\",\"AIArtDesign\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-02 11:24:19', NULL, 0, 1);
