(330, 'Tiffany Bloomed Elegance', 18, 'A curvy bridal queen draped in all-white artistry, glowing under a rose-themed Tiffany dreamscape with powerful cinematic grace.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a cinematic scene of a curvy and stunning, light-skinned young woman wearing a dramatic all-white look with Tiffany in gradient, standing under a large white rose-themed umbrella and Tiffany in gradient. Your dress is richly designed with details. She has a striking expression, looking straight into the camera with an intense gaze. Your average black hair is styled into a bridal bun. She wears vibrant red lipstick, long lashes, light makeup and pearl jewelry around her neck and both wrists, including a prominent ring. The background is an intense and engaging White and Tiffany, filled with more exuberant White and Tiffany strips and large elements of soft white roses and Tiffany, creating a dreamy, romantic and slightly intense atmosphere. The lighting is dramatic, highlighting the textures and placement of the white and Tiffany elements in gradient. She is plus zise, curvy, and stands 5\'5\". Keep your facial features the same.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764737228_8146d43d4c34.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseCreation\",\"TiffanyAesthetic\",\"WhiteFantasyArt\",\"BridalGlamourLook\",\"CurvyCinematicPortrait\",\"UltraRealisticBeauty\",\"RoseUmbrellaTheme\",\"PearlJewelryElegance\",\"GradientTiffanyVibes\",\"CinematicAIArt\",\"PlusSizeQueen\",\"DreamyVisuals\",\"AestheticPhotography\",\"AIArtistryMagic\",\"FashionEditorialLook\",\"HighDetailPortrait\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-03 04:47:08', NULL, 0, 1),
(331, 'Rosy Street Café Elegance', 18, 'A hyperrealistic 8K portrait capturing a floral grey co-ord, teal crop top, luxe gold jewelry, and serene café vibes with PicPose branding.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultrarealistic portrait of a woman with long brown wavy hair, with some blonde highlights.\r\nOUTFIT:\r\ngrey floral blazer and shorts set paired with a teal blue crop top.\r\nDetails\r\nBlazer and Shorts: The matching two-piece set is light grey with a prominent pink and green rose floral print. The blazer is single-breasted with gold-toned buttons and the shorts are high-waisted.\r\nInner Wear: A ruched, strappy teal or turquoise blue crop top is worn underneath the open blazer.\r\nJEWELRY: gold layered necklaces, earrings, rings, bangle, watch\r\nSETTINGS:\r\nSeated in a street cafe. On top of the table, a cup of coffee, a black vase with some red roses with green foliage and tiny white flowers.\r\nNatural lightning.\r\nUltra detailed, Photorealistic,hyperrealistic, high quality, high resolution 8k. Half body shot.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764737643_7799c04f22ff.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"StreetCafePortrait\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"8KPortrait\",\"FloralBlazerSet\",\"TealCropTop\",\"HyperrealisticArt\",\"PhotorealisticImage\",\"FashionPortrait\",\"ElegantLook\",\"CafeAesthetic\",\"GoldJewelryVibes\",\"HighQualityRender\",\"DigitalPortraitArt\",\"CinematicShot\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-03 04:54:03', NULL, 0, 0),
(332, 'Emerald Fury: Rise of the Abyss Queen', 27, 'A hyper-realistic dark-fantasy cinematic artwork where a fierce young warrior confronts a colossal kraken amid a vortex of gold, power, and mystery — finished with a refined PicPose signature.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Close-up Hyper-realistic cinematic dark fantasy conceptual art with dramatic chiaroscuro lighting, depicting a full-body provocative fighting pose of a young woman with streaked dark hair and an emerald two-piece swimsuit alongside a colossal kraken emerging from a whirlpool into an abyssal chasm littered with gold coins, capturing the mysterious and opulent power of the dark fantasy mythology.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764753213_6d03ae2e5468.png', NULL, '[\"EmeraldFury\",\"AbyssQueen\",\"DarkFantasyArt\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"FantasyConceptArt\",\"KrakenAttack\",\"MythologyInspired\",\"EpicFantasyVisuals\",\"ChiaroscuroMagic\",\"PicPoseArt\",\"UltraRealisticArt\",\"FantasyIllustration\",\"DarkMythos\",\"EpicHeroine\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-03 09:13:33', NULL, 0, 0),
(333, 'Apple Orchard Serenity', 18, 'A photorealistic, warm golden-hour portrait capturing a preserved-face character harvesting apples in a lush orchard with a soft, wholesome atmosphere — complete with a subtle PicPose logo touch.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A photorealistic image of a person with the user\'s preserved face, featuring brown hair styled in a messy bun with a few delicate strands framing her face, with closed lips and looking directly at the camera. The person is wearing a pale pink button-up shirt and classic blue denim overalls. She is standing amidst an abundant apple orchard, her right arm gently raised towards a branch laden with vibrant red apples, while her left hand holds a rustic wicker basket filled to the brim with freshly picked red apples. The background features rows of lush apple trees stretching into the distance, with bright, warm sunlight filtering through the leaves, creating dappled light and a warm, inviting atmosphere. The lighting is natural and radiant, emphasizing the rich red of the apples and the fresh green of the foliage, with soft, golden hour tones. The overall mood is fresh, wholesome, and idyllic.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764755519_f98b93aa5500.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"AppleOrchard\",\"GoldenHourGlow\",\"FreshHarvestVibes\",\"AestheticPortrait\",\"MessyBunLook\",\"OutdoorPhotographyStyle\",\"UltraRealisticArt\",\"WarmNatureMood\",\"CreativeAIArt\",\"NaturalLightMagic\",\"IdyllicScene\",\"SoftAesthetic\",\"PhotoRealisticPortrait\",\"aiphotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-03 09:51:59', NULL, 0, 0),
(334, 'Drip Santa Luxe Portrait', 27, 'A hyper-realistic 8K full-body portrayal of a modern Hypebeast Santa in streetwear, surrounded by gifts, money bags, and festive chaos—while keeping the original face unchanged.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Craft an exceptionally lifelike portrait of an attractive man embodying the essence of “Drip Santa” or “Hypebeast Santa,” presenting a contemporary street-style rendition of the classic figure.  \r\nAttire:\r\n-crimson Santa hat and stylish sunglasses.  -A white undershirt or hoodie. \r\n-A crimson zip-up hoodie layered over the ivory shirt.  \r\n-Crimson cargo trousers. \r\n-The white sneakers in question exhibit characteristics of a low-top, classic court-style shoe, potentially designed to evoke the aesthetic of well-known models such as the Nike Air Force 1 or a comparable design.  Adorns oneself with an oversized silver necklace and substantial silver rings.  He is outdoors in the garden, seated in a chair with his legs crossed.  He is grasping a bottle of champagne.  A multitude of gifts strewn across the ground, two deep crimson sacks brimming with toys, and a verdant sack teeming with bills.  Upon the table lies a considerable assortment of stacked gifts, with a ginger cat leisurely reclining atop the collection.  Natural lightning.  Exquisitely detailed, exceptionally lifelike, superior quality, high-resolution 8k, complete body depiction.  Please refrain from modifying the reference face.\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764761102_6fb367157790.png', NULL, '[\"DripSanta\",\"HypebeastSanta\",\"StreetStyleSanta\",\"8KPortrait\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"ModernSanta\",\"ChristmasDrip\",\"FestiveVibes\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"SantaAesthetic\",\"LuxurySanta\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"HolidayFashion\",\"AIArtPrompt\",\"realistic\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-03 11:25:02', NULL, 0, 0),
(335, 'Merry Christmas Fusion Portrait', 27, 'Stop-Motion Magic Meets Photorealistic Realism in a Festive Holiday Composition\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a festive Christmas scene centered around a large “MERRY CHRISTMAS” sign made entirely of colorful Christmas gift wrap—wrapping paper textures, ribbons, bows, folds, and shine clearly visible. The sign is bold, three-dimensional, and the primary focal point.\r\nThe uploaded images are the main subjects and are positioned around the sign.\r\n⚠️ IMPORTANT STYLE RULE (STRICT):\r\nThe SECOND uploaded photo must remain 100% photo-realistic and strictly identical to the original image.\r\nDo NOT change facial features, skin texture, lighting, expression, pose, clothing, or proportions.\r\nDo NOT convert the second image into cartoon, stop-motion, clay, or animation style.\r\nThe result must look like the exact original photograph, seamlessly composited into the scene.\r\n🎄 Other uploaded images (except the second photo):\r\nConvert into stop-motion / claymation animation characters\r\nHandcrafted look with soft textures, slight exaggeration, and festive poses\r\nMaintain recognizable likeness while clearly animated\r\nComposition:\r\nThe photorealistic second subject should stand out naturally among the animated characters without alteration\r\nAll characters surround the Merry Christmas sign in a celebratory arrangement\r\nSnow-covered ground, Christmas lights, ornaments, gift boxes, candy canes\r\nLighting & Mood:\r\nCinematic Christmas lighting\r\nWarm golden lights reflecting off snow and gift wrap\r\nCozy, joyful, magical holiday atmosphere\r\nQuality & Output:\r\nUltra-high resolution\r\nSharp focus\r\nClean compositing between photorealistic and stop-motion elements\r\nFestive red, green, gold, and white color palette.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, professional “PicPose” logo/seal at the bottom-left corner with light opacity and proper padding, elegant but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764823953_c3ddd6a292c1.png', NULL, '[\"MerryChristmasArt\",\"FestivePortrait\",\"StopMotionStyle\",\"ClaymationVibes\",\"PhotoRealisticEdit\",\"ChristmasAesthetic\",\"HolidayMagic\",\"CreativeCompositing\",\"PicPoseEdit\",\"ChristmasFantasy\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"AIArtPrompt\",\"ChristmasVibes\",\"HolidaySeasonArt\",\"FestiveCreation\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-04 04:52:33', NULL, 0, 0),
(336, 'Floral Ombre Couture Queen', 27, 'A surreal ultra-realistic fashion portrait blending dramatic haute-couture ombré elegance with floating calla-lily artistry — your face preserved exactly as it is, transformed into a magazine-cover masterpiece with a soft PicPose signature.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', '* Estilo e Vestuário: A mulher está vestindo um vestido de alta costura dramático com um decote coração ou tomara que caia. A peça é uma obra de arte em ombré, com a cor do corpete e da parte superior da saia em rosa pálido/claro, que transiciona gradualmente para tons de rosa mais escuros, magenta/bordô intenso e, finalmente, preto profundo nas camadas inferiores.\r\n* Detalhes da Saia: A saia é extremamente volumosa e texturizada, composta por camadas e camadas de babados e formas que se assemelham a pétalas em ondas esculturais.\r\n* Mangas: Ela usa mangas curtas e volumosas nos ombros, feitas do mesmo material franzido em tons de rosa.\r\n* Acessórios:\r\n* Chapéu: Um chapéu de abas largas (floppy hat) em um tom de rosa pálido, que ela segura delicadamente com a mão direita, cobrindo parte do seu rosto.\r\n* Sapatos: Sapatos de salto alto (scarpin) em rosa bebê/pálido que complementam o topo do vestido.\r\n* Joias: Brincos longos e discretos são visíveis.\r\n* Pose e Expressão: Ela tem uma pose de modelo, com a perna direita estendida e o corpo levemente inclinado. Sua expressão é misteriosa e sofisticada, com a metade superior do rosto escondida pela aba do chapéu.\r\n🌷 Elemento Botânico Estilizado\r\n* Aparência: À direita da figura, há um arranjo de lírios-calla (copos-de-leite) gigantes e altamente estilizados.\r\n* Cores: As espatas (pétalas) são de um tom vibrante de rosa intenso nas bordas externas, com o interior da flor em rosa pálido/quase branco, criando um efeito ombré dentro de cada flor.\r\n* Composição: O arranjo é alto e esguio, com os caules invisíveis ou subentendidos, dando a impressão de que as flores estão flutuando ou brotando do chão.\r\n🎨 Contexto e Cenário\r\n* Iluminação: A iluminação é suave, difusa e de estúdio, com luz caindo de cima para acentuar as dobras e a textura do vestido e das flores.\r\n* Fundo: O fundo é um cinza sólido e neutro, sem detalhes, o que garante que o foco permaneça inteiramente na figura e no arranjo floral.\r\n* Qualidade: A imagem possui uma qualidade digital impecável e um alto nível de detalhes, com a textura do tecido e a suavidade das pétalas sendo representadas de forma fotorrealista.\r\nA imagem transmite uma sensação de drama, elegância surreal e fantasia floral, como uma capa de revista de moda transformada em uma obra de arte digital.\r\nUsando a minha imagem crie uma foto 100% ultrarrealistas sem mudar meu rosto eas minhas características.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764824278_8d6221a13613.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"UltraRealisticArt\",\"HighFashionPortrait\",\"CoutureElegance\",\"OmbreGown\",\"FloralFantasy\",\"DigitalHauteCouture\",\"SurrealFashion\",\"ModelPose\",\"LuxuryEditorial\",\"ArtisticPortrait\",\"callalilydesign\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-04 04:57:58', NULL, 0, 0),
(337, 'Garden Muse of Golden Hour Elegance', 18, 'An ultra-realistic 8K portrait capturing serene beauty, soft bokeh, and timeless DSLR-grade aesthetics in a flower-laden garden setting.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create Ultra-realistic portrait of a young woman (upload image)in an elegant garden, captured with full-frame DSLR, 85mm lens, f/1.4, shallow depth of field, cinematic lighting.\r\nA beautiful young woman (upload image) with fair smooth skin and delicate facial features leans gently on an ornate stone balustrade overflowing with flowers.\r\nShe looks directly at the camera with an intense, calm, slightly melancholic expression.\r\nHer hair flows naturally over her shoulders, softly lifted by her right hand as if adjusting it from the breeze.\r\nShe wears a flowing ivory-white or pale blue sleeveless dress made of soft satin or thin silk, natural draping and realistic texture.\r\nForeground: vibrant flowers in pink, magenta, and lavender tones (impatiens, petunia, or small roses) cascading from the stone structure.\r\nHer right hand gently touches a pink flower petal.\r\nBackground: softly blurred classical villa or greenhouse windows on the right; deep green foliage on the left creating natural vignette.\r\nSmall purple and pink flowers scattered on the grass below.\r\nLighting is soft golden-hour illumination from the left, creating natural skin glow and gentle highlights on her dress and hair.\r\nHyper-realistic skin texture, natural colors, realistic shadows, lifelike depth, 8k photo, ultra-detailed, soft bokeh, high dynamic range, award-winning photography style, no painting effect.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764824981_5077ad63442b.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"UltraRealisticPortrait\",\"8KPhotography\",\"GoldenHourGlow\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"DSLRQuality\",\"GardenAesthetic\",\"ElegantPortrait\",\"SoftBokeh\",\"HyperRealism\",\"NatureBeauty\",\"FlowerPortrait\",\"PremiumArt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-04 05:09:41', NULL, 0, 0),
(338, 'Tri-Persona 2026: The Iconic Man Collage', 32, 'A Hyper-Realistic 4K Photo Poster Featuring Three Dynamic Poses of the Same Man — Ultra-Detailed, Smokey ‘Coming Soon 2026’ Cinematic Aesthetic.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a hyper-realistic 4K photo poster collage featuring the same man from the provided reference image, keeping his face 100% identical with no alterations. Include three poses: (1) an intense close-up portrait, (2) a relaxed full-body pose, and a turning side-profile shot. The man wears a navy-blue 9 Heather jacket, a white T-shirt, jeans, and white sneakers.Arrange all three poses in a layered collage composition over a smokey \"2026 Coming soon\"background dark smoke Movie poster\r\nOn-image Signature: Top-right — “AI PROMPT BY PicPose Creation” (bold silver-foil signature, extra-bold emphasis on Meatla Creation, luxury metallic shine, elegant calligraphy, high-visibility, soft reflective chrome look, premium embossed finish)\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764831584_a797aa7a9e65.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseCreation\",\"4KPoster\",\"HyperRealisticArt\",\"MalePortrait\",\"MoviePosterStyle\",\"CollageDesign\",\"2026ComingSoon\",\"PhotoRealistic\",\"AIArtPrompt\",\"LuxurySignature\",\"SmokeyBackdrop\",\"FashionPortrait\",\"HeatherJacketLook\",\"CinematicPoster\",\"UltraHDDesign\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-04 06:59:44', NULL, 0, 2),
(339, 'Seaside Roses & Retro Moments', 18, 'A vibrant outdoor lifestyle portrait capturing a joyful young woman in red, surrounded by seagulls, roses, serene waters, and nostalgic vintage vibes — finished with a clean PicPose signature.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a realistic portrait (100% like the face), High-quality A vibrant and atmospheric outdoor lifestyle portrait of a young woman sitting by a body of water, surrounded by seagulls, holding a bouquet of roses and a vintage camera. The image has a lively and slightly nostalgic feel.\r\n* Subject: A young woman shown from the back and looking smiling at the camera , and side profile, seated on the edge of a body of water.\r\n* Pose: She is sitting with her legs bent, facing away from the camera and looking out towards the water. Her head is slightly tilted, and she appears relaxed.\r\n* Props Held: She is holding a vibrant bouquet of red roses in her lap/arms, and a retro-style orange camera with a strap in her left hand.\r\n* Emotion/Mood: Contemplative, relaxed, joyful, and appreciative of the scenery.\r\n* Top: A bright red long-sleeved sweatshirt or sweater, creating a strong color statement.\r\n* Bottom: Loose-fitting black and white plaid trousers or a wide-leg skirt, adding a fashionable, slightly quirky element.\r\n* Footwear: Bright red sneakers with a white \'N\' logo (New Balance style).\r\n* Headwear: A red baseball cap worn backwards, with white over-ear headphones worn over the cap.\r\n* Aesthetic: Casual, vibrant, fashionable, and slightly sporty.\r\n* Location: The edge of a large body of water (likely a lake or calm sea). The water is a deep blue.\r\n* Wildlife: Numerous white seagulls are visible on the water and flying in the air, with one prominent bird in flight overhead, adding a dynamic natural element.\r\n* Background: A hazy or slightly foggy distant shore with faint mountains or hills under a bright sky, suggesting a wide, open landscape.\r\n* Lighting: Bright, natural daylight, creating clear visibility and vibrant colors.\r\n* Mood: Serene, joyful, picturesque, and slightly adventurous.\r\n* Outdoor lifestyle, young woman, red outfit, plaid trousers, red sneakers, red baseball cap, white headphones, seagulls, lake, sea, red roses, vintage camera, vibrant, natural, serene, joyful, contemplative, East Asian.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764832787_4e75149d458d.png', NULL, '[\"SeasidePortrait\",\"PicPoseStyle\",\"OutdoorLifestyle\",\"RetroVibes\",\"RedAesthetic\",\"WaterfrontMood\",\"RealisticPortrait\",\"VintageCameraLook\",\"RosesAndWaves\",\"SeagullScene\",\"EastAsianStyle\",\"TravelVibes\",\"NatureAndFashion\",\"UltraHDPortrait\",\"CreativePhotographyPrompt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-04 07:19:47', NULL, 0, 1),
(340, 'Crimson Gearblade Sentinel', 28, 'An ultra-realistic steampunk warrior poised in a cinematic industrial workshop, glowing with power and precision.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A highly detailed steampunk warrior crouching in a dramatic pose inside an industrial workshop filled with gears, pipes, and glowing machinery. The character wears a deep red armored outfit with brass and copper mechanical elements, knee guards, and gauntlets. A katana with a red handle is strapped across the back. The warrior has stylishly groomed hair, a trimmed beard, and vintage round brass goggles with glowing lenses. Steam rises from the ground, creating a cinematic, atmospheric mood. Warm industrial lighting, bokeh lights in the background, ultra-realistic textures, dramatic shadows, high-detail steampunk style, 4K.\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764834131_ff552880912e.png', NULL, '[\"SteampunkWarrior\",\"GearbladeSentinel\",\"IndustrialAesthetic\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"SteamPunkStyle\",\"UltraRealisticArt\",\"4KArtwork\",\"DarkWorkshopVibes\",\"MechanicalSamurai\",\"picposebranding\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-04 07:42:11', NULL, 0, 0),
(341, 'Golden Neo-Warrior: Salman Khan Futuristic Saga', 27, 'A hyper-realistic 8K anime-inspired portrait of Salman Khan as a golden-armored futuristic warrior with glowing neon blue eyes, cinematic lighting, swirling energy aura, and a powerful heroic stance set in a sci-fi India — with Picpose branding lightly placed at the bottom-left.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Salman Khan as a futuristic anime warrior, golden armor, glowing neon blue eyes, cinematic lighting, hyper-realistic 8K, dramatic background, swirling energy aura, ultra-detailed face textures, powerful heroic pose, sci-fi India setting\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764843242_8b5cd97fab35.png', NULL, '[\"Picpose\",\"SalmanKhanEdit\",\"FuturisticWarrior\",\"AnimeStyle\",\"GoldenArmor\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"8KPortrait\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"NeonBlueEyes\",\"SciFiIndia\",\"EnergyAura\",\"AnimeWarrior\",\"UltraDetailed\",\"AIArtCreation\",\"PicposeEdits\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-04 10:14:02', NULL, 0, 1),
(342, 'Skyfall Street Duo', 27, 'Two young men plummeting through a towering cityscape, captured in a high-energy urban aesthetic with early-2000s streetwear flair — enhanced with PicPose signature branding.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Two young men falling through the sky between tall skyscrapers in a dramatic cityscape view from above. They are wearing early inspired outfits: the first man wears a red football jersey with the number 42, a black cap, oversized dark denim shorts, a belt with a chain, white socks, and chunky black sneakers. The second man wears a red checkered short-sleeve shirt, oversized dark denim shorts with a chain, tan Timberland-style boots, and a camouflage.\r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764847322_a9528234214b.png', NULL, '[\"SkyfallStreetDuo\",\"UrbanFallAesthetic\",\"CityscapeDynamics\",\"StreetwearVibes\",\"AerialSceneArt\",\"PicposeCreation\",\"HyperRealismAI\",\"UrbanMotionShot\",\"DramaticDropScene\",\"HighEnergyPortrait\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-04 11:22:02', NULL, 0, 0),
(343, 'Climb of Fury: The Eagle Assault', 17, 'A hyper-realistic, high-tension mountain climb interrupted by a chaotic aerial ambush of furious hawks and eagles — complete with dust, wind, motion blur, and PicPose branding.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a dynamic, highly realistic scene of a young man climbing a steep mountain. As he climbs, a large flock of angry eagles/hawks suddenly bursts into the sky, flying chaotically around him and aggressively attacking. Show powerful wings, sharp motion blur, and dramatic tension in the scene. The man looks shocked but determined while holding onto the rocky mountain. Add flying dust, wind effects, and a dramatic cloudy sky for a powerful atmosphere.\r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764998729_36683d3e89c6.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"MountainClimb\",\"EagleAttack\",\"HyperRealisticArt\",\"DynamicScene\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"CinematicArt\",\"ActionShot\",\"EpicVisuals\",\"AIArtPrompt\",\"DramaticLandscape\",\"MotionBlurEffects\",\"AdventureVibes\",\"SurvivalScene\",\"HighDetailArt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-06 05:25:29', NULL, 0, 0),
(344, 'Miniature Vespa Caricature Keychain – Hyper-Realistic Studio Shot', 27, '8K ultra-detailed close-up portrait of a customized caricature keychain featuring a smiling face, vintage yellow Vespa, and premium PicPose branding with cinematic shallow depth of field.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, 8k, highly detailed studio photograph captured with a 50mm prime lens at a wide aperture, showcasing a miniature caricature keychain held prominently in the foreground by a human hand. The composition is a close-up, slightly low-angle shot, with the keychain suspended in the upper center of the frame, creating a shallow depth of field that blurs the background into soft bokeh lights, suggesting an indoor retail environment. The keychain features a silver metal split ring, attached to a dark blue strap with a white geometric pattern and the text \"PicPose \" embossed in white. A short silver chain connects the strap to the main charm: a caricature figure with an oversized head and smaller body, riding a bright yellow vintage-style Vespa scooter. The character wears a yellow knit beanie, a yellow and black striped long-sleeve sweater, blue denim shorts, white socks, and vibrant green high-top sneakers with white laces and soles. The character\'s face uploaded 100% face as reference is rendered in a smiling expression  eyebrows, using uploaded 100% face as reference. The miniature Vespa scooter is meticulously detailed with a brown seat, silver handlebars, mirrors, a glowing headlight, and realistic tires, all rendered with highly detailed texture and a glossy finish. Cinematic lighting illuminates the keychain with soft, even light, emphasizing reflections on the metal and plastic surfaces, while the human hand, with light skin tone, holds the ring between the thumb and forefinger, exhibiting subtle skin texture and natural shadows.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1764999779_7c43d8d96524.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CaricatureKeychain\",\"MiniatureArt\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"8KRender\",\"StudioPhotography\",\"VespaMini\",\"CustomFaceArt\",\"CinematicShot\",\"ShallowDOF\",\"ToyPhotography\",\"Realistic3D\",\"KeychainDesign\",\"ForegroundFocus\",\"ProductPhotography\",\"ArtisticDetail\",\"CrispBokeh\",\"CreativePortrait\",\"PicPoseDesign\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-06 05:42:59', NULL, 0, 0),
(345, '2026 – The Skybound Moment', 17, 'A relaxed cinematic poster of a young man on a dark-blue car roof, pointing toward the sky — captured with 100% facial accuracy and stylish PicPose aesthetics.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A relaxed movie poster featuring a young man (use the uploaded image, ensuring 100%) lying casually on the roof of a dark blue car. He has a messy hair and is dressed in a blue-and-white gardient line shirt over a black t-shirt, black trousers and black chelsi. He is looking up, pointing his right index finger towards the sky while reclining against the car\'s windshield area. Movies name \'2026\'\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765001457_1ed75f44cd39.png', NULL, '[\"2026MoviePoster\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"RelaxedPosterStyle\",\"UrbanCinematic\",\"PicPoseStyle\",\"SkyPointPose\",\"CarRoofShot\",\"UltraRealisticEdit\",\"MoviePosterDesign\",\"creativeaivisuals\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-06 06:10:57', NULL, 0, 0),
(346, 'Enchanted Bloom: Forest Fairy in Pink Tulle', 18, 'A dreamy cinematic portrait of a young woman seated on a moss-covered branch above a tranquil forest stream, wrapped in soft sunlight and fairytale charm — with PicPose branding elegantly placed at the left-bottom.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A photo of a young woman, the main subject, seated gracefully on a moss-covered tree branch that extends horizontally over a gently flowing stream in a lush forest. She wears a vibrant, layered pink tulle dress with a floral-embroidered bodice and matching pink strappy sandals. A flower crown of pink and red blossoms adorns her dark, wavy hair. She holds a small wicker basket overflowing with colorful flowers. The forest background is a tapestry of green hues, with ferns and other foliage lining the stream banks. Sunlight filters through the dense canopy, creating dappled lighting and a soft, ethereal ambiance. The tree branches overhead are covered in moss and small green leaves, adding to the enchanted forest atmosphere. The stream reflects the surrounding greenery, enhancing the sense of depth and tranquility. The camera is positioned at eye level, capturing a medium shot that emphasizes the woman\'s serene expression and the beauty of her surroundings. The overall mood is dreamy and whimsical, evoking a sense of fairytale magic. 4K, HDR, cinematic. No visible crowds, text, or frames.\r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765084837_784c328ec01b.png', NULL, '[\"EnchantedPortrait\",\"ForestFairyVibes\",\"PinkTulleMagic\",\"DreamyCinematicShot\",\"WhimsicalAesthetic\",\"NatureElegance\",\"FloralCrownBeauty\",\"EtherealMood\",\"4KPortrait\",\"HDRPhotography\",\"PicPoseStyle\",\"FantasyArtLook\",\"CinematicFairytale\",\"ForestDreamscape\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-07 05:20:37', NULL, 0, 0),
(347, 'Stormrise of the Kraken: The Human Against the Titan', 17, 'Hyperrealistic cinematic showdown in a storm-torn ocean—where human fragility meets ancient monstrous power.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Hyperrealistic Cinematic Photography, 2:3 ratio, side-angle dynamic frame. A person with a face and hair identical to the reference photo appears mounted on the colossal head of a mythological Kraken, both facing to the right. The scale emphasizes human smallness in front of the monstrous enormity of the Kraken, with perfect integration thanks to the same stormy light and ocean atmosphere\r\nThe human figure wears realistic casual clothes, basic t-shirt, light shirt, watch on the wrist, earphones around the neck, trousers and plain footwear. Her clothes and hair are drenched by the Iluvia and the splashes of the sea, waving violently in the middle of the wind, reinforcing the sense of action and hyperrealism.\r\nThe Kraken, colossal and hyperrealistic, emerges from the ocean with titanic strength: rough and wet skin with realistic textures, monumental suction cups, and gigantic tentacles that soar into the sky, creating a terrifying and majestic spectacle. Water pours down her body as her face appears angled, roaring fiercely, transmitting an unstoppable ancestral power.\r\nThe setting is a raging sea in the midst of a storm: uncommon waves rise around the Kraken, foam and suspended water fill the air, while lightning lights up the scene with dramatic flashes. The movement of the ocean and tentacles generates a cinematic sensation of chaos and grandeur.\r\nThe composition conveys extreme hyperrealism, monumental scale, and epic atmosphere, capturing the exact moment when the Kraken emerges from the depths, creating a brutal and unforgettable spectacle.\r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765085082_13863e41bed5.png', NULL, '[\"KrakenRise\",\"EpicCinematicArt\",\"HyperrealisticFantasy\",\"OceanStormScene\",\"MythicalBeast\",\"DynamicSideAngle\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"EpicScaleVisuals\",\"StormyAtmosphere\",\"FantasyRealism\",\"picposecreation\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-07 05:24:42', NULL, 0, 0),
(348, 'Shell Swing Elegance: PicPose Luxe Portrait', 17, 'Modern architecture ke saamne ek classy, ultra-realistic portrait — asli chehre ko bilkul preserve karte hue premium fashion, cozy vibes aur PicPose branding ke saath.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Buat seorang pria yang elegan [referensi adalah foto yang diupload tanpa merubah wajah aslinya]. Ia mengenakan kemeja abu-abu gelap yang lembut, celana putih, dan sepatu Air Jordan edisi mewah, duduk dengan anggun di ayunan berbentuk kerang yang dihiasi bola-bola putih dan aksen emas sambil memegang segelas kopi panas. Ia memakai kacamata hitam, gelang perak tipis, kalung emas sedikit tebal, dan jam tangan emas, dengan bantal-bantal pastel berbentuk makaroni, rambut sedikit berantakan. Lokasinya berada di depan bangunan modern. Tambahkan logo \'PicPose\' di kiri atas.\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765086995_179bf923ee7d.png', NULL, '[\"PicPosePortrait\",\"LuxeElegance\",\"ModernVibes\",\"ShellSwingAesthetic\",\"AirJordanStyle\",\"CoffeeMood\",\"PastelProps\",\"FashionEditorialLook\",\"RealFacePreserved\",\"CinematicEdit\",\"UltraRealisticPortrait\",\"PremiumAesthetic\",\"PicPoseBranding\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-07 05:56:35', NULL, 0, 0),
(349, 'Rosy Dreamscape Elegance', 18, 'A surreal top-down cinematic portrait capturing serene beauty, flawless makeup, and a blooming red-rose fantasy — with the subject’s original face preserved 100%\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Tanpa merubah bentuk wajah Create close up a sharp, high-resolution large format photo with a 9:16 aspect ratio. Change the style of the character in the photo provided and maintain the correct proportions of the character\'s facial features such as eyes, nose and mouth. The extreme top-down angle creates a surreal photo that focuses on the character\'s face. Only flawless white skin, natural makeup and serene expression are shown. She has smooth, radiant skin with a light blush and long, thin lashes framing her eyes. glam make up with red raddish lips ,sitting nat the middle of red roses flowers field  gazed upward to the camera while  Her hand is hold the hat, shielding her face from the sunlight and other hand hug a big bouquet red roses flowers,   She wears a flowing sparkling gown made of sheer pale dark maroon  overwide tulle. Her hijab is  red styled adorned with  tie, covering vintage overwide hat with maroon bow,The soft sunlight creates shadows on her face, highlighting her delicate features and giving a dreamy, graceful atmosphere. Cinematic style, gentle and expressive,high key lighting, emphasizing beauty, innocence and calmness. By using the extract same face\r\ncopy my face 100%.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765087512_9ddf63bbd269.png', NULL, '[\"RosyDreamscape\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"TopDownShot\",\"SurrealBeauty\",\"FlawlessSkin\",\"NaturalMakeup\",\"RedRosesField\",\"HijabElegance\",\"SparklingGown\",\"MaroonTulle\",\"VintageHatStyle\",\"GlamMakeup\",\"SoftSunlightGlow\",\"DreamyAesthetic\",\"picposesignature\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-07 06:05:12', NULL, 0, 0),
(350, 'Whispers From the Darkroom', 17, 'A Silent Presence… Waiting Just Behind Her.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a cinematic poster.Show the same person from the reference — denim jacket, serious expression — standing in the center of an old abandoned living room, looking over her shoulder with fear and suspicion, as if she senses something behind her. Behind her, looming in the shadows, reveal a terrifying monster with elongated limbs, sharp claws, and a gaping petal-like mouth full of teeth — a demonic creature emerging from the darkness. The creature should be positioned directly behind the character, partially illuminated, creating a sense of imminent danger. Decorate the walls with glowing Christmas lights draped over painted alphabet letters, some flickering, casting eerie neon reflections. Old retro furniture, dusty floors, and a cold blue-tinted atmosphere should fill the room. Color palette: deep blues, cold cyans, subtle red highlights, foggy texture, cinematic shadows. Mood: tense, mysterious, supernatural horror, hyper-realistic details, no text or titles anywhere.\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765089809_7459eb98c1d5.png', NULL, '[\"Picpose\",\"DarkroomMystery\",\"CinematicHorror\",\"SupernaturalThrill\",\"FearInTheShadows\",\"HauntedLivingRoom\",\"HorrorAesthetics\",\"HyperRealisticArt\",\"DemonicCreature\",\"SuspenseVisuals\",\"CinematicPoster\",\"MysteryAtmosphere\",\"BlueTintCinema\",\"PicposeBranding\",\"NightmareFrame\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-07 06:43:29', NULL, 0, 0),
(351, 'Climb of Fury: The Sky Attack', 17, 'A Determined Man’s Battle Against a Storm of Furious Eagles Amid a Ruthless Mountain Ascent\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a dynamic, highly realistic scene of a young man climbing a steep mountain. As he climbs, a large flock of angry eagles/hawks suddenly bursts into the sky, flying chaotically around him and aggressively attacking. Show powerful wings, sharp motion blur, and dramatic tension in the scene. The man looks shocked but determined while holding onto the rocky mountain. Add flying dust, wind effects, and a dramatic cloudy sky for a powerful atmosphere. Ensure the man’s face and hairstyle is 100%\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765091122_bc70b460a2a5.png', NULL, '[\"EpicClimb\",\"MountainBattle\",\"EagleAttack\",\"CinematicScene\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"ActionShot\",\"DynamicLighting\",\"DramaticSky\",\"SurvivalMoment\",\"PicposeCreation\",\"HighIntensityArt\",\"AIArtwork\",\"ThrillingAdventure\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-07 07:05:22', NULL, 0, 0),
(352, 'Skybound Magic: The Flying Carpet Rider', 17, 'A hyper-realistic cinematic portrait blending fantasy and modern cityscape, capturing a smiling man soaring above neon skyscrapers on an intricately woven magic carpet — complete with Picpose branding.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, highly detailed composite photograph of a smiling man with curly hair and a pink bandana, wearing a white tunic and a dark vest. He is lying prone on a richly decorated, intricately woven flying magic carpet, gripping the front edges. The carpet is soaring high above a modern cityscape at night, with towering illuminated skyscrapers blurred in the background, suggesting speed and distance. The lighting is dramatic and cinematic, with a soft, warm light on the man and carpet contrasting with the deep, moody blues and greys of the night sky and the hazy cloud/smoke effects around the carpet. Fantasy meets modern reality.\r\nStyle: Cinematic, Hyper-realistic, Photo manipulation, High-resolutionLighting: Dramatic, High-contrast rim lighting, MoodyColor Palette: Deep blues, golds, vibrant pink/red accentCamera: Shot with a wide-angle lens, low-angle perspective, dynamic motion blur effect.\r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765091641_3ed41810a2c3.png', NULL, '[\"FlyingCarpet\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"HyperRealisticArt\",\"FantasyMeetsReality\",\"MagicCarpetRide\",\"CityscapeNightView\",\"PhotoManipulation\",\"DynamicMotionBlur\",\"EpicVisuals\",\"HighResolutionArt\",\"PicposeBranding\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"FantasyPhotography\",\"ModernFantasyVibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-07 07:14:01', NULL, 0, 0),
(353, 'Paint Studio Tweety Vibes', 17, 'A hyper-real cinematic portrait of a young artist in a vibrant studio with a real-sized Tweety companion — featuring Picpose signature branding.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-detail, hyper-realistic, super cinematic, 9:16 ratio. A young man (face and hair 100% reference) bright-faced, messy-haired, wearing an orange apron full of bright paint splashes, sitting casually on a blue folding staircase in a bright painting studio. Her body pose is slightly leaning forward while smiling, one hand holding brush, one hand touching cheek, with the character of real sized Tweety bird.\r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765092042_8b16eb0591dc.png', NULL, '[\"PicposeCreation\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"UltraRealisticArt\",\"ArtistVibes\",\"TweetyStyle\",\"9by16Portrait\",\"StudioAesthetic\",\"HyperDetail\",\"AIArtPrompt\",\"VisualMasterpiece\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-07 07:20:42', NULL, 0, 0),
(354, 'Cozy Christmas Rug Selfie Magic', 27, 'Warm festive POV portrait with gifts, fairy lights & cinematic holiday vibes — enhanced with PicPose signature branding.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Selfie POV of a middle age man lying on a fluffy white rug, wearing a festive red Nordic-patterned Christmas sweater. He is surrounded by piles of red and white wrapped gift boxes and is tangled in glowing warm white fairy string lights that create a magical foreground blur. + Cozy holiday living room setting, blurred Christmas tree with ornaments in the background. + High-end lifestyle photography, festive aesthetic, candid social media style.  Warm ambient lighting, glowing bokeh effect, vibrant red and gold color palette, cozy atmosphere. + Wide-angle lens (24mm), close-up shot, shallow depth of field (f/1.😎, low angle perspective. + 8k resolution, photorealistic, sharp focus on eyes, highly detailed textures, cinematic composition\r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765096286_98bf64696018.png', NULL, '[\"PicposeOfficial\",\"HolidayVibes\",\"ChristmasAesthetic\",\"CozySelfie\",\"FestivePortrait\",\"POVPhotography\",\"CinematicLook\",\"FairyLightsMagic\",\"LifestylePhoto\",\"ChristmasGifts\",\"WarmBokeh\",\"8KPortrait\",\"CreativePhotography\",\"HolidaySeason\",\"RedAndWhiteTheme\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-07 08:31:26', NULL, 0, 0),
(355, 'Gigantic Grip: Forced-Perspective Power Pose', 17, 'Gigantic Grip: Forced-Perspective Power Pose\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, 8k photograph captured with an extreme low-angle perspective using a wide-angle lens, creating a dynamic forced-perspective composition. The main subject, a cute man with uploaded face as reference, dominates the immediate foreground, appearing gigantic. He is wearing a black hooded jacket with a white Nike logo, a grey t-shirt, blue jeans, and black and white high-top sneakers. He is crouched slightly, with his left hand placed against a large, light-colored stone tower in the mid-ground, creating the illusion that he is holding it. His right hand is dramatically extended towards the camera, further enhancing the exaggerated scale. In the background, the historical stone tower with its conical roof and an ornate archway are visible, appearing significantly smaller due to the forced perspective. The paved stone ground leads to a grassy area where numerous tiny, distant people are scattered. The scene is illuminated by bright natural daylight, casting soft, defined shadows under a partly cloudy sky, ensuring highly detailed textures on all surfaces, from the fabric of the clothing to the ancient stone architecture.\r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765099149_91c578f80f5a.png', NULL, '[\"ForcedPerspective\",\"GiganticPose\",\"UltraRealistic8K\",\"WideAngleShot\",\"DynamicDepth\",\"CreativePhotography\",\"PicPoseStyle\",\"HyperRealism\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"ArchitectureBlend\",\"GiantIllusion\",\"PerspectivePlay\",\"PhotoManipulation\",\"AIPhotography\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-07 09:19:09', NULL, 0, 0);
