(356, 'Eternal Glow — High-Fashion Studio Couple Portrait', 23, 'Ultra-Realistic 8K Editorial Shot with Warm Rim Lighting and Picpose Signature Styling\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A high-fashion, editorial portrait of a young man with styled dark hair and subtle highlights, leaning on a glossy white marble kitchen counter. He is wearing a chunky, oversized knit sweater featuring a bold geometric color block pattern in muted earthy tones (tan, taupe, and dark brown). A plain white ceramic mug sits on the counter in front of him. The setting is a modern, minimalist kitchen with matte, flat-front taupe cabinets and warm LED under-cabinet lighting. The subject is looking off.\r\nSignature in golden color: PicPose AI#stylish\r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765099820_b3a912cb3c4f.png', NULL, '[\"PicposePortrait\",\"HighFashionEdit\",\"StudioGlow\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"UltraRealistic8K\",\"CoupleEditorial\",\"RimLightPortrait\",\"FashionAesthetic\",\"PremiumAIEdit\",\"MoodyStudioVibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-07 09:30:20', NULL, 0, 0),
(357, 'Sunlit Heights of Joy', 17, 'A triumphant coastal portrait capturing pure happiness, luxury style, and breathtaking limestone vistas — finished with PicPose’s signature touch.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create photograph captures a young man sitting triumphantly on a large, prominent rock outcrop overlooking a stunning coastal landscape.\r\n\r\nSubject: The man uploaded photo is seated, wearing sunglasses, a white louie vuitton shirt, gucci above the knee shorts and balenciaga shoes. He is smiling broadly with, face tilted up towards the sun, appearing joyful and relaxed.\r\nForeground/Setting: He is positioned on a rugged, dark gray rock that appears to be part of a high vantage point, with dappled sunlight creating intricate shadow patterns on the rock surface in the bottom right corner.\r\nBackground/Location: The background is dominated by a majestic view of a limestone karst landscape rising out of the water. The sea is a calm, deep turquoise and gray-green. Numerous small fishing boats and houseboats are visible scattered between the islands, and a bridge or elevated road can be seen in the lower left connecting two landmasses. The overall atmosphere is slightly hazy,\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765105929_f6e4c4af2594.png', NULL, '[\"Step-by-Step\",\"Guide\",\"1\",\"Open\",\"Google\",\"Gemini\",\"2\",\"Upload\",\"your\",\"reference\",\"photo\",\"3\",\"Copy\",\"paste\",\"this\",\"prompt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-07 11:12:09', NULL, 0, 0),
(358, 'Whispers of a Woken Dawn', 18, 'A hyper-intimate 8K portrait capturing serene beauty, tousled hair, and a soft morning embrace — framed naturally through raised hands and subtle emotion.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Keep the facial features from the uploaded image...H..An ultra-sharp 8k quality An extremely close-up or extreme close-up shot, focusing intensely on the subject\'s face and upper shoulder/arm area. The shallow depth of field ensures that almost all focus is on the eyes and the immediate surrounding features, creating a high level of intimacy.\r\nThe character is partially lying\r\nBoth arms are raised high and positioned in front of the chin. The two hands are gently clasped or stacked on top of each other, with the fingers curled. The arms and hands form a \'frame\' supporting one side of the face, which rests lightly on them (both hands are on the same side)\r\nHer dark brown ash-gray hair is loose and appears somewhat messy or deliberately tousled, suggesting she has just woken up or is deeply relaxed. Strands of hair fall across her forehead and cheek, partially obscuring her face and adding a soft, natural frame to her features.\r\nOnly a small portion of her outfit is visible: a thin strap of a top or camisole.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765106349_a3acb702557c.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"UltraCloseUp\",\"8KPortrait\",\"IntimateMood\",\"SoftAesthetic\",\"MorningVibes\",\"CinematicLook\",\"NaturalBeauty\",\"MessyHairArt\",\"EmotivePortrait\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-07 11:19:09', NULL, 0, 0),
(359, 'Moonlit Christmas Flight', 19, 'A Magical Night Ride with Santa — Capturing Pure Joy in a Cinematic Winter Sky\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', '(Toma de referencia la foto manteniendo la consistencia perfecta de rostro, cuerpo y tono de piel). Un niño con un gorro de lana azul y vestimenta de navidad, se ríe emocionado mientras está sentado junto a un Santa Claus sonriente en un trineo de madera tradicional. El trineo está volando por un cielo nocturno despejado, sobre un paisaje nevado iluminado por la luna llena. Se pueden ver las luces de una pequeña ciudad a lo lejos. La escena debe ser muy detallada, con un brillo cálido emanando del trineo. Fotografía profesional en alta resolución, escena cinematográfica en donde la cámara captura cada detalle.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765172074_06c07c5bdd67.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseChristmas\",\"CinematicMagic\",\"SantaAndChild\",\"HolidaySpirit\",\"WinterWonder\",\"FlyingSleigh\",\"MoonlitScene\",\"HighResolutionArt\",\"UltraRealisticPortrait\",\"FestiveFantasy\",\"PicPoseLogo\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-08 05:34:34', NULL, 0, 0),
(360, 'Red Fury on the Runaway Train', 18, 'A Victorian Warrior Clinging to Chaos — An Epic PicPose Cinematic Portrait\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create image of A woman (upload image) in a red Victorian-style dress clinging to the outside of a speeding steam train, her long thick wavy dark brown hair whipping wildly in the wind. She wears black leather gloves and a rugged leather harness strapped across her chest and waist. Sparks and bullets fly around her as she reaches outward with determination. In the background, smoke clouds billowing dramatically. Intense cinematic lighting, hyperrealistic textures, detailed fabric folds, motion blur, flying embers, dynamic action scene, Western adventure, ultra-sharp focus on the woman’s face, expressive eyes, high contrast, dramatic atmosphere, 8K, photorealistic, epic composition.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765172828_784636f84f3f.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"VictorianAdventure\",\"EpicCinematicShot\",\"SteamTrainAction\",\"HyperRealPortrait\",\"DynamicScene\",\"RedDressDrama\",\"Photorealistic8K\",\"WesternActionVibes\",\"WindBlownHair\",\"BulletStorm\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"UltraSharpFocus\",\"ActionHeroine\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-08 05:47:08', NULL, 0, 0),
(361, 'Golden Meadow Companionship', 18, 'A cottagecore-inspired ultra-realistic portrait of a young woman sharing a serene countryside moment with two ducks.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create Ultra-realistic photograph of a young woman (upload image) with a soft gentle smile, long thick Dark brown messy hair, squatting and leaning toward two ducks — an emerald-green-headed mallard and a bright yellow duckling. She wears a mauve cottagecore dress with short puff sleeves and a floral blue-pink apron over a deep bluish-purple skirt. Set in a golden meadow or wheat field, warm summer/autumn ambience, green trees and a small rustic shed in the far background. Side sunlight illuminating her hair and the dry grass, natural soft bokeh, high-detail textures, lifelike skin tones, realistic lighting and depth of field. Peaceful countryside mood.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765174513_d734106aaabb.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CottagecorePortrait\",\"GoldenMeadow\",\"UltraRealisticArt\",\"SummerAutumnVibes\",\"CountrysideMagic\",\"NatureAesthetic\",\"SoftBokeh\",\"WarmSunlight\",\"AIPhotography\",\"HighDetailPortrait\",\"MessyHairAesthetic\",\"RusticAmbience\",\"DucklingMoments\",\"artisticportrait\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-08 06:15:13', NULL, 0, 0),
(362, 'Golden Meadow Companionship', 17, 'Hyper-Realistic 9:16 Cinematic Close-Mid Shot Featuring a Smiling Steampunk Girl with Mechanical Wings & Picpose Branding\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-detailed, hyper-realistic, cinematic vertical 9:16 — close-mid portrait: pria muda bergaya steampunk mengenakan topi trucker hitam, kacamata goggle bercahaya, sayap serangga mekanis, tersenyum sambil memberi tanda peace; penuh aksesori mekanis: straps, kabel, roda gigi, tangki, pipa, gesper logam, sarung tangan kulit, boots berat, backpack mesin berongga detail. Tekstur mikro: pori kulit, gigi, getaran rambut, kuncir, goresan cat, jahitan kulit, retak.\r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765177142_11c919da8e35.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CottagecorePortrait\",\"GoldenMeadow\",\"UltraRealisticArt\",\"SummerAutumnVibes\",\"CountrysideMagic\",\"NatureAesthetic\",\"SoftBokeh\",\"WarmSunlight\",\"AIPhotography\",\"HighDetailPortrait\",\"MessyHairAesthetic\",\"RusticAmbience\",\"DucklingMoments\",\"artisticportrait\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-08 06:59:02', NULL, 0, 0),
(363, 'Crimson Christmas Couture Elegance', 18, 'A Luxe Holiday Portrait Blending High-Fashion Glamour with Cozy Festive Opulence\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', '​A glamorous, high-fashion portrait of a stunning  woman with long, dark, wavy hair pulled back in a high ponytail. She is seated elegantly on a plush, velvet, white armchair next to a spectacularly decorated Christmas tree. She is wearing a chic, monochromatic red outfit consisting of a structured blazer and matching high-heeled boots with abundant, fluffy white fur trim. She also wears a matching camisole/bodysuit underneath the blazer and layered gold jewelry. The Christmas tree is heavily frosted and decorated exclusively in shades of red, silver, and white, featuring large ornaments, feathered boas, snowflakes, and sparkling lights. The opulent room has light grey walls with ornate white molding, a large framed mirror reflecting soft light, and a stylish wall sconce with candlelight. The aesthetic is luxurious, feminine, and cozy, emphasizing a red and grey color palette. High detail, photorealistic, professional studio lighting. Use uploaded photo as reference face and body 100%.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765182156_b6683c64c0cd.png', NULL, '[\"CrimsonElegance\",\"HolidayGlamour\",\"FestiveFashionPortrait\",\"HighFashionChristmas\",\"LuxuryAesthetic\",\"RedAndGreyVibes\",\"WinterGlamShoot\",\"StudioLightingMagic\",\"PicPoseSignature\",\"PhotorealisticPortrait\",\"FashionEditorialLook\",\"ChristmasCouture\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-08 08:22:36', NULL, 0, 0),
(364, 'Mini Boss Arrival', 19, 'A fearless 8-year-old walking forward as a helicopter lands behind him—dust, motion blur, fluttering coat, sunglasses swag, and pure cinematic power.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', '“8-year-old boy stepping forward confidently as a helicopter lands behind him, dust flying, coat fluttering, stylish sunglasses, tiny smartwatch, full-body cinematic shot with realistic motion blur and epic boss-style attitude.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765184269_fa92e97368e7.png', NULL, '[\"MiniBoss\",\"EpicArrival\",\"CinematicKid\",\"HeroVibes\",\"HelicopterLanding\",\"MotionBlurMagic\",\"BossMode\",\"StylishKid\",\"PicPoseEdit\",\"EpicVisual\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-08 08:57:49', NULL, 0, 2),
(365, 'Red Harmony: Man & Mascot Studio Elegance', 17, 'A cinematic, photorealistic portrait blending bold fashion with a playful 3D character in a seamless red studio aesthetic.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A photorealistic studio shot of a handsome young man wearing a vibrant red chunky knit sweater and matching red denim jeans. He is leaning casually against a giant, life-sized 3D cartoon character resembling a round red bird with thick black eyebrows. The background is a seamless solid red studio backdrop. Soft, high-key lighting creates a commercial photography aesthetic. 8k resolution, cinematic composition.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765184955_08668876d29b.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"RedStudioShot\",\"FashionPortrait\",\"PhotorealisticArt\",\"3DCharacterDesign\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"8KResolution\",\"StudioAesthetic\",\"CreativePhotography\",\"AIVisuals\",\"BoldRedLook\",\"CommercialShoot\",\"StylizedPortrait\",\"ArtisticFusion\",\"aiconceptart\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-08 09:09:15', NULL, 0, 0),
(366, 'White Maybach Billionaire Aesthetic', 17, 'Ultra-realistic cinematic portrait of a young success icon relaxing in pure-white luxury with soft-flex billionaire vibes\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic cinematic photo of a successful young man relaxing in the reclining backseat of a white luxury Maybach SUV, wearing an all-white outfit and gold watch, holding an iPad. Huge panoramic sunroof, palm trees visible through glass ceiling, bright daylight, clean white leather interior, minimalistic luxury, soft flex billionaire lifestyle aesthetic. 50mm lens, HDR, editorial fashion lighting, extremely detailed.\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765185448_edc1640fbfd8.png', NULL, '[\"Picpose\",\"LuxuryLifestyle\",\"BillionaireAesthetic\",\"MaybachVibes\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"WhiteOnWhiteLook\",\"EditorialLighting\",\"SoftFlex\",\"PremiumVibes\",\"LuxuryMood\",\"HDRPhotography\",\"iPadShot\",\"PalmTreeView\",\"PanoramicSunroof\",\"MinimalLuxury\",\"SuccessPortrait\",\"RichVibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-08 09:17:28', NULL, 0, 0),
(367, 'Miniature Creator: Rise of the Tiny Artist', 17, 'A hyper-realistic 8K studio-world portrait where a 1:10 scale artist stands tall atop creativity, facing a giant universe of ideas — complete with PicPose branding.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic 8k medium shot from a slightly low angle captures a surreal creative-studio scene with a shallow depth of field, focusing on a tiny 1:10 scale person with uploaded 100% face as reference. The miniature person stands confidently on top of a giant open sketchbook, surrounded by oversized art tools. He holds a massive graphite pencil that is nearly twice his height, leaning on it like a heroic weapon. He wears a casual white T-shirt with subtle graphic prints, dark jeans, and clean white sneakers.\r\nAround him, the sketchbook pages show a half-finished pencil illustration of a city skyline, with hyper-detailed shading and realistic pencil textures. Scattered across the desk are enormous colored pencils, a tilted metal cup filled with huge brushes, a giant eraser with visible wear marks, and a spilled container of sharpened pencil shavings curling dramatically across the page.\r\nTo the left, a towering desk lamp emits soft, cinematic light, creating dramatic highlights and shadows around the tiny person. To the right, an oversized tablet (like an iPad) displays a digital drawing interface with layers and brushes visible. A sticky note attached to the tablet reads “Keep Creating”.\r\nThe wooden desk surface shows scratches, texture, and scattered dust particles. Behind the desk, a blurred creative studio environment is visible, including mood boards, pinned drawings, and warm ambient lighting. The mood of the scene conveys empowerment and creativity, portraying the tiny person as an artist facing a giant world of ideas.\r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765187013_bbdbc1b23a96.png', NULL, '[\"MiniatureArtist\",\"TinyWorldConcept\",\"CreativeStudioVibes\",\"8KHyperRealism\",\"PicPoseEdit\",\"ArtisticUniverse\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"SurrealVisuals\",\"GiantToolsTinyArtist\",\"DigitalArtMagic\",\"StudioAesthetic\",\"EpicCreatorMood\",\"AIArtPrompt\",\"PicPoseBranding\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-08 09:43:33', NULL, 0, 0),
(368, 'Garden Glow: Cinematic Youth Portrait', 17, 'A hyper-realistic 8K cinematic poster capturing a stylish 25-year-old boy in a serene garden setting, showcasing effortless charm, fashion, and modern elegance.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic 8K cinematic poster of an 25-year-old skinny boy, 5.6 ft tall, A very handsome young boy, Cinematic, hyper-realistic full body portrait, exact face from uploaded reference, wearing red oversized printed sweater, black cargo jeans, white shoes, tousled hair, black sunglasses, black smartwatch, holding an iPhone 16 seating in garden table with comfort\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765188513_875b88f7dde5.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"UltraRealistic8K\",\"HandsomeLook\",\"StylishBoy\",\"GardenVibes\",\"FashionPoster\",\"iPhone16\",\"OversizedSweater\",\"CinematicPoster\",\"HyperRealisticArt\",\"FullBodyPortrait\",\"ModernAesthetic\",\"AIArtDesign\",\"professionalposter\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-08 10:08:33', NULL, 0, 0),
(369, 'Inferno Stride: The Man Who Walks Through Fire', 17, 'A fearless lone hero standing tall as chaos ignites behind him — captured in ultra-realistic cinematic 8K intensity with PicPose signature styling.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A stylish man stands confidently in the foreground, wearing a black leather jacket, dark sunglasses, and rugged boots. He smokes calmly while a massive fiery explosion erupts behind him, illuminating the scene with intense orange and yellow flames. A car is dramatically thrown into the air by the blast, adding a high-energy action-movie vibe. The ground reflects the explosion in wet puddles, creating vivid reflections. Golden-hour lighting, ultra-realistic details, cinematic composition, sharp focus, dramatic atmosphere, action-film poster style, 8K.\r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765190324_ce15168d9c63.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPoster\",\"ActionVibes\",\"UltraRealistic8K\",\"ExplosionScene\",\"HeroShot\",\"MoviePosterStyle\",\"GoldenHourGlow\",\"EpicVisuals\",\"DramaticAtmosphere\",\"CreativePrompt\",\"AIArtMagic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-08 10:38:44', NULL, 1, 1),
(370, 'Neon Drift: Cyberpunk City Lounge', 17, 'A futuristic cinematic portrait of a young man relaxing on a Lamborghini under electrifying neon lights — modern, vibrant, and richly detailed.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A cyberpunk neon-inspired nighttime street shot in the middle of a bustling city — a young man lounges on the hood of a red Lamborghini with a brightly colored anime one-piece livery. The blue, pink, and purple neon lights from the tall buildings reflect off the wet street, creating a futuristic atmosphere. The subject is wearing a patterned black t-shirt, white cargo pants with red accents, and clean black Nike sneakers. The background is filled with a crowd of pedestrians, a glass bridge, and a large LED light billboard. The mood is modern, vibrant, and cinematic, with sharp details and a vibrant city night atmosphere.\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765191627_5e7f9f029695.png', NULL, '[\"CyberpunkVibes\",\"NeonCityLights\",\"FuturisticAesthetic\",\"LamborghiniShot\",\"AnimeLivery\",\"UrbanCinematic\",\"NightPhotography\",\"PicposeBranding\",\"ModernStreetStyle\",\"SciFiAtmosphere\",\"VibrantCityscape\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-08 11:00:27', NULL, 0, 0),
(371, 'Santa Magic Through the Screen', 27, 'A Hyper-Realistic Christmas Fantasy Bursting Out of an iPhone — Featuring Blue-Haired Santa & Her Mischievous Squirrel Sleigh\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Hyper-realistic photograph of a hand holding a massive iPhone with shiny red letters\" MERRY CHRISTMAS\" on top of the screen. On the screen, Santa Claus lady looks exactly like the photo I uploaded, with messy short azure blue hair are bursting out of the iPhone on a sleigh pulled by a mischievous squirrel. Behind them on the screen is a decorated Christmas tree with levitating presents. Snow swirls wildly around the sleigh and the table, creating a playful snowstorm that spills off the screen. She playfully shakes a snowball at the squirrel, adding humor and energy. Clean kitchen background around the iPhone, cinematic lighting, ultra-realistic textures, 16K, sharp focus on, lady Santa, and sleigh, magical, whimsical, and humorous winter atmosphere. Soft bokeh on background, realistic shadows and reflections, dynamic motion, sparkling snow effects.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765192295_0976f074b734.png', NULL, '[\"MerryChristmas\",\"SantaMagic\",\"PicPose\",\"HyperRealisticArt\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"FantasyVisuals\",\"BlueHairSanta\",\"HolidayVibes\",\"CreativeConcept\",\"ChristmasArtwork\",\"WhimsicalDesign\",\"16KRender\",\"SnowstormEffect\",\"iPhoneMagic\",\"UltraRealistic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-08 11:11:35', NULL, 0, 0),
