(379, 'Sugar Garden Nightfall: The Tiny Lantern Dream', 20, 'A 1-cm fairy woman gliding on a macaron swing beneath a glowing cupcake tree in an ultra-realistic macro fantasy world.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic macro scene of a 1-cm-tall woman sitting on a hanging macaron swing made of twisted sugar strings beneath a cupcake “tree” in a dessert garden at night. She gently holds the sugar ropes with both hands as her toes brush glowing jelly petals below. Her sheer pastel nightie flows lightly with motion, messy bun softly undone. Fog drifts beneath her like clouds. She has tied her tiny candied lantern to the swing post, bathing her face in warm light. Tiny sugar butterflies flutter nearby. Dreamlike, fairy-tale mood, cinematic lighting, ultra-detailed macro fantasy.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765276977_064f9e9763e2.png', NULL, '[\"MacroFantasy\",\"TinyWorldMagic\",\"SugarGarden\",\"FairyCinematic\",\"DreamlikeVisuals\",\"UltraRealisticMacro\",\"FantasyAesthetics\",\"PicPoseArt\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"WhimsicalDesign\",\"CreativeImagery\",\"MacroPhotographyStyle\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-09 10:42:57', NULL, 0, 2),
(380, 'Skyline Stealth Ascent', 27, 'A Hyper-Realistic Spy Thriller Portrait of a High-Tech Agent Scaling a Futuristic Skyscraper\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic cinematic action portrait of a tactical spy agent climbing the exterior glass wall of a skyscraper at extreme height. The man wears a futuristic black combat suit with armor plates, tactical straps, gloves, and utility gear. His expression is focused, intense, and fearless. One hand grips the building ledge while the other sticks to the glass as if supported by high-tech climbing gear.\r\n\r\nBelow him is a breathtaking aerial view of a massive modern city busy highways, tall buildings, and depth stretching into the horizon. The lighting is cool and dramatic, with a slightly blue cinematic tone and subtle atmospheric haze. The reflection of the character on the glass façade adds realism and depth.\r\n\r\nStyle: 8K hyper-realistic movie poster, sharp texture details (fabric, metal, reflections), dramatic perspective, spy thriller theme inspired by Mission Impossible / Marvel / futuristic stealth hero vibes. Keep the face 100% real as in reference image. \r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765277795_6f93217ffa20.png', NULL, '[\"CinematicAction\",\"SpyThrillerVibes\",\"FuturisticAgent\",\"8KRealism\",\"HyperRealisticPortrait\",\"MissionImpossibleStyle\",\"MarvelInspired\",\"UrbanSkyscraperScene\",\"HighTechClimber\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"EpicCityscape\",\"PicposeBranding\",\"MoviePosterLook\",\"ActionHeroAesthetic\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-09 10:56:35', NULL, 0, 0),
