(384, 'Tokyo Reality Breaker', 17, 'Gigantic 3D Billboard Illusion of a Man Emerging Into the Real World – A Surreal Hyper-Realistic Cityscape at a Busy Japanese Intersection, with PicPose Branding Touch\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A surreal hyper-realistic cityscape scene set in a busy Japanese intersection during daylight. The central focus is a gigantic 3D anamorphic billboard integrated into the corner of a modern building. From this billboard, a massive, ultra-realistic human figure appears to emerge into the real world. The billboard displays a lifelike room interior with soft gray walls, ceiling spotlights, and sheer curtains, creating the illusion of depth and a real physical space.\r\nThe giant man( from the picture attached) leans forward from the billboard frame as if bending out of the screen, with his right arm stretching far outward into the street below. His expression is friendly and curious, with a natural smile. His skin texture is rendered in extremely high detail—pores, subtle highlights, soft shadows, and natural color variations. He wears a dark, fitted polo shirt with realistic fabric folds and natural shading.\r\nLighting is bright and natural, coming from the outdoor sun, casting sharp and accurate shadows on the building façade and on the figure’s extended hand. The fingers are large and expressive, reaching down toward the busy streets, with hyper-realistic proportions and subtle translucency at the fingertips.\r\nBelow, the intersection is filled with crowds of pedestrians crossing multiple crosswalks, buses, cars, and bicycles—the hustle of Tokyo life. Every element is rendered in high clarity: store signs in Japanese, glass reflections from surrounding skyscrapers, streetlights, traffic flow, and subtle motion blur capturing the movement of people.\r\nThe overall composition highlights an eye-catching contrast between the massive-scale 3D illusion and the real environment. Emphasis on photorealistic lighting, urban ambiance, and crisp architectural details. Shot in 9:16 vertical orientation, 8K resolution, ultra-sharp, HDR, cinematic realism.\r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765354147_dc85af2141b7.png', NULL, '[\"Tokyo3DIllusion\",\"HyperRealisticBillboard\",\"SurrealCityscape\",\"AnamorphicArt\",\"PicPoseCreative\",\"8KUltraReal\",\"CinematicUrbanShot\",\"JapaneseIntersection\",\"DigitalAnamorphic\",\"UrbanSurrealism\",\"HDRVisuals\",\"3DRealism\",\"CityscapeMagic\",\"EmergingGiantEffect\",\"PicposeBranding\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-10 08:09:07', NULL, 0, 0),
(385, 'Silver Lightning: Futuristic Duo Portrait', 17, 'A ultra-realistic photobooth moment inside a spaceship, capturing powerful expressions, detailed outfits, and a creative energy-filled backdrop — complete with PicPose signature branding.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an ultra-realistic image of a silverhawks character [Silver Lightning] poses for a photo with one hand rested on the subject\'s shoulder and the other hand on his waist.\r\nHe is next to the person in the attached photo, with white T-shirt to the body, silver jacket open inflated type, dark jean pants. , and he has an arm around the character\'s waist.\r\nWe\'re inside a futuristic room that looks like inside a spaceship.\r\nThe soft lighting of the photobooth highlights their faces, focusing on facial expressions and clothing details, with a soft and creative background full of energy\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765354662_3ceabbdc940b.png', NULL, '[\"SilverLightning\",\"SilverhawksInspired\",\"FuturisticPortrait\",\"UltraRealisticImage\",\"CinematicRender\",\"SpaceRoomVibes\",\"SciFiPhotobooth\",\"CreativeEnergyShot\",\"PicposeBranding\",\"CharacterAndHuman\",\"DynamicDuoPortrait\",\"HyperDetailedArt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-10 08:17:42', NULL, 0, 0),
