(388, 'Candy Cane Glam Studio Portrait', 18, 'A hyper-real festive beauty shot with peppermint elegance, cinematic glow, and perfect facial fidelity\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Preserve my exact facial identity with perfect accuracy identical bone structure, symmetry, proportions, and all micro details unchanged. Maintain real fair skin tone, pores, texture, youthful glow, and natural facial contours with hyper real clarity.\r\nScene/Setting:\r\nA red-and-white candy cane themed studio with oversized candy props, glossy peppermint swirls, and bright festive lights.\r\nShe expresses: festive warmth and playful sweetness.\r\nHair: Sleek high ponytail with soft face-framing strands.\r\nMakeup: Red lip gloss, shimmering silver eyeshadow, no winged eyeliner.\r\nOutfit: Red velvet cropped blazer, white mini skirt, rhinestone heels. Nails: red + white stripes (candy cane), glossy.\r\nLighting: Bright cinematic glam.\r\nCamera: 85mm • f/3.2 • ISO 150 • 1/200s\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765357492_2b84733b5016.png', NULL, '[\"CandyCaneGlam\",\"FestivePortrait\",\"PeppermintStudio\",\"HolidayAesthetic\",\"CinematicGlam\",\"UltraRealisticBeauty\",\"RedAndWhiteTheme\",\"PicPosePortrait\",\"PeppermintVibes\",\"StudioPhotography\",\"ChristmasGlam\",\"HyperRealFace\",\"CandyCaneFashion\",\"HolidayPhotoshoot\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-10 09:04:52', NULL, 0, 0);
