(389, 'Mint Winter Magic: A Christmas Fantasy Portrait', 20, 'A dreamy snow-lit Christmas world featuring her true face, mint winter fashion, glowing fairy lights, and a charming animated duck companion — rendered in ultra-realistic 4K.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a magical, ultra-realistic winter fantasy Christmas portrait using the uploaded girl\'s face and appearance exactly as it is (100% facial accuracy, same skin tone, same hair details).\r\nPlace her in a beautiful snow-covered walkway decorated with glowing golden fairy lights, frosted Christmas trees, white roses, and a grand arched doorway in the background.\r\nShe is wearing a soft mint-green winter dress with subtle snowflake embroidery, matching boots, warm stockings, and braided hair with mint accessories.\r\nBeside her stands a cute animated duck character (similar to classic cartoon style), wearing a matching mint-green winter outfit and holding a glowing lantern.\r\nThe atmosphere is dreamy, warm, festive, with falling snow, cinematic bokeh lights, soft sparkle, and high-end studio lighting.\r\nRender in ultra-detail, 4K, high clarity, soft shadows, magical fairy-tale mood.\r\nMake sure the girl’s pose, expression, and style fit naturally into the scene while keeping her original face perfectly preserved.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765359709_225c072d0254.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"WinterMagic\",\"ChristmasPortrait\",\"MintGreenAesthetic\",\"FairyLightDreams\",\"UltraRealisticArt\",\"FantasyChristmas\",\"SnowfallVibes\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"CuteCartoonDuck\",\"4KRender\",\"MagicalScene\",\"HolidayFantasy\",\"ChristmasWonderland\",\"MintWinterLook\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-10 09:41:49', NULL, 0, 2),
(390, 'New Year Vision 2026 – Cinematic Style Portrait', 17, 'A stylish modern man posing atop glowing 3D “2026” with futuristic lighting and ultra-realistic promotional aesthetics.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a picture of a stylish Handsome man sitting confidently on top of large 3D glowing metallic numbers \"2026\" at the bottom, with \"HAPPY NEW YEAR\" written right bottom it in big glowing letters. The man is wearing a brown baseball cap with A-logo light brown cargo trousers, white long-sleeved shirt written PicPose AI intricate batik scribbles.The lighting is soft and futuristic with the combination of cool blue and warm orange, creating a cinematic and modern atmosphere. Add \"akmal ansari in right corner with 1 inch margin\" metallic shiny logo under design. Ultra-realistic 8K photo, elegant promotional style.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765361179_8aaaddc7cd51.png', NULL, '[\"NewYear2026\",\"HappyNewYear\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"UltraRealistic8K\",\"FuturisticVibes\",\"Glowing3DArt\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"ModernAesthetic\",\"PromotionalDesign\",\"StylishManPortrait\",\"AkmalAnsariDesign\",\"DigitalArtwork\",\"AIImagePrompt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-10 10:06:19', NULL, 0, 1),
(391, 'Winter Joy Close-Up: Hyper-Realistic Couple Portrait', 23, 'Snowy Christmas ambience with lifelike couple expressions, captured in 8K clarity using exact facial reference.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a hyper-realistic 8K close up zoom in portrait of a couple model, using the uploaded photo as the exact facial reference. Maintain 100% accuracy of the facial features — do not alter or modify any aspect of the face. Render the skin texture, lighting, and overall composition with photo-realistic detail, ensuring lifelike color tones and natural depth of field. A joyful couple they wearing white winter clothes man holding a iphone camera and taking a picture with the adorable big M&M characters, they are happy on their facial expressions. Fresh snow everywhere, glowing winter lights, playful Christmas atmosphere.dont change their face and hairstyle focusing on the couple face with a very clear.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765364544_a23da5dd420c.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"HyperRealisticPortrait\",\"8KCloseUp\",\"WinterCouple\",\"ChristmasVibes\",\"RealFaceAccuracy\",\"SnowMagic\",\"MMCharacters\",\"CouplePhotography\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"AIPhotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-10 11:02:24', NULL, 0, 0),
(392, 'Midnight Realty Vision', 17, 'A cinematic ultra-realistic portrait of a realtor beside a glowing miniature Chicago cityscape, enhanced with PicPose signature branding.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Realtor man wearing a tailored midnight-blue suit with a crisp white shirt and black silk tie, standing beside a glowing miniature of Chicago. The model features illuminated skyscraper windows, glowing riverwalk lights, tiny lit bridges, and reflective water surfaces. Darkened luxury office background, balanced focus on both the man and the miniature, cinematic lighting, ultra-realistic, 8k.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765364967_f64196d4aaef.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"RealEstatePortrait\",\"RealtorPhotography\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"MiniatureCity\",\"ChicagoModel\",\"UltraRealistic8K\",\"ProfessionalBranding\",\"CorporatePortrait\",\"ArchitecturalGlow\",\"LuxuryOfficeVibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-10 11:09:27', NULL, 0, 1),
(393, 'Golden Triumph – 2026 Celebration Portrait', 18, 'A cinematic New Year victory poster featuring a confident young woman, dazzling fireworks, and shimmering golden aesthetics.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', '\"Create an ultra-realistic 8K Closeup cinematic joyful celebration poster that perfectly replicates the exact style, dark navy-blue color palette, high-contrast lighting, and design of an Instagram milestone banner. The central subject is a confident, well-dressed young woman standing in the center, wearing a stylish, open-buttoned white coat over a dark top, holding a golden trophy high in her right hand. Her powerful pose and expression must align with a modern success celebration. The background is a dark, rich navy-blue (with a deep blue to black gradient) filled entirely with a dazzling array of golden fireworks, thick shimmering golden confetti, floating spark particles, and intense golden glowing effects, utilizing premium gold color tones. Behind the woman, create a huge, massive sparkling golden text made of intensely glowing light particles that reads: \'2026\'. Above this main text, add bright, elegant golden festive text: \'Happy New Year\'. Below it, add crisp white script text:  The number \'2026\' must also be clearly visible and inscribed on the golden trophy. The scene should feature cinematic high-contrast lighting with strong vertical spotlights reflecting clearly on the glossy floor, along with floating geometric gold icons (like 3D stars or cubes) on the ground, maintaining a dramatic, celebratory atmosphere and extreme attention to detail. All text mustly write on background. the young women\'s face matches the uploaded reference image.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765366117_b7c5a85ccb37.png', NULL, '[\"2026Celebration\",\"NewYearPoster\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"UltraRealistic8K\",\"GoldenFireworks\",\"VictoryVibes\",\"MilestoneBannerStyle\",\"FestivalGraphics\",\"PicPosePoster\",\"HighContrastLighting\",\"NavyBlueAesthetic\",\"GoldenTrophyShot\",\"SparkleAndShine\",\"LuxuryDesignArt\",\"CreativePrompt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-10 11:28:37', NULL, 0, 0),
(394, 'The Young Illusionist', 19, 'A magical moment frozen in time — an 8-year-old magician showcasing a stunning floating card trick under dramatic spotlight.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', '8-year-old boy magician performing a floating playing-card trick in front of a small stage audience. Wearing a black velvet magician coat, white shirt, red bow tie, magic wand in hand. Dramatic spotlight, flying cards around him, sparkles in the air. Camera: 50mm portrait lens, low-angle shot, motion freeze, shallow DOF, real shadows. Ratio 4:5. Ultra-realistic skin, crisp fabric texture, light film grain for cinematic look.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765428575_89ed68fbc83e.png', NULL, '[\"MagicMoment\",\"YoungMagician\",\"IllusionArt\",\"FloatingCards\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"MagicianVibes\",\"KidsPhotography\",\"PicPoseExclusive\",\"MagicShow\",\"CreativeShot\",\"FantasyPortrait\",\"DramaticLighting\",\"StageMagic\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-11 04:49:35', NULL, 0, 0),
