(396, 'Snowfall Serenity: A Cozy Couple Moment with Stitch', 23, 'A hyper-realistic 8K winter portrait featuring a couple in fluffy blue coats, white beanies, and a lifelike Stitch under magical nighttime snowfall — with PicPose signature branding.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a hyper-realistic 8K close-up body portrait of a couple model, using the uploaded photo as the exact facial reference. Maintain 100% accuracy of the facial features — do not alter or modify any aspect of the face. Render the skin texture, lighting, and overall composition with photo-realistic detail, ensuring lifelike color tones and natural depth of field. A couple wear in a fluffy blue winter coat and white beanie posing with a lifelike big Stitch during heavy snowfall. Blue-toned nighttime lighting, cozy and cute winter aesthetic, soft falling snowflakes.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765430414_24f1567b2176.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"WinterPortrait\",\"8KRealism\",\"CouplePhotography\",\"SnowfallAesthetic\",\"BlueWinterVibes\",\"StitchArt\",\"HyperRealisticPortrait\",\"AIPhotoArt\",\"MoodyWinterLook\",\"CinematicSnow\",\"ColdSeasonVibes\",\"CozyAesthetic\",\"NightSnowfall\",\"AIModelPhotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-11 05:20:14', NULL, 0, 0),
(397, 'Winter Ride of Love – Hyper-Realistic Couple Portrait', 23, 'Blue-toned night aesthetic with lifelike Stitch characters, falling snow, and 100% accurate facial detailing — crafted for cinematic PicPose perfection.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a hyper-realistic 8K close-up body portrait of a couple model, using the uploaded photo as the exact facial reference. Maintain 100% accuracy of the facial features — do not alter or modify any aspect of the face. Render the skin texture, lighting, and overall composition with photo realistic detail, ensuring lifelike color tones and natural depth of field. A happy couple in an blue puffer jacket and blue pants they riding a two big bicycle with a lifelike two big Stitch at the back, wearing winter accessories, Blue-toned night time lightning, cozy and cute winter aesthetic, soft falling snowflakes.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765430742_b41336242e47.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"WinterPortrait\",\"CouplePhotography\",\"HyperRealistic8K\",\"AIArtPortrait\",\"BlueAesthetic\",\"SnowEffect\",\"CozyVibes\",\"StitchRide\",\"RealisticAI\",\"RomanticAIArt\",\"NightToneArt\",\"AestheticCouple\",\"AIModelPortrait\",\"PhotoRealisticRender\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-11 05:25:42', NULL, 0, 0),
(398, 'Escalator Elegance: Cinematic Urban Portrait', 18, 'A warm-toned, ultra-realistic mall aesthetic featuring a stylish modern look with flawless bokeh ambience\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic low-angle (3:4) half-body photo of the person in the reference on a mall escalator, holding a Starbucks coffee and Medium 30 L Laptop Backpack, Slightly Smiling Face. Few hair strands fall on his face. Grey colour hoodie \"NIKE\" logo, white cargo pants, is wearing clear-framed glasses, an apple watch. Background mall lights/people blurred with creamy bokeh. atural light, cinematic warm tones, ultra-detailed 8K. Keep her face, skin tone, hairstyle same as reference.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765431519_a2c9c429db65.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"UrbanPortrait\",\"CinematicShot\",\"MallAesthetic\",\"LowAnglePhotography\",\"WarmTones\",\"8KUltraRealistic\",\"FashionPortrait\",\"StreetStyleVibes\",\"BokehBackground\",\"ModernLook\",\"AIPhotography\",\"LifestylePortrait\",\"ClearFrameGlasses\",\"StarbucksVibes\",\"LaptopBackpack\",\"NIKEHoodie\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-11 05:38:39', NULL, 0, 0),
(399, 'Shadow Blade Ascension', 17, 'A hyper-real cinematic battle moment capturing the hero’s mastery, precision, and unmatched presence—crafted through elite Photoshop manipulation for lifelike realism.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper detailed cinematic scene featuring use uploaded face 100% as reference as a master of his signature weapon in the heat of battle. The camera captures the hero in the center of the frame with absolute clarity and dramatic presence. The modern Assassin suit, matte-black, the fabric showing realistic tension and movement around his arm as the blade extends. A powerful, dynamic shot of Adrian engaging a mercenary, the sleek, matte-black carbon fiber Hidden Blade, appearing as a practical, perfectly engineered prop with all its intricate mechanisms, extended from his gauntlet, glinting under the harsh light. The mercenary\'s surprised expression is clearly visible, and the impact of the blade is implied with dynamic motion blur, achieved through expert photo manipulation. heavy atmosphere. Use language inspired by premium photography and expert level photo manipulation techniques similar to high end Photoshop to achieve top quality realism without CGI or 3D graphics. Create a one of a kind, unforgettable scene with unmatched detail, cinematic power, and full focus on the hero. no CGI or 3D graphics or art. use Photoshop manipulation if the scene illogical and imaginary.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765432063_565e73355402.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseOriginal\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"AssassinMode\",\"HyperRealismShot\",\"PhotoshopMasterpiece\",\"BattleIntensity\",\"HeroInFocus\",\"DynamicActionFrame\",\"PremiumPhotoManipulation\",\"ModernAssassinVibes\",\"SignatureWeaponShot\",\"EpicVisualStorytelling\",\"HighEndRetouching\",\"NoCGIJustArt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-11 05:47:43', NULL, 0, 0),
(400, 'Timebound Serenity – Mahabharat Sands Portrait', 17, 'Golden-hour cinematic portrait of a man seated barefoot on ancient war sands, framed by a monumental vintage pocket watch — blending mythology, realism, and timeless calm.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A sitting barefoot on sand at mahabharat war, relaxed pose wavy hair blowing in the breeze, open white linen shirt, layered necklaces and wristwatch, ripped light blue jeans golden hour sunset lighting, huge vintage pocket watch behind him like a giant backdrop, ornate roman numerals and intricate engravings on the clock, shallow depth of field, warm cinematic tones, ultra realistic, high detail, 8k, dramatic sky, photorealistic portrait, full body shot, centered composition.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765432317_b2a71bf81f4b.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"TimeboundSerenity\",\"MahabharatVibes\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"GoldenHourMagic\",\"VintageClockArt\",\"DesertSandsMood\",\"UltraRealistic8K\",\"WavyHairAesthetic\",\"MythologyMeetsModern\",\"EpicBackdrop\",\"DramaticSky\",\"FullBodyPortrait\",\"ArtisticComposition\",\"artwork\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-11 05:51:57', NULL, 0, 0),
(401, 'Jungle Strike: The Silent Warrior', 17, 'A lone soldier locked in stealth mode, navigating the rain-soaked jungle with unwavering focus — captured in intense cinematic realism.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A young male soldier in a dense, wet jungle environment, wearing full camouflage uniform. He is kneeling among lush green tropical plants, aiming forward with a tactical rifle equipped with a red glowing scope. The atmosphere is dark, humid, and cinematic, with dramatic lighting highlighting his serious expression. Raindrops and moisture on leaves enhance the realism. The overall mood is intense, action-focused, and highly detailed, like a military movie scene.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765434016_3a49f86df28b.png', NULL, '[\"JungleWarrior\",\"MilitaryCinematic\",\"ActionScene\",\"SoldierInJungle\",\"TacticalRifle\",\"RainEffect\",\"CamoUniform\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"IntenseMood\",\"HyperRealisticArt\",\"PicPoseCreation\",\"MoodyAtmosphere\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-11 06:20:16', NULL, 0, 0),
