(404, 'Sage Serenity: The Butterfly Whirl', 18, 'An ultra-realistic portrait of Indonesian elegance in motion, wrapped in sage-green grace, fluttering butterflies, and a magical landscape bathed in soft evening light.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Potret ultra realistis seorang perempuan muda cantik berwajah khas Indonesia, mengenakan hijab pashmina warna ijo sage cerah berhias rangkaian bunga senada di sisi kepala. Ia memakai gaun panjang elegan berbahan tipis berlapis-lapis, memadukan warna ijo sage cerah dan aksen putih , dengan hiasan motif kupu kupu yg indah indah pada bagian luar gaun bawah yang menjuntai anggun hingga menyentuh tanah. Di ujung jemarinya hinggap seekor kupu-kupu cantik, sementara ia berpose seolah sedang berputar.\r\nLatar belakang menampilkan pemandangan alam epik: tebing hijau menjulang, air terjun tinggi yang mengalir deras menuju sungai biru jernih, pepohonan sakura bermekaran dengan nuansa ijo sage, dan kelopak bunga beterbangan di udara. Cahaya lembut sore hari menerangi adegan, menciptakan suasana damai, romantis, dan magis. Ultra realistic, 8K resolution, cinematic lighting, detailed textures, high dynamic range, depth of field.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765448565_073eda0f5109.png', NULL, '[\"SageSerenity\",\"IndonesianBeauty\",\"HijabPortrait\",\"UltraRealisticArt\",\"ButterflyAesthetics\",\"CinematicVisuals\",\"8KArt\",\"MagicalLandscape\",\"PicPose\",\"ElegantPortrait\",\"NatureFantasy\",\"SageGreenVibes\",\"whirlinggrace\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-11 10:22:45', NULL, 0, 0),
(405, 'Candid Bond: A Stylish Moment with Eevee', 17, 'A warm outdoor portrait capturing a Filipino man in an all-white outfit sharing a playful, lifelike moment with Eevee — blending real fashion, natural lighting, and cinematic realism in 8K.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A candid outdoor photoshoot of a Filipino man in a clean all-white outfit — sweatshirt, jogger pants, and sneakers. He is relaxed and smiling, playfully interacting with a realistic, lifelike version of Eevee imagined as a real animal — small, fox-like, with soft natural brown-and-white fur, a fluffy tail, and expressive hazel-brown eyes. The man and Eevee appear to be having fun together, as if caught in a genuine playful moment. The background is a natural outdoor setting, seamlessly blending with the subjects. Lighting is soft and even, giving a professional yet natural portrait feel. The overall mood is candid, warm, modern, and stylish, blending real-world fashion with a believable animal companion. Captured in 8K UHD, crisp, sharp, studio-quality with cinematic depth.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765451840_b43bf71c4378.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CandidPortrait\",\"EeveeRealism\",\"FilipinoStyle\",\"OutdoorPhotoshoot\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"8KUHD\",\"AIPhotography\",\"FashionPortraits\",\"PlayfulMoment\",\"RealisticEevee\",\"ModernAesthetic\",\"NaturalLightPhotography\",\"AIArtPrompts\",\"CreativePortraits\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-11 11:17:20', NULL, 0, 0),
