(407, 'Midnight Violet in the Snow', 18, 'A hyperreal winter fashion portrait capturing confidence, calm mystery, and glossy purple elegance under a silent snowy night.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'The same person, the same face, unaltered features. An hyperrealistic image with sharp detail. A mid-shot portrait on a snowy night: a young woman stands against a backdrop of snow-covered pine forest, wearing a deep purple, lustrous quilted jacket with neat seams and a textured, polished plastic sheen. A purple hat, coated in snow, gives her head a serene, spherical shape. Her long, blonde hair flows over her shoulders, snaking through the jacket sleeves, some strands tinted with moonlight and delicately catching snowdrops at their tips. Professional makeup, full lips painted with glossy purple lipstick, and green eyes. In her left hand, she holds a modern phone with a gold metal frame, snapping a selfie that reflects her powerful presence, conveying confidence and commanding attention even amidst relative mystery. Her nails are softly painted a pale pink, and the pose is firmly in place. The angle reveals her shoulder and the front of her chest, framed roughly at shoulder level. The gaze is focused on the camera, giving the frame a sense of cool presence and modern neutrality, while the shadows of trees and the sound of snow on the ground behind it lend the image depth and refined tranquility. The night light is clear yet subdued, emanating from the sky and the nearby snow, with silvery reflections bouncing off the jacket\'s polished fabric and illuminating the hair. Purple dominates, with shades of deep blue and snowy white, highlighting the garment\'s sheen and the soft sheen of the hair; it gives the scene a sense of elegant coolness and modernity simultaneously, without any visible text. Keywords: cinematic, photographic realism, 8k, snow, winter fashion, glossy purple jacket, purple hat, cold night selfie. Negative feedback: blurry, low quality, facial distortions, plastic appearance, high noise, blunt edges, excessive contrast, washed-out colors, unbalanced lighting, motion blur\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765603933_aadb9577b21c.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"WinterFashion\",\"SnowyNight\",\"PurpleAesthetic\",\"ColdNightSelfie\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"Hyperrealistic\",\"8KPhotography\",\"GlossyJacket\",\"FashionInSnow\",\"ModernElegance\",\"WinterStyle\",\"MoodyTones\",\"PhotographicRealism\",\"AIImagePrompt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-13 05:32:13', NULL, 0, 0),
(408, 'Golden Glow of Christmas Joy', 37, 'A cinematic moment of warmth and celebration as festive lights, ornaments, and soft sunlight wrap her in the magic of Christmas.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'An ultra-realistic cinematic scene of a woman uploaded photo decorating a Christmas tree inside a cozy, modern home. She is wearing a sleeveless white top and short blue denim shorts. Warm golden Christmas lights glow softly around the room, reflecting on colorful ornaments as she carefully places a decoration on the tree. The Christmas tree is tall and lush, adorned with red, gold, and silver ornaments, twinkling fairy lights, and a glowing star on top. Sunlight gently enters through a window mixed with warm indoor lighting, creating a festive, intimate holiday atmosphere. The woman has a natural, joyful expression, slightly smiling, her hair softly illuminated by the lights. Shallow depth of field, soft bokeh effects, cinematic lighting, highly detailed textures, realistic skin tones, 8K quality, photorealistic, holiday mood, warm color grading.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765604514_7dccfe271c4d.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"ChristmasVibes\",\"HolidayMagic\",\"FestiveMood\",\"CinematicChristmas\",\"CozyHome\",\"ChristmasDecor\",\"WarmLighting\",\"HolidayAesthetic\",\"Photorealistic\",\"8KVisuals\",\"ChristmasTreeDecor\",\"WinterFestive\",\"JoyfulMoments\",\"AIPhotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-13 05:41:54', NULL, 0, 2),
