(410, 'Lantern of Destiny', 18, 'A soul illuminated above the Loy Krathong night — where tradition, light, and emotion float together.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Photo-realistic DSLR portrait photograph, cinematic flash lighting, ultra-detailed human skin.\r\nA high-resolution, realistic bird\'s-eye view photograph looking down at a large sky lantern floating in the night sky. The lantern is larger than a person. On top of the lantern is a person (face details are 100% identical to the original image), sitting with their head tilted back, arms outstretched gracefully, looking at the camera.\r\nThe person is wearing an intricately patterned Thai silk dress with sparkling gold and jeweled jewelry.\r\nIf male: wearing a loincloth and a Rajapratan shirt, without a sash or shawl.\r\nIf female: wearing a Thai Chakri or Chakraphat dress made of shiny, luxurious silk.\r\nThe background is the Loy Krathong festival atmosphere, with numerous small krathongs (floating lanterns) scattered in the river. Hundreds of candlelight from the krathongs sparkle on the water\'s surface, along with the lights from buildings and fireworks illuminating the sky beautifully. Many sky lanterns are floating at various levels throughout the sky. Create an atmosphere that is warm, sacred, and captivating.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765623260_28aa2dd714b8.png', NULL, '[\"LanternOfDestiny\",\"LoyKrathongFestival\",\"ThaiCulturalElegance\",\"FloatingLanterns\",\"SacredNight\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"BirdsEyeView\",\"FestivalOfLights\",\"GoldenGlow\",\"CulturalFantasy\",\"PhotoRealisticArt\",\"UltraDetailed\",\"AIPhotography\",\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-13 10:54:20', NULL, 0, 0),
