(415, 'Mario’s Cozy Café Magic', 33, 'Where baking meets nostalgia — a joyful, hyper-realistic moment of teamwork, warmth, and playful Mario-inspired charm in a cozy café.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a hyper-realistic image of the uploaded person they dressed in a coordinated red-and-blue café baking outfit matching Mario’s palette: a red fitted baker’s top, blue apron with embroidered mushrooms, rolled sleeves, hair same hairstyle above , wearing comfortable brown kitchen clogs and minimal jewelry, with face 100% preserved and identical. Mario appears as a lifelike human-sized plumber-chef hybrid in red cap, blue overalls, and white gloves. They are smiling happily while kneading dough together at a wooden counter inside a cozy coffee shop filled with plants, pastries, and warm tones. Studio lighting with soft key light creates a joyful, inviting mood. Wide-angle 35mm lens, f/2.8, 8K resolution, rule-of-thirds composition.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765688995_39fe7a7a3d9c.png', NULL, '[\"MarioInspired\",\"CafeAesthetic\",\"BakingTogether\",\"HyperRealisticArt\",\"AIPhotography\",\"PicPose\",\"CreativePortrait\",\"CoffeeShopVibes\",\"StudioLighting\",\"8KArt\",\"AIImagePrompt\",\"MarioVibes\",\"WarmTones\",\"FoodAndFun\",\"CinematicPortrait\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-14 05:09:55', NULL, 0, 1),
(416, 'Iron Throne Rockstar', 17, 'Post-Apocalyptic Power, Cyber Soul & Rebel Music\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, cinematic image of a rockstar man, resembling the attached photo, sitting on a imposing throne made of scrap metal, concrete, and technological junk.\" He has messy gray hair, wears sunglasses, several colorful scarves, thick rings and torn and worn jeans. He holds a classic Les Paul electric guitar in one hand and a lit cigarette in the other, as the smoke artistically rising. Behind your head, there\'s a glowing blue holographic tech halo with cyber symbols. The setting is a dusty post-apocalyptic desert. In the background, little worn out white robots watch. In the foreground, heads of green reptilian humanoids (lizard men) appear in the corners, facing the throne. Dramatic lighting, high definition, 3D digital art style.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765689245_f3d1d1a19509.png', NULL, '[\"IronThroneRockstar\",\"PostApocalypticKing\",\"CyberRockVibes\",\"DigitalArt3D\",\"HyperRealisticArt\",\"RockstarAesthetic\",\"CyberHalo\",\"FutureRebel\",\"AIArtIndia\",\"SciFiFantasyArt\",\"GuitarLegend\",\"ApocalypseMood\",\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"AIImagePrompt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 1, '2025-12-14 05:14:05', NULL, 0, 2),
(417, 'Smokey Santa Swagger', 17, 'Luxury attitude meets festive chaos — a cinematic Santa with smoke, style, and confidence.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, 8k, cinematic medium shot captures a person wearing a bright red Santa hat with a fluffy white brim and pom-pom, and a red \"ugly Christmas sweater\" adorned with white snowflake patterns and small white pom-poms. The character, with uploaded face as reference, wears dark aviator-style sunglasses and is exhaling a thick, dense cloud of smoke from their mouth and nose, creating a dramatic \"smoke beard\" effect that billows upwards. Their right hand (viewer\'s left) is raised in a thumbs-up gesture, prominently displaying a silver watch with a diamond-studded bezel, while their left hand rests on a dark table, partially obscured by the low-lying, volumetric smoke that completely covers the lower half of the frame. Through the smoke, several green and white poker chips are visible on the table. The composition features a shallow depth of field, with the character in sharp focus against a dramatically blurred background of warm, golden bokeh lights from numerous Christmas string lights, creating a festive and glowing atmosphere. A red and white candy cane striped pole is subtly visible on the left side of the background. The lighting is dramatic and cinematic, with strong front lighting illuminating the smoke and the character, complemented by soft backlighting from the bokeh, creating a vibrant and mysterious scene.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765689549_ba3669ae6946.png', NULL, '[\"SmokeySanta\",\"SantaWithSwag\",\"ChristmasDrip\",\"UglySweaterVibes\",\"FestiveSmoke\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"8KHyperRealistic\",\"HolidayAesthetic\",\"LuxuryChristmas\",\"SantaStyle\",\"BokehLights\",\"PokerVibes\",\"AttitudeShot\",\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"AIChristmasArt\",\"AIPhotoPrompt\",\"CreativePortrait\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-14 05:19:09', NULL, 0, 0);
