(418, 'Miniature Mountains, Mega Imagination', 17, 'A focused artist brings a peaceful mountain river diorama to life—where tiny worlds meet giant creativity.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an image in 9:16 ratio, of this man in the above image sits cross-legged on a wooden floor, looking focused and meticulous as he creates a nature diorama using a small brush. He wears a casual red T-shirt, blue jeans,and black anf white sneakers giving an everyday casual style. His facial expression is happy and full of concentration as he works.\r\nIn front of him is a highly realistic mountain river diorama, featuring clear bluish water with natural flow and foam effects, richly textured river stones, and miniature green grass that looks alive. A small concrete bridge spans across the river, with miniature children playing—some standing on the bridge, others jumping into the river—captured in dynamic, natural poses.\r\nThe background of the diorama shows a dense, tall pine forest. Soft morning sunlight filters through the trees, creating gentle god rays and a cool, peaceful atmosphere typical of Indonesian mountain landscapes. Around the young man are complete diorama tools such as various acrylic paints, brushes, tweezers, glue, small bottles, and synthetic grass materials, naturally scattered across the floor.\r\nThe visual composition uses a giant-scale concept, where the diorama maker appears much larger than the miniatures, creating a creative and magical visual effect.\r\nCinematic ultra-realistic style,vibrant colours photorealistic, sharp details, very fine textures, natural lighting, realistic colors, depth of field, 8K resolution, high realism, dramatic yet peaceful mood.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765690317_61a0ae2a2477.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"MiniatureWorld\",\"DioramaArt\",\"CreativeScale\",\"TinyWorldBigDreams\",\"ArtInProgress\",\"CinematicCreation\",\"UltraRealisticArt\",\"ScaleModelArt\",\"MiniaturePhotography\",\"CreativeMind\",\"VisualStorytelling\",\"Photorealistic\",\"8KArt\",\"ImaginationUnleashed\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-14 05:31:57', NULL, 0, 0),
(419, 'Ride the Moment', 18, 'A fearless mountain biker captured in a candid cinematic selfie — raw energy, real smile, and unstoppable freedom.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create candid ultra-realistic cinematic glamour image 100% copy face ,identical to the attached image. A young woman\r\n close-up, low-angle, real-life photograph of a smiling female mountain biker looking directly at the camera. She has long, brown hair flowing over her shoulders and is wearing a silver or gray helmet . She is wearing a white and black cycling jersey with a prominent floral or abstract design in pink/purple accents on the sides. Her right hand, wearing a black cycling glove, is raised in a \"rock on\" hand gesture (sign of the horns), and her fingernails are painted black. She is wearing black cycling shorts. The shot is taken from a low perspective, capturing the front wheel and handlebars of the mountain bike and a bright, slightly overexposed blue sky with white clouds in the background. Selfie perspective.\r\nHigh-resolution, realistic photograph. Clear focus on the subject. Camera: Shot on a high-end mirrorless camera (e.g., Sony A7R V or Canon R5) with a fast 85mm lens (e.g., f/1.4 or f/1.2). Soft, dramatic high-key  lighting, beautiful skin texture, elegant, shallow depth of field.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765690388_427b4198bdc3.png', NULL, '[\"RideTheMoment\",\"CinematicGlamour\",\"MountainBikerGirl\",\"AdventurePortrait\",\"LowAngleShot\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"SelfiePerspective\",\"ActionLifestyle\",\"CyclingVibes\",\"FearlessFemale\",\"OutdoorCinematic\",\"HighKeyLighting\",\"MirrorlessMagic\",\"85mmLook\",\"picpose\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-14 05:33:08', NULL, 0, 0),
(420, 'Little Harvest of Happiness', 18, 'A radiant smile, tiny hands full of fresh greens, and pure joy blooming under the sun 🌞\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a close-up photo from a prototype face that is more than 98% similar. A cute toddler with a round face and rosy cheeks, looking directly at the camera. The child has a radiant, infectious smile, revealing small teeth, with bright eyes that convey pure happiness.\r\n• Attire:\r\n• The child is wearing a light brown, round straw hat (boater style).\r\n• The outfit consists of a matching sleeveless top and trousers made from fabric featuring a traditional geometric pattern (reminiscent of Thai traditional textiles) in earthy tones of reddish-brown, gold, and cream.\r\n• Props & Action:\r\n• Back: Strapped to the child\'s back is a tall, woven bamboo basket (traditional backpack style), held by white ropes.\r\n• Hands: The child\'s small hands are grasping the handle of a large wicker basket held in front. This basket is overflowing with fresh green vegetables, likely flowering choy sum or bok choy, distinguished by their dark green leaves and clusters of small yellow flowers.\r\nBackground & Atmosphere:\r\n• Setting: An outdoor organic vegetable garden featuring raised wooden planter beds.\r\n• Environment: The background is filled with rows of leafy green vegetables blurring slightly into the distance. Bright natural sunlight illuminates the scene from the upper left, casting soft highlights on the child\'s face and the vegetables. The sky above is a vivid, cloudless blue, contributing to a cheerful, wholesome, and sunny atmosphere. \r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765690760_12d1d4d8bd48.png', NULL, '[\"LittleFarmer\",\"PureHappiness\",\"InnocentSmile\",\"OrganicLife\",\"VillageVibes\",\"NatureLove\",\"TinyExplorer\",\"WholesomeMoments\",\"SunlitJoy\",\"ChildhoodMagic\",\"TraditionalStyle\",\"GreenHarvest\",\"NaturalBeauty\",\"CuteToddler\",\"PicPose\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-14 05:39:20', NULL, 0, 0),
(421, 'Selfie Safari: Market Mayhem Adventure', 33, 'When a simple selfie turns into a joyful 3D family adventure surrounded by animated animal chaos\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a highly detailed, cinematic, ultra-realistic 3D animated scene inspired by a fun family adventure movie style.\r\nUse the uploaded photo as the main human subject, preserving 100% accurate facial features, skin tone, face shape, expression, and identity from the uploaded image. Do not change the face.\r\nScene & Composition:\r\nThe main character is standing at the center of a colorful indoor vegetable market, holding a smartphone in one hand and taking a cheerful selfie. The camera angle is slightly wide, selfie perspective, with dynamic depth and lively action in the background.\r\nCharacters & Action:\r\nSurround the main character with expressive, friendly, animated animal characters (mammoth, tiger, sloth, fox, squirrel, and other playful animals). Each animal shows exaggerated emotions like surprise, excitement, laughter, and curiosity, leaning into the frame for a group selfie moment.\r\nEnvironment:\r\nA busy fresh produce market with wooden crates full of fruits and vegetables (apples, tomatoes, cucumbers, greens) scattered naturally on the floor. People in the background react with shock and excitement adding story and motion.\r\nStyle & Quality:\r\nPixar / Ice-Age inspired 3D animation style, cinematic lighting, soft global illumination, realistic textures, shallow depth of field, vibrant colors, ultra-sharp focus on the main subject.\r\nOutput:\r\n8K resolution, ultra-high detail, professional cinematic render, joyful and adventurous mood, perfectly blended face replacement with no distortion.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765700835_0fb1c17d32ca.png', NULL, '[\"SelfieSafari\",\"MarketMayhem\",\"PicPose\",\"3DAdventure\",\"PixarStyle\",\"IceAgeVibes\",\"FamilyFun\",\"AnimatedAnimals\",\"Cinematic3D\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"AI3DArt\",\"FacePreserved\",\"GroupSelfie\",\"JoyfulMoments\",\"8KRender\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-14 08:27:15', NULL, 0, 0),
(422, 'Neon Pulse DJ Queen', 27, 'A cyberpunk-inspired DJ portrait glowing with futuristic neon beats, confidence, and electrifying energy\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A vibrant, highly detailed digital artwork of a female DJ with neon lighting effects. She has wavy, shoulder-length hair illuminated with glowing blue and pink highlights, wearing large, reflective sunglasses that mirror the neon lights. She is dressed in a pink lace off-shoulder top, revealing her cleavage, with a confident and focused expression. She is wearing headphones over her head, with one hand adjusting the headphones and the other hand on a DJ turntable. The scene is set against a dark background, emphasizing the colorful neon glow, creating a futuristic and energetic atmosphere. The DJ equipment includes a professional mixer and two turntables, illuminated with subtle pink and purple lighting accents. The overall style is cyberpunk-inspired with a focus on glowing neon elements, vivid colors, and a dynamic, immersive vibe.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765704428_2e4027ba33e7.png', NULL, '[\"NeonDJ\",\"CyberpunkVibes\",\"FuturisticPortrait\",\"AIArtCreation\",\"DigitalArtwork\",\"NeonAesthetic\",\"DJLife\",\"GlowEffect\",\"SynthwaveStyle\",\"AIImagePrompt\",\"PicPose\",\"CreativeAI\",\"CyberGlow\",\"MusicMeetsArt\",\"VisualBeats\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-14 09:27:08', NULL, 0, 0),
(423, 'Crimson Wreath Queen', 18, 'A Luxurious Christmas Fantasy Portrait Wrapped in Red Elegance & Winter Magic\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic Christmas fantasy portrait of a stunning woman sitting elegantly on a giant circular Christmas wreath adorned with glowing warm fairy lights, red and gold ornaments, and lush green pine branches. She is wearing an extravagant couture gown entirely made of layered red poinsettia petals with emerald green leaves, sparkling crystal embellishments, and a long flowing train that spreads beautifully across the snowy ground. Her long straight hair is perfectly styled, her makeup is glamorous with deep red lipstick and shimmering gold accents on her cheekbones. She poses gracefully with one leg crossed, wearing shiny gold high heels. Soft snowflakes fall around her in a serene winter forest filled with tall trees and glowing archways of Christmas lights behind her. Magical atmosphere, cinematic lighting, 8K ultra realistic details, rich colors, perfect skin texture, bokeh lights, fantasy holiday aesthetic, luxurious Christmas editorial photoshoot.\r\nMake it real face the photo uploaded\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765705658_45cc709900e6.png', NULL, '[\"CrimsonWreathQueen\",\"PicPose\",\"ChristmasFantasy\",\"LuxuryChristmas\",\"HolidayEditorial\",\"ChristmasPortrait\",\"FestiveGlam\",\"WinterMagic\",\"CoutureGown\",\"PoinsettiaDress\",\"ChristmasLights\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"8KUltraRealistic\",\"FantasyPhotoshoot\",\"AIChristmasArt\",\"HolidayGlamour\",\"LuxuryEditorial\",\"WinterFairyTale\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-14 09:47:38', NULL, 2, 2),
(424, 'Emerald Empress', 18, 'A cinematic luxury portrait where emerald silk, golden glow, and unshakable confidence meet timeless elegance.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'The same person, the same face, without any change in features. An extremely realistic image with sharp details. A medium-length portrait shot. A woman stands in a narrow corner of a luxurious room, displaying a deep emerald silk dress that flows smoothly from a thin shoulder to the waist, with delicate pleats and a clear seam that shines with the dim light. Professional makeup, green eyes, full lips colored with glossy lipstick, long, soft, blond hair arranged that flows around her shoulders, and she wears a thin gold necklace in the shape of a small, shiny heart and earrings of the same shape, and an elegant ring that shines on her finger, adorned with diamonds. She raises the hand lined with velvet leather towards her chest to highlight the necklace and catch the light on the surface of the dress, while she lets her bare shoulders appear in a gentle contrast with the shiny fabric, and she gazes with a directed look out of the frame that reflects composure and unshakeable confidence. The background is dark, with subtle golden reflections and scattered light impurities that create depth and a three-dimensional effect. The image is bathed in a warm glow with soft shadows that highlight the details of the fabric, embroidery, and velvet leather. The camera zooms in from the center of the chest at a slightly forward angle. A shallow depth of field separates the model from the dark background and gives the image a cinematic feel with precise handling of shadow and highlights. A color palette ranging from emerald green and gold to deep black dominates, with subtle contrasts that enhance the sense of luxury and opulence. Keywords: luxury, realistic photography, emerald silk dress, gold jewelry, opulent feel, warm lighting, shallow depth of field, classic portrait, cinematography, high detail.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765774087_42f0de06594c.png', NULL, '[\"EmeraldEmpress\",\"LuxuryPortrait\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"HighFashionLook\",\"EmeraldSilkDress\",\"GoldenGlow\",\"OpulentStyle\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"EditorialPortrait\",\"ShallowDepthOfField\",\"LuxuryAesthetic\",\"FashionCinematography\",\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-15 04:48:07', NULL, 0, 0),
(425, 'Sky Rebellion: The PicPose Manifesto', 17, 'A fearless punk standing above the clouds, claiming the sky with defiance, freedom, and the power of PicPose AI.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A cinematic wide-angle shot of a rebellious punk man standing triumphantly on top of a modern stealth fighter jet mid-flight above a vast mountain range. He stands with legs apart in a powerful stance, holding a bold protest sign overhead that reads “PicPose AI” in distressed white lettering on a red-and-black background, with a smaller name beneath it. He wears a sleeveless, patch-covered punk vest over a black shirt, cargo pants with a chain, and heavy combat boots. His expression is confident and defiant. Bright daylight sky with lens flare, crisp blue atmosphere, clouds drifting below, dramatic sense of height and freedom. Hyper-realistic detail, cinematic lighting, sharp focus, epic scale, high-contrast realism, ultra-detailed textures, 4K quality.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765774426_ea9ce87be701.png', NULL, '[\"SkyRebellion\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"RebelInTheSky\",\"CinematicFreedom\",\"PunkAesthetic\",\"EpicScale\",\"AIArtCinematic\",\"DefiantSpirit\",\"JetTopPose\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"4KVisuals\",\"CreativeRevolt\",\"FutureOfAIArt\",\"HighContrastArt\",\"PicPoseBrand\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-15 04:53:46', NULL, 0, 0),
(426, 'Frozen Blue Christmas Dream ❄️🩵', 18, 'A hyper-realistic winter fantasy where sky-blue elegance meets festive magic — glowing reindeer, cozy interiors, and timeless holiday charm.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Frosty Sky-Blue Reindeer Scene\r\nTransform my photo into a hyper-realistic, wide shot with backlighting, 8k resolution, and a very refined image. Make sure my face has 100% accuracy the same with the uploaded photo.\r\nOutfit/Shoes: White winter coat with sky-blue lining, snow boots.\r\nHairstyle/Accessories: Hair with bangs, sky-blue earmuffs.\r\nPose: leaning on a very big sky-blue reindeer display while reaching out to touch its glowing antlers.\r\nView: In the Living room with feathered Sky-Blue carpet, sky-blue big Christmas Tree and a chimney with sky-blue Xmas lights and ornaments.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765774962_90c50aa242f1.png', NULL, '[\"FrozenBlueChristmas\",\"SkyBlueWinter\",\"ReindeerFantasy\",\"ChristmasAesthetic\",\"WinterPortrait\",\"HolidayMagic\",\"FestiveVibes\",\"BlueChristmasTheme\",\"HyperRealisticAI\",\"AIPhotoTransformation\",\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"AIChristmasArt\",\"WinterWonderland\",\"LuxuryHolidayLook\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-15 05:02:42', NULL, 0, 0),
