(428, 'Urban Duke Rider', 17, 'A hyper-realistic portrait of a young street-style rider, confidence in his eyes, city greens behind him, and attitude riding strong on a KTM Duke 250.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Hyper-realistic full body shot: me(use my face with accurate 100%) A 13 year old cool young boy, oversized black shirt, Baggy Denim pants, and white sneakers, and slightly messy dark hair, sharp jawline, direct gaze,, his height is 5.5 feet.he sitting on a customized red and black ktm duke250 motorcycle. He is looking ahead. He has a glossy rider black helmet on the tank of the bike and he has placed his hands on it. The scene is outdoors. Background This image Urban green.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765797257_dff87bd5cd66.png', NULL, '[\"UrbanRider\",\"KTMVibes\",\"Duke250\",\"StreetStyleBoy\",\"YoungRider\",\"HyperRealisticAI\",\"FullBodyPortrait\",\"BikeLovers\",\"UrbanGreen\",\"CoolKidStyle\",\"AIPhotography\",\"PicPose\",\"AIImagePrompt\",\"StreetAesthetic\",\"RiderMood\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-15 11:14:17', NULL, 0, 2),
