(432, 'Enchanted Storytime with Minnie & Mickey', 23, 'A magical, hyper-realistic library moment where pastel fashion meets childhood fantasy — faces preserved, emotions alive.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a hyper-realistic image of the uploaded person the girl dressed in a soft pastel pink cashmere sweater,with white polka dots and high-waisted jeans, and stylish white sneakers, men is wearing a knit sweater with white polka dots and cargo pants and sneakers , she wearing delicate small pearl earrings the men same hairstyle same hairstyle of the uploaded image above ,she wear a big ribbon polkadots headband color pink with face 100% preserved and identical, they sitting cross-legged on the library floor reading an open storybook beside Minnie Mouse and Micky brought to life as a photorealistic, full-sized, plush-textured character in iconic pink polka-dot dress and bow.mickey Mouse with iconic red jumper suit The enchanted library glows with golden light from a fireplace, shelves packed with books reaching the ceiling, and sparkles of magic drifting in the air. Warm amber lighting with floating dust particles, soft bokeh in the background. Professional DSLR, 35mm lens, f/2.8, 8K ultra HD.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765860661_e24379fea6c8.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"EnchantedLibrary\",\"MinnieMouse\",\"MickeyMouse\",\"MagicalStorytime\",\"AIPhotoRealism\",\"HyperRealisticAI\",\"FacePreserved\",\"PastelAesthetic\",\"CouplePortrait\",\"FantasyPhotography\",\"StorybookVibes\",\"WarmCinematicLight\",\"AIArtIndia\",\"PhotorealisticAI\",\"8KUltraHD\",\"CreativeAI\",\"PicPosePrompts\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration',