(433, 'Paradise in a Glass', 27, 'A surreal miniature beach world captured inside a crystal-clear tumbler, where fantasy meets hyper-realistic summer dreams.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A surreal miniature beach paradise contained inside a transparent glass tumbler. Inside the glass is a crystal-clear turquoise lagoon surrounded by soft white sand and lush green vegetation. Tiny people relax on the beach, swim in the water, and play a small game of beach volleyball set underwater. Colorful umbrellas dot the sand, and swimmers float beneath the surface, with bubbles rising through the water. Rocky formations frame the lagoon on both sides. At the top edge of the glass sits a small tropical house with a porch, backed by tall palm trees swaying gently. Warm natural sunlight filters through, creating soft highlights, reflections on the glass, and a shallow depth of field. The scene feels whimsical, hyper-detailed, cinematic, and dreamlike, blending realism with fantasy, like a tiny vacation world captured inside a drinking glass. optimized for high-resolution 16K upscale.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765861003_0263f9552e5e.png', NULL, '[\"ParadiseInAGlass\",\"MiniatureWorld\",\"SurrealArt\",\"FantasyPhotography\",\"Dreamscape\",\"TinyUniverse\",\"CinematicArt\",\"GlassWorld\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"AIArtCreation\",\"AIImagePrompt\",\"CreativeVisuals\",\"WhimsicalArt\",\"VacationVibes\",\"BeachFantasy\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-16 04:56:43', NULL, 0, 1),
