(439, 'Midnight Drift at Barangaroo', 17, 'A cinematic urban night portrait capturing a lone traveler against Sydney’s glowing harbor skyline — where city lights, motion, and silence meet.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Tourist man standing along the waterfront walkways of Barangaroo Reserve, wearing a black casual tee, dark jeans, and white sneakers, city lights reflecting off the harbor at night. The Sydney skyline glows behind him with subtle motion blur from passing ferries. Strong focus on the man in the foreground and the illuminated skyscrapers behind. Wide angle, ultra-realistic, cinematic urban night lighting, 8k resolution, full body shot, drone shot capturing the curved shoreline and glowing skyline.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765875563_32bf56658cee.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"StreetStyleBoy\",\"AlohaVibes\",\"GoldenHourGlow\",\"BokehBackground\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"4KPortrait\",\"StylishLook\",\"ModernFashion\",\"CasualDrip\",\"NaturalTones\",\"PortraitPhotography\",\"AIImagePrompt\",\"CreativeVisuals\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-16 08:59:23', NULL, 0, 0),
(440, 'City of 2026', 17, 'A cinematic vision of tomorrow — where style, technology, and ambition meet in the heart of a futuristic city.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, 8k, full vertical shot with a slightly low-angle perspective, captured with a standard lens, depicts a futuristic cityscape under bright, clear daylight with cinematic lighting casting soft, defined shadows. The composition features a male character, uploaded face as reference, sitting cross-legged atop massive, highly detailed, brushed metallic silver 3D numbers that spell \"2026\", which are positioned directly on a checkered city sidewalk. The character is wearing a vibrant orange short-sleeved hoodie over a clean white t-shirt, dark grey joggers, and white sneakers with orange laces, looking thoughtfully towards the viewer\'s left. In the background, towering, modern skyscrapers with reflective glass and concrete facades rise into the clear blue sky, adorned with large, glowing digital billboards displaying abstract, colorful graphics. Several sleek, futuristic flying vehicles are visible in the mid-ground sky, adding to the sci-fi ambiance. The street level features blurred pedestrians, providing a sense of depth and urban activity. The entire scene is rendered with highly detailed textures and a clean, vibrant aesthetic.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765875868_3f812c16554c.png', NULL, '[\"Future2026\",\"CityOfTomorrow\",\"SciFiAesthetic\",\"FuturisticVibes\",\"UrbanFuture\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"8KVisuals\",\"DigitalCity\",\"FlyingCars\",\"ModernSkyscrapers\",\"NextGenStyle\",\"OrangeHoodie\",\"CreativeAI\",\"AIPortrait\",\"AIArtIndia\",\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, N