(441, 'Urban Velocity Drip', 27, 'A cinematic portrait of modern street confidence — futuristic ride, bold fashion, and city energy captured in ultra-realistic detail.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A handsome young man, using 100% of his face, hairstyle, and body proportions from the uploaded image, wearing reflective sunglasses, wireless earbuds, a dark gray soft wool sweater, topped with a black leather jacket, ripped blue jeans, and black leather shoes. He is sitting on a large sporty motorcycle scooter with a futuristic design, which is dark purple with yellow star-shaped accents and lines.\r\nScene & Background: Set in a modern city street, featuring urban buildings, streets, and city details, under bright daylight.\r\nCamera & Style: Medium shot, 85mm lens, shallow depth of field, cinematic colors, natural soft light, realistic textures, ultra-realistic details, high-quality photography look.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765876615_e78eb064081b.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"UrbanStyle\",\"StreetDrip\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"FuturisticRide\",\"CityVibes\",\"MenFashion\",\"ModernAesthetic\",\"MotorcycleLife\",\"UrbanPhotography\",\"AIPhotography\",\"AIImagePrompt\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"StreetStyleMen\",\"EditorialLook\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-16 09:16:55', NULL, 3, 3),
(442, 'A Magical Winter Chase', 27, 'A hyper-realistic cinematic moment where golden-hour sunlight, playful fantasy, and pure winter joy collide in motion.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a hyper-realistic 8K vertical cinematic winter scene during golden hour. A young adult (use uploaded face as exact reference) wearing a green puffer jacket, white snow pants, and brown furry snow boots sits on a wooden sled sliding downhill. The subject is laughing and looking directly at the camera.\r\nBehind the sled, a cute anthropomorphic snowman (Olaf-inspired) with a carrot nose, stick arms, and flowing green scarf is pushing the sled, creating playful motion. Snow sprays realistically with subtle motion blur.\r\nThe background shows a snowy pine forest, warm sunset rim light, volumetric light rays, and a pastel pink–blue sky. Cinematic lighting, ultra-detailed textures, sharp focus, magical winter realism.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765877298_dc57507cc6e3.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"WinterMagic\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"AIImagePrompt\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"8KPhotography\",\"GoldenHourVibes\",\"FantasyRealism\",\"SnowAdventure\",\"MagicalMoments\",\"VolumetricLighting\",\"SurrealArt\",\"AIPhotography\",\"CreativeAI\",\"WinterAesthetic\",\"Photorealistic\",\"MotionInFrame\",\"AIArtCommunity\",\"VisualStorytelling\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 1, 0, '2025-12-16 09:28:18', NULL, 5, 3),
(443, 'Golden Breeze by the Sea', 18, 'A sun-kissed tropical portrait capturing elegance, warmth, and effortless island beauty.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Use 100% my uploaded face as the identity reference, keeping the face natural and realistic with correct proportions and skin texture.. A beautiful young Asian woman, looking over her shoulder, smiling gently at the viewer, long wavy brown hair, white plumeria flower tucked behind her ear, wearing a flowy off-the-shoulder yellow tiered maxi dress, dress gently billowing in the breeze, standing on a pristine white sand beach, clear turquoise ocean in the background, a white motorboat gently floating in the distance, lush green palm trees with one prominent palm tree arching over from the left, bright tropical sunshine, warm golden hour light creating a soft lens flare in the upper left, idyllic atmosphere, professional studio photography, highly detailed, hyperrealistic, photorealistic, 8k, ultra-high resolution, cinematic lighting, vibrant colors, sharp focus, shallow depth of field, captured from a slightly low angle, natural pose.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765947551_8647f7519863.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"GoldenHourGlow\",\"TropicalPortrait\",\"BeachAesthetic\",\"IslandVibes\",\"SummerElegance\",\"AIPhotography\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"PhotorealisticAI\",\"BeachPhotoshoot\",\"TropicalBeauty\",\"PortraitInSunlight\",\"AIImageGeneration\",\"UltraHDVisuals\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-17 04:59:11', NULL, 0, 0),
(444, 'Ivory Authority', 18, 'A cinematic luxury portrait where refined tailoring, soft fur, and confident elegance merge into a powerful fashion statement.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'The same person, the same face, unaltered features. An exaggeratedly realistic image with sharp detail: a medium shot of a stunning woman standing against a dark concrete wall in an interior studio. Her long, sleek, blond hair flows smoothly over her shoulders with a soft sheen. Green eyes, professional makeup, and full lips are framed by a thick layer of white fur, enhancing her luxurious presence and lending the scene a tangible depth. She wears a white double-breasted suit with a glossy satin collar that accentuates the shoulders and bust, with gold buttons and a minimalist pocket layout that exudes refined rigor. Beneath, the delicate textures of the fabric blend and the threads shimmer in the light, while the warm, fair skin reveals a hint of her neck at the collar opening, striking a balance between strength and femininity. An elegant gold ring adorns her finger, and small, sparkling gold heart earrings add a touch of brilliance without being overpowering. The lighting is soft and focused from the left, creating gentle shadows and highlighting the details of the tailoring, satin, and fur, while the dark background maintains the depth of the scene and gives it a cinematic feel. The camera, positioned at shoulder level with a shallow depth of field, makes the craftsmanship in the textures and sheen of the fabrics stand out. The close-up frame creates a powerful presence, while subtle processing enhances the softness of the texture and the contrast of the dark fabrics. The dark colors and varied textures combine to create a stern and aesthetically pleasing visual statement, like a sophisticated fashion advertisement that embodies both confidence and rigor. Keywords: Cinematography, luxury fashion, white suit, white fur, fine tailoring, side lighting, glossy satin, shallow depth of field, neutral colors, dramatic effect.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765947874_be6ddcd4db27.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"LuxuryFashion\",\"HighFashionPortrait\",\"IvoryElegance\",\"WhiteSuitStyle\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"FashionEditorial\",\"StudioFashion\",\"PowerLook\",\"ModernElegance\",\"FineTailoring\",\"FashionPhotography\",\"AIImageArt\",\"EditorialStyle\",\"LuxuryAesthetic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-17 05:04:34', NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `ai_posts` (`id`, `title`, `category_id`, `short_description`, `prompt_text`, `image_url1`, `image_url2`, `tags`, `external_id`, `status`, `moderation_flags`, `reviewed_by`, `reviewed_at`, `priority`, `is_popular`, `is_featured`, `tier`, `premium_unlock_cost_points`, `premium_pack`, `likes`, `favorites`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `copies`, `views`) VALUES
(445, 'Steel Resolve', 17, 'A cinematic portrait of dominance, grit, and unshakable leadership — forged in shadows.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper detailed cinematic scene featuring use uploaded face 100% as reference as the charismatic leader, leaning casually against a worn, rust-pitted corrugated metal wall, a faint smile playing on his lips. The camera captures the hero in the center of the frame with absolute clarity and dramatic presence. He wears a meticulously tailored black leather jacket with visible stitching and subtle scuffs, over a thick, dark grey Henley shirt with substantial fabric weight. His jeans are rugged denim, showing realistic creases and faded patches. In his right hand, Lucille, a baseball bat wrapped in barbed wire, rests effortlessly on his shoulder, the sharp wires glinting subtly. The setting is a dimly lit, dilapidated warehouse interior, dust motes dancing in shafts of gritty sunlight filtering through high, broken windows. A group of his wary, subservient followers stand in the blurred background. heavy atmosphere. Use language inspired by premium photography and expert level photo manipulation techniques similar to high end Photoshop to achieve top quality realism without CGI or 3D graphics. Create a one of a kind, unforgettable scene with unmatched detail, cinematic power, and full focus on the hero. no CGI or 3D graphics or art. use Photoshop manipulation if the scene illogical and imaginary.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765948267_d2826ad41b30.png', NULL, '[\"SteelResolve\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"DarkCinematic\",\"LeaderVibes\",\"GritAndPower\",\"LucilleEffect\",\"MoodyPhotography\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"PhotoshopMasterpiece\",\"NoCGI\",\"PremiumPhotoManipulation\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"HeroShot\",\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-17 05:11:07', NULL, 0, 1),
(446, 'Moments Before Christmas', 37, 'A warm candid captured as festive lights glow and a timeless memory is made.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A candid, slightly low-angle shot looking up at the man as he reaches up to place an ornament on a tall, heavily decorated Christmas tree. He is dressed in a festive, dark green flannel shirt with a navy and red tartan plaid pattern, buttoned up, and dark indigo selvedge denim jeans. His body is angled slightly away from the camera, showing the action in his hands. The background is a cozy living room filled with warm fairy lights. The composition focuses on the interaction between the man and the tree. Shot on Leica M10 with a 35mm f/1.4 lens. Natural indoor light mixed with tree lights. KEEP FACE FEATURES IDENTICAL FROM ATTACHED IMAGE.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765948567_93b8853113c5.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"ChristmasVibes\",\"FestiveMoments\",\"HolidaySeason\",\"CandidPhotography\",\"ChristmasTree\",\"WarmLights\",\"CozyHome\",\"LifestylePortrait\",\"LeicaPhotography\",\"NaturalLightPhotography\",\"HolidayMood\",\"WinterAesthetic\",\"ChristmasDecor\",\"StorytellingShot\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-17 05:16:07', NULL, 1, 3),
(447, 'Whispers of Wonder in the Enchanted Library', 17, 'A magical cinematic moment where reality meets fantasy — laughter, love, and light swirling through an endless dream library.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A realistic portrait of a young man sitting on concrete steps beside a modern white pillar. He is wearing a navy blue and mustard yellow varsity jacket with embroidered patches, a white t-shirt, black jogger pants, and red-black high-top sneakers. He has styled dark hair, a neatly trimmed beard, and a confident, relaxed pose with one hand resting on his head. The background is softly blurred with autumn trees showing red and green leaves, creating a cinematic bokeh effect. Natural daylight, shallow depth of field, professional fashion photography, ultra-realistic, high detail, sharp focus, DSLR quality, 85mm lens look.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765949193_7f2fe3de3f35.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"ChristmasVibes\",\"FestiveMoments\",\"HolidaySeason\",\"CandidPhotography\",\"ChristmasTree\",\"WarmLights\",\"CozyHome\",\"LifestylePortrait\",\"LeicaPhotography\",\"NaturalLightPhotography\",\"HolidayMood\",\"WinterAesthetic\",\"ChristmasDecor\",\"StorytellingShot\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-17 05:26:33', NULL, 8, 12),
(448, 'Winter Royale Elegance', 18, 'A cinematic portrait of timeless luxury, fur-lined couture, and diamond-lit confidence\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a stunning portrait of an elegant woman\r\nOutfit & Styling:\r\nCoat: A luxurious, tailored brocade low neckline coat in a rich, warm brown. The fabric features intricate, shimmering champagne-colored floral and scrollwork embroidery, damask pattern that catches the light.\r\nFur Trim: The coat is heavily trimmed with thick, plush, natural-toned (taupe/sable/ash-brown) arctic fox fur. This trim is prominent on the oversized lapels, which are wrapped elegantly around the neck, and on the cuffs. The fur should look exceptionally soft, deep, and voluminous.\r\nInnerwear/Neckline: A hint of a low-cut, silk garment, a bustier, in a matching deep champagne color is visible at the cleavage, suggesting a layered, sophisticated ensemble beneath the coat.\r\nJewelry: A spectacular, icy-white diamond necklace featuring a large, ornate pendant, worn close to the throat. Matching dramatic, chandelier-style diamond earrings that sparkle intensely and graze the shoulder line. The setting is white gold.\r\nHair & Makeup:\r\nHair: Voluminous, meticulously styled soft large loose curls. The hair is a vibrant, brown with warm, golden undertones that reflect light. The style has deep side-parting and incredible shine, with perfect curls framing the face.\r\nMakeup (Glamorous/Soft Focus):\r\nEyes: Perfectly blended smokey eye in taupe, champagne, and deep brown shades. Sharp, liquid black eyeliner and dramatically long, full eyelashes. Lightly sculpted brows with perfect definition.\r\nSkin: Flawless, luminous complexion with subtle highlight on the cheekbones, bridge of the nose, and cupid\'s bow. A soft, warm bronzer defines the cheek structure.\r\nLips: Full, glossy lips painted in a natural, true red color.\r\nPose & Expression:\r\nPose: Head-and-shoulders portrait, slightly angled toward the camera (three-quarter profile). Her left hand (viewer\'s right) is subtly tucked into a pocket, keeping the pose elegant and casual.\r\nExpression: A captivating, soft, and slightly mysterious smile. Her eyes are hazel and gaze directly into the lens with a confident, warm, and inviting expression.\r\nBackground & Environment:\r\nSetting: An upscale, blurred outdoor city environment in winter. The ground is likely dusted with light, soft snow, visible in the shallow depth of field.\r\nDetails: The background should feature soft, out-of-focus architectural elements (ornate stone buildings, wrought iron fences, or blurred trees) suggesting a luxury urban district. The lighting indicates late afternoon or early evening.\r\nDepth of Field: Extreme shallow depth of field (bokeh), with the background melted into soft, creamy circles of light and color, ensuring the subject remains the sharp, central focus.\r\nLighting, Photography & Realism:\r\nLighting: Soft, directional studio lighting mixed with ambient winter light (golden hour). A catchlight should be perfectly visible in her eyes. The fur and jewelry must exhibit realistic, detailed specular highlights.\r\nCamera/Lens: Shot with a high-end full-frame DSLR (e.g., Canon R5 or Sony A1) and a fast, telephoto prime lens (e.g., 85mm f/1.2 or 135mm f/1.😎.\r\nTechnical Aesthetics: Hyper-realistic, photo-realistic, cinematic quality. Ultra-detailed texture mapping on the brocade and fur. Small watermark in the lower center : “anne.mrnd”. 8K resolution. Highly detailed skin texture (subtle pores, not plastic). Intricate detail in the threads of the fur and the cut facets of the diamonds. High contrast, warm color grading. (V-Ray, octane render).\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1765959543_ac0358417ebb.png', NULL, '[\"WinterElegance\",\"LuxuryPortrait\",\"HighFashionEditorial\",\"FurCouture\",\"BrocadeStyle\",\"DiamondGlam\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"GoldenHourBeauty\",\"LuxuryWoman\",\"FashionPhotography\",\"EditorialLook\",\"HauteCoutureVibes\",\"SoftGlamMakeup\",\"WinterFashion\",\"PicPoseAI\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-17 08:19:03', NULL, 5, 1),
(449, 'Golden Noir Elegance', 18, 'A timeless studio portrait blending rich black tones with shimmering gold details — grace, confidence, and festive luxury captured in one frame.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Portrait of a young South Asian woman with fair skin, long wavy dark brown hair styled in loose curls with a partial braid, wearing a glamorous black and gold lehenga choli outfit: a sparkling gold sequined long-sleeved crop top with deep V-neckline and intricate border details, paired with a high-waisted black skirt featuring vertical gold fringes and embellishments, and a sheer black dupatta with gold trim draped over one arm. She has a gold choker necklace, large earrings, multiple bangles, a ring, red nail polish, smoky eye makeup, and a bright smile while standing in a three-quarter pose, holding the dupatta. Neutral beige studio background with soft warm lighting, realistic style, high detail on fabric textures, jewelry, and sequins. Don\'t change the face.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766034414_447c5f59abb0.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"GoldenNoir\",\"LehengaLook\",\"SouthAsianBeauty\",\"EthnicGlam\",\"IndianFashion\",\"DesiElegance\",\"FestiveWear\",\"LuxuryPortrait\",\"StudioPortrait\",\"TraditionalWithATwist\",\"BlackAndGold\",\"HighFashionDesi\",\"BridalInspired\",\"CoutureVibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-18 05:06:54', NULL, 0, 0),
(450, 'Golden Noir Elegance', 23, 'A timeless studio portrait blending rich black tones with shimmering gold details — grace, confidence, and festive luxury captured in one frame.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Edit the uploaded photo  Ensure the face remains consistent with the person in the uploaded image, without changing facial structure, skin tone. A young couple smiling towards the camera she wearing a delicate white sundress men wearing a mustard yellow t-shirt and beige short they riding a gigantic , vibrant goldfish.the couple are tiny The scene is magical and surreal, with the couple are holding onto the fish gently as they floats in the water. Bubbles rise from above, creating a whimsical atmosphere. The background features a soft, out-of-focus underwater environment with other smaller goldfish swimming around. The lighting highlights the couple face and the golden scales of the fish, emphasizing a fantasy-like, chherful mood. The overall composition evokes a fairytale scene, blending innocence and enchantment. Using a Canon EOS R camera with a 50mm f/1.8 lens, f/2.2 aperture, shutter speed 1/200s, ISO 100 and natural light, Full Body, Hyper Realistic Photography, Cinematic, Cinema, Hyper detail, Ultra hd, Color Correction, ultra hd, hdr , color grading, \r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766034812_e7d37d9b2a44.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"GoldenFishFantasy\",\"SurrealLove\",\"FairytalePhotography\",\"UnderwaterDream\",\"FantasyCouple\",\"CinematicArt\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"AIPhotography\",\"DreamyVisuals\",\"LoveInFantasy\",\"MagicalMoments\",\"CreativeAI\",\"FantasyWorld\",\"UltraHDArt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-18 05:13:32', NULL, 0, 0),
(451, 'Ride of Joy', 27, 'Carefree laughter, shared moments, and the freedom of motion — captured in pure natural light.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Action shot of boy cycling while girl sits behind holding his shoulders, both laughing freely. Green park background, motion blur on wheels, wind in hair, natural sunlight. Full body portrait, shallow depth of field, crisp texture, sporty clothing, 4:5 ratio, 8K realism.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766035066_6696e8cb7e29.png', NULL, '[\"RideOfJoy\",\"CarefreeMoments\",\"MotionMagic\",\"NaturalLightPhotography\",\"CoupleVibes\",\"JoyInMotion\",\"CandidLove\",\"SportyStyle\",\"OutdoorPortrait\",\"GreenParkVibes\",\"ShallowDepth\",\"8KRealism\",\"FullBodyPortrait\",\"LifestylePhotography\",\"PicPose\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-18 05:17:46', NULL, 0, 0),
(452, 'Midnight Fireblade Drip', 17, 'A bold urban night portrait on the Honda CBR 1000RR-R Fireblade — leather, neon lights, and pure street attitude.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A stylish man, wearing a black leather jacket and black pants, with green sunglasses, sitting on a bright black sports motorcycle at night. The bike is a Honda CBR 1000RR-R Fireblade. He is holding a helmet. In the background, there are elevated highway overpasses with city lights, giving a modern urban feel. The lighting is dim with highlights on the man and motorcycle, suggesting artificial street lighting. The overall mood is cool and a bit edgy.A100% FACE match reference image.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766035379_18ac0bac7018.png', NULL, '[\"MidnightRider\",\"Fireblade\",\"HondaCBR\",\"UrbanBiker\",\"StreetAesthetic\",\"NightVibes\",\"LeatherStyle\",\"MotorcycleLife\",\"CityLights\",\"EdgyPortrait\",\"BikerDrip\",\"SportsBikeLove\",\"AIPhotography\",\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-18 05:22:59', NULL, 0, 0),
(453, 'Winter Wonder at the Old Steam Station', 18, 'A timeless cinematic moment of joy, nostalgia, and winter magic — where laughter meets golden sunlight and vintage steam dreams.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A high-resolution, photorealistic cinematic shot captures a joyful woman , identical person from the added image, maintaining 99.99% similarity. The subject should have natural wrinkles, skin imperfections, and distinct crow\'s feet around the eyes, with unaltered facial features and the specific eye shape clearly visible.in her 40s, featuring natural wrinkles, skin imperfections, and visible crow\'s feet around her eyes, laughing as she tosses a handful of sparkling snow into the air. She is kneeling on a snow-covered platform at a vintage train station, wearing a beige quilted puffer coat, a thick knit scarf, matching mittens, and fur-lined winter boots. In her hand, she holds a tiny, intricate toy steam engine.\r\nBehind her, a massive, black vintage steam locomotive sits on the tracks, emitting soft plumes of white steam that blend into the bright, hazy winter sunlight. The background is filled with nostalgic details, including rustic lanterns sitting on the snow and wrapped brown paper parcels. The lighting is warm and golden, creating a glowing rim light around her blonde hair, which is styled in soft waves with a delicate braid detail. The atmosphere is magical and festive, capturing a perfect moment of winter wonder.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766035813_7125b2e41e4c.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"WinterWonder\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"PhotorealisticAI\",\"VintageVibes\",\"SteamLocomotive\",\"GoldenHourMagic\",\"WinterJoy\",\"NostalgicMoments\",\"AIPhotography\",\"AIPortrait\",\"RealisticAI\",\"WinterAesthetic\",\"CinematicLight