(454, 'Ethereal Garden Bride', 18, 'A radiant bridal portrait bathed in natural sunlight, where delicate florals, flowing veil, and timeless elegance bloom together in a dreamy garden setting.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', '​Ethereal Garden Gown, stunning young blonde female subject, joyful smile, long flowing blonde hair, half-up style with loose waves, delicate white and pink floral crown integrated into the veil, translucent floor-length single-tier wedding veil flowing in the gentle breeze, wearing an elegant plunging V-neck A-line wedding gown with sheer long sleeves, the gown is meticulously adorned with detailed 3D floral lace appliqué that covers the bodice and sleeves, pearl embellishments along the neckline and sleeves, drop pearl earrings, soft natural makeup, high dynamic range, ultra-realistic, photorealistic, deep focus, natural outdoor sunlight, bokeh light elements, realistic warm lighting, standing outdoors in a lush, sunny garden surrounded by light pink blossoms and natural foliage, scattered white and pink petals gently falling around the subject, 8K ultra-realistic, 9:16 vertical, smooth skin tones, deep focus.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766036291_b2cfa7694800.png', NULL, '[\"EtherealBride\",\"GardenWedding\",\"BridalElegance\",\"FloralWeddingGown\",\"DreamyBride\",\"LuxuryBridal\",\"WeddingPortrait\",\"BridalInspiration\",\"RomanticWedding\",\"FineArtWedding\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"AIWeddingArt\",\"PhotorealisticBride\",\"SoftLightPortrait\",\"PicPose\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-18 05:38:11', NULL, 0, 0),
