(459, 'Midnight Decay', 29, 'A raw, ultra-realistic portrait of excess, survival, and broken dreams beneath the streetlights.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create A detailed description of a gritty, ultra-realistic DSLR-style photograph set at night in a cluttered, urban slum. In the center, a young man in his 30s, sits in a worn, sunken leather sofa. He wears a grey t-shirt, distressed blue jeans, and black-and-white Nike sneakers. In his left hand, he holds a small shot glass, and in his right, he holds an open clear glass bottle of liquor.\r\nHe is surrounded by three prostituted women. One woman is slumped over on the right side of the sofa, appearing unconscious. A second woman stands behind the sofa, dancing while holding a colorful tropical cocktail with a straw and a small paper umbrella. The third woman sits on the left armrest of the sofa, smoking a long pipe. All three women wear tattered, dark-colored clothing and have smeared makeup.\r\nThe ground around them is littered with trash, including crushed aluminum cans, old newspapers, and discarded wrappers. To the right of the sofa, a large silver vintage boombox sits on the ground, with white musical note icons floating above it to indicate it is playing music. The scene is illuminated by the warm, orange-yellow glow of overhead streetlamps, creating deep shadows in the background of the dark alleyway.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766045393_94be1fcc8a2d.png', NULL, '[\"MidnightDecay\",\"UrbanGrit\",\"DarkRealism\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"StreetLife\",\"NightAesthetic\",\"RawReality\",\"NeoNoirMood\",\"UrbanPortrait\",\"GrittyVibes\",\"DSLRStyle\",\"MoodyLighting\",\"StoryInFrames\",\"RealismArt\",\"PicPose\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"