(467, 'Pastel Bunny Glow', 18, 'A cozy kawaii idol moment with soft glam beauty, pastel warmth, and playful charm — captured in a natural, candid frame.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create image of a young woman (upload image) candid energetic expression, soft glam makeup, clear bright skin,  light blonde long soft wavy hair falling to shoulders, thin see-through bangs, wearing fluffy white bunny ear headband with pale pink inner ears, holding the base of the bunny ears with both hands, pastel striped knitted sweater (soft yellow, baby blue, pastel pink), kawaii aesthetic, Japanese influencer style, soft feminine mood, warm pastel color palette, soft diffused lighting, shallow depth of field, creamy beige and white bokeh background, ultra-detailed, high quality portrait photography, natural candid moment, cozy and cute atmosphere, 85mm lens, f1.8, photorealistic., japanese kawaii idol vibe, social media aesthetic, soft film look.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766207706_e2c4288821cf.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"KawaiiAesthetic\",\"BunnyGirl\",\"JapaneseKawaii\",\"SoftGlamLook\",\"PastelVibes\",\"CuteAesthetic\",\"IdolVibe\",\"CozyMood\",\"CandidPortrait\",\"SoftLighting\",\"InfluencerStyle\",\"PastelFashion\",\"CutePhotography\",\"AIPhotoArt\",\"PhotorealisticAI\",\"SocialMediaAesthetic\",\"SoftFilmLook\",\"KawaiiPortrait\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-20 05:15:06', NULL, 0, 0),
(468, 'Golden Hour Drip', 17, 'A relaxed summer luxury moment — vintage vibes, sun-kissed style, and effortless confidence.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, 8k, cinematic medium shot, captured with a standard prime lens, features a stylish individual leaning casually against the front of a vintage, cream-colored American convertible car. The subject, with uploaded face as reference, stands with their left leg crossed over the right, resting their right arm on the car\'s hood, and holding a chocolate ice cream bar in their left hand. They wear dark sunglasses, a light blue and white striped long-sleeve shirt with sleeves rolled up and several buttons undone, dark green shorts, and brown boat shoes. A necklace and watch are visible. The car\'s prominent chrome grille and dual headlights are in sharp focus, with a license plate partially visible in the lower center. The composition uses a slightly low-angle perspective, with the subject centered and the car filling the lower and right frame. Strong, warm natural sunlight from the golden hour provides beautiful rim lighting on the subject\'s hair and shoulders, creating soft shadows and a vibrant, sun-drenched atmosphere. The background features a blurred urban street scene with palm trees and distant buildings, rendered with a shallow depth of field and creamy bokeh. The image boasts highly detailed textures on the clothing, car, and textured ground, conveying a sense of relaxed summer luxury.A100% face march reference image.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766208814_2c04ec606d8e.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"WinterVibes\",\"MountainLove\",\"SnowAesthetic\",\"8KPhotography\",\"HyperRealisticArt\",\"MoodyTones\",\"CouplePortrait\",\"EditorialStyle\",\"LuxuryPortrait\",\"WinterFashion\",\"AIPhotography\",\"CreativePortrait\",\"ColdMoodWarmBond\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-20 05:33:34', NULL, 0, 0),
(469, 'Eternal Beauty in a Single Gaze', 18, 'True beauty is the moment when the soul quietly recognizes itself in nature.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Kecantikan adalah menatap keabadian diri sendiri dalam cermin. -Kahlil Gibran-\r\nCreate a cinematic, ultra-realistic film still of a young woman (upload image) in side profile, porcelain smooth skin with natural pink undertones,soft emotional expression, eyes gently focused on a small bird in front of her. Long flowing honey-blonde wavy hair moving slightly in the breeze, adorned with a natural floral crown of pale pink roses and small deep red buds.\r\nShe wears a dress, translucent and flowing, with intricate red and gold floral embroidery, realistic fabric grain, natural folds, illuminated by soft backlight.\r\nA small robin-like bird perched on a fully bloomed pink rose in the foreground, vivid orange head, black eye stripe, pale gray chest, hyper-detailed feathers. A larger bird resting naturally on her shoulder, blue-gray feather gradients, sharp cinematic realism.\r\nForeground filled with blooming pink roses and deep green foliage, natural imperfections visible.\r\nGolden hour sunlight streaming through trees, strong cinematic backlighting, glowing rim light outlining hair and dress, volumetric light rays, floating dust particles, shallow depth of field, creamy cinematic bokeh.\r\nMoody yet warm cinematic color grading, soft contrast, filmic tones, subtle grain, HDR lighting, 85mm cinema lens look, f/1.8, realistic skin texture, high dynamic range, ultra-sharp subject focus.\r\nPhotorealistic, cinematic photography, movie still, fine-art realism, 8K detail.\r\nNegatif prompt: illustration, painting, anime, cartoon, CGI, 3D render, fantasy art, plastic skin, over-smooth face, oversaturated colors, unrealistic lighting, extra limbs, distortion.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766209279_4dfe818b08ff.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"EternalBeauty\",\"FineArtPhotography\",\"GoldenHourMagic\",\"FilmStillLook\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"ArtisticPortrait\",\"NatureAndSoul\",\"FloralAesthetic\",\"BirdAndBeauty\",\"MoodyCinematic\",\"85mmLook\",\"PhotorealisticArt\",\"AIPhotography\",\"AIPortrait\",\"VisualPoetry\",\"SoftEmotion\",\"CinematicLight\",\"HighDetailArt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-20 05:41:19', NULL, 0, 0),
(470, 'Golden Horizon Elegance', 18, 'A timeless ultra-realistic portrait capturing luxury, serenity, and confidence under golden skies.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic portrait of the uploaded young man. Face must stay 100% identical to the uploaded reference. The photo is taken directly from the front, with his body turned fully toward the front. He is sitting on a green hillside wearing a light copper luxury colour salwar kameez and luxury same color sall   , and black dress shoes luxury. The background sky is beautiful with large golden cumulus clouds. The foreground has colorful wildflowers, and some grass close to the camera will appear softly blurred. Golden hour lighting, shallow depth of field, high resolution, luxury style sunglasses same colour\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766215071_38af27471606.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"LuxuryPortrait\",\"GoldenHourMagic\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"SalwarKameezStyle\",\"LuxuryFashion\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"AIPhotography\",\"HighEndPortrait\",\"GoldenClouds\",\"NatureAesthetic\",\"WildflowerVibes\",\"LuxuryLook\",\"FrontPortrait\",\"AIArtIndia\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-20 07:17:51', NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `ai_posts` (`id`, `title`, `category_id`, `short_description`, `prompt_text`, `image_url1`, `image_url2`, `tags`, `external_id`, `status`, `moderation_flags`, `reviewed_by`, `reviewed_at`, `priority`, `is_popular`, `is_featured`, `tier`, `premium_unlock_cost_points`, `premium_pack`, `likes`, `favorites`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `copies`, `views`) VALUES
(471, 'Morning of Love', 23, 'A cozy cinematic moment of a young Indian family — playful love, soft morning light, and pure togetherness.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', '8k ultra hyper-realistic close-up masterpiece. Young man (reference attached photo) with stylish messy hair covering forehead, white vest, and black shorts, lying on stomach on bed, hands under face. Cute beautiful Indian girlfriend in a lovely night dress and baby daughter in a white frock are sitting on his back. Girlfriend holding his hair playfully All looking at viewer. Soft natural morning light, cozy indoor bedro cinematic.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766215288_67233c8841be.png', NULL, '[\"MorningVibes\",\"FamilyLove\",\"IndianCouple\",\"CuteFamilyMoment\",\"CinematicBedroom\",\"HyperRealisticArt\",\"AIPhotography\",\"PicPose\",\"LoveAndWarmth\",\"IndianLifestyle\",\"CozyAesthetic\",\"AIImagePrompt\",\"CoupleGoals\",\"ParenthoodMoments\",\"SoftMorningLighta\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-20 07:21:28', NULL, 0, 0),
(472, 'Pointing to Perfection', 27, 'A cinematic pop-art self-portrait where playful proportions meet razor-sharp polygonal realism — bold, vibrant, and unapologetically expressive.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a 9:16 vertical full-body portrait of a cheerful man with an oversized expressive head (25–30% of total height), compact torso; and short stylized legs with voluminous fabric folds. He strikes a lively, energetic pose—body slightly twisted, knees bent, one foot forward—smiling broadly while dynamically pointing toward a large modern minimalist framed vibrant pop-art portrait of himself. Blue-white plaid flannel, white “SUWUNG” T-shirt, ripped jeans, large rounded dark-beige Onitsuka Tiger sneakers with bulky creases, and a red smartwatch. The framed portrait is ultra-detailed modern polygonal realism, 100% identical to the reference face, built from sharp faceted geometric forms with clean angular edges. Use bright reflective colors—golden yellow, deep blue, dark red, soft pastel highlights—to sculpt skin and hair. Eyes must be extremely bright, glossy, and hyper-realistic, contrasting with faceted geometry. Hair flows naturally using multi-directional polygon strokes with subtle iridescent reflections. Dramatic lighting with strong highlights and deep shadows emphasizes geometry. Add subtle paint-drip textures along the lower edge. Light beige  background. Indoor scene, warm soft natural light. Hyper-realistic cinematic photography look, Canon EOS R, 50mm, f/2.2, 1/200s, ISO 100, HDR, cinematic grading, ultra-HD, 8K.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766221372_7822dc345800.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"PopArtPortrait\",\"PolygonArt\",\"StylizedPortrait\",\"CreativePhotography\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"AIArtCreators\",\"DigitalArtStudio\",\"ModernPortrait\",\"FacetedArt\",\"HyperRealisticArt\",\"ArtMeetsTech\",\"PortraitInspiration\",\"AIVisuals\",\"8KArt\",\"CreativePose\",\"ArtistStyle\",\"VisualStorytelling\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-20 09:02:52', NULL, 0, 0),
(473, 'Sacred Serenity – A Timeless Portrait', 35, 'An ultra-realistic cinematic portrait capturing calm faith and elegance — standing before a majestic green-domed mosque, dressed in traditional white attire with authentic DSLR realism.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic portrait of me in front of a grand mosque with green domes.\r\nKeep my face 100% same as the reference. Wearing a white thobe/kandura, adjusting a black-and-white keffiyeh. Soft green cinematic bokeh background with depth.\r\nAdd blurred foreground gentle shadows, shallow dof. Signeture graphicssolutiontricks. Centered, calm expression, warm cinematic tones, Dslr-realism.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766221697_d70cf863a7fa.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"SacredPortrait\",\"IslamicAesthetic\",\"MosqueVibes\",\"GreenDome\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"DSLRRealism\",\"FaithAndElegance\",\"IslamicStyle\",\"ThobeStyle\",\"KeffiyehLook\",\"SpiritualCalm\",\"AIPhotography\",\"PortraitPhotography\",\"CinematicBokeh\",\"MuslimPortrait\",\"IslamicArt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 1, 1, '2025-12-20 09:08:17', NULL, 0, 0),
(474, 'Stained Glass Muse', 18, 'A vibrant artistic portrait blending soft beauty, colorful elegance, and a timeless stained-glass inspired fashion aesthetic.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A portrait of a young woman with fair skin, bright blue eyes, and shoulder-length brown hair styled in loose waves with wispy bangs. She has a warm, natural smile and wears subtle makeup with a soft pink lipstick and light eye makeup. She is dressed in a colorful, vibrant dress with a stained-glass window-inspired pattern featuring shades of purple, pink, orange, yellow, blue, and green. The dress has a zipper down the front, a fitted waist, and slightly puffed sleeves that are rolled up. She accessorizes with delicate drop earrings and a pendant necklace with a green gemstone. The background is an abstract, blurred mix of pastel colors, including shades of blue, pink, and purple, creating a lively and artistic atmosphere. 100% same face \r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766221941_0a1be8b98c5f.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"StainedGlassStyle\",\"ColorfulPortrait\",\"ArtisticFashion\",\"CreativePhotography\",\"AIPhotoPrompt\",\"PortraitAesthetics\",\"VibrantDress\",\"ModernMuse\",\"EditorialPortrait\",\"FashionArt\",\"StudioPortrait\",\"AIArtIndia\",\"CreativeVisuals\",\"PhotorealisticAIa\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 2, 3, '2025-12-20 09:12:21', NULL, 0, 0),
(475, 'Golden Meadow Whispers', 18, 'A dreamy golden-hour portrait capturing pure joy, soft elegance, and a heartwarming bond with nature.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a dreamy, ultra-realistic outdoor portrait using the uploaded face as exact reference (100% same face, no change in facial features).\r\n\r\nThe subject is a cheerful young woman standing in a lush green meadow during golden hour. She is smiling warmly and slightly bending forward, interacting lovingly with four fluffy alpacas/baby llamas standing close around her.\r\n\r\nOutfit & Styling:\r\nShe is wearing a soft white aesthetic outfit: a ruffled off-shoulder crop top with delicate fabric texture, a matching high-waist short skirt, and light beige ankle boots. A white crochet or knit headband on her head. Minimal natural makeup, glowing skin, soft pink lips.\r\n\r\nPose & Emotion:\r\nNatural candid pose, joyful expression, playful hand gesture near the face, cozy and innocent vibe.\r\n\r\nAnimals:\r\nAlpacas are fluffy, clean, cream-colored, friendly and calm, looking at the subject with curiosity.\r\n\r\nBackground & Lighting:\r\nRolling green hills, soft blurred background (shallow depth of field). Warm golden hour sunlight, soft cinematic lighting, natural shadows.\r\n\r\nPhotography Style:\r\nUltra-realistic DSLR photo, 85mm lens look, f/1.8, high detail fur texture, realistic skin texture, soft pastel tones, Instagram-ready aesthetic.\r\n\r\nQuality:\r\n8K resolution, professional photography, cinematic color grading, no distortion, no extra people.\r\n\r\nImportant:\r\nKeep the uploaded face identity perfectly preserved. Do not alter face shape, eyes, nose, or smile. No cartoon look.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766223368_4c52d7ed2cd3.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"GoldenHourPortrait\",\"DreamyAesthetic\",\"UltraRealisticPhoto\",\"NatureLovers\",\"AlpacaLove\",\"SoftGirlVibes\",\"PastelTones\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"AIPhotography\",\"AestheticPortrait\",\"InstaReady\",\"MeadowMagic\",\"NaturalBeauty\",\"RealisticAI\",\"FaceReference\",\"ProfessionalPortrait\",\"CozyVibes\",\"CreativeAI\",\"PicPoseAI\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-20 09:36:08', NULL, 0, 0),
(476, 'The Moment the Genie Awakened', 17, 'A cinematic night where reality meets ancient magic — one glance, one lamp, and destiny unfolds.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Take this photo without changing the face at all.\r\nA realistic cinematic photograph of a young man standing in a bedroom at night, shot in a medium-length shot (half-body), with the camera distance approximately 1.5–2 meters, and at eye level. The man holds an antique brass magic lamp with both hands, slightly tilted, from which emerges a mystical, glowing genie made of golden smoke. The genie has a semi-transparent humanoid face with sharp features, glowing eyes, a long beard, and a smooth, smoky body that blends warm blue and gold. It floats upward and leans toward the man.\r\nThe man\'s expressive eyes gaze upward in awe and disbelief at the genie. He wears a light beige denim jacket over a white t-shirt, a modern casual outfit. His posture is slightly leaned back, conveying surprise and curiosity.\r\nThe background depicts a realistic bedroom interior: a wooden door on the left, a neatly made bed with light blue sheets on the right, and plain walls with minimal decoration. The room is dimly lit, emphasizing the supernatural glow.\r\nThe lighting is cinematic and dramatic: a warm golden primary light emitted from the genie illuminates the man\'s face and hands, creating soft highlights and realistic shadows. A secondary, cool ambient light subtly fills the room, maintaining depth and contrast. Volumetric lighting and soft smoke particles add realism.\r\nThe atmosphere feels magical yet grounded, blending fantasy with realism. The setting is mysterious, awe-inspiring, and intimate, with a serene nighttime atmosphere. Ultra-realistic details, high dynamic range, shallow depth of field, sharp focus on the subject, cinematic coloring, realistic skin textures, natural shadows, not a cartoonish or illustrative style.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766225695_21ac7c40aa86.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"MagicLamp\",\"GenieAwakening\",\"FantasyMeetsReality\",\"AIPhotoArt\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"MysticalVibes\",\"DreamlikeScene\",\"CreativePortrait\",\"AIImagePrompt\",\"NightCinematic\",\"FantasyPhotography\",\"PhotoToMagic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-20 10:14:55', NULL, 0, 7),
(477, 'Midnight Rooftop Swagger', 17, 'Where city lights meet confidence — a cinematic night portrait with bold style and urban luxury.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a Ultra-realistic full-body cinematic portrait of a young man standing confidently on a modern rooftop terrace at night. He is positioned on a staircase, leaning casually with one hand resting on the metal railing and the other hand in his pocket, legs crossed in a relaxed pose, facing the camera.\r\nHe has neatly styled dark hair, a trimmed beard and mustache, and is wearing black sunglasses. His outfit consists of a bright yellow zip-up jacket worn over a plain white t-shirt, dark blue jeans, and black-and-white sneakers.\r\nThe environment is a stylish rooftop lounge with outdoor seating, potted plants, and climbing green vines along stainless-steel railings. Warm string lights hang across the terrace, creating a cozy, premium ambiance.\r\nIn the background, a city skyline is visible at night with blue-toned high-rise buildings and soft glowing windows, slightly blurred for cinematic depth.\r\nLighting is a mix of warm ambient terrace lights and cool city night tones, balanced exposure with soft highlights on the subject and gentle shadows for depth.\r\nShot on a professional DSLR camera, full-body framing, eye-level angle, shallow depth of field, subject in sharp focus with creamy bokeh city lights behind.\r\nHyper-realistic, photorealism, cinematic night portrait, 16K resolution, natural skin texture, detailed fabric and metal reflections, no blur, no distortion, no cartoon or CGI look. Keep the face 100% real as in reference image.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766226241_f264e6935ff4.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"RooftopVibes\",\"NightPhotography\",\"UrbanStyle\",\"YellowJacket\",\"StreetStyleIndia\",\"CityLights\",\"PhotorealisticAI\",\"AIPortrait\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"FullBodyPortrait\",\"ModernMenStyle\",\"FashionPhotography\",\"CinematicLook\",\"AIImagePrompt\",\"CreativePortrait\",\"PremiumAesthetic\",\"UrbanLuxury\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-20 10:24:01', NULL, 0, 10),
(478, 'Little Gentleman in Bloom', 19, 'A premium kids’ fashion portrait capturing innocence, elegance, and timeless charm in a refined outdoor setting.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'take little boy\'s face from attached photo and Create a professional kids’ fashion photoshoot portrait. The boy should look about 4 years old with a weight around 12 kg. Face must remain exactly the same as the reference photo, no changes in facial details with lite smile. Recreate the same pose: standing with hands in pocket, body facing forward with crossed leg position. Outfit should be identical in style: White dress shirt with bow tie, suspenders, and Dark shiny Persian Blue trousers, paired with Stylish shoes. Background should match a classy outdoor setup with colorful flowers and Greenery, elegant and premium studio style (no curtain). Lighting should be soft and balanced, highlighting the outfit details while keeping a warm, natural skin tone.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766293163_1b806a50da82.png', NULL, '[\"KidsFashion\",\"LittleGentleman\",\"KidsPhotoshoot\",\"ChildFashion\",\"MiniModel\",\"ElegantKids\",\"PremiumKidsWear\",\"KidsStyle\",\"FashionPortrait\",\"OutdoorKidsShoot\",\"CuteKidsStyle\",\"LuxuryKidsFashion\",\"PicPose\",\"AIPhotoshoot\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 2, '2025-12-21 04:59:23', NULL, 0, 0),
(479, 'UNIT: Beyond the Last Horizon', 17, 'A hyper-realistic sci-fi portrait of a future pilot standing against a colossal hive city — where survival, technology, and destiny collide.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a hyper-realistic digital artwork with uploaded Photo with 100% face features depicts a futuristic sci-fi scene set on a desolate, sandy terrain, featuring a high-tech pilot or soldier in the foreground. The figure wears an intricate, weathered dark grey and orange flight suit laden with tactical pouches, patches, and a bulky life-support backpack adorned with a white winged emblem and \"UNIT\" lettering. Behind their a massive, low-slung, gunmetal-grey spacecraft or mechanical walker that rests on multi-jointed hydraulic landing legs; the craft\'s transparent cockpit reveals glowing internal displays and seating for two. In the hazy background, a sprawling, vertically-oriented industrial citadel or \"hive city\" towers into a pale sky, characterized by dense clusters of pipes, cylindrical modules, and glowing blue apertures. The overall composition uses a shallow depth of field, highlighting the gritty textures of the character’s gear and the mechanical complexity of the vessel while casting the distant megastructure in a soft, atmospheric blur. Agrega logotipo de space wears en la esquila superior derecha.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766294544_768ef1fcddfd.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"SciFiArt\",\"FuturisticSoldier\",\"UNIT\",\"AIArt\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"SciFiPortrait\",\"FutureWarrior\",\"SpaceWears\",\"HiveCity\",\"CyberpunkVibes\",\"AIPhotography\",\"DigitalArtwork\",\"CinematicSciFi\",\"FaceSwapAI\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 2, 0, '2025-12-21 05:22:24', NULL, 0, 1),
(480, 'Behind the Dragon', 23, 'A candid behind-the-scenes selfie from the legendary Game of Thrones set — captured between takes with Daenerys Targaryen and a full-scale dragon prop.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Behind-the-scenes selfie on the Game of Thrones TV show set. Use two reference images: the Character Reference Image shows the person who should appear in the selfie, and the Environment Reference Image shows the exact Game of Thrones desert dragon set. The final image must look like a realistic behind-the-scenes selfie taken during filming. The character DAENERYS TARGARYEN stands directly next to the person from the Character Reference Image, both facing the camera and posing together for a casual selfie. They are close to each other, natural and relaxed, as if the photo was taken between takes on set. Daenerys wears her iconic green dress, her platinum blonde hair styled naturally, and she looks calm, confident, and composed, matching her appearance from the series. Behind them is a large dragon prop positioned exactly as shown in the Environment Reference Image, with visible film equipment such as cameras, lights, boom microphones, and crew members in the background. The environment must match the reference precisely: sandy desert ground, rocky cliffs, bright daylight, realistic set lighting. The image must clearly read as a real behind-the-scenes moment, not a movie scene and not promotional key art. Photorealistic, natural colors, no stylization, no fantasy effects beyond the physical dragon prop. Do not change the face, body, hairstyle, or proportions of the person from the Character Reference Image. Do not beautify or alter their appearance. No text, no logos, no watermarks\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766294865_27df96