(481, 'Shattered Within', 17, 'When humanity breaks… the hero awakens.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A cinematic, ultra-realistic portrait of a man split down the center of his face — one half a gritty, realistic human male with stubble, intense green eye, and moody dramatic lighting; the other half a detailed red superhero mask inspired by a spider-themed hero, with black web patterns and reflective textured eye lens. The transition between the two halves appears shattered like broken glass, with sharp translucent shards exploding outward. Dark, smoky background with cool blue tones on the human side and deep red tones on the masked side. Hyper-detailed skin texture, dramatic contrast, high sharpness, cinematic depth of field, 8K quality, epic movie poster style, dark and emotional atmosphere.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766295789_e1dfaef36e99.png', NULL, '[\"ShatteredWithin\",\"DualIdentity\",\"SplitFace\",\"SuperheroArt\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"EpicPoster\",\"DarkAesthetic\",\"AIArt\",\"AIImage\",\"AIPhotography\",\"MoviePosterStyle\",\"SpiderHeroInspired\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"8KArt\",\"DigitalArt\",\"CreativeAI\",\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 1, 1, '2025-12-21 05:43:09', NULL, 0, 0),
(482, 'Christmas Coffee With Santa', 39, 'A cozy winter night where childhood magic meets festive vibes — sharing Starbucks coffee with Santa under falling snow.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Use my photo uploaded (keep original face) 8years old. Ensure the face remains consistent with the person in the uploaded image, without changing facial structure, skin tone. Santa Claus sitting on a bench in a snowy street at night. Santa Cluas is wearing a traditional red suit with white fur trim and a red hat with a white pom-pom on top. Santa has a long white beard and is holding a Starbuck Coffee in his right hand beside me, I wearing black hoodie with PicPose AI, tattered jeans, nike air jordan1 red/black, red iwatch also holding a starbucks coffee. Santa and Me is talking to each other. behind them is a polar bear smiling holding a bottle of coca cola wearing a red beanie hat and a red scarf. The background is blurred, but it appears to be a city street with buildings and Christmas lights. The ground is covered in snow and there are snowflakes falling from the sky. The overall mood of the image is festive and cozy.Using a Canon EOS R camera with a 50mm f/1.8 lens, f/2.2 aperture, shutter speed 1/200s, ISO 100 and natural light, Full Body, Hyper Realistic Photography, Cinematic, Cinema, Hyper detail, Ultra hd, Color Correction, ultra hd, hdr , color grading,\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766298181_a5dfe1d0fbbb.png', NULL, '[\"ChristmasVibes\",\"SantaClaus\",\"WinterMagic\",\"FestiveMood\",\"HolidaySeason\",\"SnowyNight\",\"StarbucksMoments\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"AIPhotography\",\"PicPose\",\"ChristmasLights\",\"CozyWinter\",\"CanonEOSR\",\"ChristmasArt\",\"santaandmechallenge\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 8, 2, '2025-12-21 06:23:01', NULL, 0, 3),
(483, 'Christmas Coffee With Santa', 37, 'A cozy winter night where childhood magic meets festive vibes — sharing Starbucks coffee with Santa under falling snow.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Use the uploaded photo as the main face reference.\r\nKeep the original face identity, skin tone, facial structure, and expression exactly the same as the uploaded image.\r\nCreate a magical cinematic Christmas fantasy scene at night in a snowy European village.\r\nThe person from the uploaded photo is sitting in the air on a glowing futuristic floating wheel, wearing a stylish winter outfit: dark jacket with fur collar, scarf, gloves, winter boots, and modern sunglasses.\r\nSitting beside him is Santa Claus, wearing a luxurious red velvet Santa suit with white fur trim, smiling warmly.\r\nBoth are holding beautifully wrapped Christmas gift boxes in their hands.\r\nThe wheels beneath them are glowing with icy blue magical light, floating above the snowy street.\r\nBackground includes:\r\nSnow-covered cozy houses with warm yellow lights\r\nDecorated Christmas trees\r\nFalling snowflakes\r\nGolden fireworks lighting up the night sky\r\nSoft glowing street lamps\r\nLighting is cinematic, ultra-realistic, soft bokeh, magical glow, with high contrast and festive colors.\r\nCamera angle: slightly low angle, medium full shot\r\nStyle: Ultra-realistic, fantasy realism, 8K, HDR, cinematic Christmas movie look\r\nDepth of field: shallow, professional DSLR look\r\nMood: joyful, festive, magical, heart-warming\r\nNo face distortion, no extra fingers, no blur on face.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766301857_c2462595a606.png', NULL, '[\"ChristmasVibes\",\"SantaClaus\",\"WinterMagic\",\"FestiveMood\",\"HolidaySeason\",\"SnowyNight\",\"StarbucksMoments\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"AIPhotography\",\"PicPose\",\"ChristmasLights\",\"CozyWinter\",\"CanonEOSR\",\"ChristmasArt\",\"SantaAndMe\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 2, 0, '2025-12-21 07:24:17', NULL, 0, 0),
(484, 'Midnight Petals', 18, 'A low-key fashion editorial capturing mystery, elegance, and floral inked beauty in cinematic darkness.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create ultra realistic low-key studio photograph of a young woman (upload image) with delicate natural facial features, sharp yet soft brown eyes, porcelain skin with visible natural pores, subtle realistic skin texture, full lips with muted peach-terracotta lipstick, calm melancholic and mysterious expression, direct eye contact with the camera,\r\nlying sideways on flowing black satin fabric, elegant composed feminine pose, wearing a modest high-neck black satin dress with long sleeves, tailored and elegant silhouette, fully covered shoulders and arms except visible tattoo area, refined editorial styling, no revealing clothing,\r\nright arm placed naturally in front of her body revealing highly detailed black and grey realism rose tattoo, large blooming rose tattoo on shoulder and upper arm with fine shading and natural ink texture, additional rose motifs extending along the forearm,\r\nlong Messy auburn hair with natural loose strands framing the face, vibrant magenta and violet flower petals subtly scattered in her hair and around her body, creating strong contrast in darkness,\r\ndeep black satin or silk backdrop with minimal highlights, rich shadows and controlled reflections, low-key lighting from a single soft light source above and slightly to the side, dramatic shadows under jawline and cheekbones, subtle rim light separating subject from background, high contrast cinematic darkness,\r\nprofessional fashion editorial photography, fine-art realism, full-frame camera look, 85mm lens, shallow depth of field, sharp focus on eyes, photorealistic, high detail, no painting, no illustration, no CGI.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766302411_7a2e1bd1a2c9.png', NULL, '[\"MidnightPetals\",\"PicPose\",\"LowKeyPhotography\",\"FashionEditorial\",\"FineArtPortrait\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"DarkAesthetic\",\"MoodyPortrait\",\"EditorialLighting\",\"TattooArt\",\"RoseTattoo\",\"RealismPortrait\",\"StudioPhotography\",\"HighFashionLook\",\"AIPhotography\",\"PhotorealisticAI\",\"LuxuryEditorial\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 22, 0, '2025-12-21 07:33:31', NULL, 0, 0),
