(486, 'Golden Hour Authority', 27, 'A cinematic portrait of calm dominance — where luxury meets loyalty, captured in ultra-realistic golden hour perfection.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an ultra realistic photo with 8k sharp details, cinematic quality, natural light, soft focus of the man in the attached photo. Copy his face and hair 100%, do not change any of the facial feature.\r\nA man wearing a minimalist outfit consisting of a black long-sleeved button-up shirt (with sleeves slightly rolled), grey cargo pants, and clean white sneakers. He accessorizes with dark aviator sunglasses and a black wristwatch. Standing alongside him placed at the top of the hood of a large, black luxury SUV (Toyota Land Cruiser Prado), is a large, alert Rottweiler, which serves as a secondary subject. The dog is perched directly on the hood, which emphasizes a sense of ruggedness and dominance. A heavy metal chain leash connects the man to the dog.The man\'s pose is relaxed yet confident, leaning casually against the front of an SUV with one hand in his pocket and the other holding the dog\'s chain leash. His expression is stoic and \"cool,\" projecting an aura of composed authority. The setting is a coastal or tropical road. The presence of a palm tree and the turquoise water in the distance suggests a high-end coastal estate. The photo uses a vertical portrait orientation. The subjects are centered, creating a powerful \"power pose\" structure. The lines of the car lead the eye toward the man and the dog. Put a realistic watermark text of  Akmal Ansari at the bottom right. The lighting is warm and golden, characteristic of \"Golden Hour\". This creates soft highlights on his face and the car\'s hood while casting gentle shadows that define his physique and the dog\'s coat. The background features a shallow depth of field (bokeh effect). Negative Prompt: No oil painting. No drawings. No fantasy. No anime. No cartoon. No 3D render. No soft diffused illuminating skintone.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766309224_d9a622846a4b.png', NULL, '[\"GoldenHourVibes\",\"PowerPose\",\"LuxuryLifestyle\",\"AlphaEnergy\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"UltraRealisticAI\",\"8KPhotography\",\"AIPhotoArt\",\"DogAndMan\",\"RottweilerPower\",\"BossLook\",\"ConfidenceCaptured\",\"CoastalLuxury\",\"MinimalistStyle\",\"StreetLuxury\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"AkmalAnsari\",\"AIPortrait\",\"Photorealistic\",\"aivisuals\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 43, 2, '2025-12-21 09:27:04', NULL, 0, 2),
(487, 'Winter Santa Vibes – A Cinematic Christmas Portrait', 37, 'A hyper-realistic 8K winter portrait blending festive Santa style with cinematic photography aesthetics.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, 8k cinematic medium shot captures a person with an uploaded face as reference, smiling warmly, with short, styled dark brown hair and a well-groomed beard, standing outdoors in a snowy environment. The subject is wearing a vibrant red velvet Santa coat with thick, plush white faux fur trim on the collar, lapels, cuffs, and hem, lightly dusted with fresh snow. Beneath the coat, a red and black plaid button-up shirt is visible, along with a wide black leather belt featuring a prominent rectangular brass buckle. A festive sprig of green holly with bright red berries is pinned to the left lapel of the Santa coat. The subject\'s hands are casually tucked into the pockets of slightly distressed blue denim jeans. The camera angle is eye-level, using a standard lens for a natural perspective. Soft, diffused natural light illuminates the scene, characteristic of an overcast winter day, with subtle highlights on the fur and snow. Volumetric snow falls gently around the subject, creating a sense of depth. The background is a softly blurred, out-of-focus snowy forest with white snow covering the ground, emphasizing the subject. The image features highly detailed textures on the velvet, fur, plaid, and denim, with professional photography and cinematic lighting.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766469618_114ac6f8043b.png', NULL, '[\"SantaVibes\",\"ChristmasPortrait\",\"WinterAesthetic\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"AIChristmas\",\"SantaLook\",\"HolidayMood\",\"WinterPortrait\",\"FestiveStyle\",\"SnowyVibes\",\"AIPortrait\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"8KPhotography\",\"PicPose\",\"AIArtCommunity\",\"CreativePortrait\",\"ChristmasStyle\",\"HolidayAesthetic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-23 06:00:18', NULL, 0, 1),
(488, 'Crimson Snowfall Elegance', 39, 'A cinematic Christmas portrait where bold red fashion meets magical winter glow.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic 8k studio shot captured with a 35mm lens at a slightly low angle, featuring a full-body portrait of a person with uploaded face as reference, standing confidently with hands in pockets and one leg casually crossed over the other, smiling directly at the viewer. The subject wears a vibrant red suit jacket and matching trousers, both intricately adorned with crisp white snowflake patterns, paired with a sleek black button-up shirt and polished black ankle boots. They are positioned on a rectangular silver glitter platform, lightly dusted with artificial snow. Behind the subject stands a magnificently decorated Christmas tree, brimming with warm white lights, shiny red and gold baubles, and festive ornaments, creating a soft bokeh effect. At the base of the tree, an array of meticulously wrapped Christmas presents in red, green, and gold, along with a large red sack overflowing with gifts, are nestled in a bed of artificial snow. The background consists of a soft, light-colored wall illuminated by vertical strings of warm fairy lights, producing a dreamy, out-of-focus glow. Dynamic, swirling golden and subtle red light trails, interspersed with sparkling particles, elegantly encircle the subject, adding a magical and festive ambiance to the scene, all rendered with cinematic lighting and highly detailed textures.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766469928_fb344a955f69.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"ChristmasPhotoshoot\",\"FestivePortrait\",\"RedSuitStyle\",\"WinterFashion\",\"HolidayVibes\",\"CinematicLook\",\"AIPhotography\",\"AIImagePrompt\",\"StudioPortrait\",\"ChristmasMagic\