(490, 'Lioness & The White King', 18, 'A breathtaking fantasy portrait where beauty meets raw power — a woman bonded with a majestic white lion in golden-hour glory.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a photo realistic-looking,\r\n​Hyper-detailed fantasy portrait, award-winning digital art, photorealistic quality. A stunning, fair-skinned woman with sun-kissed blonde hair, styled in a long side braid, poses intimately with a large, majestic white lion. The woman wears a textured, voluminous, cream-colored, off-the-shoulder knitted mini-dress. Her waist is adorned with an elaborate, metallic, winged corset-style belt with fringe details. The setting is a sun-drenched, rocky outdoor enclosure, shallow depth of field, golden hour lighting. Intricate textures, perfect composition, sharp focus, 8k.\r\nUse uploaded photo as reference face and body 100%.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766485394_820b6fcc331c.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"FantasyPortrait\",\"WhiteLion\",\"LionessVibes\",\"AIArt\",\"AIImagePrompt\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"GoldenHourMagic\",\"PhotorealisticArt\",\"HyperRealistic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2025-12-23 10:23:14', NULL, 0, 0),
(491, 'Ride of the Sky Dragon', 17, 'A fearless journey above floating worlds — where humans, legends, and dragons rise together.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A man with short brown hair, wearing a white t-shirt and light blue jeans, is riding on the back of a large red dragon-like creature with yellow accents. He is looking forward with a slight smile, gripping the creature\'s back with both hands. Behind him, a blue-skinned, humanoid figure with long black hair, resembling a character from Avatar, is also riding on the creature. The background features rocky, floating islands amidst clouds, suggesting a fantastical, aerial setting. The lighting is bright, possibly from a sunset or sunrise, casting warm tones on the scene. use reference face. \r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766485845_9105b6fba8f6.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"FantasyArt\",\"DragonRider\",\"SkyAdventure\",\"AIImagePrompt\",\"AIGeneratedArt\",\"EpicFantasy\",\"CinematicScene\",\"FloatingIslands\",\"DragonWorld\",\"AvatarInspired\",\"MythicalCreatures\",\"FantasyReels\",\"AIArtCommunity\",\"CreativeAI\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 1, '2025-12-23 10:30:45', NULL, 0, 0),
(492, 'Celestial Archer', 18, 'A mythic moment where elegance, power, and destiny align under the dawn-lit skies.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A captivating photo realistic portrait of a young woman using the exact face and facial features with long, dark hair styled in an elegant updo, dressed in a white, revealing, fantasy-inspired outfit with a flowing, semi-transparent beige skirt and a white top with intricate detailing highlighting her ethereal natural voluptuous figure. She is posed in a dynamic arching stance, holding a bow with an arrow, and appears to be aiming at an unseen target. She stands on a circular platform with a mountainous landscape and a ruined Olympian pillars in the background, under a cloudy sky. The bright morning light behind her, creating a soft warm light effect around her head and help casting a detailed shadow on her figure, emphasizing her athletic build and the flowing movement of her clothing and hair. The scene has a realistic ethereal atmosphere with soft, natural lighting and dramatic landscape elements.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766486169_da546fccd897.png', NULL, '[\"CelestialArcher\",\"FantasyPortrait\",\"MythicalVibes\",\"EtherealBeauty\",\"FantasyArt\",\"AIPhotography\",\"PhotorealisticArt\",\"GoddessEnergy\",\"ArcherQueen\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"EpicFantasy\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 1, 0, '2025-12-23 10:36:09', NULL, 0, 0),
(493, 'Snowfall Smile – Christmas Magic in Motion', 37, 'A joyful Christmas moment captured in snow, sparkle, and festive elegance ❄️🎅 Holiday vibes with pure winter magic.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A cheerful young woman dressed in a festive Christmas outfit, standing outdoors in a snowy landscape with blurred Christmas lights and decorated trees in the background. She is wearing a red velvet off-the-shoulder dress with white faux fur trim, a matching red Santa hat with white pom-pom, and a red scarf wrapped around her neck. She is holding snow in her hands and tossing it into the air, with snowflakes falling around her. Her brown hair is styled in loose waves, and she has a bright, joyful smile on her face. The scene exudes holiday cheer and winter magic.4k (100% same face).\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766486575_fa82e2dd905d.png', NULL, '[\"ChristmasVibes\",\"WinterMagic\",\"FestiveMood\",\"SnowfallMoments\",\"ChristmasPhotoshoot\",\"HolidayAesthetic\",\"SantaStyle\",\"WinterWonderland\",\"FestiveLook\",\"AIPhotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 1, 1, '2025-12-23 10:42:55', NULL, 1, 8),
(494, 'Nature Marks 2026', 17, 'Where time flows through stone, moss, and waterfalls — a cinematic vision of the future.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic 8K outdoor portrait near a mountain waterfall captured with a 35mm lens. A person, using an uploaded face as reference, sits on a moss-covered rock wearing olive waterproof outdoor clothing. Behind them, massive “2026” letters formed from living plants and moss have water flowing through them. Soft natural light, mist, and water droplets enhance realism, texture, and depth.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766487435_4476a45028de.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"NaturePortrait\",\"WaterfallPhotography\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"2026Vision\",\"OutdoorPhotography\",\"MossArt\",\"NatureInspired\",\"AIPhotography\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"8KVisuals\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 1, 2, '2025-12-23 10:57:15', NULL, 0, 4),
(495, 'Christmas Magic with Santa 🎁', 17, 'A warm festive moment captured in winter vibes — smiling faces, snowy dreams, and Christmas joy, powered by PicPose ✨❄️\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A realistic winter portrait of a smiling young South Asian man wearing a red fleece jacket and white sweater, standing beside Santa Claus in a classic red suit with white fur trim, black belt, gloves, and glasses. Both are holding a beautifully wrapped Christmas gift box together. Snowy outdoor background with soft snowfall, frosty ground, and blurred winter trees. Additional wrapped gift boxes placed around them. Warm festive mood, natural skin tones, cinematic lighting, shallow depth of field, ultra-realistic photography style, sharp focus, high detail, 9:16 vertical composition, Christmas celebration atmosphere.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766487779_008051ba8bee.png', NULL, '[\"ChristmasVibes\",\"SantaClaus\",\"WinterPortrait\",\"FestiveMood\",\"ChristmasMagic\",\"PicPose\",\"AIPhotography\",\"AIImagePrompt\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"HolidaySeason\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 12, 7, '2025-12-23 11:02:59', NULL, 1, 33);
INSERT INTO `ai_posts` (`id`, `title`, `category_id`, `short_description`, `prompt_text`, `image_url1`, `image_url2`, `tags`, `external_id`, `status`, `moderation_flags`, `reviewed_by`, `reviewed_at`, `priority`, `is_popular`, `is_featured`, `tier`, `premium_unlock_cost_points`, `premium_pack`, `likes`, `favorites`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `copies`, `views`) VALUES
(496, 'Whispers of Innocence', 18, 'A poetic fine-art portrait capturing pure emotion, youthful elegance, and soft cinematic beauty in golden light.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A person subject based on the reference image, keeping the exact same facial structure, hairstyle, and identity (100% identical to the reference, no alterations allowed).\r\nA tall, slender, and well-proportioned handsome 7-year-old boy with slight muscles. He has a handsome face, fair, smooth skin, and an elegant, youthful aura.\r\nA close-up portrait of a young boy. He has soft facial features, extremely fair and smooth skin with natural, realistic texture; fine pores are subtly visible. His hair is deep black, medium-length, softly wavy and layered, naturally slightly tousled, framing his face with a thin center-parted fringe. A few loose strands fall freely around his cheeks and neck. His expression is calm with a slight melancholic mood. His lips are natural, soft, and slightly glossy, with no smile.\r\nThe subject wears a clean white shirt with a neatly open collar, paired with a leaf-pink knitted cardigan with clearly visible, realistic fabric texture. He wears a small silver hoop earring on his ear and a minimalist silver bracelet on his wrist, softly reflecting light.\r\nThe pose is highly intimate and aesthetic: his right hand gently lifts a single white rose, held close to his face as if inhaling its fragrance. The white rose petals are pure, fresh, soft, and highly detailed.\r\nThe background is a lush natural flower garden filled with green foliage and white flowers, with blurred leaves in the foreground creating visual depth. Natural late-afternoon lighting (soft golden sunlight) filters through the leaves, producing a gentle glow, soft highlights on the hair and face, and thin, natural shadows.\r\nPhotography style: fine art portrait, cinematic, dreamy, ethereal, with a romantic and poetic atmosphere. Shallow depth of field, with ultra-sharp focus on the eyes and the flower, and a soft bokeh background. Natural pastel color grading with dominant greens and whites, gentle contrast, and warm, soft tones. Ultra-realistic quality, high detail, 8K resolution, professional photography, resembling a high-end prime lens camera output.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766488812_2a9e2dc29c3b.png', NULL, '[\"FineArtPortrait\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"DreamyAesthetic\",\"EtherealVibes\",\"PoeticPortrait\",\"SoftEmotion\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 15, 24, '2025-12-23 11:20:12', NULL, 0, 3),
(497, 'Dragonbound Dominion', 27, 'A fearless ruler stands unshaken as an ancient dragon awakens behind—power, destiny, and fire converge in one legendary moment.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'The subject stands centered in frame, dressed in a dark leather and fabric fantasy coat with metallic detailing and shoulder armor. A long black cloak drapes naturally with subtle texture. Their stance is upright and regal, one hand relaxed at their side, the other resting against the cloak folds, gaze fixed forward with determination. Behind, the colossal dragon looms-its face filling the frame, scales hyper-detailed, eye glowing with fiery intensity. Embers and sparks drift through the smoky air, fire glowing faintly at the bottom of the composition, completing the infernal atmosphere.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766489556_7d9f6ab3673d.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"FantasyArt\",\"DragonArt\",\"EpicFantasy\",\"DarkFantasy\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"AIArt\",\"AIImage\",\"MythicalVibes\",\"DragonKing\",\"FantasyCharacter\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 20, 30, '2025-12-23 11:32:36', NULL, 0, 7),
(498, 'Frozen Gaze', 18, 'A hyper-realistic cinematic winter portrait captured under harsh snowfall and dramatic light.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'The same person, the same face, with no change in features. An hyper-realistic image with sharp detail. A cinematic medium shot, extremely detailed, captures a young woman with long, straight blonde hair, fair skin, professional makeup, green eyes, and full lips, standing outdoors during a heavy nighttime snowfall. The dog beside her, as seen in the accompanying image, is also standing, covered in snow. The young woman is wearing a black, high-gloss, highly reflective puffer jacket and a thick black faux-fur hat, both covered in a thick layer of bright white snow, highlighting the puffy texture of the fabrics and the wintry contrast. Her gaze is sharply directed at the camera, with a serious expression and slightly parted pink lips. She holds a dark smartphone (resembling a gold iPhone Pro) positioned vertically in front of her chest, with a white MagSafe crescent-shaped accessory and the Apple logo visible beneath it. Her hands are completely covered in tight-fitting black gloves and are slightly swollen from the accumulated snow. The composition uses a shallow depth of field, creating a completely blurred (bokeh) background. The intricate silhouettes of bare tree branches emerge against a dark sky, enhancing the sense of a harsh environment. The lighting is harsh and dramatic, a strong front fill light that creates a sharp contrast with the surroundings. It produces strong, shimmering reflections on the glossy faux leather jacket and emphasizes the cool, bluish-grey tones of the overall scene, giving it a professional, highly realistic, and editorial look. Professional cinematography, harsh lighting, winter print, heavy snow night, black puffer jacket, blonde, 8K, fine detail, high contrast.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766552861_79971705f11d.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"FrozenGaze\",\"WinterCinematic\",\"SnowfallPortrait\",\"HyperRealisticAI\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"AIImageGeneration\",\"WinterEditorial\",\"MoodyPortrait\",\"HarshLighting\",\"SnowNight\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 12, 5, '2025-12-24 05:07:41', NULL, 0, 46),
(499, 'Dual Fates', 27, 'When two souls stand divided, destiny awakens its ancient power.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A dramatic cinematic movie poster featuring two young women standing back-to-back, their upper bodies pressed lightly against each other.\r\nBoth girls are framed from the chest up, close-up composition focusing strongly on their faces and expressions. One girl looks to the left, the other looks to the right, symbolizing opposition and duality. Their expressions are intense, calm, and determined, with subtle emotional tension in their eyes.\r\nAbove them, centered perfectly between their heads, rises the massive head of a colossal two-headed Greek mythological serpent, inspired by ancient Greek legends. The serpent has two distinct heads sharing a powerful, muscular neck, covered in ancient bronze-green and stone-gray scales, engraved with subtle cracks and mythic patterns, as if carved from marble and aged metal. Its eyes glow with divine golden light, staring directly at the viewer with godlike authority and ancient wisdom. The serpent radiates an aura of Olympian power and fate.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1766553388_acc9d1bf2e0b.png', NULL, '[\"CinematicPoster\",\"AIArt\",\"MythologyInspired\",\"GreekMyth\",\"Duality\",\"TwinFates\",\"EpicFantasy\",\"DarkCinema\",\"MoviePosterDesign\",\"AIImagePrompt\",\"PicPose\",\"AIArtists\",\"VisualStorytelling\",\"FantasyArt\",\"EpicMyth\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 18, 11, '2025-12-24 05:16:28', NULL, 0, 67),
(500, 'Lotus of Love 🌸 | A Timeless Indian Romance', 23, 'A serene moment by the lotus pond — where love, tradition, and elegance bloom together in perfect harmony.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'The woman is wearing a Beautiful soft a yellow and deep pink cotton saree and pink blouse.\r\nwith matching accessories like earning. Her hair is open.  She is looking happy, enjoying. with a soft, serene expression. trying to touch lotus from pond. Few plucked lotus on boat, beside her.\r\nThe Man is looking at her with love in his eyes.. wearing a yellow kurta..I want same face as I uploaded.The background is a beautiful nature place with beautiful lotus pond. Lots of beautiful lotus arround.The overall mood is artistic and elegant. Make a realistic photo.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1767503552_1337c9597f89.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"AIPhotography\",\"AIPortrait\",\"IndianAesthetic\",\"SareeLove\",\"LotusPond\",\"RomanticScene\",\"CinematicArt\",\"ElegantMood\",\"IndianCouple\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-04 05:12:32', NULL, 0, 0),
(501, 'Whispers of Light & Wonder', 17, 'A dreamy nocturnal portrait where magic breathes softly — a glowing blue butterfly meets a soul lost in wonder, framed by fairy lights and quiet serenity.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Portrait of the young handsome boy in the uploaded image, dreamy nocturnal magical-realism portrait, waist-up 3/4 view, subject wearing round clear glasses, short dark hair neatly styled, wearing a deep-rose/maroon casual shirt slightly unbuttoned at the collar, hands cupped near his face holding a thin string of fairy lights, soft parted lips, gaze fixed on a large glowing blue butterfly hovering above his palms, expression of wonder and serenit \r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1767503800_6dd505568936.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"DreamyPortrait\",\"MagicalRealism\",\"BlueButterfly\",\"FairyLights\",\"NightAesthetic\",\"AIArtPortrait\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"SoftGlow\",\"EtherealVibes\",\"WonderMood\",\"MoodyTones\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-04 05:16:40', NULL, 0, 0),
(502, 'Neon Street Confidence (8K Hyper-Realistic AI Portrait)', 18, 'Hyper-realistic 8K cinematic fashion portrait with bold neon street vibes, luxury textures, and confident urban attitude.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, 8k, medium shot captured from a slightly low angle, featuring a person with an uploaded face as reference. The subject wears a vibrant, oversized neon green cropped puffer jacket, a white ribbed crop top revealing the midriff, and baggy olive green cargo pants with an elasticated waist, prominent side pockets, and a decorative gold chain belt accessory. They are accessorized with large, reflective green cat-eye sunglasses, multiple layered gold chain necklaces including a pendant, and large gold hoop earrings. Their brown hair is styled in a high ponytail. The person stands confidently with hands in pockets, body slightly angled, and head tilted, looking towards the upper right. The scene is bathed in bright, natural daylight with cinematic lighting, creating vibrant colors and subtle highlights, emphasizing the highly detailed textures of the fabric and metal. The background is an urban setting, softly blurred with a shallow depth of field, showing concrete structures and hints of colorful graffiti in pink and green, suggesting an alleyway or underpass\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1767504224_12e5a025cf9b.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"AIModel\",\"AIFashion\",\"AIPhotography\",\"AIArt\",\"AIPortrait\",\"AIGenerated\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-04 05:23:44', NULL, 0, 0),
(503, 'Modern Elegance in Natural Light', 17, 'A clean lifestyle portrait capturing confidence and calm — styled in mint tones, natural greenery, and soft bokeh for a fresh, high-end editorial look.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', '​A high-quality lifestyle portrait of a handsome young man with curly brown hair posing on an outdoor metal staircase. He is wearing a mint-green quarter-zip knit sweater over a silver chain, paired with crisp white cargo pants and a white smartwatch. He is slightly adjusting his black round-frame sunglasses with one hand while looking at the camera. The background features lush green tropical foliage and vibrant red flowers, creating a soft bokeh effect. The lighting is bright, natural, and even, with a clean and airy color grade. Shot on a 85mm lens, sharp focus on the subject, 4k resolution.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1767504619_033e3a6393dc.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"LifestylePortrait\",\"MensFashionStyle\",\"ModernLook\",\"NaturalLightPhotography\",\"OutdoorPortrait\",\"EditorialVibes\",\"MintGreenStyle\",\"CleanAesthetic\",\"FashionPortrait\",\"BokehBackground\",\"4KPortrait\",\"StylishMen\",\"UrbanLifestyle\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-04 05:30:19', NULL, 0, 1),
(504, 'Golden Elegance Over the City Lights', 18, 'A hyper-realistic cinematic portrait capturing timeless beauty, golden elegance, and a serene connection with a glowing nighttime skyline.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'The same person, the same face, unaltered features. An hyper-realistic image with sharp detail. A high-definition cinematic scene shows a captivating woman with green eyes, full lips, professional makeup, and fair skin, standing confidently on a glass balcony overlooking a nighttime skyline ablaze with lights. The camera captures a medium background of towering buildings. She wears a short, fitted beige dress with a shimmering gold floral print, featuring a square neckline and thin straps. Her long, silky blonde hair, neatly arranged, cascades over her shoulders, accentuating her curves. Simple earrings and a delicate necklace catch the light and add a touch of sparkle. Her hands rest lightly on the glass railing, and her back leans slightly forward to create a sense of movement and connection with the scene. Behind her, the city lights are piled high in rows of illuminated windows and towering skyscrapers. Spots of light reflect off the dress, creating golden gradations that evoke a captivating coolness. The soft, balanced nighttime lighting seems to emanate from cityscapes, penetrating the dress\'s face and lending it a subtle sheen. Meanwhile, the soft shadows add depth to the frame, highlighting the intricate fabric details and the fabric\'s cohesion with the gray wood floor in the background. The cinematic style, with its high level of detail and realistic precision, is complemented by a calm color palette, creating a sophisticated and cohesive impression. Keywords: masterpiece, photorealistic, 8k, shallowDOF, citynight, elegant, gold, silky fabric, slit.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1767505146_58a82e94a444.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"AIArt\",\"AIGenerated\",\"AIPhotography\",\"AIModel\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"CinematicShot\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"Photorealistic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-04 05:39:06', NULL, 0, 0),
(505, 'Guardian of the Frozen Cosmos', 19, 'A mystical soul and her loyal wolf beneath falling snow, cradling a glowing galaxy of secrets in a silent, frozen forest.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Promt for Whisk: A detailed digital illustration depicts [the subject] and a wolf in a snowy, dark forest beneath falling snow.\r\n[The subject] is the central figure, sitting cross-legged on the snow-covered ground. Light blue, intricate, tribal-like patterns adorn her forehead and the area beneath her eyes. She gazes intently at a luminous, spherical object in her hands. The sphere glows light blue and white and is covered with a glittering pattern of colorful stars and cosmic dust, reminiscent of a miniature galaxy or crystal ball.\r\n[The subject] wears warm, imaginative clothing appropriate for the cold. She wears dark blue or gray trousers and a tunic or jacket with brown leather appliqués and fur trim on the shoulders and collar. A wide leather belt with a metal buckle accentuates her waist. She wears tall, dark brown leather boots.\r\nBehind and slightly to the left of [the subject] stands a large, gray wolf. He stands close to her, as if protecting her or keeping her company. Its fur is thick, gray-brown and white, and its piercing, bright golden-yellow eyes fix on the viewer or the surroundings.\r\nIn the background, a dense, snow-covered coniferous forest (pine or fir) is depicted in deep shades of blue, gray, and white, creating a cold, nocturnal or twilight atmosphere. Heavy snowfall, visible as small white specks throughout the image, contributes to a mystical and peaceful, yet dramatic mood. The lighting is subdued overall, primarily illuminated by the pale glow of the sun and the faint reflections in the snow.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1767590001_0e9e44b8f5cb.png', NULL, '[\"AIGeneratedArt\",\"AIIllustration\",\"AIPrompt\",\"WhiskAI\",\"DigitalFantasy\",\"FantasyArt\",\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"AICreators\",\"CreativeAI\",\"AIVisuals\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-05 05:13:21', NULL, 0, 0),
(506, '4D Photorealistic Photographer Caricature on Vintage DSLR', 17, 'Ultra-realistic 4D caricature of a professional photographer — cinematic lighting, flawless facial accuracy, and a whimsical yet high-end studio vibe. Powered by imagination, styled for creators.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Using the uploaded image with 100% accuracy of the face without any distortion. Create a high-end 4D photorealistic caricature of a professional photographer with a slightly bigger head and a tiny, stylized human-like body anatomy. The face are based on the uploaded image, closed-mouth smile. He is sitting on top of a giant vintage DSLR camera as a seat. He is holding a professional DSLR camera with a large lens. The character is wearing a dark blue shirt with print \"MeCCAI\", professional photography red  vest filled with gear, dark blue cargo , pants and black high-top sneakers.\r\nThe background features a massive, soft-bokeh camera lens that creates a cinematic studio atmosphere. Sharp focus on the character, professional high-contrast lighting, 8k resolution, whimsical yet sophisticated digital art style.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1767590511_0a10e02546f3.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"PhotographerCaricature\",\"4DCaricature\",\"PhotorealisticArt\",\"AIArtIndia\",\"CreativePhotography\",\"VintageDSLR\",\"CaricatureArt\",\"AICharacterDesign\",\"DigitalArtStudio\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"8KArt\",\"AIPhotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-05 05:21:51', NULL, 0, 0),
(507, 'Lost Treasure Beneath the Blue 🌊✨', 33, 'A joyful 3D animated underwater adventure where identity meets imagination — playful fish, glowing treasure, and a magical sunken pirate ship, all brought to life with cinematic family-animation vibes.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A cheerful underwater scene featuring the same person from the provided reference photo, which must be used as the exclusive and mandatory identity reference. The human character must retain the same facial structure, proportions, age, and recognizable features from the uploaded photo, adapted into a soft, expressive 3D animated style inspired by high-quality family animation films. No face substitution and no generic character — the likeness must remain clearly identifiable, translated faithfully into a stylized animated form.\r\nThe human swims happily alongside colorful fish, with slightly stylized proportions, large expressive eyes, softened facial details, and a joyful, curious expression that still reflects the original person’s identity. The movement is light and fluid, as if floating effortlessly through the water while interacting playfully with the fish.\r\nSurrounding the human is a lively school of friendly, rounded fish with vivid colors and distinct personalities. In the background, clearly visible and intentionally included, lies a sunken pirate galleon resting on the seabed, partially broken and covered with coral and sea plants. Nearby, an open treasure chest overflows with gold coins and jewels, emitting a warm, glowing golden light that illuminates the sand, bubbles, fish, and parts of the shipwreck.\r\nSun rays filter down from the surface, creating a magical underwater atmosphere with soft volumetric light beams, floating bubbles, and sparkling particles. The coral reef and marine vegetation are colorful, rounded, and playful, maintaining a non-photorealistic animated look. The overall mood is joyful, adventurous, and whimsical, with clean rendering, smooth surfaces, vibrant colors, and a strong sense of wonder and discovery.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1767590743_ea615a5a0106.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"AIAnimation\",\"3DAnimatedArt\",\"UnderwaterAdventure\",\"AIGeneratedArt\",\"AICharacter\",\"PixarStyle\",\"FamilyAnimation\",\"DigitalArt\",\"FantasyWorld\",\"TreasureHunt\",\"OceanMagic\",\"CreativeAI\",\"ReelsArt\",\"ShortsAI\",\"AnimationLovers\",\"AIVisuals\",\"DreamyArt\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-05 05:25:43', NULL, 0, 1),
