(509, 'Mortal Kombat Legends – Epic Selfie in Shao Kahn’s Throne Room', 27, 'A hyper-realistic cinematic selfie featuring Scorpion and the iconic Mortal Kombat warriors, captured in stunning 8K detail with dramatic lighting and legendary vibes. ⚡🐉\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Full body selfie shot, 3:4 aspect ratio. A photorealistic cosplayer dressed as Scorpion (unmasked) from Mortal Kombat (based on the uploaded image) holds a smartphone out to take a group selfie. Standing closely behind him and posing for the photo are Sub-Zero in blue cryomancer armor, Liu Kang in monk attire with red headband, Raiden with a glowing straw hat and white robes, Johnny Cage in tactical gear and sunglasses giving a thumbs up, and Jax Briggs with metallic cybernetic arms. The setting is a detailed Shao Kahn\'s throne room background. Cinematic lighting, hyper-detailed textures on the costumes, sharp focus on the Scorpion cosplayer in the foreground, 8k resolution, realistic skin textures, vibrant colors.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1767682978_b80a9a413621.png', NULL, '[\"MortalKombat\",\"ScorpionMK\",\"SubZero\",\"LiuKang\",\"Raiden\",\"JohnnyCage\",\"JaxBriggs\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-06 07:02:58', NULL, 0, 0),
