(511, 'The Guardian of the Enchanted Forest 🌌✨', 17, 'Magic, leadership aur adventure ka ek cinematic fusion 🌿✨\r\nGlowing blue mushrooms, god rays, aur fantasy world ke beech ek hero ka powerful pose — PicPose AI ke saath imagination ko reality banao 💫🧙‍♂️\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a highly detailed cinematic fantasy forest scene inspired by the reference use face reference exactly. The environment features glowing giant blue mushrooms, floating, magical particles, soft volumetric god rays filtering through tall trees, lush green plants, vibrant flowers, and a mystical stone pathway winding through the forest. Place the subject confidently at the center, standing upright with one hand on the waist and the other pointing directly toward the camera, conveying leadership and adventure. Match the outfit precisely: a green checkered shirt layered over a brown t-shirt, cargo pants, and rugged outdoor boots. On both sides of the subject, add two 3D cartoon characters inspired by Mario and Luigi, waving happily. Ensure accurate scale, lighting, shadows, and color harmony so they blend naturally into the scene. The atmosphere should feel magical, vibrant, and adventurous, with rich depth of field, glowing highlights, ultra-real textures, and an ultra-HD fantasy cinematic illustration style. \r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1767762260_1dccd2344243.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"FantasyArt\",\"CinematicFantasy\",\"EnchantedForest\",\"MagicalWorld\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-07 05:04:20', NULL, 0, 0),
(512, 'Moonfall Anti-Hero | Dark Fantasy Cinematic Power', 27, 'A fearless anti-hero rises from the shadows.\r\nSkulls beneath his feet, chains of fate around his body, and the moon as his witness.\r\nDark fantasy meets cinematic realism — powered by PicPose AI.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A dark, cinematic fantasy scene featuring a powerful anti-hero standing heroically on a pile of human skulls in an ancient graveyard. The character is a muscular man wearing a black, textured bodysuit with white markings on the chest, heavy chains wrapped around his waist, and spiked red armor bands on his arms and legs. A long, flowing red cape spreads dramatically in the wind. He holds a modern tactical rifle in one hand, standing tall and fearless.\r\nBehind him, a massive full moon dominates the night sky, glowing brightly through dark storm clouds. Flying bats circle the moon, and gothic tombstones and crosses surround the graveyard. Moody blue-gray color grading, dramatic rim lighting, ultra-detailed textures, hyper-realistic style, cinematic low-angle shot, dark fantasy atmosphere, sharp focus, high contrast, 4K quality, professional concept art.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1767762960_dd2979a86911.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"DarkFantasy\",\"AntiHero\",\"CinematicArt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-07 05:16:00', NULL, 0, 0),
