(515, 'Curiosity Under the Lens 🌿🔍', 17, 'Nature, imagination aur curiosity ka cinematic fusion ✨\r\nLeaves ke beech ek moment jahan ek nazar sab kuch bada aur zyada magical bana deti hai.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', ' A young man (face and hair 100% reference) wearing a dark sleeveless hoodie, holding a large black framed magnifying glass that enlarges one of his glasses. The man is in the middle of a green leaf of various shapes and textures, with a clear leaf vein pattern, soft green-yellow gradation, and reflections warm light, along with real human sized Popeye characters paying attention to the magnifying glass. Below is a beautiful red black spotted beetle insect with a glossy body, surrounded by delicate glitter like light particles. Eye-level shooting angle, focus on the amazing expression of the man and Popeye. Leica lens cinematic portrait, subject very sharp focus, background soft blur. Lighting effect: soft golden light as permeating leaves, misty,dreamy cinematic color grading warm pastel. The lower right foreground is soft foliage that looks blurred to add visual depth. The whole atmosphere feels warm and curious.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1767767849_cf9242a9b0fb.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"CreativePortrait\",\"CinematicArt\",\"SurrealPhotography\",\"NatureFantasy\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-07 06:37:29', NULL, 0, 0),
