(517, 'Neon Drifter: The Last Ride of a Cyberpunk Survivor', 27, 'A rain-soaked futuristic city, a lone rider, and a silent guardian — survival written in neon and steel.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A cinematic cyberpunk potrait of a gritty young male(keep the facial features unchanged as uploaded image)survivor riding a motorcycle through a nron-lit futuristic city at night. He has pale skin with freckles and dirt smudges on his face . Piercing blue eyes , and messy platinum blonde hair tied in a loose bun. Worn tactical goggles rest on her forehead. He wears a weathered gray tactical jacket and a large, rugged backpack. A black cat with striking heterochromatic eyes(one yellow, one blue peeks out from the top of the backpack, alert and expressive. The motercycle handlebars are visible in the foreground, with cables and metal details. The environment is rainy and atmospheric with glowing neon signs , soft bokeh lights, and a shallow depth of field. Ultra-realistic, highly detailed textures, dramatic rim lighting , cool blue and teal colour grading, cinematic composition, 85 mm lens look , photorealistic,8k , cyberpunk dystopian aesthetic, consept art, poster quality.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1767849817_a14b70498037.png', NULL, '[\"Cyberpunk\",\"CyberpunkArt\",\"AIPrompt\",\"NeonNoir\",\"RainyNight\",\"CreateWithPicPose\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-08 05:23:37', NULL, 0, 0),
