(521, 'The Kapil Sharma Show Reimagined in Ultra-Real AI', 28, 'A cinematic AI recreation featuring The Kapil Sharma Show vibes —\r\nKapil Sharma hosting with charm, a stylish guest at center, and Shraddha Kapoor completing the iconic frame.\r\nPowered by PicPose AI for studio-perfect realism.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Recreate this exact scene from The Kapil Sharma Show featuring host Kapil Sharma on the left in a white jacket and jeans, seated on a green velvet armchair, gesturing with his hands while leaning forward attentively. In the center, place a handsome man (use reference) wearing a black zip-up tracksuit hoodie with white stripes on the sleeves, white pants, a watch on his right wrist, and white sneakers with black accents, sitting relaxed on an orange leather sofa. On the right, Shraddha Kapoor.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1767871835_c96ca358cf96.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"KapilSharmaShow\",\"KapilSharma\",\"ShraddhaKapoor\",\"AIRecreated\",\"CinematicAI\",\"BollywoodVibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-08 11:30:35', NULL, 0, 0),
