(524, 'The Final Move: Rise of the Brave Player', 27, 'A hyper-realistic fantasy adventure where courage meets destiny — one move can change the game forever.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A boy (same facial features as uploaded)with a backpack climbing a wooden ladder looking directly to the camera on a giant game board surrounded by large, menacing snakes with open mouths. A transparent dice with black dots floats above him Nearby, a treasure chest filled with gold coins, gems, and ancient scrolls is spilling onto the board. The game board has intricate, medieval illustrations and symbols, giving the scene a fantasy adventure vibe. The environment is hyper-realistic, 8K resolution, DSLR camera quality with sharp details, dramatic lighting, realistic textures, and a surreal, adventurous mood.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1768022149_bd5fc779c598.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"FantasyAdventure\",\"CinematicArt\",\"GameBoardFantasy\",\"SurrealVisuals\",\"AIArtCreation\",\"8KRealism\",\"EpicScene\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-10 05:15:49', NULL, 0, 0);
