(526, 'When Real Meets Cartoon Magic – Hyper-Real 8K PicPose Moment', 17, 'Ultra-realistic 8K portrait where style meets nostalgia.\r\nA mischievous real-world look with lifelike 3D Motu & Patlu magic — powered by PicPose AI.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'The create a 8k ultra high hyper-relativistic, A photo realistic portrait of a stylish individual. Keep uploaded face consistent and unchanged. The person is a wearing a blue denim jacket, off white t-shirts black cargo pant and white sneakers. They stand with a genuine, mischievous expression, their arm gently wrapped around a giant,lifelike 3D motu, while a playful 3D patlu is perched mischievously on Tom\'s shoulder.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1768023067_67fe1f44de47.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"AIPhotography\",\"AIPortrait\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"8KPortrait\",\"PhotoRealistic\",\"AIGeneratedArt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-10 05:31:07', NULL, 0, 0),
