(531, 'When Gold Meets Obsidian', 17, 'A silent pact between man and dragon — forged in ancient light, rooted in myth, and sealed by destiny.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A young asian man (description). wearing clad in ornate golden Baldur armor with intricate engravings and a matte metallic finish, reaching out with a gold-gauntleted hand to touch the snout of a colossal obsidian dragon. The massive dragon head is composed of charcoal-black stone-textured scales and red crimson eyes with dark obsidian energy pulsing through deep cracks and a luminous obsidian gaze. The scene is set in an ethereal forest of ancient gnarled Yggdrasil tree roots, moss-covered zamrud, snd crystal stones, and a misty atmosphere filled with floating embers. Radiant golden hour sunlight streams from the upper corner, creating cinematic rim-lighting and a warm ambient glow. The image features high-resolution textures, naturalistic lighting, and a sharp focus on the intimate point of contact between man and beast.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1768108270_60c886ba2412.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"AIArt\",\"AIGenerated\",\"FantasyArt\",\"MythicFantasy\",\"DragonArt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-11 05:11:10', NULL, 0, 0),
