(553, 'Ethereal Blossom Queen on a Dream Lake', 18, 'Ultra-realistic fantasy portrait of a woman in a flower-adorned boat, surrounded by misty mountains and a serene lake of pink waterlilies — soft dreamlike lighting preserving the face exactly as the original upload, with an elegant PicPose signature finish.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create Ultra realistic, highly detailed image of a fantasy setting featuring a woman in a flowery boat. She has pale skin, long flowing brown hair, and wears an ornate off-shoulder gown adorned with pink blossoms. The background reveals misty mountains and a serene lake with pink waterlilies. Soft, dreamlike lighting enhances her ethereal beauty. Do not change details . keep face 100% same as upload photo.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1768454662_625f2b11cbae.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"FantasyPortrait\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"EtherealBeauty\",\"DreamyAesthetic\",\"AIArtCreation\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-15 05:24:22', NULL, 0, 0),
(554, 'Mystic Halloween Witch Portrait', 18, 'A cinematic close-up of an elegant Halloween witch surrounded by glowing pumpkins, autumn leaves, and magical mystery — crafted for dark fantasy vibes with a premium PicPose finish.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a close-up of an Asian woman dressed as a witch for Halloween. She wears a black dress and hat, and has long, slightly wavy blonde hair.\r\nThe woman in the image has blue-gray eyes, heavy makeup with dramatic eyeliner, and dark red lipstick that accentuates her features. She wears a tall black witch\'s hat adorned with spiderwebs and eerie scraps of tulle. Her outfit is a long-sleeved, off-the-shoulder black dress made of sheer lace and a long, fluffy black skirt.\r\nShe sits with her knees bent, facing sideways,\r\nbut facing the camera. Her hands are holding a pumpkin-shaped bucket filled with candies and lollipops.\r\nShe\'s surrounded by carved Halloween pumpkins.\r\nThe background of the image is a Halloween atmosphere filled with orange and brown autumn leaves, and carved pumpkins surround her. A single carved pumpkin sits near her, illuminated by a light emanating from within, creating a warm and mysterious image.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1768456432_c3862a5af0a4.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"HalloweenVibes\",\"WitchAesthetic\",\"MysticPortrait\",\"DarkFantasyArt\",\"HalloweenPortrait\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"AutumnAesthetic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-15 05:53:52', NULL, 0, 0),
(555, 'Urban Legends Underground – Cinematic Subway Portrait', 33, 'A moody studio-style photo inside a graffiti-filled subway train, blending raw street fashion with iconic superhero presence. Dim cinematic lighting, natural casual vibes, and an emotional urban atmosphere — powered by PicPose AI ✨\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Edit this image to create a studio photo of a man inside an old subway train filled with graffiti. Create similar photo to Canon EOS R5 The photo must appear casual or natural, without any obvious subjects or props. The lighting is dim and cinematic, creating an urban and melancholic atmosphere.He wears a black leather jacket over a green hoodie and a white T-shirt, broken jeans and worn-out sneakers, and is accompanied by several Avengers superheroes: Spider-Man, black Widow, Iron Man, Hulk and Thor.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1768467258_2d47cfe5013e.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"AIGenerated\",\"SubwayVibes\",\"StreetPortrait\",\"MoodyTones\",\"DarkAesthetic\",\"StreetStyle\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-15 08:54:18', NULL, 0, 0),
(556, 'When Gaming Legends Steal the Spotlight 🎮🍿', 27, 'A hyper-realistic cinematic moment where a shy hero finds himself surrounded by iconic video game characters inside a lively movie theater — chaotic, joyful, and unforgettable.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyperrealistic cinematic shot inside a dark movie theater with visible blue seats in the background, filled with various video game characters having fun. The main character, a man (from the provided photo), looks embarrassed, wearing a simple black Nintendo t-shirt, holding a large red and white striped popcorn bucket in one hand.\r\nOn each side of the main character:\r\n• Left: Mario Bros. holds a red soda cup in one hand with a mischievous expression.\r\n• Right: Donkey Kong is laughing heartily,\r\nholding his own popcorn bucket. His smile is wide and sensual, with gleaming teeth. In the background, other video game characters are visible in the seats, including Goku from Dragon Ball, Kratos from God of War, Sonic, Link, Zelda, Princess Peach, a Pikachu-like character, and many more, some wearing 3D glasses, others tossing popcorn in the air, creating a chaotic and festive atmosphere.\r\nThe lighting is cinematic, primarily coming from an invisible screen in front of them, with light reflections on their faces and popcorn buckets. The details are extremely realistic. The overall atmosphere is joyful, original, and slightly exaggerated.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1768467785_a106a18c2945.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"AIArt\",\"AIGenerated\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"CinematicShot\",\"GamingUniverse\",\"VideoGameLegends\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-15 09:03:05', NULL, 0, 0),
(557, 'When Reality Enters the Cartoon Multiverse', 17, 'Real face, unreal world — city night chaos with Shinchan, Tom & Jerry vibes. Pure cinematic fun powered by PicPose.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a photo of me without changing my real face. A man. Wearing a colorful casual jacket, cargo jeans, a playful cartoon-style watch, and shoes. Create a city night fun/fight scene, referencing the original portrait to create a 100% cinematic look. The real man is among realistic Shinchan, tom and jerry doremon characters. Surreal, Cinematic, Hollywood-style dark effect with neutral lighting, vibrant cartoon-realism blend.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1768625697_8df3a7da1915.png', NULL, '[\"CinematicAI\",\"CartoonRealism\",\"AIArt\",\"AIGenerated\",\"HollywoodStyle\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-17 04:54:57', NULL, 0, 0);
