(558, 'Mario Kart Madness: Full Speed Fun Mode ON! 🏎️🔥', 33, 'Jab aap khud Mario ban jao aur racing track par ho full excitement, chaos aur pure gaming vibes – ultra-detailed 3D cinematic action with PicPose touch 🎮🚀\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A vibrant 3D-rendered Mario Kart battle scene featuring a man (same face as reference image, 100% accuracy) as the main racer. He is wearing Mario\'s outfit (red cap with \"M\", blue overalls, white gloves, brown shoes) and driving a bright red go-kart with the Mario \"M\" logo on the front. His expression is fun, happy, and full of excitement, smiling wide with energy as he races.\r\nAround him are Luigi, Princess Peach, Yoshi, and Bowser also in their karts, creating a chaotic, adrenaline-filled race. Flying items like banana peels, red shells, green shells, and a blue spiny shell fill the air, with sparks under the wheels and motion blur on the track to emphasize speed.\r\nThe scene is set on a colorful Mario Kart track with floating question blocks, a bright blue sky, and a dynamic, cartoonish atmosphere. Ultra-detailed,\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1768625994_ea757d9330ed.png', NULL, '[\"MarioKart\",\"MarioStyle\",\"3DArt\",\"AI3D\",\"AIGenerated\",\"GamingArt\",\"CartoonRacing\",\"EpicRace\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-17 04:59:54', NULL, 0, 0),
(559, 'Forever in One Frame', 23, 'A dreamy romantic couple portrait captured in nature’s embrace — soft smiles, golden light, and timeless love, perfectly preserved with PicPose magic.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'this face create a A romantic couple (keep face, eyes, norse, mouth and hair style same as photo keep my face 100% same as in the reference image) sitting closely on a large circular wicker swing chair in a lush green garden. The woman is wearing a white floral printed crop top with matching pants and white heels, while the man is in a white printed shirt with dark blue trousers and brown shoes. They both smile softly at the camera, creating a warm and intimate vibe. The natural outdoor lighting highlights their faces, with blurred greenery and soft golden bokeh lights in the background, giving a dreamy, elegant, and cozy atmosphere — perfect for a couple photoshoot or engagement portrait.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1768626535_1b9c76161d30.png', NULL, '[\"RomanticCouple\",\"CouplePhotoshoot\",\"EngagementVibes\",\"LoveInNature\",\"DreamyPortrait\",\"CinematicCouple\",\"AIPortrait\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-17 05:08:55', NULL, 0, 0),
(560, 'Emerald Elegance by the River', 18, 'A serene riverbank portrait capturing timeless beauty — emerald green gown, crimson roses, and confident grace, perfectly framed in natural light.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A realistic, high-quality portrait photograph of a beautiful young woman with long, straight brown hair, posing elegantly in a boat by the edge of a serene river. She is looking directly at the camera with a confident, slightly serious expression, holding a single red rose in one hand and a basket filled with red roses in the other. She is wearing a stunning off-the-shoulder, emerald green gown with a plunging neckline and a high slit. A delicate green pendant necklace adorns her neck. The background features the calm, reflective water of the river and lush green foliage, suggesting a peaceful, natural setting with soft, diffused lighting. The image is shot with a DSLR camera to achieve a professional, artistic, and beautifully lit portrait with natural depth and rich colors. Maintain her exact facial features and confident expression from the reference image, ensuring she has a high-quality, elegant makeup look applied, featuring defined eyes, subtle contour, and a classic red lip color. Do not change my face.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1768626836_918fcc252c4b.png', NULL, '[\"AIPhotography\",\"AIArt\",\"AIGenerated\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"ElegantPortrait\",\"RiverSideVibes\",\"EmeraldDress\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-17 05:13:56', NULL, 0, 0),
(561, 'Blossoms of Love | Elegant Maternity Portrait', 23, 'A dreamy, romantic maternity moment captured with soft pastel florals, natural elegance, and timeless love — beautifully realistic and emotionally serene.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create this photo to elegant maternity portrait of a pregnant woman and a man in a flowing blush light blue off-shoulder gown with sheer tulle sleeves, holding her belly. With soft natural makeup, sitting gracefully among pastel flowers, dreamy and romantic atmosphere copy the real face make it realistic. The man is wearing a white polo and shorts sitting beside her gently touching her tummy. Don\'t change the face features.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1768627105_36a18cc89fcc.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"MaternityPortrait\",\"ElegantMaternity\",\"PregnancyPhotoshoot\",\"CoupleMaternity\",\"PastelAesthetic\",\"DreamyPortrait\",\"RomanticVibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-17 05:18:25', NULL, 0, 0),
(562, 'Moonlit Swan Serenade', 18, 'A dreamy night portrait where elegance floats on moonlight — pastel pink saree, pearl grace, glowing petals, and swans beneath a silver sky.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a image of a girl lying down in the boat.moonlit aura.white moon in the sky.glow worm.she is wearing a baby pastel pink net saree with heavy stone work and a deep neck blue velvet full sleve blouse.she is wearing pearl jewellery. her hair is straight. in her body white petals..the pond is full of white swan.the girl is lying in the boat. keep face 100% same as uploaded photo.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1768627489_83cd03d2eabf.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"MoonlitMagic\",\"DreamyPortrait\",\"FantasyAesthetic\",\"PastelElegance\",\"SareeLove\",\"PearlJewellery\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-17 05:24:49', NULL, 0, 0),
(563, 'Ultra-Realistic Tropical Glamour at White Island Beach', 18, 'Cinematic seaside portrait with elegant vacation fashion, natural beauty, and luxury island vibes — powered by PicPose AI\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create ultra-realistic cinematic glamour young woman (keep face, eyes, norse, mouth and hair style same as photo keep my face 100% same as in the reference image) wearing\r\ncrop top or bikini top with thin straps.\r\nA maxi skirt or sarong/wrap skirt with a high slit.\r\nThe straps wrapped around the torso suggest it may also include a separate wrap tie or a strap detail integrated into the skirt or top for a fashionable, midriff-baring look.\r\nThe outfit has a tropical, white floral, orange, which is very common for vacation attire. Long wavy hair with net brim hat , doll make up and natural skin, she is sitting in white metal and have white table metal with teapot and teacup with holding. She is seaside at white island beach in elegant cottage.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1768635609_de5716b5fd02.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"AIImageGenerator\",\"AIArt\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"GlamourPhotography\",\"TropicalVibes\",\"BeachFashion\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-17 07:40:09', NULL, 0, 0),
(564, 'Ultra Realistic Tea Stall Moment with Motlu–Patlu | 4K Cinematic AI Image', 17, 'Apni real look ke saath Motlu aur Patlu ke saath Furfuri Nagar ki chai ki tapri par ek fun-filled, ultra-realistic cinematic scene.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra realistic UHD 4K image of me sitting with Motlu and Patlu cartoon characters at a tea stall in Furfuri Nagar. My real face (100% same, hairstyle same, expression with natural normal smile like my reference image). Motlu is feeding me a hot samosa with a big smile, while Patlu watches and laughs. The background shows a lively village tea stall. Cinematic lighting, natural skin texture, ultra sharp village vibe.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1768637376_c6e4d02eb7d4.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"AIPrompt\",\"AIImageGenerator\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"4KAIImage\",\"MotluPatlu\",\"CartoonWithHuman\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"VillageVibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-17 08:09:36', NULL, 0, 0),
(565, 'Luxury Rooftop Vibes – Hyper-Realistic Cinematic Portrait', 17, 'A stylish young man relaxing on a black SUV rooftop under tropical sunshine, captured in ultra-realistic cinematic detail with natural expressions and premium fashion aesthetics.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a hyper-realistic cinematic portrait of a fashionable young man (use the uploaded face for accurate likeness, ensure the face matches exactly and looks natural). The man is sitting casually on the roof of a black SUV (with visible Wrangler tires) in a sunny, tropical outdoor setting with palm trees and bright light in the background. He is wearing a loose beige short-sleeved shirt over a white tank top, paired with\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1768647013_99400d27d252.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"AIPortrait\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"HyperRealisticAI\",\"AIImageGenerator\",\"LuxuryVibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-17 10:50:13', NULL, 0, 0),
(566, 'Jungle Chase on Vespa 😂🐘', 27, 'Jab ek aam safar ban jaye zindagi ka sabse khatarnaak adventure – elephants ke saath full cinematic chase!\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a humorous, cinematic image of a man (use reference image face and hairstyle 100% realistic) speeding down a dirt road surrounded by green rice fields and palm trees on a yellow vintage Vespa scooter. The man is extremely shocked and scared, and his eyes wide open, as he is chased by three aggressive elephants running after him. One of the elephants leaps into the air with its mouth open.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1768647976_1724b33cd7e1.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"AIPrompts\",\"AIImageGenerator\",\"AIArt\",\"CinematicAI\",\"FunnyAI\",\"VespaRide\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-17 11:06:16', NULL, 0, 0),
(567, 'Midnight Minds: The Creative Council', 33, 'A cinematic, ultra-realistic night-time brainstorm where human creativity meets intelligent animal personas — Pixar-meets-cinema storytelling in a luxury office setting.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A cinematic, ultra-realistic scene inside a modern luxury office at night. A creative director sits on a leather sofa holding a digital tablet, wearing a white shirt, suspenders, glasses, and a dark cap. Around him stands a diverse group of anthropomorphic animals—a clever fox in a green shirt, a confident rabbit officer, a large buffalo police chief in uniform, a calm sloth in office attire, and a coiled blue snake—engaged in a serious creative discussion.\r\nBehind them stands a confident blonde woman in modern fashion, observing the team.\r\nWarm cinematic lighting, soft LED bookshelf lights, realistic fur and skin textures, expressive faces, shallow depth of field, detailed interior design, wooden shelves with books, city skyline visible through a large window.\r\nHighly detailed, photorealistic, Pixar-meets-cinema realism, dramatic yet friendly mood, professional storytelling composition.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1768712008_4a037a06c3bd.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"AIPrompt\",\"AIImageGeneration\",\"CinematicAI\",\"PixarStyle\",\"PhotorealisticAI\",\"CreativeStorytelling\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-18 04:53:28', NULL, 0, 0),
