etailed skin texture with visible natural pores, HDR realism, professional color grading, dramatic yet elegant mood, 8K ultra-resolution, photorealistic, cinematic masterpiece.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1768888993_87e7e3c7ed22.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"AIPortrait\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"LuxuryAesthetic\",\"AlphaVibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-20 06:03:13', NULL, 0, 0),
(582, 'Luxury on the Horizon ✨ | Ocean Yacht Editorial Portrait', 18, 'Ultra-realistic luxury lifestyle portrait on a serene yacht cruise —\r\nwhere modern elegance meets timeless confidence, captured in cinematic perfection\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Without changing my facial features, create Ultra-realistic luxury lifestyle portrait of an elegant woman seated on a yacht deck during a calm ocean cruise. She is wearing a tailored white blazer adorned with bold red floral embroidery, layered over a soft ivory camisole. A chunky gold chain necklace adds a refined statement accent. She wears light beige designer sunglasses with subtle gold detailing and small gold hoop earrings.\r\nHer hair is styled in loose, natural waves, gently lifted by the sea breeze. Makeup is fresh and sophisticated: smooth glowing skin, softly defined brows, warm neutral eyeshadow, light mascara, natural blush, and muted rose lipstick. Her expression is relaxed and confident with a serene smile, gaze directed slightly off-camera.\r\nCamera framing: mid-shot (head to mid-torso), seated angle.\r\nLighting: natural daylight with soft highlights reflecting from the sea, clean shadows.\r\nBackground: deep blue ocean water with clear horizon line, yacht railing visible, minimal distractions.\r\nColor palette: white, red, gold, ocean blue, warm skin tones.\r\nStyle: luxury travel editorial, modern elegance, high-fashion lifestyle.\r\nDetails: realistic skin texture, crisp fabric stitching, subtle reflections on sunglasses.\r\nQuality: ultra-high resolution, cinematic clarity, premium editorial finish.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1768901616_64d298c3536d.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"LuxuryPortrait\",\"YachtLifestyle\",\"LuxuryTravel\",\"EditorialPhotography\",\"HighFashionV