(583, 'Midnight Cola Fantasy – A Bold Luxury Love Story', 39, 'A bold, romantic luxury setup where cinematic lighting, iconic cola aesthetics, and confident couple energy create a timeless visual story.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a real young couple pic of a young beautiful women with long , flowing brown hair adorned with a delicate hair piece. woman seated on edge of bathtube, in a luxurious clawfoot black colour bathtub filled with cocacola . And write on bathtube cocacola in bold letter . The bathtub is positioned in a bright. A sparkling crystal chandelier hangs from the ceiling, and next to the tub, there\'s a small wooden stool with red roses in a vase and several lit candles,enhancing the romantic atmosphere. women is wearing a sophisticated, backless black slip dress with a high slit, red lipstick, and delicate gold jewelry. She is sitting elegantly on a bathtub, and her chest and belly are visible. the young women face matches the uploaded reference image. A Young men is sitting beside the tub, on chair, engrossed in PicPose AI in bathtube And hookah stay on table and He is looking directly at the viewer with a confident expression, holding a black hookah hose in his right hand. On the table. He is wear black shirt and open button coat paint. The young man face and hairstyle match uploaded reference images. In Laxury decorated room, whole room wall is black colour decroted with cocacola logo and cocacola text created by numerous flickering candles of various sizes placed around the tub, on shelves, and on the floor, casting soft, golden light throughout the scene. The overall mood is intimate and enchanting. Bold pose crate a 100% real image not like ai.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1768902248_ddd4c5d042a8.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"AIPrompt\",\"AIArt\",\"AIImageGenerator\",\"CinematicArt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-20 09:44:08', NULL, 0, 0),
(584, 'The Last Guardian of the Ice Throne', 18, 'Where ice remembers, and the guardian never forgets.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-detailed cinematic low-angle 3D render of a stoic guardian based on the upload reference photo, kneeling on one knee upon a frozen obsidian altar deep within an ice-bound citadel. The figure is draped in flowing robes of midnight silk interwoven with razor-thin chains of void iron, with silver-blue frost runes glowing faintly along the fabric and armor, without changing the facial structure of the uploaded photo. A massive double-headed war axe rests heavily across their lap, held firmly in gauntleted hands. The lighting is dramatic and high-contrast, casting long shadows and highlighting the textures of the frost-rimed materials. Looming behind the guardian is a titanic frost wraith composed of swirling blizzards and shattered ice mirrors, with snow drifting violently through the air and icy particles floating in the frigid atmosphere. The environment suffers from heavy frost distortion.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1768906691_f7192e3d95a6.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"AIPrompt\",\"AIArt\",\"AIImageGenerator\",\"CinematicArt\",\"DarkFantasy\",\"FantasyGuardian\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-20 10:58:11', NULL, 0, 0),
(585, 'Charizard-Inspired Cyber Dragon Hero', 27, 'A cinematic, hyper-realistic airborne superhero captured mid-jump, wearing futuristic dragon-inspired power armor with mechanical wings and intense action vibes.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A cinematic hyper-realistic full-body shot of an Asian male superhero wearing intricate, high-tech power armor inspired by the Pokémon Charizard. The armor features heavy orange tactical plating, a teal undersuit, and large, mechanical dragon wings with teal membranes extending from the back. The shoulder pads are sculpted to look like dragon heads. The subject has shoulder-length dark hair and is captured mid-air in a dynamic jumping pose, hovering over broken concrete slabs and rubble.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1768975792_fa30cf1b1fcd.png', NULL, '[\"CinematicShot\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"SuperheroVibes\",\"CyberHero\",\"DragonArmor\",\"CharizardInspired\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-21 06:09:52', NULL, 0, 0),
(586, 'Steampunk Guardian: Man & The Mechanical Beast', 17, 'Ultra-hyper-realistic cinematic steampunk scene with a mechanical vulture guardian\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-detail, hyper-realistic, super cinematic 9:16 ratio. A young man (face and hair 100% reference) with a fur collar jacket, black t-shirt, beige cargo pants, half gloves, Timberland boots, sitting on the rubble of an old mossy steampunk machine. Next to it is a giant Bearded Vulture monster bird with a retro-futuristic mechanical helmet, small cables, metal panels, and a stunning wing detail.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1768975935_3fa6fa2c60e4.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"AIArt\",\"AIImage\",\"AIGenerated\",\"CinematicAI\",\"SteampunkArt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-21 06:12:15', NULL, 0, 0),
(587, 'Eagle’s Pride | A Cinematic Childhood Moment', 19, 'A hyper-realistic 8K DSLR portrait of a fearless 7-year-old boy sharing a powerful bond with a bald eagle, captured in soft sunrise light amid a majestic mountain valley.', 'Hyper-realistic DSLR shot of a 7-year-old boy standing proudly with a bald eagle perched on his arm (protective glove). Mountain valley background, soft sunrise light, cinematic depth, ultra-detailed feathers, 8K realism.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1768986797_74e9a5cb76f8.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"AIPhotography\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"DSLRShot\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"8KRealism\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-21 09:13:17', NULL, 0, 0),
(588, 'Luxury Influencer Look in NYC', 18, 'Ultra-realistic cinematic glamour with 100% identity lock\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic candid cinematic glamour portrait.\r\nExact uploaded reference face only — 100% identity locked.\r\nMedium shot on Brooklyn Bridge wooden walkway; slight low-angle.\r\nPose: leaning casually on rusted steel railing.\r\nExpression: playful kiss-face (pouty lips), confident influencer vibe.\r\nHair: long straight brunette with blonde face framing highlights.\r\nOutfit: light grey voluminous faux-fur coat, white crop top, high-waisted light-wash denim jeans, white baseball cap.\r\nBackground: clear Manhattan skyline with glass skyscrapers under bright midday sun.\r\nLighting: soft high-key daylight, natural skin texture.\r\nCamera look: 85mm lens, shallow depth, clean bokeh, crisp focus.\r\nHigh-end DSLR realism, cinematic street-fashion aesthetic.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1768992560_282f36aed15d.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"StreetFashion\",\"InfluencerVibes\",\"BrooklynBridge\",\"NYCStyle\",\"LuxuryPortrait\",\"AIGlamour\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-21 10:49:20', NULL, 0, 0),
(589, 'Innocence in Golden Light ✨', 18, 'Soft romantic daylight, natural expressions, aur 100% real facial identity ke saath ek dreamy cinematic portrait — jahan har detail DSLR-level realism ko feel karati hai.\r\nPerfect for luxury AI photography lovers 🤍\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-high-resolution 8K photorealistic portrait.\r\nExact uploaded reference FACE ONLY — 100% identity preserved.\r\nVertical 9:16 composition.\r\nSoft romantic daylight with warm natural sun rays.\r\nGentle shadows shaping face; dreamy, intimate atmosphere.\r\nWoman leaning on a table, right hand resting on her face.\r\nDirect eye contact with a calm, wise, innocent expression.\r\nLong latte-brown hair below shoulders with thin bangs,\r\nnatural loose strands softly crossing face.\r\nPeach-toned lips; real skin texture; visible pores; no smoothing.\r\nWearing layered white off-shoulder chiffon top with subtle glitter,\r\npastel yellow & green floral embroidery and delicate beadwork.\r\nLarge gold butterfly pendant necklace.\r\nButterfly-themed layered rings with sparkling stones,\r\nmixed thick & thin bracelets with butterfly, dolphin, heart charms,\r\nlarge butterfly earrings.\r\nCinematic natural lighting, shallow depth of field.\r\nUltra-realistic DSLR photography, editorial realism, no CGI, no illustration.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1768993686_e46e98107a3a.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"UltraRealisticPortrait\",\"EditorialPhotography\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"AIPhotography\",\"PhotorealisticAI\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-21 11:08:06', NULL, 0, 0);
