(590, 'Serene Elegance in Bloom', 18, 'Floating dupatta, soft glam makeup, and a peaceful gaze — where nature, beauty, and calm come together in one timeless frame.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Generate image A women with long black weavy hair is wearing a green linen dress, her dupatta is floating on the ground. She is wearing soft glam makeup.She is seated in a stylish round wicker swing chair. The chair is decorated with green vines and has purple and blue cushions placed on it. She is lookin at the camera with serene expression. Above her white and purple wisteria flowers cascade down, enhancing the elegance of the scene. In the background, serene water with floating water lilies.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1768994906_45885d55b74d.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"AIPhotography\",\"AIPortrait\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"ElegantVibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-21 11:28:26', NULL, 1, 1),
(591, 'Modern Royal Elegance | Cinematic Kurta Portrait', 35, 'Ultra-realistic 8K cinematic portrait blending modern Pakistani high-fashion with classic tradition.\r\nPremium kurta-shalwar styling, editorial lighting, and confident masculine elegance — powered by PicPose.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic, hyper-detailed, 8K cinematic portrait of a young stylish man, using the uploaded reference image for the exact same face and exact same hairstyle (100% identical, no changes at all).\r\nThe young man is wearing a crisp white designer kurta shalwar, paired with a short gray waistcoat enriched with refined traditional embroidery in soft gray and beige tones.\r\nThe fabric appears premium with a subtle glossy sheen, blending modern Pakistani high-fashion with classic elegance.\r\nHe is leaning confidently against a dark architectural pillar, maintaining a cool, composed expression and relaxed posture.\r\nHis hair remains exactly the same as the reference image, slightly tousled and falling naturally over his face.\r\nCaptured in vibrant cinematic lighting with rich contrast and soft highlights that enhance fabric textures and facial details.\r\nHigh-fashion editorial atmosphere, ultra-realistic skin tones, professional cinematic composition, sharp focus, premium aesthetic.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769057086_ecfa32a23ba0.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"RoyalElegance\",\"KurtaStyle\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-22 04:44:46', NULL, 0, 2),
(592, 'Regal Heritage Portrait', 17, 'Ultra-hyper-realistic cinematic portrait capturing modern confidence in timeless South Asian royalty — crafted with editorial precision and cinematic depth.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra hyper-realistic cinematic portrait of a stylish young man, using the uploaded reference image for the exact same face and hairstyle (100% identical, no changes at all).\r\nHe has dark messy hairstyle and exudes a confident, poised, and slightly regal vibe.\r\nHe is wearing a premium navy blue shalwar kameez paired with a short embroidered waistcoat in subtle deep maroon and beige embroidery accents.\r\nNo earrings or additional facial accessories.\r\nThe kurta drapes naturally, with a relaxed yet poised posture. One hand rests casually near the waist, while the other is slightly raised, creating subtle dynamic movement.\r\nThe background features a dramatic historical architecture setting — stone pillars, arches, and textured walls giving a grand and regal atmosphere.\r\nCinematic lighting highlights realistic fabric textures, skin details, and facial features, creating a polished editorial look.\r\nUltra-realistic glossy high-fashion skin, professional photography composition, sharp focus on face and upper body, clean and sophisticated aesthetic.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769057554_68dfb6d45d28.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"RoyalPortrait\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"HeritageLook\",\"ShalwarKameezStyle\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-22 04:52:34', NULL, 0, 0),
(593, 'Royal Wedding Elegance – Cinematic 8K Portrait', 27, '📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a vibrant,high-fashion portrait of the same young man (keep his original face,hair and expression exactly the same as in the reference image)He has stylish,voluminous dark hair with subtle highlights. He is leaning against a dark pillar, looking upwards and to the side with a pensive and cool expression His outfit is a modern Pakistani designer-style dress a dress blue kurta with a dress blue waistcoat golden button,blending traditional embroidery with contemporary fashion,in shades of deep.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769058909_933f3d4580b8.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"HighFashionPortrait\",\"PakistaniFashion\",\"DesiCouture\",\"RoyalBlueLook\",\"ModernKurta\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-22 05:15:09', NULL, 0, 0),
(594, 'Glam Leopard Diva ✨🐆', 18, 'Golden reflections, crystal sparkle, aur fearless glam — yeh sirf style nahi, power ka pose hai.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Using image above create Glam Leopard Diva\r\nEyes: give her most black eyes, groomed eybrows.\r\nHair: Extra-long falling with lots of volume, over shoulder one side.\r\nMakeup: Full glam: smoky rozy pink lips, glossy chestnut lips, blinding highlighter.\r\nNails: Red stiletto nails with gold spots.\r\nOutfit: Leopard-print mini dress covered in tiny crystals under strong lights.\r\nAccessories: Sparkling drop earrings, rhinestone cuffs.\r\nPose: Siting on a gold chair with one leg crossed, chin tilted up.\r\nBackground: Golden mirrored set reflecting glitter.\r\nLighting: Diamond-bright glam lighting.\r\nCamera Quality: 8K sparkle-capturing lens.\r\nProps: Glitter tossed in the air mid-shot.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769071505_b09c1e4febd4.png', NULL, '[\"GlamLeopardDiva\",\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"LuxuryGlam\",\"LeopardPrintLook\",\"CrystalDress\",\"HighFashionVibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-22 08:45:05', NULL, 0, 0),
(595, 'Wildcat Hollywood Bombshell', 27, 'A fierce blend of Hollywood glamour and untamed elegance — bold curls, golden glow, and unstoppable bombshell energy.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Using image above create Wildcat Hollywood Bombshell\r\n\r\nHair: Big black voluminous Hollywood curls with warm honey highlights.\r\nMakeup: Smoky black cat-eye, golden shimmer lids, glossy nude lips, snatched contour.\r\nNails: Long almond nails with subtle leopard-print tips.\r\nOutfit: Skin-tight leopard print bustier dress with sweetheart neckline and thigh slit.\r\nAccessories: Thick gold hoops, stacked gold bracelets, leopard clutch.\r\nPose: Hand on hip, hair tossed over one shoulder, leg popped for bombshell shape.\r\nBackground: Gold-lit studio with soft shadows.\r\nLighting: Warm spotlight + shimmering gold backlight.\r\nCamera Quality: 8K fashion editorial.\r\nProps: Faux fur coat draped over one arm.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769072127_e8e45c1891a9.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"WildcatLook\",\"HollywoodBombshell\",\"LeopardStyle\",\"FierceGlam\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-22 08:55:27', NULL, 0, 0),
(596, 'Golden Gaze – Ultra-Realistic Cinematic Portrait', 18, 'Warm golden bokeh ke saath DSLR-level romantic close-up portrait, jisme flawless skin, dramatic lashes aur natural elegance perfectly capture ki gayi hai — 100% real identity preserved.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic professional DSLR portrait.\r\nExact uploaded reference FACE ONLY — 100% identity preserved.\r\nDiagonal close-up composition at eye level.\r\nWoman leaning sideways, head resting on chair surface,\r\nlooking directly into the camera.\r\nRight hand placed neatly near the face.\r\nVery long thick dark-brown latte hair, slightly wavy,\r\nflowing across lower-right frame.\r\nOutdoor romantic background with warm golden bokeh lights,\r\nsoftly blurred environment.\r\nMakeup focus: ultra-long dramatic lashes, precise eyeliner,\r\nsmall gemstone nose piercing.\r\nPeach-pink glossy lips with clear shine.\r\nFair pink-toned skin with well-blended rosy blush.\r\nGold bracelet with multiple vibrant gemstones on left wrist,\r\ngold ring.\r\nGold necklace with floral pendant encircled by chain,\r\nmatching gold bracelet charm.\r\nOval nails with gold manicure and white pointed tips.\r\nThin glitter chiffon off-shoulder kurti,\r\nintricate pastel-pink floral embroidery on chest.\r\nSoft flattering lighting highlighting hair texture,\r\nmakeup detail and skin realism.\r\nShallow depth of field, cinematic romantic mood,\r\nno CGI, no illustration.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769073190_f83c2fc8e24a.png', NULL, '[\"RomanticMood\",\"GoldenBokeh\",\"LuxuryPortrait\",\"ProfessionalPhotography\",\"PicPoseAI\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-22 09:13:10', NULL, 1, 1),
(597, 'Little Gentleman, Big Style', 19, 'A luxury kids’ fashion photoshoot capturing confidence, class, and modern urban charm — styled like a high-end fashion magazine cover.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Turn this photo into a professional kids’ fashion photoshoot portrait. The boy should look around 4.5 years old with weight about 14 kg. Face details must remain exactly the same as the reference, no changes to the facial appearance. Recreate the same pose as in the reference: leaning stylishly against a luxury car with both hands in pockets, confident attitude. Outfit should be identical in style: white shirt with rolled sleeves, bright yellow waistcoat with black accents, and white slim-fit trousers. Add modern stylish hairstyle with sharp clean cut, glossy and fashionable. Accessories like sunglasses and bracelet should remain, keeping the trendy and cool vibe. Lighting should be clean and crisp, like high-end outdoor fashion photography, with sharp details and vibrant colors. \r\nBackground should match an urban street setting with cars, maintaining a luxury and modern lifestyle look. Main focus should remain on the original face, while overall photo looks like a premium kids’ fashion magazine shoot.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769073717_188e4b8a8dfd.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"KidsFashion\",\"KidsStyle\",\"LittleGentleman\",\"LuxuryKids\",\"MiniModel\",\"KidsPhotoshoot\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-22 09:21:57', NULL, 1, 2),
(598, 'Garden Smile & Puppy Love 🐶', 18, 'Ek khoobsurat pal jahan natural beauty, fresh garden vibes aur puppy ki innocence milkar ek perfect heart-warming portrait banate hain.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A beautiful young woman like this photo with long, wavy brown hair and red lipstick smiles as she holds an adorable puppy.\r\nShe is wearing an off-the-shoulder orange dress with white floral patterns and a straw hat adorned with orange flowers. The background is a lush green garden with more orange flowers.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769075343_0c424c03a3a1.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"PuppyLove\",\"GardenPortrait\",\"NaturalBeauty\",\"CuteMoments\",\"FloralDress\",\"SummerVibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-22 09:49:03', NULL, 0, 0),
(599, 'Sun-Kissed Serenity in Bloom', 18, 'A dreamy fine-art portrait where golden sunlight, delicate blossoms, and prism reflections embrace my real beauty — timeless, radiant, and magical.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Using my picture as a reference, create and transform it into this scene while keeping my real facial features. A realistic portrait of me standing in a sunlit garden, surrounded by delicate white blossoms. My head is slightly turned over my shoulder, giving a soft, captivating gaze directly into the camera. My hair is styled in a loose, romantic updo, with many soft strands falling freely across my cheeks and framing my face, adding a natural, windswept elegance. I am wearing yellow saree with embroidered lace, off shoulder long ruffles blouse trim on the shoulders, glowing in the sunlight. Soft beams of light filter through the branches and flowers, scattering across my face, neck, and dress. Multiple rainbow-colored reflections dance across my skin, with stronger golden and yellow tones, making my face glow warmly as if kissed by sunlight. My skin is radiant and luminous, with a natural glow, subtle blush, defined brows, long curled lashes, and soft coral-pink lips. The atmosphere is ethereal, romantic, and magical, filled with vibrant prism light, blending realism with a painterly, fine-art aesthetic. Ultra realistic, highly detailed, photorealistic 8k, cinematic lighting, professional photography. --reference image (insert my photo)\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769076158_bc7d038ae972.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"SunlitPortrait\",\"GardenAesthetic\",\"YellowSaree\",\"FineArtPortrai\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-22 10:02:38', NULL, 0, 0),
