(601, 'Sky Blue Swagger | Luxury Meets Confidence', 18, 'Ultra-realistic 8K cinematic portrait of a modern gentleman—confidence, class, and supercar luxury captured in one powerful frame.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an ultra-realistic 8K portrait of a stylish young man sitting casually on the rear of a sky blue Lamborghini car, which features black alloy rims and red brake calipers. He is wearing a sky blue suit paired with Nike Air Jordan white sneakers, adding to his cool, fashionable look. The man has a neatly styled, voluminous hairstyle, and he gazes of into the distance with a confident expression. Surrounding him are vibrant blossoms of sky blue flowering brogwilley plants, enhancing the scene. Don\'t change face.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769079889_d83468e535ce.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"LuxuryPortrait\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"8KPortrait\",\"AIPhotography\",\"SupercarStyle\",\"LamborghiniVibes\",\"SkyBlueAesthetic\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-22 11:04:49', NULL, 0, 0),
