(604, 'Rise of the Cyber Dragon Rider', 27, 'A fearless warrior, a cybernetic dragon, and a battlefield forged in fire and steel.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'An ultra-realistic cinematic scene of a young male warrior riding a massive mechanical dragon in a war-torn environment.\r\nThe rider is wearing futuristic black combat armor with sharp angular plating, glowing red energy lines, and advanced sci-fi details. His expression is intense and focused, dark hair slightly messy, heroic posture while gripping the dragon’s back.\r\nThe dragon is a cybernetic metal beast, built from dark steel armor plates, exposed mechanical joints, glowing blue energy cores, neon circuitry, and hydraulic details. Its eyes burn with orange light as it breathes roaring fire, flames lighting up smoke and debris around it.\r\nLarge mechanical wings with metallic bones and leathery panels are spread wide, showing scale and power. Dust, smoke, sparks, and flying debris fill the ground, creating a dramatic battlefield atmosphere.\r\nCinematic lighting, shallow depth of field, ultra-sharp\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769230216_103f6f095de2.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"CinematicAI\",\"AICinematic\",\"SciFiArt\",\"cyberdragon\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-24 04:50:16', NULL, 0, 0),
