(606, 'Midnight Edge – A High-Fashion Editorial Muse', 18, 'Bold silhouette, effortless attitude, and cinematic studio elegance — where modern fashion meets timeless allure.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic studio fashion portrait of a young woman with fair skin and soft features, She has long, voluminous black hair styled in loose natural messy waves, slightly tousled, with one hand resting against the side of her head, fingers in her hair. Calm, confident, slightly sultry expression, lips gently parted, direct eye contact with the camera. She wears a fitted white cropped tank top revealing toned abs, paired with black high-waisted pants. A black leather jacket is draped loosely off her shoulders, partially worn, adding an edgy fashion vibe. Minimal jewelry: thin bracelets on the wrist. Natural makeup with subtle contouring, warm blush, soft nude lips, defined brows. Pose & Composition: Three-quarter body portrait, vertical framing, subject centered. One arm raised to the head, the other relaxed downward near the hip. Elegant yet casual fashion pose. Clean silhouette with strong subject separation. Lighting: Professional studio lighting on a pure black background. Soft but directional key light from front-left, creating gentle highlights on the face, collarbone, and torso. Smooth falloff shadows for depth and contrast. High dynamic range, cinematic contrast. Style & Quality: High-end editorial fashion photography, ultra-sharp focus, shallow depth of field, realistic skin texture, natural color grading, no grain. DSLR look, 85mm lens feel, f/2.8 aesthetic. Premium magazine-quality image, photorealistic, no stylization.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769231891_28279e63ed55.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"EditorialFashion\",\"StudioPortrait\",\"HighFashionLook\",\"CinematicPortrait\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-24 05:18:11', NULL, 0, 0),
(607, 'Golden Glow Elegance', 18, 'Soft smile, natural douyin makeup aur denim charm ke saath ek timeless portrait — jahan nazar seedha dil tak jaati hai 💛\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an image of a woman with long wavy golden brown hair, looking directly at the camera with a soft expression and a slight smile (her right cheek has a dimple). Her skin is fair and smooth, with natural makeup (light douyin makeup) that highlights her features: neat eyebrows, light eyeshadow, slightly elongated eyeliner, and lips painted pink lipstick. She is wearing a denim top with a bow on the right shoulder with a small pleat detail, and a gold necklace with the name \'Jess\' and small gold love earrings. Soft lighting highlights her face, creating a glow on her skin. The background is a plain dark wooden wall. The photo is taken from the chest up, emphasizing her face and upper body. Her nails are long, maroon with a white bow pattern. She wears a small gold ring on her left index finger and a small gold bracelet. Pose with her hand on her chin. Do not change her face.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769244598_05a8200bbb17.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"GoldenGlow\",\"SoftSmile\",\"DimpleLove\",\"DouyinMakeup\",\"NaturalBeauty\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-24 08:49:58', NULL, 0, 0),
