(611, 'Pride of India 🇮🇳 | 77th Republic Day Cinematic Poster', 17, 'A tribute to freedom, unity, and the tricolor — standing tall with pride on 26th January 2026.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'An ultra-realistic 8K cinematic Republic Day poster. The main subject is the man from the reference photo, maintaining his exact facial features, hairstyle, and skin tone. He is positioned on the left side of the frame, barefoot, wearing a stylish white kurta and dhoti with a small Indian flag pinned to his chest pocket. He is looking upward towards the national flag with a proud, emotional expression, standing on a field with his body facing the flag in a salute. In the foreground, a large, majestic Indian national flag waves with realistic fabric texture and wind ripples. The background features a dramatic twilight sky transitioning from navy blue to warm orange, with large fluffy clouds glowing in the sunset and a faint silhouette of the Indian map. Text elements: \'HAPPY\' in metallic silver 3D letters at top center; \'77th\' in massive chrome-silver 3D font below it; \'REPUBLIC DAY\' in bold white with a red shadow; \'26th January 2026\' in clean white sans-serif; and a tagline \'Wishing every Indian a joyful and proud Republic Day.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769325213_04a7f0fb4384.png', NULL, '[\"RepublicDay2026\",\"77thRepublicDay\",\"PrideOfIndia\",\"IndianFlag\",\"DeshBhakti\",\"TricolorLove\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-25 07:13:33', NULL, 0, 1),
