(613, 'Poetic Solitude in Winter Light', 17, 'A hyper-realistic cinematic portrait capturing quiet emotion, Nordic winter fog, and timeless solitude — where texture, light, and feeling breathe together.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Hyper-realistic 8K editorial frame, medium portrait leaning back against tall pine tree, ringlets falling naturally, soft contemplative gaze away from camera. hands in pockets, snow resting on coat shoulders, gentle winter fog, dramatic soft\r\nNordic sunlight through branches. textured bark and wool fabric contrast. quiet emotional depth, poetic solitude. cinematic snow particles.\r\nFace has not changed\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769328175_725bee90ffba.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"WinterPortrait\",\"PoeticSolitude\",\"NordicMood\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-25 08:02:55', NULL, 0, 0),
(614, 'Golden Lace Serenity – Ultra-Realistic Cinematic Portrait', 18, 'Soft warm light mein captured ek intimate indoor portrait —\r\nnatural expressions, detailed lace texture aur cinematic depth ke saath. Perfect blend of realism & elegance ✨\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an ultra-realistic portrait of a woman sitting indoors in soft warm light.\r\n\r\nShe has long dark wavy hair and her face should remain consistent with the reference image provided.\r\n\r\nThe woman is wearing a mustard-yellow lace outfit with intricate floral embroidery, sheer sleeves, and a deep neckline.\r\n\r\nShe is leaning forward slightly, resting her head gently on her left hand, fingers softly tangled in her hair.\r\n\r\nHer expression is calm, intimate, and softly thoughtful, with relaxed eyes looking directly at the camera.\r\n\r\nThe background is warm, slightly dark, and softly blurred, enhancing the cozy indoor atmosphere.\r\n\r\nCapture fine skin texture, natural glow, detailed lace patterns, soft shadows, and depth-of-field for a cinematic portrait style.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769331069_3f1312f55287.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"UltraRealisticPortrait\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"LuxuryPortrait\",\"IndoorPortrait\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-25 08:51:09', NULL, 0, 0),
(615, 'Urban Pokémon Awakening', 17, 'A cinematic night alley battle where real-world grit meets anime energy — lightning, fire, and Pokémon power unleashed.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A high-quality photo of a young man standing in a gritty city alley at night, wearing a denim jacket and jeans. He is surrounded by glowing, 2D anime-style Pokémon creatures. Intense yellow lightning bolts and orange fire swirls wrap around the man and the creatures. The man has a confident battle pose. Dramatic street lighting, wet pavement reflections, cinematic composition, hybrid of realistic photography and vibrant cel-shaded anime art.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769489304_53ad5618f3ab.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"PokemonStyle\",\"AnimeFusion\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"UrbanFantasy\",\"AnimeArtStyle\",\"AIArtPrompt\",\"HybridArt\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-27 04:48:24', NULL, 0, 0),
(616, 'Pearl of the Deep Abyss', 17, 'A cinematic underwater fantasy where magic meets courage — a man reaching destiny beneath the ocean’s glow.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A cinematic, hyper-realistic underwater shot of a handsome man with dark wavy hair and a beard, wearing a tactical black wetsuit, reaching out to touch a massive glowing magical pearl inside a giant open seashell. The pearl emits a soft ethereal light. Surrounding him are vibrant tropical fish, jellyfish, and a large octopus in the background. Sunbeams piercing through the deep blue water surface, bioluminescent particles, coral reef setting, 8k resolution, highly detailed textures, magical atmosphere, wide-angle lens.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769489669_032067ce6524.png', NULL, '[\"PearlOfTheDeep\",\"UnderwaterFantasy\",\"CinematicShot\",\"MagicalPearl\",\"OceanMystery\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-27 04:54:29', NULL, 0, 0),
(617, 'Golden Hour Bloom Walk', 18, 'A candid 8K cinematic moment — soft Korean glam, flowing hair, vintage flowers, and a joyful walk past a sunset-lit flower shop. Pure elegance, perfectly real.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic 8K cinematic lifestyle portrait, use ONLY uploaded face (100% identical, no face change). Young woman with smooth fair skin and soft natural glow, gentle charming smile (lips closed, no teeth), cute flirty close-up pose while walking outdoors in the evening. Long straight black hair flowing naturally. Korean makeup look: calm grey softlens, winged eyeliner, naturally curled lashes, soft pink blush, glossy pink lips. Outfit: fitted cream t-shirt, black denim skirt. Accessories creatively styled: black quilted shoulder bag with gold chain, white smartwatch, minimal elegant gold ring, delicate pendant necklace. She carries a large vintage-wrapped bouquet with mixed colorful flowers. Scene set in front of a flower shop at golden hour, warm sunset light, lively road with passing vehicles softly blurred. Candid joyful mood, natural movement, realistic skin texture, shallow depth of field, cinematic color grading, 85mm lens look, photorealistic, 9:16.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769491261_cd2c5c375a68.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"GoldenHourVibes\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"8KPortrait\",\"LifestylePhotography\",\"FlowerShopMood\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-27 05:21:01', NULL, 0, 0),
(618, 'Golden Hour Bloom Walk', 17, 'A candid evening moment wrapped in flowers, soft smiles, and cinematic warmth.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A cinematic, hyper-realistic portrait of a young man (100% matched the face reference) sitting casually on large 3D golden letters spelling “AKMAL.” He wears a dark hoodie, blue jeans, and white sneakers. Behind him, dramatic golden, black, and white smoke bursts outward against a dark backdrop. Ultra-detailed, 8K quality, with cinematic lighting, subtle reflections on the floor, and a bold, modern, and powerful atmosphere.\"do not change my face.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769513263_d74c4b2bf945.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"GoldenHourVibes\",\"FlowerShopMood\",\"LifestylePhotography\",\"UltraRealistic8K\",\"CandidBeauty\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-27 11:27:43', NULL, 0, 1),
(619, 'Chaos on Wheels: Superheroes Gone Wild', 33, 'A high-speed cinematic ride where superheroes panic, villains sneak in, and reality bends inside a vintage blue car.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, wide-angle fisheye shot from inside a vintage blue car driving at high speed. In the driver\'s seat is an Asian man with glasses and a black t-shirt holding a red soda can, looking calm. In the passenger seat, The Flash sits looking panicked. Squeezed into the back seat are The Hulk, Superman, Batman, and the Chucky doll. On the roof of the car, a Gremlin monster is looking down through the windshield. In the background through the rear window, a police car is chasing them with lights flashing. Motion blur outside, sunny day, cinematic lighting, 8k resolution.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769580880_d429311a0931.png', NULL, '[\"ChaosOnWheels\",\"SuperheroCrossover\",\"CinematicAI\",\"HyperRealisticArt\",\"FisheyeShot\",\"AIImagePrompt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-28 06:14:40', NULL, 0, 0),
(620, 'Leap Through Time', 17, 'A surreal moment where time bends, courage rises, and one jump changes everything.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A dynamic, surreal photograph of a young man with glasses and a beard, wearing a white short-sleeved school shirt, a blue tie, dark trousers, and a backpack. He is mid-air, leaping across a gap between two concrete rooftops. Directly behind him is a massive, swirling vortex of blue light and energy, filled with antique clocks, clock faces, and gears. Below is a dense, sprawling city, and the sky is filled with large, dramatic clouds and sunbeams. The lighting is bright and energetic.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769581221_ce89e3bdd935.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"LeapThroughTime\",\"SurrealPhotography\",\"CinematicArt\",\"TimeVortex\",\"DreamlikeVisuals\",\"AIPhotography\",\"ConceptualArt\",\"UrbanFantasy\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-28 06:20:21', NULL, 0, 0),
(621, 'Luxury in Motion | Dubai Supercar Style', 17, 'White-Golden Bugatti ke saath designer Gucci look, Dubai ki shaam aur confidence jo camera se baat kare — pure elite lifestyle vibes.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'DSLR-quality fashion photo of man with a slim physique, sitting sideways in the driver’s seat of a white-golden-black Bugatti (Chiron) with the door open,look camera.His upper body is turned toward the door,one arm resting on the door frame,the other on his thigh.He wears a fitted white-darkgeen-gold-red designer gucci tracksuit,sneakers,chain and sunglasses pushed up on his forehead. highlights his face and outfit.Ultra-detailed Bugatti leather interior visible. Outside,a Dubai evening.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769581774_96b9637f7d02.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"LuxuryLifestyle\",\"DubaiVibes\",\"BugattiStyle\",\"SupercarLife\",\"GucciOutfit\",\"MensFashion\",\"DesignerLook\",\"RichVibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-28 06:29:34', NULL, 0, 0),
(622, 'Sacred Serenity | Lotus Grace at Sri Lankan Temple', 18, 'A candid evening moment wrapped in flowers, soft smiles, and cinematic warmth.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic photograph of a woman (keep face, eyes, nose, mouth and hair style same as photo keep my face 100% same as in the reference image)\r\nAttire:\r\n​She should be wearing a long dress with large sleeves.\r\n​The dress must be made of white lace.\r\n​Setting / Background:\r\n​The background should be a Sri Lankan Temple.\r\n​She should be standing near a Stupa/Dagoba.\r\n​Pose / Action:\r\n​She should be standing.\r\n​She should be holding a few lotus flowers in her hand.\r\n​Hairstyle:\r\n​Her hair should be tied in a Ponytail.\r\n​Image Features:\r\n​The photo should be a close-up shot of her.\r\n​The face should be uploaded with 100% clear visibility\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769583409_e61ce225a6da.png', NULL, '[\"SacredSerenity\",\"LotusGrace\",\"SriLankanTemple\",\"StupaVibes\",\"WhiteLaceDress\",\"DivinePortrait\",\"SpiritualAesthetic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-28 06:56:49', NULL, 0, 0),
(623, 'Serene Back Glance by the Lake', 18, 'A photorealistic portrait of elegance — soft natural light, calm lake vibes, and a graceful feminine back pose captured in timeless realism.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Generate a photorealistic image of a young woman sitting on rocks by a serene lake. She is wearing a flowing white dress with thin straps and an open back detail, with the dress spread out around her on the rocks. The woman has long, dark brown wavy hair and is looking back over her left shoulder towards the camera with a slight smile. She is touching her face with her left hand near her mouth. She is adorned with a chunky patterned necklace, a patterned bracelet on her left wrist, and a ring on her left hand. The background features a calm lake with a blurred shoreline in the distance and tree leaves hanging down from the top of the frame. The lighting is soft and natural, suggesting late afternoon or early morning with warm tones. The image should have high realism, sharp details on the woman and rocks, and a shallow depth o. I focusing on the women.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769590052_9a238a7a1317.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"PhotorealisticArt\",\"LakeSidePortrait\",\"SereneVibes\",\"ElegantWoman\",\"NaturalLightPhotography\",\"SoftAesthetic\",\"FemalePortrait\",\"AIPhotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-28 08:47:32', NULL, 0, 0);
