(624, 'Crimson Gaze — Ultra-Realistic Portrait Elegance', 18, 'An intense, eye-level portrait set in a dark red velvet lounge, capturing raw confidence and timeless beauty. Shot with cinematic lighting, bold red tones, and a powerful stare that commands attention.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic portrait photography of a young woman. Use the face from image exactly as it is; do not change the facial structure or beauty\r\nFrame: Sitting eye-level portrait\r\nLocation: Dark red velvet lounge\r\nPose: Sitting on leather chair, elbow on armrest, fingers near chin — intense stare\r\nOutfit: Deep red corset blouse, gold waist chain\r\nMakeup: Classic red lips, bold eyeliner glow\r\nCamera: Sony A7R V • 50mm\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769590601_098de7ef9b99.png', NULL, '[\"CrimsonGaze\",\"UltraRealisticPortrait\",\"PortraitPhotography\",\"AIPhotography\",\"PicPose\",\"LuxuryPortrait\",\"BoldElegance\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-28 08:56:41', NULL, 0, 0),
(625, 'Nature’s Grace Portrait', 18, 'A photorealistic portrait capturing her natural beauty amid a vibrant flower garden and lush green mountains — bright skies, warm sunlight, and a timeless serene vibe.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a photorealistic of me using the 1st uploaded image as my outfit (preserve face like a photo attached) the right side has a plenty flower garden\r\nstanding and slightly leaning on a wooden railing with a beautiful mountain landscape behind her*\r\nThe sky is bright blue with a few scattered clouds, and the mountains are lush and green.\r\nThe sun is shining, creating a clear and vibrant scene.\r\nslightly looking on her front\r\n•dont change my face.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769591369_c68752ddcc4b.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"AIPhotography\",\"PhotorealisticPortrait\",\"NaturePortrait\",\"MountainVibes\",\"FlowerGarden\",\"AestheticPhotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-28 09:09:29', NULL, 0, 0),
(626, 'Cinematic Confidence – Ultra-Realistic 4K Portrait', 17, 'Soft cinematic lighting, bold attitude, and hyper-realistic details — a modern portrait that captures confidence, depth, and natural charisma in stunning 4K realism.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic 4K hyper-detailed cinematic portrait of a very handsome young man, face 100% identical to the uploaded reference photo,wearing sunglasses, confident expression. Soft, moody cinematic lighting highlights his facial features, emphasizing the\r\ncontours, skin texture, and subtle details. He leans casually in a relaxed pose, wearing an oversized black t-shirt that complements his figure. His voluminous, well-styled hair adds depth and character, perfectly matching the reference photo. The background is softly cinematic: deep, blurred lush green foliage with warm yellow backlight subtly illuminating the top of his head, creating a natural halo effect.\r\nForeground leaves are softly visible, adding depth\r\nand immersive layering to the composition. Lighting is soft and cinematic, with gentle shadows and highlights enhancing facial realism and texture. Color grading leans toward warm, earthy tones with a serene, natural mood. The overall image is rendered in ultra-realistic 4K.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769592871_9b201bc180a7.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"4KPortrait\",\"HyperDetailed\",\"MoodyLighting\",\"CinematicVibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-28 09:34:31', NULL, 0, 0),
(627, 'Forest Guardians: The Child & The Wild Companions', 19, 'A magical autumn forest scene where innocence meets the wild — a smiling young boy walking fearlessly alongside a lion, a white tiger, and a white cat, captured in warm cinematic tones with soft depth and emotion.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A young boy 9 year old (use reference image face and hair style exactly) sit on a forest path surrounded by tall pine trees. The child is wearing a brown jacket and smiling directly at the camera. Behind the child, a young lion\'s is walking on the left and a young white tiger on the right and a white cat, every one appearing to approach the viewer. The forest has an autumn atmosphere with warm tones, fallen leaves, and soft, diffused lighting. The background is slightly blurred to create depth and focus on the child and animals.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769594592_1588d6264eda.png', NULL, '[\"ForestMagic\",\"ChildAndNature\",\"WildCompanions\",\"LionAndTiger\",\"AutumnVibes\",\"PicPose\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-28 10:03:12', NULL, 0, 0),
(628, 'Dragonbound Warrior – Legacy of Power', 17, 'Ultra-realistic cinematic full-body portrait of an iconic martial artist standing in ancient ruins, clad in a luxurious black-and-gold robe, united with a majestic dragon that mirrors his power, dominance, and legacy.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a super Ultra-realistic full-body cinematic image of the man reference uploaded image do not alter the face , in his youthful and iconic martial artist physique, wearing the exact luxurious black-and-gold patterned robe from the reference image, the golden patterns shining vividly under the light. His muscular torso is visible as the robe flows dramatically in motion. Standing beside him is a majestic dragon, its scales shimmering with the same intricate black and gold fabric pattern as the robe, making them visually connected. The dragon is powerful, with glowing golden eyes, exuding charisma and dominance. The background shows an ancient stone ruin bathed in warm daylight, perfectly clear, no haze, sharp high-definition clarity. His facial features and hairstyle are consistent with his iconic look, his expression intense and determined.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769662299_466063e6a5c0.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"MartialArtist\",\"DragonPower\",\"LegendaryWarrior\",\"MythicVibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-01-29 04:51:39', NULL, 0, 0),
