(644, 'Elemental Awakening: The Trainer’s Final Stand', 33, 'Where fire, water, lightning, and earth collide — a cinematic Pokémon legend reborn.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic dynamic full-body portrait of a young man (same face as reference image, 100% accuracy) with dark spiky hair and serious determined expression, kneeling in the center of an epic fantasy landscape. Outfit : White and blue collared short sleeves jacket over half white t-shirt, green fingerless gloves, light blue denim jeans, red and white baseball cap with stylized green \"L\", green and white sneakers. Left hand glowing orange-red energy pressed to cracked ground, radiating white lightning bolts. Right hand extended forward holding glowing red Pokeball. Surrounding Pokémon: Pikachu crackling with electricity (left), Charizard soaring with blue wings against fiery sunset ruins (upper left), Blastoise with dynamic water splash (upper right), Venusaur with large pink flower (lower right). Background split: Fiery arid ruins with embers (left) vs lush tropical landscape under clear blue sky (right). Dramatic high-contrast lighting, vivid elemental effects, intense action-packed atmosphere, cinematic poster style.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769922788_722ce02c0f7c.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"EpicFantasyArt\",\"PokemonArt\",\"PokemonTrainer\",\"Pikachu\",\"Charizard\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-01 05:13:08', NULL, 0, 0),
(645, 'Fantasy on the Move: Velociraptor Ride Through Paradise', 27, 'A hyper-realistic cinematic moment where imagination meets reality — a fearless rider, a blue velociraptor, and a timeless tropical village captured in DSLR-level detail.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic cinematic fantasy scene of a young man riding a small blue velociraptor through a traditional tropical village. The man sits confidently on the dinosaur with a calm, focused expression, wearing an olive-green hoodie, dark blue jeans, brown leather boots, and a brown backpack. The velociraptor is hyper-detailed with realistic blue-gray scales, sharp claws, intelligent eyes, and a leather saddle and reins fitted naturally around its body. The village features wooden huts with thatched roofs on both sides of a dusty path, tall coconut palm trees in the background, and villagers standing on either side watching in curiosity. Goats and chickens roam freely on the ground, adding realism. Warm natural daylight, soft shadows, shallow depth of field, cinematic framing, realistic skin tones, ultra-detailed textures, fantasy-meets-reality atmosphere, photorealistic style, DSLR quality,\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1769928312_6c38138d0ff1.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"CinematicFantasy\",\"FantasyMeetsReality\",\"VelociraptorRide\",\"AIArtIndia\",\"HyperRealistic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-01 06:45:12', NULL, 0, 0),
(646, 'Ocean Breeze Confidence', 17, 'Ultra-HD cinematic portrait of a stylish young man enjoying a luxury yacht moment under golden sunlight and open sea vibes.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-HD / 8K photorealistic photograph of a handsome young man with sun-kissed skin and wind-tousled dark hair.\r\nScene: He is on the deck of a luxury white yacht in the open ocean, sunlight reflecting brightly on the water.\r\nOutfit: wearing a relaxed white linen shirt and beige shorts, barefoot\r\nPose: leaning casually on the yacht railing, looking out at the ocean behind him, wind blowing through his hair.\r\nLighting: bright natural daylight, cinematic depth of field, highly detailed textures.\r\nBottom left corner: A small, subtle circular seal logo with the text \"PicPose\".\r\nNegative prompt: deformed hands, distorted face, extra people, bad anatomy, blurry, watermark, oversized logo.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770008387_826fb44e8e03.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"LuxuryYacht\",\"OceanVibes\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"MensFashion\",\"WhiteLinenStyle\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-02 04:59:47', NULL, 0, 0),
(647, 'Urban Alpha Look', 17, 'A cinematic daylight portrait of a confident modern man — sharp denim style, bold attitude, and a powerful gaze straight into the camera. Clean, masculine, and effortlessly stylish.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A high-resolution cinematic portrait of a stylish young man with a well-groomed beard and thick, wavy black hair. He is wearing classic black wayfarer-style sunglasses and looking downward with a focused, brooding expression. His outfit features a light-wash blue denim jacket -blue denim jeans.\r\nHe is leaning casually against a sleek, modern silver car in a soft-focus urban environment. The lighting is bright, natural daylight, creating a clean, high-fashion aesthetic with a shallow depth of field that beautifully blurs the background. The mood is cool, masculine, and contemporary. 100% my face same, I need this prompt picture, man looking him camera,\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770008650_99ea4848032d.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"UrbanStyle\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"MensFashion\",\"DenimLook\",\"AlphaVibes\",\"ModernMan\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-02 05:04:10', NULL, 0, 1),
