(649, 'Golden Hour Royal Vibes', 17, 'Navi Blue elegance, luxury attitude aur sunset ke soft tones ke saath ek timeless photorealistic moment.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', '8k photorealistic full-body, young man Navi Blue Shalwar And Kameez,, white shoes. Black Rolex on right wrist, black Gucci sunglasses. Sitting on the bonnet of La Navi Blue Bugatti, plate hillside road at golden hour one foot stretched, one planted on bonnet arms spread, leaning on windshield; looking slightly right/down. Soft natural evening light, gentle reflections, hills/stone backdrop, shallow DOF, ultra detailed.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770009493_956ea9268dcd.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"GoldenHourVibes\",\"LuxuryStyle\",\"RoyalLook\",\"ShalwarKameezStyle\",\"DesiLuxury\",\"HighEndFashion\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-02 05:18:13', NULL, 0, 0),
