(651, 'Golden Grace in Black Elegance', 18, 'A hyper-realistic studio portrait capturing timeless South Asian beauty in a black & gold lehenga — rich textures, sparkling details, and a confident radiant smile.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Portrait of a young South Asian woman with fair skin, long wavy dark brown hair styled in loose curls with a partial braid, wearing a glamorous black and gold lehenga choli outfit: a sparkling gold sequined long-sleeved crop top with deep V-neckline and intricate border details, paired with a high-waisted black skirt featuring vertical gold fringes and embellishments, and a sheer black dupatta with gold trim draped over one arm. She has a gold choker necklace, large earrings, multiple bangles, a ring, red nail polish, smoky eye makeup, and a bright smile while standing in a three-quarter pose, holding the dupatta. Neutral beige studio background with soft warm lighting, realistic style, high detail on fabric textures, jewelry, and sequins. Don\'t change the face.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770010810_e067c73cc9b8.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"SouthAsianBeauty\",\"LehengaLook\",\"BlackAndGold\",\"EthnicElegance\",\"IndianFashion\",\"studioportrait\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-02 05:40:10', NULL, 0, 0),
(652, 'Golden Winter Laughter', 18, 'A magical cinematic moment where timeless joy meets vintage winter charm — laughter frozen in golden light.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A high-resolution, photorealistic cinematic shot captures a joyful woman , identical person from the added image, maintaining 99.99% similarity. The subject should have natural wrinkles, skin imperfections, and distinct crow\'s feet around the eyes, with unaltered facial features and the specific eye shape clearly visible.in her 40s, featuring natural wrinkles, skin imperfections, and visible crow\'s feet around her eyes, laughing as she tosses a handful of sparkling snow into the air. She is kneeling on a snow-covered platform at a vintage train station, wearing a beige quilted puffer coat, a thick knit scarf, matching mittens, and fur-lined winter boots. In her hand, she holds a tiny, intricate toy steam engine. Behind her, a massive, black vintage steam locomotive sits on the tracks, emitting soft plumes of white steam that blend into the bright, hazy winter sunlight. The background is filled with nostalgic details, including rustic lanterns sitting on the snow and wrapped brown paper parcels. The lighting is warm and golden, creating a glowing rim light around her blonde hair, which is styled in soft waves with a delicate braid detail. The atmosphere is magical and festive, capturing a perfect moment of winter wonder.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770010875_23c164eaaf27.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"WinterWonder\",\"GoldenHourMagic\",\"VintageVibes\",\"PhotorealisticArt\",\"RealBeauty\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-02 05:41:15', NULL, 1, 0),
(653, 'Purple Power in the Snow ❄️💜', 18, 'A cinematic winter-night selfie capturing confidence, elegance, and modern fashion — where glossy purple meets moonlit snow.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'The same person, the same face, unaltered features. An hyperrealistic image with sharp detail. A mid-shot portrait on a snowy night: a young woman stands against a backdrop of snow-covered pine forest, wearing a deep purple, lustrous quilted jacket with neat seams and a textured, polished plastic sheen. A purple hat, coated in snow, gives her head a serene, spherical shape. Her long, blonde hair flows over her shoulders, snaking through the jacket sleeves, some strands tinted with moonlight and delicately catching snowdrops at their tips. Professional makeup, full lips painted with glossy purple lipstick, and green eyes. In her left hand, she holds a modern phone with a gold metal frame, snapping a selfie that reflects her powerful presence, conveying confidence and commanding attention even amidst relative mystery. Her nails are softly painted a pale pink, and the pose is firmly in place. The angle reveals her shoulder and the front of her chest, framed roughly at shoulder level. The gaze is focused on the camera, giving the frame a sense of cool presence and modern neutrality, while the shadows of trees and the sound of snow on the ground behind it lend the image depth and refined tranquility. The night light is clear yet subdued, emanating from the sky and the nearby snow, with silvery reflections bouncing off the jacket\'s polished fabric and illuminating the hair. Purple dominates, with shades of deep blue and snowy white, highlighting the garment\'s sheen and the soft sheen of the hair it gives the scene a sense of elegant coolness and modernity simultaneously, without any visible text. Keywords: cinematic, photographic realism, 8k, snow, winter fashion, glossy purple jacket, purple hat, cold night selfie. Negative feedback: blurry, low quality, facial distortions, plastic appearance, high noise, blunt edges, excessive contrast, washed-out colors, unbalanced lighting, motion blur\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770011343_81bf82fc84c5.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"WinterFashion\",\"SnowyNight\",\"PurpleAesthetic\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"ColdNightVibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-02 05:49:03', NULL, 1, 1),
(654, 'Cafe Bloom Elegance', 18, 'Ultra-realistic street café portrait featuring floral fashion, teal accents, and timeless elegance — captured in natural light with photorealistic 8K detail.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultrarealistic portrait of a woman with long brown wavy hair, with some blonde highlights.\r\nOUTFIT:\r\ngrey floral blazer and shorts set paired with a teal blue crop top.\r\nDetails\r\nBlazer and Shorts: The matching two-piece set is light grey with a prominent pink and green rose floral print. The blazer is single-breasted with gold-toned buttons and the shorts are high-waisted.\r\nInner Wear: A ruched, strappy teal or turquoise blue crop top is worn underneath the open blazer.\r\nJEWELRY: gold layered necklaces, earrings, rings, bangle, watch\r\nSETTINGS:\r\nSeated in a street cafe. On top of the table, a cup of coffee, a black vase with some red roses with green foliage and tiny white flowers.\r\nNatural lightning.\r\nUltra detailed, Photorealistic,hyperrealistic, high quality, high resolution 8k. Half body shot.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770011940_536fd8ea2e45.png', NULL, '[\"CafePortrait\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"StreetCafeVibes\",\"FloralFashion\",\"TealStyle\",\"ModernElegance\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-02 05:59:00', NULL, 0, 0);
