(655, 'Timeless Elegance in Motion', 17, 'Luxury vibes meet confidence — a hyper-realistic portrait capturing style, success, and sophistication with roses and a supercar.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Hyper-realistic 8K hyper portrait of a man (same face, hairstyle, beard, and outfit, 100% match) holding a bouquet of red roses, white lilies, and blue hydrangeas, casually leaning on the rear of a dark blue Lamborghini car. He is checking his watch, wearing stylish rectangular shades, a dark blue suit, a black shirt, and matching formal shoes. The car features black alloy rims and red brake calipers. The man has a handsome look.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770020768_60083fcf952d.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"LuxuryPortrait\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"8KPortrait\",\"GentlemanStyle\",\"LuxuryLifestyle\",\"SupercarVibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-02 08:26:08', NULL, 0, 1),
(656, 'Urban Red Attitude | Duke Street King', 17, 'Cinematic street vibes with bold red style — power, confidence, and raw urban energy on two wheels. 🏍️🔥\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Cinematic, hyper-realistic full-body portrait of a stylish young man sitting on a KTM Duke 250 bike in the middle of an urban street. He is wearing a plain oversized red t-shirt, ripped grey jeans, and white sneakers. A black wristwatch is visible on his left wrist. A black helmet is placed on the bike\'s fuel tank. The background is softly blurred with buildings and trees, giving focus on the subject and bike. Natural daylight, sharp details, vibrant colors, ultra HD, 16k quality, realistic photography style.use reference face.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770024484_4ba84a1a6fdd.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"StreetStyleIndia\",\"UrbanVibes\",\"BikePhotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 6, 5, '2026-02-02 09:28:04', NULL, 5, 42),
(657, 'Emerald Grace | Fine Art Portrait', 18, 'Traditional elegance meets nature’s calm — a fine art moment captured in rich teal tones, timeless beauty, and serene depth.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Fine art photography capturing a young woman in a traditional green floral blouse and cream skirt seated on stone steps. She wears gold jewelry and her wavy dark hair cascades. A turquoise water body and lush greenery are in the background. The top-down perspective features rich deep teal tones, soft contrast, and saturation. Face should be same as reference photo.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770024947_ccbff8d620d3.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"FineArtPhotography\",\"TraditionalElegance\",\"IndianPortrait\",\"CulturalBeauty\",\"FineArtPortrait\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-02 09:35:47', NULL, 0, 1),
(658, 'Prehistoric World in Miniature', 23, 'Cinematic diorama art jahan lava-lit jungle, giant dinosaurs aur human creativity milkar ek epic prehistoric kahani rachti hai 🦖🌋\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Highly detailed cinematic diorama of a prehistoric world: a lush jungle filled with gigantic ferns, waterfalls, and volcanic cliffs glowing with lava cracks. Towering dinosaurs like T Rex, Triceratops, and long necked Brachiosaurus roam among the trees, while pterodactyls soar in the smoky sky above a distant erupting the workbench, a beautiful man and woman with the same hairstyle above are carefully placing miniature dinosaurs into the glowing jungle terrain, using tweezers with intense focus. The diorama is illuminated with warm golden sunlight mixed with fiery volcanic glow, creating an epic, adventurous atmosphere.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770025992_017c6dee435c.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"PrehistoricWorld\",\"DinosaurArt\",\"CinematicDiorama\",\"MiniatureArt\",\"EpicVisuals\",\"AIArtIndia\",\"CreativeDiorama\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-02 09:53:12', NULL, 0, 0),
