(660, 'Golden Hour Authority', 17, 'Ultra-realistic cinematic portrait of calm power — coastal luxury, commanding presence, and untamed confidence.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an ultra realistic photo with 8k sharp details, cinematic quality, natural light, soft focus of the man in the attached photo. Copy his face and hair 100%, do not change any of the facial feature.\r\nA man wearing a minimalist outfit consisting of a black long-sleeved button-up shirt (with sleeves slightly rolled), grey cargo pants, and clean white sneakers. He accessorizes with dark aviator sunglasses and a black wristwatch. Standing alongside him placed at the top of the hood of a large, black luxury SUV (Toyota Land Cruiser Prado), is a large, alert Rottweiler, which serves as a secondary subject. The dog is perched directly on the hood, which emphasizes a sense of ruggedness and dominance. A heavy metal chain leash connects the man to the dog.The man\'s pose is relaxed yet confident, leaning casually against the front of an SUV with one hand in his pocket and the other holding the dog\'s chain leash. His expression is stoic and \"cool,\" projecting an aura of composed authority. The setting is a coastal or tropical road. The presence of a palm tree and the turquoise water in the distance suggests a high-end coastal estate. The photo uses a vertical portrait orientation. The subjects are centered, creating a powerful \"power pose\" structure. The lines of the car lead the eye toward the man and the dog. Put a realistic watermark text of  Akmal Ansari at the bottom right. The lighting is warm and golden, characteristic of \"Golden Hour\". This creates soft highlights on his face and the car\'s hood while casting gentle shadows that define his physique and the dog\'s coat. The background features a shallow depth of field (bokeh effect). Negative Prompt: No oil painting. No drawings. No fantasy. No anime. No cartoon. No 3D render. No soft diffused illuminating skintone.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770095737_ffc17342c75b.png', NULL, '[\"GoldenHourPortrait\",\"PowerPose\",\"UltraRealisticPhoto\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"LuxuryLifestyle\",\"AlphaVibes\",\"CoastalAesthetic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-03 05:15:37', NULL, 0, 0),
