(677, 'Frostbound Guardian: The Crystal War', 17, 'A legendary blue-armored warrior stands fearless with his ancient dragon ally, wielding frozen energy amidst a storm-ravaged battlefield.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, cinematic full-body shot of a rugged male warrior in glowing blue crystalline armor, holding a jagged energy sword made of ice. He has a weathered face with light battle scars. Standing protectively behind him is a massive, prehistoric-style dragon with a long neck and shimmering, translucent opal-colored fins. The background is a battlefield filled with gray smoke, embers, and debris under a stormy sky. Lighting is dramatic and high contrast, emphasizing the bioluminescent blue glow of the suit and the creature\'s scales. 8k resolution, Unreal Engine 5 render style.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770182456_068b17610040.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"EpicFantasy\",\"DragonWarrior\",\"CrystalArmor\",\"IceSword\",\"CinematicArt\",\"UnrealEngine5\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-04 05:20:56', NULL, 0, 0),
(678, 'Midnight Majesty in Dubai', 17, 'Luxury. Power. Calm Confidence — where cinematic dreams meet Dubai nights.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an ultra-realistic, cinematic full-body portrait of a young man leaning casually against his Lamborghini Veneno Roadster, parked under the Burj Khalifa at night.\r\nThe car’s headlights and taillights are softly glowing, casting a warm reflection on the sleek pavement.\r\nThe city skyline and passing lights dance across the car’s polished surface, creating a luxurious, high-contrast look.\r\nThe man gazes thoughtfully into the distance, his posture confident yet calm.\r\nHe’s dressed in modern fashion — a fitted black jacket, white shirt, and dark trousers — styled with subtle sophistication.\r\nThe background captures Dubai’s essence: glass towers, rich neon highlights, and crisp reflections that shimmer under the night sky filled with sparkle and ambient haze.\r\nUse cinematic color grading, sharp focus, and realistic depth of field to emphasize a premium, lifestyle vibe.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770182696_14cb17346732.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"LuxuryLifestyle\",\"DubaiNights\",\"BurjKhalifaVibes\",\"LamborghiniVeneno\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"MidnightLuxury\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-04 05:24:56', NULL, 0, 0),
(679, 'Smoke Se Nikla Sher 🔥 | Power Walk Attitude', 27, 'White smoke ke beech se confident walk — natural daylight, sharp DSLR realism, saath mein Black Panther aur Angry Lion. Pure cinematic attitude, no plastic look, sirf raw power aur style. 🐆🦁📸\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Realistic DSLR photo of a stylish young man Fair skin from reference photo walking out from thick white smoke, Wearing white sleeve Shirt, gray ripped Baggy pants, one hokstick in one hand, sneakers,and rectangular black model sunglasses Attitude action mode, confident walk,sparks and smoke around, cinematic Sharp natural skin texture,real shadows, no plastic look. 4:5 ratio | Natural daylight | smoke entry 8K ultra realistic. Wear bracelet and A black panther and angry lion walking beside him.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770182938_6671349ad625.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"AttitudeShot\",\"PowerWalk\",\"AlphaVibes\",\"BlackPantherVibes\",\"LionEnergy\",\"SmokeEffect\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-04 05:28:58', NULL, 1, 2),
(680, 'Cherry Blossom Melody', 18, 'Pink cherry blossoms ke neeche ek sukoon bhari violin melody — natural beauty, soft light aur timeless elegance ka perfect portrait.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A realistic, high-quality portrait photograph of a charming young woman with long, brown hair, sitting on a stone ledge beneath a beautiful cherry blossom tree with vibrant pink flowers. She is looking gently at the camera with a sweet, serene smile, resting her chin on her hand. She is holding a classic wooden violin. She is wearing a pink-the-shoulder top with puffy sleeves, light blue jeans, and colorful sneakers. The background features the stunning blurred pink blossoms of the tree and a hint of an urban park setting. The image is shot with a DSLR camera to achieve a professional, soft-focus, and naturally lit portrait with beautiful, ethereal light. Maintain her exact facial features and gentle expression from the reference image, ensuring she has a high-quality, natural-looking makeup applied, featuring clear, dewy skin, subtle eyeliner, soft eyebrows, and a natural pink lip tint. Do not change her face.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770183367_98ec6813f6f6.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CherryBlossomVibes\",\"ViolinMood\",\"SerenePortrait\",\"AIPortrait\",\"DreamyAesthetic\",\"SoftLightPhotography\",\"NatureAndMusic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-04 05:36:07', NULL, 0, 0),
(681, 'Urban Vibes, Pixar Style', 33, 'A cheerful Pixar-style 3D caricature of a young man lost in his smartphone, strolling through a glowing city street at dusk — fun, friendly, and ultra-detailed ✨\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A full-body digital illustration, Pixar style, of a young man with Asian features walking down a city street at dusk. He has a large, cartoonish head and a bright, friendly smile. He is wearing a blue and white hooded jacket (a jersey or an official sports jacket), jeans, and sneakers, and he is looking down at a smartphone he holds in both hands. The background is a blurry, shallow depth of field street with cars and tall buildings, creating a bokeh effect. 3D render, hyper-detailed, caricature, large head, small body.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770184953_20fa0d90ae9b.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"PixarStyle\",\"3DCaricature\",\"DigitalIllustration\",\"UrbanVibes\",\"CityLife\",\"CartoonArt\",\"CharacterDesign\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-04 06:02:33', NULL, 0, 0),
(682, 'Good Morning with BOOM Style ☕✨', 33, 'Urban vibes ke saath ek cinematic morning moment — playful wink, mini heart gesture aur realistic city mood.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a candid, ultra-realistic, cinematic full-body image, 100% face copy, identical to the attached image of a tiny-bodied, big-headed teenage woman. Absolutely no cartoon face changes.\r\nShe has light brown makeup and dark brown hair styled in two messy braids with bangs.\r\nShe is wearing a bright orange tank top screen-printed with \'BOOM Style\' in colorful graffiti-style letters, loose-fitting black denim jeans with rips at both knees, casually cuffed at the ankles, and black sneakers. She is also wearing a cool matching silver necklace and bracelet.\r\nThere is a giant orange ceramic Thursday coffee cup with small white flowers and a tiny rabbit design on it. The cup has the words \"Good Morning\" and steam rising above it.\r\nA cute rabbit doll is placed next to the cup.\r\nShe is standing sideways, leaning against the cup, looking at the camera, giving a playful wink, and making a mini heart gesture with her hand towards the camera.\r\nThe background is a blurred urban city scene.\r\nThe image should be realistic like a photograph, with real lighting and real people; no drawings, cartoons, or anime.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770185856_79362b1f0903.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"BoomStyle\",\"GoodMorningVibes\",\"CinematicLook\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"UrbanAesthetic\",\"aiphotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-04 06:17:36', NULL, 0, 1),
(683, 'From Photo to Rockstar Stage Vibes 🔥', 27, 'Aapki normal photo ko ek powerful rockstar performance me badal dijiye — leather jacket, mic in hand, colorful stage lights aur cheering crowd ke saath.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Make this uploaded photo into a rockstar on stage.  \r\nHe is wearing a leather jacket and ripped jeans.  \r\nHe is holding a microphone while singing passionately.  \r\nThe background has colorful stage lights and cheering fans.  \r\nAwith minimum 100 pixels padding or margin from top and right.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770187854_5e8be2b465f5.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"RockstarLook\",\"StagePerformance\",\"AIPhotoEdit\",\"AIPortrait\",\"PhotoToRockstar\",\"MusicVibes\",\"CreativeAI\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-04 06:50:54', NULL, 0, 0),
(684, 'Snorlax Streetwear Fantasy ✨ | Where Comfort Meets High Fashion', 17, 'Pokémon-inspired oversized streetwear photoshoot with a cinematic editorial touch.\r\nRelaxed luxury, pastel tones, and hyper-realistic 8K fashion storytelling — only with PicPose.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your reference photo 📷 \r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Bright Full-body profesional editorial fashion photoshoot. A profesional Model (keep the exact same face and hair from reference photo) wearing oversized streetwear inspired by Pokémon theme — loose hoodie, oversized joggers, styled with chunky sneakers and smart watch. White glossy floor reflections inside cozy furnished living room, ultra-detailed fabric folds. High-fashion profesional photography with cinematic composition, soft pastel color grading, hyper realistic 8K detail.\r\n​Theme: SNORLAX\r\nBackground: Realistic 3D rendering (exactly as in the Pokémon anime, do not alter design). Pokémon is lying down, sleeping, with the model sitting relaxed against its round tummy, head turned toward the camera. Pokémon appears taller than the model but far bulkier, with a massive round body that makes the model look small and slim in comparison.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770193378_8b14e26bba61.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"SnorlaxTheme\",\"PokemonFashion\",\"StreetwearEditorial\",\"OversizedStyle\",\"HighFashionShoot\",\"CinematicPhotography\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-04 08:22:58', NULL, 0, 0),
(685, 'Inside the Crunch Universe 🥔✨', 17, 'Jab imagination milti hai realism se — ek surreal cinematic shot jahan aap khud ek giant potato chip bag ke andar ho.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, 8k, high-angle studio shot, looking directly down into a massive, oversized potato chip bag. The composition features a person of normal scale lying comfortably inside the giant, crinkled chip bag, which is overflowing with countless golden, wavy potato chips. The person, wearing a simple white t-shirt, has their uploaded face as reference, and is looking directly at the camera with a gentle smile, holding a single potato chip up in their right hand. The interior of the chip bag is a highly detailed, reflective silver foil, contrasting with the orange and blue exterior visible at the edges. Several loose potato chips are scattered on the light brown wooden floor in the foreground, just outside the bag\'s opening. The background is a clean, minimalist light beige wall. The scene utilizes soft, diffused cinematic lighting from above, creating subtle shadows and highlighting the highly detailed texture of the chips and the crinkled bag, emphasizing the surreal scale and forced perspective.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770201113_746d68fb99a0.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"AIPhotography\",\"SurrealArt\",\"ForcedPerspective\",\"CreativePhotography\",\"HyperRealistic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-04 10:31:53', NULL, 0, 0),
(686, 'Mistwalker of the Blue Dragon', 17, 'Where ancient power walks with silent fury.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A photorealistic, cinematic vertical shot of a stoic Asian warrior walking forward through a misty mountain gorge. The warrior has shoulder-length dark hair and is wearing intricate blue plate armor with a scale motif, layered under a dark, tattered leather trench coat. Behind him, a massive, majestic blue serpent-dragon coils through the mist, its scales shimmering and matching the warrior\'s armor. The dragon has a piercing blue eye and horn-like protrusions. The foreground is littered with jagged, translucent blue crystals protruding from the wet, rocky ground. Towering, moss-covered cliffs rise on both sides, disappearing into heavy white fog. The lighting is soft and diffuse with a cool blue and grey color palette. 8k resolution, movie still quality.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770201497_7c9511df0bbe.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"AICinematic\",\"AIArtIndia\",\"FantasyWarrior\",\"DragonArt\",\"CinematicAI\",\"MythicalVibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-04 10:38:17', NULL, 0, 0),
(687, 'Golden Hour Queen with the White Lion 🦁', 18, 'A hyper-realistic fantasy portrait where elegance meets raw power.\r\nSun-kissed beauty, majestic white lion, cinematic golden light — crafted with PicPose AI perfection.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a photo realistic-looking,\r\n​Hyper-detailed fantasy portrait, award-winning digital art, photorealistic quality. A stunning, fair-skinned woman with sun-kissed blonde hair, styled in a long side braid, poses intimately with a large, majestic white lion. The woman wears a textured, voluminous, cream-colored, off-the-shoulder knitted mini-dress. Her waist is adorned with an elaborate, metallic, winged corset-style belt with fringe details. The setting is a sun-drenched, rocky outdoor enclosure, shallow depth of field, golden hour lighting. Intricate textures, perfect composition, sharp focus, 8k.\r\nUse uploaded photo as reference face and body 100%.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770202258_ff6b7cf6de9b.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"FantasyPortrait\",\"WhiteLion\",\"CinematicArt\",\"GoldenHourMagic\",\"PhotorealisticArt\",\"HyperDetailed\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-04 10:50:58', NULL, 0, 0);
