(688, 'Cyber Sushi Mecha – Neon Night Guardian', 27, 'A surreal cyberpunk battle scene where futuristic tech meets Japanese sushi art — hyper-realistic, cinematic, and visually explosive. Created with PicPose AI.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, cinematic wide shot of a futuristic cyberpunk street at night. In the center, a man in a metallic silver techwear jacket and black cargo pants strikes a defensive martial arts pose. Standing directly behind him is a massive, menacing mecha robot constructed entirely out of oversized sushi components. The robot\'s limbs are made of thick salmon and tuna nigiri, its torso is a giant rice roll wrapped in nori, and it has glowing red circular eyes. Ikura  serves as glowing orange joints and accents. The background features towering skyscrapers with glowing blue and purple neon holographic advertisements. High-contrast lighting, volumetric fog on the ground, 8k resolution, surreal digital art style.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770204892_439bf686ca3a.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"CyberpunkArt\",\"FuturisticDesign\",\"AIArtIndia\",\"DigitalSurrealism\",\"MechaRobot\",\"CyberStreet\",\"NeonAesthetic\",\"AIImageGeneration\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-04 11:34:52', NULL, 0, 0),
(689, '✨ Calm Confidence | Modern Lifestyle Portrait', 18, 'A cinematic, ultra-realistic lifestyle portrait capturing effortless elegance — soft warm lighting, modern hotel dressing room vibes, and a confident, editorial fashion mood. Shot in vertical 9:16 with refined details and subtle PicPose branding.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A highly realistic lifestyle portrait of a young woman with features similar to the person in the reference image, leaning slightly forward with both hands resting on a dark wooden vanity table. she is facing the camera with a calm, confident expression and a subtle relaxed smile. \r\nlong straight wavy dark brown hair sharp jawline; smooth glass skin texture.blue eyes long lashes,taupe ombre nude gradiant lips,she is wearing an oversized beige and black color-blocked sweatshirt featuring bold abstract typography prints across the front, paired with black short pants. A black watch is on her left wrist. Background shows a modern hotel dressing room interior with a large rectangular mirror framed by warm LED strip lighting, creating a glowing outline behind him. \r\nSoft warm ambient lighting, cinematic warmth, editorial fashion photography style, shallow depth of field, sharp focus on subject, ultra-high realism, vertical composition, 9:16 aspect ratio.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770267422_8cb1bfcb0eae.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"LifestylePortrait\",\"EditorialPhotography\",\"FashionPortrait\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"ModernAesthetic\",\"HotelVibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-05 04:57:02', NULL, 0, 0),
(690, 'Epic Selfie with Clash of Clans Legends', 33, 'Jab real world aur gaming universe mil jaaye — cinematic 3D heroes ke saath ek next-level POV selfie 📸⚔️\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A high-quality, wide-angle POV selfie taken by a smiling Southeast Asian\r\nman in a black polo shirt. He is surrounded by 3D-rendered characters\r\nfrom Clash of Clans, including a muscular Barbarian swinging a sword, a\r\ngiant orange-bearded Giant, a hooded Wizard holding fire, and a sneaky\r\ngreen Goblin holding a sack of gold. The characters should look like\r\nhigh-fidelity 3D animations with cinematic lighting, appearing as if\r\nthey are physically in a brightly lit modern living room with him. The\r\ncomposition is crowded and energetic, with the man\'s arm extended toward\r\nthe camera to create a realistic selfie perspective.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770267822_dcb42a7e6a5b.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"ClashOfClans\",\"GamingSelfie\",\"POVSelfie\",\"AIGenerated\",\"3DCharacters\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"GameMeetsReality\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-05 05:03:42', NULL, 0, 1),
(691, 'Golden Mango Empress', 18, 'A surreal fantasy couture portrait where luxury meets nature — a regal vision draped in mango elegance, glowing under golden orchard light.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A stunning, elegant same woman standing in a lush mango orchard, wearing a luxurious gown made entirely of layered mango slices. The dress is intricately designed like scales, flowing to the ground in a regal silhouette. She holds a wicker basket filled with fresh mangos. She wears sparkling diamond jewelry, including a tiara, necklace, earrings, bracelets, and rings. Her hair is styled in a sophisticated updo, her makeup is flawless with red lips, and she smiles confidently. Warm golden sunlight filters through the mango trees, creating a dreamy, fairytale atmosphere. Ultra-detailed, hyper-realistic, cinematic lighting, vibrant colors, fantasy fashion photography, 8k resolution, highly polished digital art.\r\nOptional Style Tags (if needed):\r\nsurreal fashion\r\nfantasy couture\r\nluxury portrait\r\nphotorealistic\r\neditorial photography\r\nmagical realism.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770268660_0274607b034f.png', NULL, '[\"mangofashion\",\"fantasycouture\",\"surrealfashion\",\"luxuryportrait\",\"editorialphotography\",\"fruitcouture\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-05 05:17:40', NULL, 0, 0),
