(694, 'Miniature Magic on Wheels', 33, 'A hyper-realistic caricature keychain capturing personality, style, and motion in one tiny frame.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, 8k, highly detailed studio photograph captured with a 50mm prime lens at a wide aperture, showcasing a miniature caricature keychain held prominently in the foreground by a human hand. The composition is a close-up, slightly low-angle shot, with the keychain suspended in the upper center of the frame, creating a shallow depth of field that blurs the background into soft bokeh lights, suggesting an indoor retail environment. The keychain features a silver metal split ring, attached to a dark blue strap with a white geometric pattern and the text \"PicPose \" embossed in white. A short silver chain connects the strap to the main charm: a caricature figure with an oversized head and smaller body, riding a bright yellow vintage-style Vespa scooter. The character wears a yellow knit beanie, a yellow and black striped long-sleeve sweater, blue denim shorts, white socks, and vibrant green high-top sneakers with white laces and soles. The character\'s face uploaded 100% face as reference is rendered in a smiling expression eyebrows, using uploaded 100% face as reference. The miniature Vespa scooter is meticulously detailed with a brown seat, silver handlebars, mirrors, a glowing headlight, and realistic tires, all rendered with highly detailed texture and a glossy finish. Cinematic lighting illuminates the keychain with soft, even light, emphasizing reflections on the metal and plastic surfaces, while the human hand, with light skin tone, holds the ring between the thumb and forefinger, exhibiting subtle skin texture and natural shadows.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770270718_1140