(700, 'AI Trends: Run Before It Rewrites Reality', 17, 'A hyper-realistic disaster vision where technology, chaos, and survival collide.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A cinematic, hyper-realistic wide shot of a young man running desperately toward the camera along the center of the Golden Gate Bridge. The man has short dark hair and a beard, wearing a dark open jacket over a white t-shirt that clearly says \'AI TRENDS\' in black letters, paired with blue jeans. Behind him is a massive, surreal, tunnel-like tsunami wave curling over the bridge, destroying the red towers. The wave is filled with falling cars, debris, and sparks. The asphalt road in the foreground is cracked and scattered with rocks. The lighting is dramatic and moody, resembling a high-budget disaster movie poster.\r\n\r\nAdd a small Picpose Branding Logo at the left bottom with proper padding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770440420_f5c355b7ff25.png', NULL, '[\"AITrends\",\"AICinema\",\"FutureOfAI\",\"DisasterMovieStyle\",\"CinematicReels\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"AIVisuals\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-07 05:00:20', NULL, 0, 0),
(701, 'Mission Begins at Dawn', 17, 'One man. One mission. Zero hesitation.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a cinematic photo-realistic image of a confident man, with the same face as the uploaded image, entering a powerful helicopter on a windswept airstrip during morning hour He is wearing a desert-storm military camo uniform. On top of the uniform, he\'s wearing a full dark tactical armor vest with magazine pouches in front, tactical gloves, tactical elbow guard, tactical shoulder guard, tactical knee and shin guard, tactical boots, tactical belt, tactical holster, assault rifle sling at his back, aviator sunglasses with orange lens. One foot is firmly placed on the boarding ramp, while his right hand grips the edge of the hatch that reflects the bright blue sky with clouds, His eft hand touching earpiece in an alert stance, expression focused and charismatic, intense gaze at camera.. His expression is firm and fearless, as if he is an elite operative embarking on a high-risk mission.\r\nDust, sparks, and dry leaves swirl dramatically around him from the helicopter\'s engines, while cinematic lighting and subtle motion blur emphasize the sense of speed, power, and purpose in the scene. Dynamic blur from the spinning rotor blades. Vivid, vibrant, ultra detailed, WIDE SHOT 16:9 ratio.\r\nAdd PicPose seal/logo at the bottom-left corner for branding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770440684_9fed72b98af2.png', NULL, '[\"cinematicAI\",\"photorealisticAI\",\"eliteOperative\",\"tacticalVibes\",\"militaryAesthetic\",\"helicopterEntry\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-07 05:04:44', NULL, 0, 0),
(702, 'Last Watch on the Broken Flyover', 27, 'A lone survivor, a silent city, and a lion standing guard in a world left behind.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A lone survivor sitting at the edge of a destroyed flyover in a post-apocalyptic city. He wears a black shirt, black jeans, and yellow air jordan sneakers. A sniper rifle is slung across his back, the strap resting on his shoulder. He holds binoculars, scanning the distance for survivors. Beside him is a half-full bottle of milk. Behind him sits a big sleek Lion, alert and protective, acting as his guardian. Below the flyover lie abandoned, decaying cars overgrown with wild grass and weeds, showing years of neglect. The sky is gray and cloudy, with shafts of diffused sunlight piercing through the dust. The atmosphere feels tense, lonely, and cinematic — hyper-realistic lighting, 8K ultra detail, depth of field, volumetric fog, cinematic color grading, realistic textures, dramatic mood, post-apocalyptic realism, photographic composition.\r\nAdd PicPose seal/logo at the bottom-left corner for branding', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770440976_6073c02dbfe7.png', NULL, '[\"PostApocalyptic\",\"LoneSurvivor\",\"CinematicScene\",\"EndOfTheWorld\",\"GuardianLion\",\"SurvivalStory\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-07 05:09:36', NULL, 0, 0),
(703, 'Fan Moment with a Cartoon Legend', 33, 'Real-World Vibes meet Classic Toon Magic 🐰✨\r\nA life-like moment with Bugs Bunny on the sports court — fun, energetic & cinematic.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A realistic photo of me standing beside Bugs Bunny smiling and posing casually. The scene has a bright, fun, and energetic vibe, like a fan meet up. Bugs Bunny looks life-sized and 3D-realistic, keeping his classic cartoon charm but rendered with real-world lighting and texture. Background is a sports court, with subtle Looney Tunes details like hoops, toon rings, and colorful patterns. Photo-realistic lighting, natural skin tones, and cinematic composition.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770441626_4bf028199bb6.png', NULL, '[\"BugsBunny\",\"LooneyTunes\",\"FanMoment\",\"CartoonMeetsReality\",\"AIGenerated\",\"PhotoRealistic\",\"3drealism\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-07 05:20:26', NULL, 0, 0),
(704, 'Power Beyond the Throne', 27, 'A cinematic vision of dominance, loyalty, and rebirth.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an 8K ultra-realistic cinematic portrait of a 32-year-old Indian man seated on an imposing silver and gold skull throne in the middle of a vast desert. He wears a black tailored suit, black T-shirt, and dark sunglasses, exuding quiet dominance and modern royalty. His posture is confident and composed — hands resting firmly on the armrests, gaze forward, symbolizing power and control.\r\nOn each side of the throne stand two majestic guardians — a white tiger with icy blue eyes and a black wolf with golden eyes. Both animals are calm yet alert, radiating strength and loyalty. The background features the Great Pyramids of Giza, partially veiled by swirling sandstorms and golden dust trails that spiral around the throne, adding depth and cinematic motion.\r\nThe lighting is warm and dramatic, highlighting the metallic reflections of the throne, the smooth textures of the suit, and the sand particles dancing in the air. The composition captures a perfect balance between realism and fantasy, evoking the aura of a dethroned king reclaiming his power.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770445058_f76a203d21d4.png', NULL, '[\"CinematicPortrait\",\"AIArtIndia\",\"ModernKing\",\"DesertKing\",\"PowerAndRoyalty\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-07 06:17:38', NULL, 0, 0),
