(706, 'Skybound Rider: The Dragon Ascension', 17, 'A photo-realistic fantasy adventure where reality meets imagination — a fearless rider soaring through floating islands atop a radiant, iridescent dragon, captured in cinematic detail with a touch of PicPose magic.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a photo-realistic a man (photo provided)(keep & preserve face 100%), is seated atop a large, vibrant, multicolored, fantastical dragon-like creature. The dragon is a mix of teal, turquoise, and iridescent rainbow hues. It has large, clawed feet and a wide, open mouth. The man wears a blue hoodie, white t-shirt, and dark-colored pants. He\'s wearing shaded sunglasses and has a relaxed, smiling expression. Avatar man bluish-skinned, is also seated on the dragon, behind the man. The scene is set in a fantastical, floating island environment with waterfalls and lush, misty vegetation. The islands are light gray, and bluish-white, and hazy in the background. The dragon is flying with its wings spread wide. The perspective is from a slightly lowered angle, looking up at the creature. The lighting is soft and bright, emphasizing the vivid colors of the dragon and the scene. The composition centers on the man and dragon. The style is photorealistic, but the dragon and environment feel like a computer-generated movie or game. The scene evokes a sense of adventure and wonder.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal/logo at the bottom-left corner, with professional padding to ensure branding is visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770463225_3a798d2bb738.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"FantasyArt\",\"DragonRider\",\"CinematicFantasy\",\"AIPhotography\",\"PhotoRealisticAI\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-07 11:20:25', NULL, 0, 0),
(707, 'Strawberry Dreams 🍓✨', 17, 'Reality se pare ek whimsical fantasy — jahan imagination, vibrant colors aur cinematic 3D magic milkar ek dreamy moment create karte hain. Riding imagination, one strawberry at a time.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A surreal, high-quality 3D render of a smiling young man sitting on top of a giant ripe strawberry in the middle of a vast strawberry field. He is holding the strawberry’s green stem like a pole, riding it like a plant. He wears a black t-shirt, ripped gray jeans, and white sneakers. The strawberries around him are oversized and glossy, with vibrant red color and realistic texture. Bright daylight, clear blue sky, soft natural lighting, shallow depth of field, cinematic composition. Ultra-detailed, photorealistic, whimsical fantasy style, 8K resolution, sharp focus, vibrant colors.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770526294_a3b170be4eb5.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"StrawberryFantasy\",\"SurrealArt\",\"3DRender\",\"FantasyVibes\",\"WhimsicalWorld\",\"CreativeImagination\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-08 04:51:34', NULL, 0, 0),
(708, 'City in His Command', 17, 'A powerful realtor standing beside a glowing miniature Chicago — where ambition meets architecture in a cinematic, ultra-realistic frame.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Realtor man wearing a tailored midnight-blue suit with a crisp white shirt and black silk tie, standing beside a glowing miniature of Chicago. The model features illuminated skyscraper windows, glowing riverwalk lights, tiny lit bridges, and reflective water surfaces. Darkened luxury office background, balanced focus on both the man and the miniature, cinematic lighting, ultra-realistic, 8k.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770526945_dfda6f162944.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"LuxuryLifestyle\",\"RealtorLife\",\"BusinessAesthetic\",\"MiniatureCity\",\"ChicagoVibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-08 05:02:25', NULL, 0, 0),
(709, 'Candy Cane Glam Studio Portrait', 18, 'A hyper-real festive studio look with flawless natural beauty, candy-inspired elegance, and cinematic glam lighting — playful, polished, and picture-perfect.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Preserve my exact facial identity with perfect accuracy identical bone structure, symmetry, proportions, and all micro details unchanged. Maintain real fair skin tone, pores, texture, youthful glow, and natural facial contours with hyper real clarity.\r\nScene/Setting:\r\nA red-and-white candy cane themed studio with oversized candy props, glossy peppermint swirls, and bright festive lights.\r\nShe expresses: festive warmth and playful sweetness.\r\nHair: Sleek high ponytail with soft face-framing strands.\r\nMakeup: Red lip gloss, shimmering silver eyeshadow, no winged eyeliner.\r\nOutfit: Red velvet cropped blazer, white mini skirt, rhinestone heels. Nails: red + white stripes (candy cane), glossy.\r\nLighting: Bright cinematic glam.\r\nCamera: 85mm • f/3.2 • ISO 150 • 1/200s\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770527232_afaab8fa90a9.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"CandyCaneTheme\",\"FestiveGlam\",\"StudioPortrait\",\"HyperRealBeauty\",\"NaturalSkinDetails\",\"CinematicLighting\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-08 05:07:12', NULL, 0, 0),
(710, 'Seaside Coffee & Calm Smiles', 17, 'Blue ocean, mountain breeze aur ek relaxed café moment — natural daylight mein captured ek perfect candid coffee shot.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A realistic photo of a young man (facial detail 100% matches with the reference photo) sitting at an outdoor wooden table at a seaside café. The background shows a calm blue ocean, rocky shoreline, and large mountains clearly visible in the distance. On the left side, the café area has light wooden chairs, outdoor dining tables, small palm plants, and a bright resort-like atmosphere. A large cream-colored canopy stretches above him, casting soft shadows. The sky is bright blue with thin clouds.\r\nThe man sits relaxed, body angled slightly to the left of the frame. He wears a white t-shirt shirt with a gray sweater draped over his shoulders, a black smartwatch, a black baseball cap and dark sunglasses. His right hand lifts a white marble-patterned cup to chest height as if sipping coffee. He smiles when gazing to the camera. His left hand rests naturally on the table.\r\nOn the table are an empty ceramic-pattern plate with a spoon, a clear glass of water, a white smartphone, and natural daylight reflections.\r\nCamera angle is eye-level slightly from the left, giving a candid, natural composition. Lighting is bright daylight with warm, natural tones and detailed textures on the wooden table.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770527471_09f88c0006ef.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"SeasideCafe\",\"CoffeeWithAView\",\"OceanVibes\",\"CandidPortrait\",\"RelaxedMood\",\"TravelAesthetic\",\"CafeLifestyle\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-08 05:11:11', NULL, 0, 0),
(711, 'Shadow Ops: The Silent Strength', 18, 'Ek ultra-realistic cinematic action-glamour portrait — abandoned hallway mein khadi ek fearless woman, jahan roshni, shadows aur confidence ek powerful kahani sunate hain.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a candid ultra-realistic full-frame cinematic glamour portrait using the uploaded face 100% identical. Full-body portrait of a stunning young woman standing in a dimly lit abandoned building hallway; wavy shoulder-length brown hair, bright expressive eyes, and a determined direct gaze. She wears a tactical vest/plate carrier over a black tank top showing a slight midriff, paired with fitted dark gray/black jeans, black tactical gloves, and wrapped compression sleeves on both arms. She holds a black assault rifle (AR-15/AK tactical hybrid with stock + foregrip) across her chest in a ready-for-action pose. Background shows a long derelict industrial hallway with cracked dusty walls and concrete floors, tall dirty windows on the left casting dramatic side light, deep shadows, drifting dust particles. Cinematic contrast, soft dramatic lighting, premium skin detail, elegant shallow DOF, hyper-real HD DSLR action-glamour look.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770529343_d8aacfffd7a2.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"ActionGlamour\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"StrongWomen\",\"CinematicLighting\",\"MoodyShadows\",\"HyperRealHD\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-08 05:42:23', NULL, 0, 1),
(712, 'Legend vs Beast: The Ultimate Cinematic Battle', 27, 'An ultra-realistic 8K fantasy action moment — raw power, intense combat, and AAA movie-level visuals brought to life with cinematic lighting and epic detail.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an 8K photo-realistic cinematic action scene of [main character] battling a [creature].\r\nCharacter:\r\n[warrior/hero], [muscular/athletic], in a [dynamic action pose], delivering a powerful strike. Worn/torn clothing or armor, dirt, sweat, and motion for realism. Preserve identity if using a real face.\r\nCreature:\r\n[dragon/beast/monster], huge and detailed with [scales/skin texture], glowing [eyes], and an aggressive pose (open jaws, roar, or attack).\r\nLighting:\r\nDramatic [sunset/fiery/stormy] lighting with dust, smoke, embers, or haze for cinematic depth.\r\nEnvironment:\r\nRugged [battlefield/rocky canyon/ruins], scattered debris, warm or dramatic color palette.\r\nStyle:\r\nUltra-detailed, hyper-realistic, AAA fantasy film/game energy.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770529670_8840fb21c4d3.png', NULL, '[\"CinematicAction\",\"EpicBattle\",\"FantasyWarrior\",\"DragonFight\",\"PhotoRealistic\",\"8KRender\",\"UltraDetailed\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-08 05:47:50', NULL, 0, 1),
(713, 'Street Style Portrait with Attitude', 17, 'Black leather jacket, sunglasses aur BMW ke saath ek powerful street-side portrait — confident, masculine vibes with a premium lifestyle feel.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Use my image upload in Creata a portrait of a man (uploaded photo for 100.999% facial reference) sitting on the curb of a street.\r\nImage Description\r\nThe man uploaded photo is sitting casually on a stone curb, looking directly at the camera. He has sunglasses. He\'s wearing an entirely black outfit, giving him a stylish, edgy, and masculine look:\r\nOuterwear: A black leather motorcycle jacket with silver zippers and snaps.\r\nPants: Black, slim-fit jeans or trousers.\r\nFootwear: Black Vans Old Skool sneakers with white soles and white stripes.\r\nAccessories: He is holding a white Starbucks cup in his right hand and appears to be holding celfone in his left. He also has a watch or bracelet on his left wrist.\r\nThe background features a dark-colored BMW SUV parked directly behind him, which takes up a significant portion of the frame but is slightly out of focus. The setting appears to be a residential street with a paved road and some trees visible further down the street. The natural lighting suggests it is a bright, sunny day, creating a strong.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770529969_f33dffc656af.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"StreetStylePortrait\",\"MensPortrait\",\"UrbanVibes\",\"BlackOutfit\",\"LeatherJacketLook\",\"SunglassesStyle\",\"BMWLifestyle\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-08 05:52:49', NULL, 0, 2),
(714, 'Dubai Nights: Ultra-Luxury Cinematic Portrait', 17, 'Hyper-realistic 8K full-frame portrait of a confident gentleman with a futuristic Lykan Hypersport under Dubai’s iconic night skyline.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a hyper-realistic, full-frame 8K cinematic portrait using the uploaded face exactly 100% with zero changes.\r\nSubject: Male, standing confidently in front of a futuristic silver Lykan Hypersport, facing the camera. Wearing a navy blue 3-piece slim-fit suit, Onitsuka Tiger white sneakers with blue and red stripes, and a luxury watch. Expression: confident, stylish, and poised.\r\nFace Match: Use uploaded photo 100% (skin tone, features, hair texture)\r\nOutfit: Navy blue 3-piece suit, crisp white shirt, Onitsuka Tiger sneakers, luxury watch; preserve textures and details.\r\nEnvironment: Modern Dubai boulevard at night, Burj Khalifa towering among illuminated skyscrapers, warm city lights reflecting on car’s metallic surface, street glow, sleek and luxurious cinematic vibe.\r\nLighting: Night-time cinematic lighting, reflections on car and street, soft ambient glow, highlights on suit and sneakers.\r\nCamera Setup: Medium full-body composition, slight low angle to emphasize car and skyline, 8K ultra-realistic, sharp focus on subject with subtle bokeh on background lights.\r\nUltra-realism: Skin pores, fabric textures, hair, metallic car surfaces, city light reflections, HDR, micro-details.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770531514_5740a537cc23.png', NULL, '[\"CinematicPortrait\",\"UltraRealisticAI\",\"DubaiNightVibes\",\"LuxuryLifestyle\",\"LykanHypersport\",\"8KPortrait\",\"AIPhotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 1, 1, '2026-02-08 06:18:34', NULL, 0, 14),
(715, 'Beige Reverie – A Timeless Romantic Portrait', 18, 'Ek gehra, moody aur baroque-inspired portrait jahan soft beige tones, emotional gaze aur warm spotlight milkar ek high-fashion editorial feel create karte hain. \r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a highly dramatic, moody, and romantic portrait of a woman seated, dressed in a voluminous, off-the-shoulder ballgown made of ruffled tulle in a shimmering beige color. She holds a single beige rose delicately near her chest, with her eyes looking at the camera in a moment of emotional repose. She wears long, glittering chandelier earrings. The background is heavily stylized, featuring a dense cluster of tall, beige dried grasses or pampas grass, creating a warm, earthy texture. The lighting is rich, and intensely warm, with a spotlight effect on the subject, reminiscent of a baroque painting or high-end editorial shoot. Use the uploaded photo as reference.\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770531687_a25c7d6781c3.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"LuxuryLifestyle\",\"LykanHypersport\",\"8KPortrait\",\"AIPhotography\",\"HyperRealism\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-08 06:21:27', NULL, 0, 3),
(716, 'Dubai Nights: Ultra-Luxury Cinematic Portrait', 17, 'Hyper-realistic 8K full-frame portrait of a confident gentleman with a futuristic Lykan Hypersport under Dubai’s iconic night skyline.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, high-angle cinematic shot captures a rugged warrior riding a colossal white griffin soaring high above a Mediterranean-style coastline. The rider, identified by **uploaded face as reference**, is clad in detailed weathered leather armor with weapons strapped to his back, gripping reins as wind whips through his hair. The mythical beast features intricate white plumage, a sharp hooked beak, piercing amber eyes, and massive wings spread wide against the sky. Below, a vast expanse of deep blue ocean meets rocky cliffs and islands, rendered with photorealistic water textures and atmospheric depth. The lighting is bright and natural, emphasizing the texture of feathers and leather, 8k resolution, Octane Render, epic fantasy composition, dynamic aerial perspective.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770547738_30e6420ed11f.png', NULL, '[\"CinematicPortrait\",\"UltraRealisticAI\",\"DubaiNightVibes\",\"LuxuryLifestyle\",\"LykanHypersport\",\"8KPortrait\",\"AIPhotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-08 10:48:58', NULL, 0, 0),
(717, 'Above & Below – The Calm Observer', 18, 'A hyper-realistic cinematic moment where ocean serenity meets professional photography — one world above the surface, another beneath.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, 8k, cinematic wide-shot, split-level photograph capturing a serene ocean scene under bright, clear daylight. The composition is expertly balanced, showing both the expansive blue sky with subtle wispy clouds and the crystal clear underwater world simultaneously. Above the water, a person is seated calmly on a vibrant blue surfboard, holding a professional DSLR camera equipped with a large white telephoto lens, aiming towards the left. The person wears a straw hat, a light grey t-shirt, and khaki pants, with another camera body and lens hanging from a strap around their neck. Several seagulls are visible flying gracefully in the upper sky. Below the water\'s surface, the person\'s legs are clearly visible, with a surfboard leash attached to one ankle, extending towards the blue surfboard\'s three black fins. The water is transparent and a vivid blue, revealing volumetric light rays penetrating the surface and subtle bubbles, with the deep blue ocean floor fading into the distance. The lighting is natural and bright overhead daylight, emphasizing hyper-realistic, highly detailed textures on the water\'s surface, the surfboard, the camera equipment, and the underwater environment. The overall image conveys a sense of peaceful observation. The character\'s face is uploaded face as reference.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770548375_612bbd8f70c3.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"CinematicPhotography\",\"SplitLevelShot\",\"OceanPhotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-08 10:59:35', NULL, 0, 0),
(718, 'The Digital Throne of Destiny', 17, 'A hyper-realistic cinematic vision where modern power meets celestial loyalty — crowned by technology, guarded by angels.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, cinematic wide shot of a modern man with glasses and a beard sitting confidently on a dark, feathered throne. He is wearing a detailed bomber jacket with anime-style patches and holding a glowing blue and white digital device (Digivice). Surrounding him are four powerful celestial beings: behind him stand two towering, armored knight-angels in silver and teal-gold plate armor with massive wings; kneeling in front of him are two angelic figures, one male and one female, with blonde hair and silver helmets, bowing in reverence. The lighting is dramatic and moody, with high-fidelity textures on the feathers, polished metal, and fabric. The atmosphere is epic and ethereal, blending 3D fantasy art with realistic human features.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770548835_c344f5e66c57.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"DigitalThrone\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"HyperRealisticArt\",\"AIArtCreation\",\"Fantasy3DArt\",\"CelestialPower\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-08 11:07:15', NULL, 0, 1),
(719, 'Wrath of the Dragon Warrior', 27, 'A dark, cinematic Saiyan-inspired hero stands unbroken in the storm, as Shenron rises behind him and destiny ignites.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, cinematic live-action interpretation of a warrior inspired by Dragon Ball . In the center, a rugged man with dark, messy hair and a beard sits intensely on a rock in the pouring rain, wearing scuffed and battle-worn Saiyan-style armor with pointed pauldrons. Six glowing orange crystal dragon balls with red stars lie in the mud at his feet. Looming behind him is a colossal, serpentine green dragon (Shenron) with glowing yellow eyes and long whiskers, circling through a dark, stormy sky filled with lightning. The atmosphere is moody, dark, and epic, with high-contrast lighting and detailed water droplets splashing off the armor.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770549448_765a73fd4b3e.png', NULL, '[\"DragonBallInspired\",\"SaiyanWarrior\",\"Shenron\",\"EpicCinematic\",\"animeliveaction\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-08 11:17:28', NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `ai_posts` (`id`, `title`, `category_id`, `short_description`, `prompt_text`, `image_url1`, `image_url2`, `tags`, `external_id`, `status`, `moderation_flags`, `reviewed_by`, `reviewed_at`, `priority`, `is_popular`, `is_featured`, `tier`, `premium_unlock_cost_points`, `premium_pack`, `likes`, `favorites`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `copies`, `views`) VALUES
(720, 'Pit Wall Power | Where Speed Meets Vision', 32, 'A high-stakes Formula 1 night race moment — capturing adrenaline, technology, and passion through the lens, inside a futuristic Red Bull Racing command center. Powered by focus, precision, and PicPose.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A high-detail, cinematic photo of a cheerful young man with a beard and dark hair sitting in a futuristic Red Bull Racing pit wall command center. He is wearing a professional team polo and large Red Bull branded headsets, holding a high-end DSLR camera and pointing toward the camera with a smile. The desk in front of him is filled with multiple glowing monitors displaying live F1 race telemetry and track maps. On the desk sits a Red Bull energy drink can, a small F1 model car, and scattered LEGO bricks. The lighting is dramatic and colorful, capturing the high-stakes atmosphere of a Formula 1 night race. 8k resolution, photorealistic, vibrant colors.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770612166_88e255a604f4.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"Formula1\",\"F1NightRace\",\"RedBullRacing\",\"PitWall\",\"MotorsportPhotography\",\"CinematicShot\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-09 04:42:46', NULL, 0, 0),
(721, 'Eternal Valentine Glow', 18, 'A cinematic portrait of love, elegance, and timeless romance — wrapped in red, roses, and golden light.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A breathtakingly romantic Valentine\'s Day portrait based on the provided reference face. The woman has long, polished mahogany hair with wide, soft waves reflecting warm red and gold highlights, with a subtle red crystal hair accessory on one side. She wears romantic-glam makeup: luminous satin skin, rose and gold eyeshadow, and juicy cherry-red lips. She is dressed in a flowing, ethereal long red chiffon tiered dress that looks like it\'s floating. She stands in the center of a richly decorated room with translucent red curtains, heart garlands, warm hanging lights, and glowing candles. She holds an abundant bouquet of red and pink roses with baby\'s breath and a red gift box with a satin ribbon against her chest. Some petals are gently falling around her. Professional 8K cinematic lighting with red and gold bokeh. The background features a glowing \'Love\' sign. Shallow depth of field, sharp focus on her joyful expression. Canon EOS R5 style.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770613599_154638b1953c.png', NULL, '[\"ValentinesDay\",\"RomanticPortrait\",\"LoveInRed\",\"CinematicBeauty\",\"EtherealElegance\",\"ValentineVibes\",\"RoseAesthetic\",\"LuxuryPortrait\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-09 05:06:39', NULL, 0, 0),
