(724, 'Natural Light Portrait – Real Beauty, Real You', 18, 'Soft daylight, natural expression aur true-to-life details ke saath ek classy portrait — bina artificial effects, sirf real elegance.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Generate Image, 8K resolution, 9:16 aspect ratio. High-resolution daylight portrait based on the provided photo reference (preserve the real face, do not alter facial features). A smooth-skinned woman (keep face, eyes, nose, mouth and hair style same as photo keep my face 100% same as in the reference image) stands leaning casually against a smooth white wall. Gentle, dense sunlight from outdoors casts soft grating shadows across her face, creating a natural and artistic lighting effect.\r\nShe wears a tight black long-sleeved t-shirt, blue jeans, a black watch, small bracelets, necklace, earrings, and rings. Her long, hair is black with brown-gray tones, slightly messy with curtain bangs and visible roots covering parts of her face, giving a sweet and cute impression.\r\nHer makeup is natural, with lightly curled lashes and peach-colored lipstick for a fresh effect. She looks directly at the camera with a soft, smiling expression.\r\nThe shot is framed from head to thigh, captured with EOS full-frame realism—true-to-life color, clean contrast, and balanced highlights. Maintain natural texture and expression, with no artificial blur or enhancement.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770620371_951768b16f6c.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"NaturalPortrait\",\"DaylightPhotography\",\"RealFaceAI\",\"AIPhotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-09 06:59:31', NULL, 0, 0),
