(726, 'Reality Just Went Extinct', 27, 'When a city street turns into a dinosaur nightmare, survival becomes the only mission.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A cinematic high-action wide shot of a terrified man sprinting through a crowded metropolitan intersection, clutching a large, speckled dinosaur egg to his chest. In the background, a massive Tyrannosaurus Rex is bursting out of a realistic 3D digital billboard on a glass skyscraper, appearing to leap into the real world. Debris and glass shards fly through the air. Panicked office workers in business attire are running in all directions across a zebra-stripe crosswalk. The sky is overcast and moody, with sharp lighting and high-detail textures. \r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770628146_2604298453b5.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"CinematicShot\",\"HighActionScene\",\"DinosaurAttack\",\"TRex\",\"DigitalBillboard\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-09 09:09:06', NULL, 0, 0),
