(734, 'Creating Myself in Miniature', 18, 'Ek cinematic moment jahan artist aur artwork ek hi frame mein zinda ho jaate hain — har detail, har expression, bilkul real.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'An extremely realistic cinematic film still featuring the uploader (ref.face) intensely painting a custom figure of themselves at a desk, looking directly into the camera.\r\nThe figure is mounted on a clear acrylic base but is larger than the typical 1:2 scale(-Armita), making it prominent and almost half the height of the actual person.\r\nBoth the person and the figure are wearing the identical outfit in every detail.\r\nRealistic painting supplies, brushes, and hobby tools are scattered around the desk, creating a creative workshop atmosphere.\r\nThe figure must look exceptionally realistic, with lifelike skin tone, natural facial details, and a premium PVC texture.\r\nRealistic indoor background, cinematic studio lighting, and sharp details\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770700593_5ce83400adb9.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"CinematicArt\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"FilmStill\",\"ArtistLife\",\"CreativeProcess\",\"MiniatureArt\",\"SelfCreation\",\"FigurePainting\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-10 05:16:33', NULL, 0, 0),
