(736, 'Desert Dominion – The Eagle’s Hour', 17, 'Blue hour ke sannate me, ret aur toofan ke beech ek akela warrior — jahan power, freedom aur destiny takraate hain.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A breathtaking 8k wide angle cinematic shot depicts a dramatic scene in a vast, arid desert during the \"blue hour. The character, with uploaded face as reference, is leaning casually against the side of a dusty, vintage bronze Ford Bronco, holding a classic revolver pointed towards the ground. They are dressed in a rugged denim vest over a faded hoodie, ripped grey jeans, and worn leather boots. Perched dominantly on the roof of the vehicle is a giant, majestic golden eagle with a massive wingspan, its sharp eyes reflecting the faint moonlight. The car\'s circular headlights are on, casting long, sharp shadows and creating a powerful lens flare through a swirling dust storm. The atmosphere is hazy and mysterious, with a deep indigo sky and distant silhouettes of jagged rock formations. Every grain of sand and scratch on the car is rendered in hyper realistic detail.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770711246_8efe8ed65346.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"AICinematic\",\"BlueHour\",\"DesertVibes\",\"CinematicShot\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"8KRender\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-10 08:14:06', NULL, 0, 4),
(737, 'Urban Confidence in Motion ☕🛍️', 18, 'Mall escalator par ek cinematic moment — Starbucks coffee, NIKE hoodie aur warm bokeh lights ke saath ultra-realistic city vibe ✨\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic low-angle (3:4) half-body photo of the person in the reference on a mall escalator, holding a Starbucks coffee and Medium 30 L Laptop Backpack, Slightly Smiling Face. Few hair strands fall on his face. Grey colour hoodie \"NIKE\" logo, white cargo pants, is wearing clear-framed glasses, an apple watch. Background mall lights/people blurred with creamy bokeh. atural light, cinematic warm tones, ultra-detailed 8K. Keep her face, skin tone, hairstyle same as reference.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770713961_5c197f73be70.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"MallVibes\",\"UrbanStyle\",\"LowAngleShot\",\"creamybokeh\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-10 08:59:21', NULL, 0, 3),
(738, 'Reality Se Bahar Aata Shehar | When Billboards Come Alive', 21, 'Tokyo ke beech ek zinda 3D illusion — jahan screen aur real world ka fark hi khatam ho jaata hai. Ultra-realistic anamorphic art in cinematic perfection.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A surreal hyper-realistic cityscape scene set in a busy Japanese intersection during daylight. The central focus is a gigantic 3D anamorphic billboard integrated into the corner of a modern building. From this billboard, a massive, ultra-realistic human figure appears to emerge into the real world. The billboard displays a lifelike room interior with soft gray walls, ceiling spotlights, and sheer curtains, creating the illusion of depth and a real physical space.\r\nThe giant man( from the picture attached) leans forward from the billboard frame as if bending out of the screen, with his right arm stretching far outward into the street below. His expression is friendly and curious, with a natural smile. His skin texture is rendered in extremely high detail—pores, subtle highlights, soft shadows, and natural color variations. He wears a dark, fitted polo shirt with realistic fabric folds and natural shading.\r\nLighting is bright and natural, coming from the outdoor sun, casting sharp and accurate shadows on the building façade and on the figure’s extended hand. The fingers are large and expressive, reaching down toward the busy streets, with hyper-realistic proportions and subtle translucency at the fingertips.\r\nBelow, the intersection is filled with crowds of pedestrians crossing multiple crosswalks, buses, cars, and bicycles the hustle of Tokyo life. Every element is rendered in high clarity: store signs in Japanese, glass reflections from surrounding skyscrapers, streetlights, traffic flow, and subtle motion blur capturing the movement of people.\r\nThe overall composition highlights an eye-catching contrast between the massive-scale 3D illusion and the real environment. Emphasis on photorealistic lighting, urban ambiance, and crisp architectural details. Shot in 9:16 vertical orientation, 8K resolution, ultra-sharp, HDR, cinematic realism.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770715172_eff9f59063bc.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"AnamorphicArt\",\"3DBillboard\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"SurrealCity\",\"TokyoStreets\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-10 09:19:32', NULL, 0, 0),
(739, 'Shehar Ke Upar Udta Jazba', 17, 'Upar se nazar, neeche rangon se bhara shehar — hawaon me junoon aur haathon me aag jaisa confidence.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A man in a yellow jumpsuit and a beanie is falling or flying through a city street, holding red and white smoke flares. The perspective is from directly above him, looking down. The city buildings are colorful and vibrant, with cars and buses visible on the streets below. The man has a slight smile and his arms are outstretched. His sneakers are prominent in the foreground. The overall mood is dynamic and energetic.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770715802_2bd91e02a192.png', NULL, '[\"AIPrompt\",\"TopDownShot\",\"UrbanVibes\",\"FlyingMoment\",\"DynamicEnergy\",\"StreetFromAbove\",\"CreativePhotography\",\"CinematicMood\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-10 09:30:02', NULL, 0, 1),
(740, 'Against the Storm: Rise Beyond Fear', 27, 'A hyper-realistic cinematic moment of a determined climber battling nature’s fury, surrounded by raging eagles, violent winds, and a dramatic sky — capturing raw courage, motion, and intensity at the edge of survival.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a dynamic, highly realistic scene of a young man climbing a steep mountain. As he climbs, a large flock of angry eagles/hawks suddenly bursts into the sky, flying chaotically around him and aggressively attacking. Show powerful wings, sharp motion blur, and dramatic tension in the scene. The man looks shocked but determined while holding onto the rocky mountain. Add flying dust, wind effects, and a dramatic cloudy sky for a powerful atmosphere. Ensure the man’s face and hairstyle is 100%\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770719794_48b8017cb6cb.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"AIGeneratedArt\",\"CinematicScene\",\"EpicAdventure\",\"MountainClimber\",\"SurvivalMoment\",\"DramaticLighting\",\"ActionPhotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-10 10:36:34', NULL, 0, 2),
(741, 'Crocodile Skies: The Future Takes Flight', 18, 'An ultra-realistic cinematic vision of a crocodile-shaped helicopter soaring above golden mountains at sunset, with a human pilot seamlessly blended into a futuristic cockpit.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an ultra-realistic cinematic image of a futuristic crocodile-shaped helicopter flying high above lush green mountains during sunset. The helicopter has a transparent glass cockpit with detailed controls inside. Insert the uploaded person as the pilot seated inside the cockpit — matching the same pose, angle, expression style, and lighting as the original pilot. The person should wear modern aviation headphones, sunglasses (if possible), and neutral-colored pilot attire.\r\nThe crocodile helicopter body must look highly detailed with realistic scales, textures, and mechanical parts. Background should show a winding river and soft golden sky. Maintain hyper-realistic lighting, soft reflections on the cockpit glass, and natural shadows on the face of the uploaded person.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770720436_8f6a9dccf596.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"AIGeneratedArt\",\"CinematicAI\",\"FuturisticDesign\",\"SciFiAviation\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"AIVisuals\",\"ConceptArt\",\"FutureAircraft\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-10 10:47:16', NULL, 0, 1),
(742, 'Moonlit Serenity by the Sea', 18, 'A quiet, introspective coastal night portrait illuminated by soft moonlight, natural textures, and timeless elegance.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A highly realistic night portrait of a woman(upload image) sitting on rugged coastal rocks by the sea, illuminated softly by a large full moon.\r\nShe sits sideways with one knee bent, arms resting naturally over it, her gaze directed slightly upward to the right with a calm, reflective expression.\r\nShe wears a long-sleeved, high-neck evening dress made of opaque, slightly shimmering fabric, decorated with subtle fine beads and metallic threads in muted tones of silver and pale blue. The dress looks elegant, modest, and realistic—no fantasy elements, just soft sparkle reflecting moonlight.\r\nHer long wavy brown hair appears naturally tousled by the sea breeze.\r\nHer bare feet rest on the textured rocks, skin tones rendered naturally with gentle highlights from the moon.\r\nThe full moon appears large but realistic, with clear crater details and soft white-blue light.\r\nThe night sky is deep navy with a few small, natural-looking stars—not magical particles.\r\nThe sea below is calm with subtle ripples, reflecting faint moonlight in a natural way.\r\nThe rock formations are dark, rough, and realistic, with visible wet textures near the waterline.\r\nLighting is dominated by natural moonlight, creating soft shadows, realistic skin texture, and a cool nighttime mood.\r\nColor palette: cool blues, neutral tones, soft highlights.\r\nMood: quiet, serene, introspective, natural coastal night scene.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770723102_e69cefcf5719.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"MoonlitPortrait\",\"NightPhotography\",\"CoastalPortrait\",\"SereneMood\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"NaturalLighting\",\"RealisticPortrait\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-10 11:31:42', NULL, 0, 0),
(743, 'Golden Hour Elegance in Montmartre', 17, 'A photorealistic romantic portrait capturing timeless Parisian charm — where gentle moments, warm light, and graceful style come together.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Photorealistic medium close-up shot, handsome Indonesian man with athletic toned muscle build, rose gold and silver hair in a ponytail, a few loose strands of hair swept by the wind, small black ear stud, wearing a classic Parisian outfit (beige trench coat with a small embroidered \'Pame Dab\' patch on the lapel, black turtleneck, slim-fit trousers, leather ankle boots), holding bread crumbs in his palm with pigeons eagerly eating from his hand, some birds taking flight around him, gentle closed-lip smile, in front of the Sacré-Cœur Basilica, Montmartre, clear background showing the basilica architecture, sharp focus on face and background, morning golden hour, soft warm light, romantic and elegant atmosphere. Use my photo as the model.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770723514_490a063eaf10.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"AIPhotoEdit\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"ParisVibes\",\"MontmartreMoments\",\"GoldenHourMagic\",\"RomanticAesthetic\",\"PhotorealisticAI\",\"AIPhotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-10 11:38:34', NULL, 0, 1),
(744, 'Crimson Elegance – A River of Roses & Couture', 18, 'A breathtaking fashion portrait where burgundy tulle flows like a river across a room of deep red roses, illuminated by dramatic crimson neon light for a bold and luxurious visual story.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A stunning fashion portrait of a woman elegantly lying on a bed of deep red roses, enveloped in an enormous, flowing haute couture gown made of burgundy tulle that fills the entire room, cascading gracefully like a river of luxurious fabric. The lighting design is dramatic and moody, dominated by crimson neon light that casts deep shadows across the scene, enhancing the sense of depth and emotion.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770785440_c39ebb3f45eb.png', NULL, '[\"CrimsonElegance\",\"HauteCouture\",\"FashionPortrait\",\"LuxuryAesthetic\",\"BurgundyVibes\",\"RoseBed\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 7, 0, '2026-02-11 04:50:40', NULL, 0, 8),
(745, 'Limitless Power: Arrival of the Elite', 17, 'A cinematic blue-hour masterpiece capturing dominance, wealth, and unstoppable ambition — where luxury meets authority under the storm-lit sky.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, 8k, cinematic wide-shot captured during the blue hour, featuring an elite private airfield with dramatic, cinematic lighting. The composition centers on a sophisticated individual, uploaded face as reference, striding confidently down the illuminated stairs of a sleek, matte-black Gulfstream G650 private jet. The character is dressed in a bespoke, three-piece charcoal grey suit with a long black cashmere overcoat resting on their shoulders, wearing aviator sunglasses. In their right hand, they carry a leather briefcase slightly open to reveal overflowing stacks of US dollar bills, and in their left hand, a crystal glass of aged whiskey. Flanking the jet on the wet, rain slicked tarmac are two armored black Cadillac Escalade SUVs with headlights cutting through the mist. In the background, a massive hangar is visible with silhouette figures of security personnel. The ground is scattered with loose 100 dollar bills being blown by the wind. The image features incredibly detailed textures, from the rain droplets on the car paint to the metallic sheen of the jet, emphasizing dominance and limitless power.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770788669_612877a7cfcf.png', NULL, '[\"LimitlessPower\",\"EliteLifestyle\",\"CinematicVibes\",\"LuxuryJet\",\"PrivateAirfield\",\"BlueHourMagic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 1, 1, '2026-02-11 05:44:29', NULL, 0, 4),
(746, 'Golden Empire at Sea', 27, 'A hyper-realistic 8K cinematic vision of power, luxury, and dominance aboard a mega-yacht at sunset on the Amalfi Coast.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, 8k, cinematic wide-shot captured under a vibrant, fiery sunset, set on the teak deck of a 100-meter luxury mega-yacht sailing near the Amalfi Coast. The main character, uploaded face as reference, is lounging on a custom-made, gold-trimmed velvet throne chair, facing the camera with an air of absolute authority. They are wearing a pristine white unbuttoned silk shirt, white trousers, and luxury loafers, adorned with a heavy gold chain and a diamond-encrusted watch. On a marble table in front of them sits a bucket of ice with a magnum of champagne and a gold-plated desert eagle pistol resting on top of a mountain of cash bundles. In the background, a private helicopter is seen landing on the yacht’s helipad, while the deep blue ocean stretches to the horizon. The lighting is warm and volumetric, highlighting the sea spray and the golden reflections on the character skin and the stacks of money.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770789221_ca4092e6ea64.png', NULL, '[\"GoldenEmpire\",\"LuxuryLifestyle\",\"MegaYachtLife\",\"CinematicShot\",\"8KVisuals\",\"AmalfiCoast\",\"PowerAndWealth\",\"UltraLuxury\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-11 05:53:41', NULL, 0, 1),
(747, 'Golden Hour Billionaire Lifestyle | 8K Hyper-Realistic Island Cinematic Shot 🌅💎', 18, 'Luxury redefined — private island villa, infinity pool vibes, super-yacht views, and ultimate cinematic wealth aesthetic in ultra-realistic 8K. Experience tropical golden hour like never before with PicPose.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, 8k, cinematic wide-shot taken during a humid, tropical golden hour on the terrace of a private island cliffside villa overlooking turquoise waters. The main character, uploaded face as reference, is leaning casually against the railing of an infinity pool that blends into the ocean horizon. They are dressed in a designer linen shirt with rolled-up sleeves and expensive tailored shorts, wearing a Patek Philippe Nautilus watch. They hold a lit thick cigar and a glass of aged rum. Floating in the pool on a large teak tray is a feast of lobster, exotic fruits, and waterproof wrapped bricks of US currency. Below in the private bay, a white super-yacht is anchored alongside a docked seaplane. Lush jungle foliage surrounds the villa. The air is thick with humidity, visualized by soft volumetric light rays filtering through the palm tree.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770789988_d7c147601f8e.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"LuxuryLifestyle\",\"GoldenHourVibes\",\"CinematicShot\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"8KVisuals\",\"IslandVillas\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-11 06:06:28', NULL, 0, 2),
(748, 'Where Nature Lives Inside Her Mind | Surreal Double Exposure Art', 18, 'A dreamy double-exposure portrait blending a woman’s silhouette with pine forests and snow-capped mountains — where thoughts turn into landscapes and imagination breathes through nature.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Surreal double-exposure portrait of a young woman with olive skin and dark hair in side profile facing left, her head and neck transparently blending into a lush forest landscape, tall pine trees filling her brain area, a distant snow-capped mountain under clear blue sky with soft clouds, green branches and leaves sprouting from her chin and neck, loose hair strands, small pearl earring, contemplative expression with closed eyes, soft natural lighting, ethereal atmosphere, photorealistic digital art, high detail, 8k resolution.\r\n\r\nAdd a subtle “PicPose” seal / logo at the bottom-left corner, clean professional padding, visible but not distracting.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770792689_36e3554d78da.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"DoubleExposure\",\"SurrealArt\",\"DigitalArt\",\"Photorealistic\",\"NaturePortrait\",\"CreativePortrait\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 2, 0, '2026-02-11 06:51:29', NULL, 0, 2),
(749, 'Bugs Bunny’s Luxury Barber Experience – Ultra Realistic Looney Tunes Scene', 33, 'A hyper-realistic barbershop portrait featuring Bugs Bunny as the barber, surrounded by the iconic Looney Tunes gang in a warm, classic luxury setting — crafted with extreme detail and cinematic daylight ambiance.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Crea una imagen de calidad fotorrealista de mí sentado de frente en una silla de barbero. Bugs Bunny debe estar detrás de mí, actuando como mi barbero y sosteniendo una máquina de cortar pelo. Llevo una capa de barbero negra con el logo de \'Warner Bros. World en el pecho, tal como se ve en la imagen de referencia. Visto jeans azules.\r\nEl fondo debe ser el de una barbería clásica y lujosa, con un gran espejo en la pared trasera que refleje el interior. En el reflejo del espejo, quiero que aparezcan otros personajes de Looney Tunes, replicando la disposición de la imagen de referencia: el Tweety Bird debe estar en una jaula a la izquierda, leyendo un periódico, y otros personajes como El Pato Lucas, Porky Pig, El Demonio de Tazmania, Silvestre el gato y la demas pandilla, deben estar presentes en el fondo reflejado.\r\nLa iluminación debe ser brillante y natural, con una sensación de luz diurna que entra por grandes ventanas arqueadas, creando un ambiente cálido y acogedor, similar al de la imagen de referencia. La composición general y el estilo deben emular la imagen proporcionada, pero con un nivel de realismo extremo y con mi persona reemplazando al sujeto original, sin alterar mis características.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770871965_b131cd1b758e.png', NULL, '[\"BugsBunny\",\"LooneyTunes\",\"WarnerBrosWorld\",\"HyperRealisticArt\",\"AIArtCreation\",\"CinematicPortrait\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-12 04:52:45', NULL, 0, 1),
(750, 'Fearless Young Rider – Ocean Speed Adventure', 19, 'A movie-level realistic portrait of a confident young boy racing across the crystal-blue sea on a sleek white jet ski, water splashing around as sunlight reflects in his black sunglasses — pure energy, style, and fearless spirit captured in one powerful frame.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A person subject based on the reference image, keeping the exact same facial structure, hairstyle, and identity (99% identical to the reference, no alterations allowed).\r\n\r\nA tall, slender, and well-proportioned handsome 7-year-old boy with slight muscles. He has a handsome face, fair, smooth skin, and an elegant, youthful aura.\r\n\r\nCreate a movie-level realistic photo of boy.\r\n\r\nHe is driving a white silver jet ski at speed on the clear blue sea with splashes of water around. He wear white shirt with lemons and green leaves printed, while the buttons of the shirt is all off. His body is slighly muscled.\r\n\r\nConfident posture, both hand holding the handlebar tighly, while his face looks calm and confident. wear black sunglasses that reflect the sun.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770872311_b4579ed9f6c0.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"PicPoseAI\",\"AIPhotography\",\"AIPortrait\",\"CinematicShot\",\"OceanAdventure\",\"jetskilife\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 1, 1, '2026-02-12 04:58:31', NULL, 1, 3),
(751, 'Blooming From Within – A Surreal Rose Portrait', 18, 'A poetic visual masterpiece where serenity meets symbolism — emerging softly from the heart of a crimson rose. Created with cinematic depth and artistic elegance.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A surreal and poetic conceptual artwork depicting a person with the facial features of the provided image, dressed in deep red garments, sitting pensively nestled inside a giant, open rosebud. The figure’s posture is calm and introspective, with their head slightly bowed and hands resting gently on their knees, appearing to emerge from within the petals. Their loose, layered outfit flows naturally with soft fold, matching the rich red tones of the rose surrounding them.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770890322_c4011c31f13d.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"SurrealArt\",\"ConceptualPortrait\",\"AIPortrait\",\"CreativeVisuals\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-12 09:58:42', NULL, 0, 0);
