(752, 'Sunset Elegance in Royal Purple ✨', 18, 'A luxurious fashion moment captured at dusk — flowing purple couture, crystal heels, and timeless beauty set against a dramatic villa staircase. Pure elegance, untouched and unforgettable.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Using my photo without making changes to my face creates a fashion and lifestyle photograph that captures a woman posing elegantly in a luxurious and dramatic outdoor environment, likely at sunset or dusk.\r\nModel and dressing room: The protagonist is a tall woman with long darkbrown and slightly wavy strands. She wears a spectacular purple long dress. The dress has long sleeves, a pronounced V-neckline and strategic contours along the and waist, showing lots of skin. The fabric appears to be lightweight, sheer gauze or tulle that falls into a fluid skirt with high openings.\r\nAccessories: Share your outfit with a small, bright black structured handbag and purple high-heeled sandals adorned with what appear to be crystals or stones.Scenario: The woman is slightly recharged on the outdoor white stone staircase, which appears to be part of a luxury villa or resort built into a cliff or rocky slope. There are lighting elements.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770890775_0b108f35a244.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"LuxuryFashion\",\"SunsetVibes\",\"ElegantStyle\",\"FashionPhotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-02-12 10:06:15', NULL, 0, 0),
(753, 'Tiny Money Boss – Ultra Realistic Miniature Vibes 💰✨', 19, 'A super cute, ultra-realistic miniature Asian man sitting on a modern ATM machine, hugging oversized currency bundles with a happy expression. Sharp focus, warm tones, and cinematic realism — finished with an elegant PicPose touch.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra realistic photo of a very realistic and cute little figure of a asian man, wearing a navy blue polo shirt, khaki cargo pants, nike sneakers. This little creature is very sharp while the background in an ATM room, adds a cute and warm impression. He is seen sitting right on the modern ATM machine with a pile of money beside her and hugging a pile of 1,000 currency which are very contrastingly larger than him. A cute happy expression facing the camera.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1770891694_e0a35c3203d2.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"MiniatureArt\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"AIPortrait\",\"CreativeReels\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 3, 0, '2026-02-12 10:21:34', NULL, 0, 6),
(754, 'Frozen Heights, Unshaken Confidence ❄️🏔️', 17, 'A cinematic mountain portrait capturing bold confidence and raw authenticity — every facial detail preserved with absolute precision, set against a breathtaking snow-covered highland view.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A cinematic outdoor portrait of a young man (26 years old, height 172 cm, weight 64 kg, athletic and well-proportioned build) sitting confidently on a snow-covered rock at a high mountain viewpoint. Use 100% the exact face, facial features, skin tone, beard shape, hairline, and hairstyle from the attached photo with absolute precision no changes, no enhancement, no stylization of facial structure.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771044400_3bb1af3e646d.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"MountainVibes\",\"AIPortrait\",\"ConfidenceLook\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 1, 1, '2026-02-14 04:46:40', NULL, 0, 1),
(755, 'Golden Hour Alpha – Cinematic Desert Portrait', 17, 'A hyper-realistic 8K side-profile shot capturing raw confidence, luxury vibes, and bold fashion energy under warm golden sunlight.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic, hyper-detailed, 8K cinematic portrait of a young, handsome man (26 years old, 172 cm, 64 kg, athletic build, face and hair 100% from uploaded photo) with black hair and black beard. He is wearing aviator sunglasses, a white crew-neck T-shirt under an open black leather jacket, black leather gloves, with hands in pockets. He stands confidently in a desert-like rocky landscape at golden hour, with a luxury black sports car blurred in the background. Side profile view, cinematic lighting with warm sunlight highlighting his muscular build, defined shoulders, sharp jawline, and natural skin texture. His posture is relaxed yet powerful, exuding a stylish and moody high-fashion vibe. Photorealistic, ultra-detailed textures on skin, hair, beard, leather, and environment. Shallow depth of field, cinematic color grading, realistic shadows and highlights, 8K resolution, emphasizing realism, clarity, and strong visual impact. \r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771044690_e6622f7ea100.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"LuxuryVibes\",\"GoldenHourMagic\",\"AIPhotography\",\"HighFashionLook\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-14 04:51:30', NULL, 0, 0),
(756, 'Magic Selfie in the Enchanted Great Hall ✨📚', 17, 'A cinematic POV selfie of a smiling young South Asian man inside a magical Gothic library, surrounded by legendary wizards, floating candles, glowing wands, and a majestic snowy owl — captured in stunning 8K realism.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A high-quality, cinematic POV selfie taken by a smiling young Indian man with a beard, wearing a casual blue button-down shirt. He is standing in the middle of a magical, Gothic style Great Hall library with floating candles and towering bookshelves. Surrounding him are iconic magical characters: Harry Potter with his round glasses and wand, a tall wizard resembling Dumbledore with a long white beard holding a wooden staff, and two identical twin wizards in school robes. A large white snowy owl with spread wings is perched just behind the man\'s head. The lighting is warm and magical, with glowing sparks coming from the wands. Photorealistic, 8k resolution, wide-angle lens style.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771045354_9837afbb2a41.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"MagicSelfie\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"AIPhotography\",\"FantasyVibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-14 05:02:34', NULL, 0, 0),
(757, 'Eternal Love in Roselight ✨🌹', 23, 'A romantic eye-level portrait of a couple surrounded by glowing candles, heart-shaped rose petals, and soft pink fairy lights — capturing pure affection in a dreamy, photorealistic 8K setting.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Eye-level medium shot of a romantic couple seated on a plush rug, utilizing uploaded face as reference for both subjects, gazing affectionately while holding a bouquet of red roses. The man wears a grey knit sweater, the woman a long-sleeved beige dress. The scene is framed by a heart-shaped arrangement of deep red rose petals on the floor, interspersed with glowing white pillar candles in glass cylinders. The background features cascading pink chiffon drapery illuminated by vertical warm fairy lights, adorned with a red foil script \"Love\" balloon. Additional props include red heart-shaped helium balloons on the right and wooden \"Love\" signage on the left. Lighting is soft, warm, and volumetric with a pink ambient hue, high-fidelity textures, 8k resolution, photorealistic rendering.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771046015_d8ef837cdcb3.png', NULL, '[\"Add a small\",\"elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner\",\"aligned and padded perfectly for a professional\",\"clean finish\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-14 05:13:35', NULL, 0, 0),
(758, 'King of Roses – Power Meets High Fashion 🔥🌹', 17, 'A bold red statement suit, dramatic spotlight, and a throne made of stacked chairs — this ultra-realistic editorial look defines confidence, luxury, and avant-garde style. Created with PicPose AI.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A confident stylish man sitting like a king on stacked grey plastic chairs, wearing a bold red textured suit with deep V neckline, black sunglasses, gold wristwatch, surrounded by multiple red roses arranged dramatically, dark grey studio background, cinematic spotlight lighting from above, strong shadows on the floor, high fashion editorial photography, avant-garde conceptual art, luxury campaign style, powerful pose, dramatic composition, ultra realistic, sharp details, 8k resolution.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771049942_a9611bc0b9fb.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"HighFashion\",\"LuxuryVibes\",\"EditorialStyle\",\"AIPortraitChallenge\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-14 06:19:02', NULL, 0, 0),
(759, 'Born to Rule – A Cinematic Vision of Modern Royalty', 19, 'Where confidence meets the throne and a white lion stands guard. Power, luxury, and legacy captured in ultra-realistic 8K detail.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic cinematic luxury portrait of a stylish young boy seated confidently on an ornate royal white throne chair with intricate carved details and lion-head armrests. He wears an elegant monochrome white outfit textured white sweatshirt, matching jogger pants, and clean white sneakers paired with black sunglasses for a modern fashionable look. Relaxed confident pose with one leg crossed over the other, one hand resting on the armrest and the other lightly touching the sunglasses. Behind the throne stands a majestic white lion with thick ivory mane, calm regal expression, pale eyes, positioned protectively and symmetrically to create a powerful royal composition. Neutral studio background with soft gradient grey tones, controlled professional lighting producing gentle shadows, crisp skin texture, highly detailed fabric folds, ultra-sharp lion fur rendering. Shallow depth of field, editorial fashion photography style, HDR clarity, cinematic color grading, clean luxury aesthetic, ultra-high detail, 8K resolution, vertical composition, studio quality, photorealistic finish.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771062332_bcb1f1521858.png', NULL, '[\"BornToRule\",\"ModernRoyalty\",\"KingEnergy\",\"LuxuryPortrait\",\"CinematicArt\",\"WhiteLion\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 1, 1, '2026-02-14 09:45:32', NULL, 1, 2),
(760, 'Intense Elegance in Red', 18, 'A masterful portrait capturing the perfect blend of poise, power, and timeless beauty — where every detail, from the crimson corset to the piercing gaze, tells a story.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic portrait photography of a young woman. Use the face from image exactly as it is; do not change the facial structure or beauty\r\nFrame: Sitting eye-level portrait\r\nLocation: Dark red velvet lounge\r\nPose: Sitting on leather chair, elbow on armrest, fingers near chin — intense stare\r\nOutfit: Deep red corset blouse, gold waist chain\r\nMakeup: Classic red lips, bold eyeliner glow\r\nCamera: Sony A7R V • 50mm\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771065767_a4e3cdb04d8d.png', NULL, '[\"UltraRealisticPortrait\",\"PicPoseStudio\",\"RedElegance\",\"PhotographyLovers\",\"PortraitPerfection\",\"sonya7rv\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-14 10:42:47', NULL, 0, 0),
(761, 'Midnight Supercar Dynasty', 27, 'A cinematic 8K urban masterpiece capturing power, luxury, and street dominance under the glowing city lights — where speed meets style in a bold metropolitan night scene.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A cinematic, wide angle street photography shot at night in a bustling metropolitan city like New York. In the foreground, a man in a black racing jacket sits on the hood of a vibrant yellow Lamborghini, and a woman in a black leather jacket and hijab leans against a sleek black Bugatti Chiron. They are parked in the middle of a multi-lane city street lined with towering skyscrapers and glowing streetlights. Behind them, a long convoy of colorful supercars (bright blues, greens, and oranges) stretches into the distance. The atmosphere is filled with a light city haze and steam rising from the ground. Moody, high-contrast lighting with deep blues in the sky and sharp highlights on the car paint. Hyper-realistic, 8k resolution, urban car culture aesthetic.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771133653_9579ff0a16ab.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"SupercarLifestyle\",\"UrbanNights\",\"LuxuryCars\",\"cinematicphotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-15 05:34:13', NULL, 0, 0),
(762, 'Edge of the Neon Abyss 🌃', 27, 'A fearless soul perched above a glowing cyberpunk metropolis, where city lights curve into infinity and the night feels limitless.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A high-angle, wide-angle fisheye lens photograph of a young man with curly hair and a beard sitting on the extreme edge of a skyscraper at night. He is wearing a black leather biker jacket, a white t-shirt, grey trousers, and black Chelsea boots. Below him, a sprawling, glowing cyberpunk-style metropolis (like Seoul or Tokyo) stretches to the horizon with vibrant streaks of long-exposure traffic lights and neon building signs. The horizon has a slight spherical curvature. The mood is cinematic, daring, and moody, with high contrast and sharp urban details.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771133921_b7b8e2f9119f.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"CyberpunkVibes\",\"UrbanCinematic\",\"NeonCity\",\"moodyphotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-15 05:38:41', NULL, 0, 0),
(763, 'Legendary Fire Pokémon Master – Cinematic 8K Power', 17, 'An ultra-realistic Unreal Engine 5 cinematic scene featuring a dominant fire-type master standing on volcanic terrain, summoning flames while a massive Dragonite rises behind him under a dramatic sky.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic cinematic full body shot, Unreal Engine 5 render, 8K resolution, extreme detail, hyper-real textures, volumetric lighting, ray tracing, global illumination, HDR, physically accurate materials, AAA game cinematic quality.\r\nA powerful fire-type Pokémon master standing on cracked volcanic terrain with glowing lava veins beneath his boots. Low angle camera for dominance and heroic scale. Epic dramatic sky with dynamic clouds, subtle sunlight breaking through smoke.\r\nBehind him stands a massive Dragonite on a higher rock formation, wings fully expanded, realistic scale texture with subsurface scattering, subtle fire aura glowing around horns and wing edges, floating embers drifting through the air, cinematic depth of field.\r\nThe character has the exact facial features from the reference image: short curly dark hair with clean fade on the sides, thick sharp eyebrows, brown eyes, light stubble beard, defined jawline, confident intense expression. Realistic skin texture with visible pores, natural light interaction, micro facial detail, sharp focus.\r\nHe wears a premium fire-sorcerer outfit: long flowing coat in deep black and crimson, high structured collar, molten glowing patterns along seams, fire-infused metallic chest and shoulder armor, circular flaming sigil on chest emitting orange-gold light, detailed leather belts and metal elements, physically accurate shaders and fabric simulation.\r\nFull body visible from boots to head. Heavy black combat boots firmly grounded on volcanic rock. One hand conjuring a realistic fire sphere with dynamic flames, sparks, heat distortion and light bloom. Other hand surrounded by swirling ember particles like an elemental invoker mage. Subtle wind moving coat fabric.\r\nStrong cinematic contrast between warm fire glow and cool blue atmospheric light. Sharp focus, dramatic shadows, realistic fire physics, embers, smoke particles, atmospheric depth.\r\nUltra detailed, photorealistic, epic composition, powerful presence, legendary fire Pokémon master.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771134600_bca5f83e9b8b.png', NULL, '[\"FirePokemonMaster\",\"DragonitePower\",\"CinematicRender\",\"UnrealEngine5\",\"EpicFantasy\",\"picposeai\"]', NULL, 'published', '[{\"type\": \"seed_cleanup_auto\", \"severity\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"brand_or_minor_keyword_match\"}]', 'policy_migration', '2026-02-15 11:02:21', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-15 05:50:00', NULL, 0, 0),
(764, 'Chibi Goku Power Burst ⚡', 33, 'Ultra-realistic 3D chibi avatar in Goku costume unleashing a powerful Kamehameha in stunning 8K detail.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an image of me using the attached image for identical facial features. The image I want must be a 3D chibi cartoon with a larger head and a smaller body. I am dressed in a \"Goku\" costume, standing and doing a \"Kamehameha\" on a giant hand. Everything has to be ultra-realistic in 8K ultra HD quality.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771134940_0a7fdf5089e4.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"ChibiArt\",\"GokuStyle\",\"Kamehameha\",\"3DCartoon\",\"UltraHD\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-15 05:55:40', NULL, 0, 0),
(765, 'Forest Calm Vibes 🌿', 17, 'A warm outdoor portrait capturing effortless style and peaceful moments in nature’s soft daylight.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A warm, casual outdoor portrait of a young man sitting on a large, fallen tree log in a green, grassy field. He is wearing a light beige or cream ribbed knit sweater over a white crew neck t-shirt, paired with dark brown pants and matching sneakers. He has a large white-faced watch with a green strap.looking the side. The background is a gently sloping hillside covered in a dense, lush green forest. The lighting is soft and natural daylight.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771135445_b2ee5d5df429.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"OutdoorPortrait\",\"NaturalLight\",\"MensStyle\",\"ForestVibes\",\"aestheticshots\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 1, 1, '2026-02-15 06:04:05', NULL, 0, 2),
(766, '8K Valentine Studio Magic 💖 | Created with PicPose AI', 23, 'Turn your love story into a cinematic 8K Valentine masterpiece. Floating heart balloons, neon glow, mirrored floors, and a joyful couple framed in a stunning low-angle Nikon Z9 style capture — all designed with PicPose AI. Create, shine, and make your moments unforgettable.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Based on the follower’s uploaded image, construct a modern Valentine studio scene featuring floating red and white heart balloons, a mirrored flooring, neon heart accents glowing softly, scattered confetti, and dynamic party textures that suggest motion without blur,and a mirror with back light behimlnd them while keeping the subject sharply rendered. Simulate a Nikon Z9 capture at 8K cinematic resolution, framed in a low-angle close up full body shot that adds depth and energy while maintaining clear perspective lines. Lighting should rely on evenly distributed soft LED panels, carefully positioned to avoid mirror reflections while preserving vibrant colors and clean highlights across surfaces. They sitting in a white fur large heart pillow she wearing white floral midi dress and sandals white men wear polo white with white cargo pants and sneakers girl hair long and wavy blavlck men same hairstyle above girl hands are shaping heart same with the men. Optional ideas: modern casual outfits, playful movement, confident joyful mood. Finish with string heart lights placed around the mirrored floor edges.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771138491_0a248c1d8261.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"ValentineVibes\",\"AIPortrait\",\"8KCinematic\",\"couplegoals\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-15 06:54:51', NULL, 0, 1),
(767, 'Unleash the Fire Within – Epic Sorcerer Awakens 🐉🔥', 17, 'A hyper-realistic 8K fantasy scene where a powerful mage commands blazing fireballs while a majestic golden dragon rises behind him under a dramatic sunset sky. Created with PicPose AI.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A cinematic, full body shot of a powerful sorcerer with dark curly hair and a short beard, wearing an intricate orange and black leather mage’s robe with a high collar and a glowing circular emblem on his chest. He is standing on a jagged volcanic rock, conjuring intense fireballs in both hands. Behind him stands a massive, benevolent golden dragon with wide wings and glowing embers on its skin. The background features a dramatic, cloudy sunset sky. The entire scene is filled with floating embers, sparks, and warm, fiery lighting. Hyper realistic, 8k resolution, epic fantasy style.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771153716_949d072ee599.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"EpicFantasy\",\"AIPowered\",\"DragonVibes\",\"CinematicReels\",\"8KVisuals\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, 'akmalcbm@gmail.com', '2026-02-15 12:41:01', 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-15 11:08:36', NULL, 0, 0),
(768, 'Sunset Rebel – Cinematic Power Portrait', 17, 'A hyper-realistic 8K low-angle shot capturing fearless attitude, tactical style, and fiery tropical energy in one bold frame.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, 8k, cinematic portrait shot, captured with a 35mm lens at a slightly low-angle, featuring a muscular male character in a dynamic medium close-up. The character, with uploaded face as reference, sports a short fade haircut and a well-trimmed beard, looking intently to the right of the frame. He is leaning casually against the weathered, rusty red-orange front of a vehicle, with his right leg bent and his right hand holding a silver pistol. He wears an unbuttoned, vibrant yellow-orange striped jacket with red trim and various patches, over a distressed dark grey t-shirt with a faded graphic print. A black tactical harness with a grenade labeled \"CASTILLO\" is strapped across his chest. His arms are adorned with intricate tattoos, and his right wrist features multiple colorful beaded bracelets. He wears dark, ripped jeans with a large knife in a sheath strapped to his left thigh, and red-maroon boots with black protective plating and a distinctive red knee pad with a yellow \'X\' on his right knee. The background features a stylized, vibrant tropical sunset or sunrise, with dark silhouettes of palm trees against a gradient sky transitioning from teal-blue at the top to fiery red-orange at the bottom, creating a dramatic and colorful backdrop. The lighting is cinematic, with strong warm rim lighting highlighting the character\'s profile and form, contrasting with cooler tones, creating deep shadows and highly detailed textures on his clothing, skin, and metallic accessories. The composition is vertical, emphasizing the character\'s presence and the vibrant environment, with a cracked windshield visible behind his left shoulder, adding to the gritty aesthetic.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771217732_54b2e4e3ba5b.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"8KVisuals\",\"ActionCharacter\",\"TropicalVibes\",\"UltraRealistic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-16 04:55:32', NULL, 1, 1),
(769, 'Apocalypse in Style', 27, 'A fearless survivor relaxes in flooded chaos, blending danger, luxury, and cinematic intensity in a hyper-realistic 8K post-apocalyptic world.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, 8k, highly detailed image captured with a medium shot, slightly low-angle perspective, utilizing a 35mm lens. The scene is set in a chaotic, post-apocalyptic tropical environment under bright, cinematic daylight with strong direct lighting creating vibrant colors and clear shadows. The main subject, a male character, is casually seated in a teal green armchair, partially submerged in murky, reflective water. He wears sunglasses, a sleeveless camouflage vest over a graphic t-shirt with a skull design, ripped jeans, and sturdy boots. He holds a silver revolver in his left hand, resting on the chair arm, and a vibrant red cocktail garnished with a grapefruit slice and a small umbrella in his right hand. A katana with a distinctive red and blue sheath leans against the chair behind him. His face is uploaded face as reference. Around him, several grotesque zombies are partially submerged in the water, their decaying forms visible. In the mid-ground to the right, another zombie-like figure stands on a small patch of land or debris. The background features a lush tropical landscape with tall palm trees and a hazy, distant city skyline under a clear blue sky, with pink and dark confetti-like debris falling through the air, adding to the chaotic atmosphere. The water surface shows intricate ripples and reflections of the surrounding elements, with highly detailed textures on all surfaces, emphasizing the gritty yet vibrant aesthetic.. No cartoon , No Ghraphic.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771218091_5654a045814b.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"ApocalypticVibes\",\"Cinematic8K\",\"ZombieWorld\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"EpicScene\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-16 05:01:32', NULL, 1, 1),
(770, 'Born to Ride Vibes', 17, 'A rugged, muscular biker stands confidently beside a glossy black luxury SUV, styled in leather, gold, and bold attitude — captured in ultra-realistic daylight detail.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, medium shot of a rugged, muscular man with a groomed full beard and arm tattoos, standing confidently next to the open door of a glossy black luxury SUV. He is wearing a distressed brown leather cowboy hat, amber-tinted aviator sunglasses, and a vintage grey sleeveless muscle tee featuring a large eagle graphic with the text \"BORN TO RIDE\". He is also wearing tight black leather pants and a gold chain necklace. He is holding a smartphone in his hands. The lighting is natural and bright, highlighting the texture of the leather and the definition of his arms. The background is a blurred outdoor daytime setting\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771219982_d4c5c43759d8.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"BornToRide\",\"LuxuryLifestyle\",\"BikerStyle\",\"AIPortrait\",\"CinematicShot\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-16 05:33:02', NULL, 0, 0),
(771, 'Golden Glow Close-Up ✨', 18, 'A dreamy hyperreal portrait with soft elegance, glowing skin, and subtle luxury details in a cozy café vibe.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'mujhe is prompt ka english me short title, subtitle aur 5-6 hashtags bana kar ke do \r\nHyperrealistic close-up portrait (shoulders only) of an young woman matching the original face tilt, soft dreamy expression. Curly-to-straight hair, shiny and voluminous, light strands over the face. Long lashes, orange-nude lips. Sleeveless deep-neck blouse visible at shoulders. Gold \"K\" pendant necklace, rose-gold smartwatch partly visible. 9:16 vertical. no feature changes. Cafe bg \r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771220987_5df9cfe0f44e.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"HyperRealPortrait\",\"CafeAesthetic\",\"DreamyVibes\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"AIGlamour\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-16 05:49:47', NULL, 0, 0),
(772, 'Luxury Meets Confidence', 18, 'Ultra-realistic 8K fashion portrait at a premium car show — bold style, powerful stance, and flawless detail.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic 8K full-body fashion portrait, vertical 9:16. Use ONLY uploaded reference face (100% identical facial features, natural complexion preserved, no modification). Woman standing confidently at a modern professional car show with a sleek red sports car positioned directly behind her. Dark brown wavy hair styled naturally, black oval sunglasses, cherry-red manicured nails. Outfit: mustard yellow leather jacket layered over a black cropped tube top, black denim mini shorts, black leather over-the-knee boots. Confident stance with one leg slightly forward, shoulders back, relaxed yet powerful posture. Background: contemporary exhibition hall with blurred crowd movement and bright overhead showroom lighting. Cinematic color grading, glossy reflections on car surface, realistic skin texture, high-detail fabric and leather textures. Shot on full-frame DSLR, 85mm lens, shallow depth of field, sharp focus on subject, premium editorial automotive fashion aesthetic.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771223448_c0e65a7e4fe2.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"LuxuryVibes\",\"AutomotiveFashion\",\"8KPortrait\",\"CinematicStyle\",\"editoriallook\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-16 06:30:48', NULL, 0, 0),
(773, 'Matrix Dodge in the Kitchen? ☕🔥 | Hyper-Real 8K Freeze Frame', 17, 'When tea defies gravity and reality bends — created with PicPose AI in stunning cinematic detail.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, cinematic freeze-frame shot of a chaotic scene in a kitchen. A young man with curly brown hair, wearing a light green t-shirt and jeans, is bending backward in an extreme, gravity-defying Matrix-style dodge. His face is upside down, looking directly at the camera with a wide-eyed, shocked expression.\r\nSuspended in mid-air directly above his chest is a silver metal tea kettle. Dark amber tea is splashing violently out of the spout and lid, defying gravity and spraying upward in a golden, liquid arc. The liquid glows in the light.\r\nIn the background, slightly out of focus, a woman stands near a window reaching out in panic, as if shouting. The kitchen is bathed in intense, warm golden backlighting streaming through the window, highlighting floating dust motes, steam, and the glossy texture of the tiled floor. The atmosphere is a mix of magical realism and high-action drama. 8k resolution, highly detailed textures, dramatic lighting. \r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771228833_b31c010a6f06.jpg', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"CinematicReels\",\"8KVisuals\",\"AIMagic\",\"ReelsTrending\",\"VisualStorytelling\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-16 08:00:33', NULL, 0, 1),
(774, 'Neon Elegance in Every Detail ✨ | PicPose AI Magic', 18, 'Ultra-realistic profile portrait with zero face edits – Pure style, pure confidence, powered by PicPose AI.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an image with the person in the uploaded image without modifying features, skin tone, hair style or color in a phone screen background format. The person appears in profile, standing and with the body slightly facing towards the camera, displaying an upright and stylized posture. He keeps a gentle smile looking directly at the viewer, with one arm relaxed to one side holding a small padded texture black handbag and the other arm slightly flexed. The outfit consists of a neon yellow thin strap short top and ankle-length denim black tight-knee-length jeans, complemented by thin-striped high-heeled sandals in the same shade of neon yellow. For the visual finish, add detailed makeup, lips painted in vibrant red, several gold bracelets on the wrists, a ring on each hand, large dangle earrings, and a chain with a diameter around the neck that elegantly matches all other accessories. The background is a minimalist interior, spacious and bright, with white walls, light floors and a metal railing to the background that adds depth.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771236739_c2ac00ef9426.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"AIPortrait\",\"CinematicReels\",\"AIPhotoEdit\",\"ReelsTrending\",\"DigitalFashion\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-16 10:12:19', NULL, 0, 0),
(775, 'Unstoppable Over the Waves 🌊 | AI Cinematic Power Shot', 17, 'Experience hyper-real 8K action as he launches the Kawasaki Jet Ski Ultra 310 into the sky — frozen mid-air with cinematic precision. Powered by PicPose AI.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'levate this photo into a visually striking composition. Keep the man\'s actual facial details fully intact and unaltered in anyway as a cinematic image of him, wearing topless slight muscular showing 6 pack , a fitted black shorts , black sunglasses,natural wet look. He launches the black Kawasaki JET SKI ULTRA 310 off a high wave, fully airborne, water spray trailing behind, Sunlight glows through the day, illuminating his focused expression. The background shows a vast ocean horizon and dynamic sky. Cinematic action shot with mid-air freeze, hyper-realistic detail, and high-contrast reflections, 8K clarity.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771238399_b4fc0945a269.jpg', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"CinematicAction\",\"JetSkiLife\",\"8KVisuals\",\"AIPowered\",\"ReelsTrending\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-16 10:39:59', NULL, 0, 0),
(776, 'Neon Nights Street Portrait 🔥 | Shot with PicPose AI', 18, 'Cyberpunk vibes, rain-soaked streets, and 8K cinematic glow — transform your photos into ultra-real street masterpieces with PicPose AI.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A high-resolution, photorealistic street portrait of a cheerful young man leaning casually against the front bumper of a weathered, light blue minibus taxi. He is laughing with a bright, confident expression, arms crossed, wearing a red t-shirt with a bold graphic design and distressed blue jeans with ripped knees, paired with clean white sneakers. The scene is set on a wet city street at night, featuring a vibrant cyberpunk atmosphere inspired by a bustling Asian metropolis. The background is filled with soft bokeh from vertical neon signs, glowing city traffic lights, and rain-soaked pavement reflecting colorful lights. Cinematic lighting, sharp focus on the subject, shallow depth of field, ultra-detailed, 8K quality.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771304696_1580caa5bce0.jpg', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"NeonVibes\",\"CyberpunkPortrait\",\"8KPhotography\",\"CinematicReels\",\"AIPhotoMagic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-17 05:04:56', NULL, 0, 0),
(777, 'Sunlit Garden Elegance 🌿✨', 18, 'A dreamy 8K portrait with natural beauty, soft sunlight and perfect fashion vibes – powered by PicPose AI.\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an image with the person in the loaded image without modifying features, skin tone, hair style or color. The person is sitting sideways on a stone step next to a pond, with their legs outstretched and one foot touching the water. Her body is slightly leaning forward, with her arms rested on her knees and a hand gently touching her opposite shoulder as she looks at the camera. She wore a short white strapless dress with a see-through tulle section on the hem. Includes makeup, red painted lips, bracelets, a ring on each hand, large dangle earrings, and a matching necklace chain. The background is a sunlit garden with fuzzy green foliage. add my logo at bottom center The size of the image should be in the format of a phone screen background.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.\r\n', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771307598_72938372df38.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"GardenPortrait\",\"8KBeauty\",\"CinematicReels\",\"AIFashion\",\"reelstrending\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-17 05:53:18', NULL, 0, 0),
(778, 'Luxury Ride in Dubai Marina | Jet Ski Vibes 🌊', 17, 'Urban adventure meets ocean power. Experience cinematic water sports lifestyle with PicPose AI.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A stylish man riding a luxury jet ski in front of the Dubai Marina skyline during a bright afternoon. He faces the camera directly with a confident gaze, wearing a black life jacket over a white half-sleeve shirt and navy-blue shorts. The background shows tall glass skyscrapers reflecting sunlight and luxury yachts anchored nearby. The jet ski is metallic silver and blue, cutting through turquoise waves, splashing crystal-clear water droplets. The overall composition feels urban, energetic, and luxurious, showing modern adventure and travel vibes. His posture is balanced and natural, with both hands gripping the handles. The lighting is bright but soft on the face, maintaining realistic tones and sharp details. Perfect cinematic portrait of water sports lifestyle in a city luxury setting, Take Face From Uploaded image Keep same 100%.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771322966_9d353d017339.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"DubaiMarina\",\"LuxuryLifestyle\",\"JetSkiLife\",\"CinematicReels\",\"TravelVibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-17 10:09:26', NULL, 0, 2),
(780, 'Alien Jungle Encounter in 8K 🔥', 18, 'From reality to a cinematic sci-fi universe — powered by PicPose AI.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Transform the uploaded person into an ultra-realistic cinematic sci-fi jungle scene. Keep their exact facial features, age, expression, skin texture and identity unchanged. Place the person standing waist-deep in a glowing alien swamp, wearing a tactical futuristic explorer suit with camouflage patterns, wet fabric details, metallic buckles, and utility gear.\r\nBeside them, create a giant bioluminescent reptile-like creature with intricate scales, glowing blue cracks, amber eyes, and massive size. The creature should be leaning close to the person as if communicating—tense but respectful interaction. Surround them with dense alien vegetation: large teal bioluminescent flowers, tall twisted vines, floating spores, mist, and soft volumetric light.\r\nRender in 8K ultra-realistic cinematic quality, dramatic lighting, shallow depth of field, detailed reflections on water, realistic skin highlights, and movie-grade atmosphere. Keep the uploaded person’s face 100% accurate.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771325531_888d0c48fbba.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"SciFiPortrait\",\"CinematicReels\",\"8KVisuals\",\"AIFantasy\",\"reelstrending\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-17 10:52:11', NULL, 0, 1),
(781, 'Little Genius, Big Vision 🧪💡', 19, 'Watch creativity glow with hyper-realistic AI portraits powered by PicPose.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic cinematic 8K portrait, 4:5 aspect ratio — a young child scientist standing in a laboratory environment, medium close-up composition, wearing a clean white lab coat, light protective gloves, and oversized round blue eyeglasses. Short neatly styled light brown hair, bright expressive eyes, soft cheerful smile conveying curiosity and confidence. The child holds a clear glass test tube filled with glowing yellow liquid in one hand while the other hand steadies another tube, tiny bubbles and subtle spark-like particles visible inside the liquid. Background shows a softly blurred modern chemistry lab with glassware, bottles, and scientific equipment creating depth and bokeh highlights. Soft cinematic lighting with gentle rim light on hair and face, shallow depth of field, hyper-realistic skin texture, crisp focus on face and test tube, vibrant yet natural color grading, professional photography quality, highly detailed, photorealistic, studio-level clarity.\r\n Add a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771390847_1c28f810f3bb.png', NULL, '[\"PicPose\",\"AIArtMagic\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"YoungScientist\",\"ReelsTrending\",\"8KVisuals\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-18 05:00:47', NULL, 1, 3),
(782, 'Ramadan Mubarak – Cinematic AI Portrait Magic ✨', 17, 'Turn your simple photo into a 4K Ramadan masterpiece with glowing lantern vibes and ultra-realistic editing – Only on PicPose AI.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A stylish young man standing in a relaxed pose with both hands in his jacket pockets, medium-wide framing, upper body visible, soft confident expression, looking slightly at camera to the right, face must match 100% exactly with the reference photo (same facial features, beard style, skin tone, jawline, nose shape, eye shape, hairstyle, and expression).\r\nHe is wearing a dark green topi (cap), a light grey t-shirt, and a teal-blue varsity jacket with white sleeves and striped cuffs, casual modern streetwear style.\r\nBackground is a smooth warm orange gradient with a soft glowing effect, Islamic Ramadan theme, elegant hanging golden lanterns on the left side with subtle light glow, a large soft faded duplicate silhouette of the same man in the background (slightly transparent, looking in the same direction) creating a dreamy spiritual effect.\r\nSoft studio lighting on the subject, warm highlights, gentle shadows, high dynamic range, sharp focus on the man, background slightly blurred for depth.\r\nAt the middle right, elegant  English text “Ramadan Mubarak” \r\nColor grading: warm, vibrant, slightly matte finish, cinematic tones, smooth skin retouching but natural texture preserved.\r\nUltra high resolution, professional portrait editing style, poster composition, balanced negative space, Instagram post aesthetic, 4K quality.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771392520_f9aff69bfa43.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"RamadanMubarak\",\"AIPortrait\",\"CinematicReels\",\"4KEdit\",\"ramadanvibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-18 05:28:03', NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `ai_posts` (`id`, `title`, `category_id`, `short_description`, `prompt_text`, `image_url1`, `image_url2`, `tags`, `external_id`, `status`, `moderation_flags`, `reviewed_by`, `reviewed_at`, `priority`, `is_popular`, `is_featured`, `tier`, `premium_unlock_cost_points`, `premium_pack`, `likes`, `favorites`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `copies`, `views`) VALUES
(783, 'he Rooftop Gardener', 17, 'Barefoot in the soil, grounded above the city. A quiet moment of growth captured in ultra-realistic\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'The Rooftop Garden\r\nVertical 9:16 cinematic portrait. Preserve subject\'s exact facial identity — identical bone structure, skin tone, hairstyle, calm natural expression. No facial alteration. Realistic human proportions.\r\nSubject & Pose Single male subject tending to raised garden beds on a city rooftop, kneeling in rich soil. Hands deep in earth, planting a seedling, the action ancient and immediate. Head slightly bowed, watching the roots settle, the connection literal. Expression grounded, nurturing, emotionally rooted.\r\nOutfit & Styling Washed olive canvas work shirt, sleeves rolled, soil on the forearms. Vintage denim overalls, strap loose on one shoulder, the wear authentic. Bare feet in the soil, the grounding intentional, the city forgotten. Simple leather bracelet, the only accessory, earth on leather.\r\nEnvironment Rooftop garden, raised beds in weathered wood, vegetables and herbs thriving. City skyline surrounding, towers of glass reflecting sunset, the contrast stark. Compost bin in corner, rain barrel, the systems sustainable, the life considered. Bees working the lavender, the sound audible, the ecosystem complete.\r\nLighting & Mood Sunset light horizontal and warm, the skin glowing, the soil rich, the city golden. Mood cultivation, balance, cinematic, quietly viral, the urban dream realized.\r\nCamera & Composition Low angle from the soil level, looking up at him against the skyline. Subject centered, the towers behind, the hands in earth, the message clear.\r\nQuality & Finish 8K resolution, photorealistic soil texture with root systems, skin dirt accumulation in creases, canvas fabric wear patterns, denim fading at knee, city glass reflection distortion, natural sunset color temperature, cinematic dynamic range, 35mm equivalent, urban-nature intimacy.\r\n\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771392944_58989bb6bb42.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"RooftopLife\",\"UrbanFarming\",\"CinematicShot\",\"GoldenHour\",\"reelstrending\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-18 05:35:44', NULL, 0, 0),
