(799, 'Rugged Rider Vibes', 17, 'Adventure meets attitude — a bold lifestyle portrait beside a custom motorcycle.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A fashion and lifestyle photograph with a rugged, adventurous aesthetic, capturing a male figure sitting casually next to a customized motorcycle.\r\nThe subject is seated on the ground, leaning against the bike\'s rear wheel, with his legs extended and arms relaxed. His gaze is directed to the side, out of the frame, conveying a pensive and adventurous expression (Face 100% accurate like uploaded photo).\r\n\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771653515_ef1fbf25484b.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"RuggedStyle\",\"MotoLifestyle\",\"AdventurePortrait\",\"CinematicVibes\",\"custombikes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-21 05:58:35', NULL, 0, 0),
