(802, 'Royal Blue Alpine Luxury | PicPose AI', 17, 'Sharp look, luxury car, and breathtaking alpine backdrop – pure cinematic energy.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A high-resolution cinematic portrait of a stylish man with a well-groomed beard and voluminous dark hair, wearing dark classic sunglasses. He is dressed in a vibrant royal blue ribbed crewneck sweater over a white undershirt, paired with crisp white trousers. He is leaning casually against a sleek black luxury car. The background features a breathtaking alpine landscape with a turquoise glacial lake, a dense evergreen forest, and majestic snow-capped mountains under a soft, overcast sky. Professional photography, shallow depth of field, sharp focus on the subject, clean and modern travel aesthetic.\r\n\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771658504_bf4a261e0fdd.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"AlpineLuxury\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"TravelAesthetic\",\"LuxuryLifestyle\",\"ReelsTrending\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-21 07:21:44', NULL, 0, 1),
(803, 'Luxury CEO Walk – Private Jet Lifestyle ✈️🔥', 17, 'Ultra-realistic cinematic 8K shot of a confident businessman owning the runway with power, style, and sunset vibes. Created with PicPose AI.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra realistic cinematic photo of a handsome confident businessman in his 30s, wearing a perfectly tailored white suit with white shirt and shiny white shoes, walking forward on an airport runway while talking on a smartphone. Behind him a sleek private jet and a black luxury car are parked in golden sunset light, and four serious bodyguards in dark suits walk slightly behind him in formation, long dramatic shadows on the ground, rich warm tones, high detail, 8K, DSLR shot, fashion magazine.\r\n\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771660533_e161e0c57fd2.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"LuxuryLifestyle\",\"CinematicReels\",\"8KRealism\",\"BossVibes\",\"privatejetlifestyle\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-21 07:55:33', NULL, 0, 1),
(804, 'Tiny Man vs Giant Mouse | 8K Cinematic Survival', 17, 'A six-inch man running for his life inside a colossal house — hyper-realistic 8K shot on Canon EOS with dramatic shadows and terrifying scale.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A breathtaking, hyper-realistic, cinematic shot captured at a terrifying scale.\r\nA tiny man, appearing no more than six inches tall, is captured mid-stride, desperately scrambling across the massive, glossy dark wood floor of a gigantic house. He is dressed in simple casual wear a slightly torn red t-shirt and faded jeans—conveying vulnerability. His face, which must be rendered using the provided photo reference, is a mask of pure, sweat-drenched terror and exhaustion.\r\nHe is being relentlessly pursued by a colossal, terrifyingly giant house white mouse. The mouse is captured in motion, its massive pink paws barely inches from the man. Its beady black eyes reflect the ambient light, and its long, dark whiskers quiver with predatory focus.\r\nThe scene is dominated by the terrifying scale of the domestic environment: the man is running past the base of a massive, intricately carved wooden table leg, and the deep, dusty grain of the floorboards appears like canyons beneath him.\r\nCinematography & Style: Shot at a low-angle, eye-level perspective relative to the tiny man, creating a dramatic, immersive viewpoint. Use hard, dramatic cinematic lighting with deep shadows cast by the colossal furniture and the mouse itself. Ultra-detailed, photorealistic, 8K.\r\nCamera Specification: Shot on a Canon EOS camera with a 50mm prime lens, emphasizing realistic depth of field and sharp focus on the man and the approaching mouse.\r\n\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771661309_a4ea92e9c254.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"CinematicReels\",\"8KRealism\",\"MiniatureWorld\",\"SurvivalScene\",\"AIVisuals\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-21 08:08:29', NULL, 0, 1),
(805, 'Moonlight Sakura Queen | 8K Cinematic Fashion by PicPose AI', 18, 'Ultra-realistic 9:9 editorial portrait with dreamy sakura blossoms, soft pastel glow and luxury moon aesthetic. Powered by PicPose AI.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', '9:9 aspect ratio, 8K Ultra HD, keep the same face from uploaded image, ultra-realistic cinematic fashion portrait of a woman sitting on a massive moon-shaped structure covered with pink sakura blossoms and maroon fabric accents, facing camera elegantly, maroon sequin gown draping softly among petals, pastel pink light glowing behind her, fine softbox lighting and rim highlights, Nikon Z 70-200mm f/2.8 lens, aperture f/2.8, ISO 125, shutter 1/200s, white balance 5100K, soft cinematic tone, realistic skin detail, romantic editorial composition.\r\n\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771663032_c9155cb42352.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"8KPortrait\",\"SakuraAesthetic\",\"CinematicFashion\",\"MoonlightVibes\",\"AIPhotoMagic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-21 08:35:39', NULL, 0, 0),
(806, 'River Beauty & The Silent Predator 🐊✨ | PicPose AI Magic', 18, 'Soft morning sunlight, floating serenity, and a hidden crocodile — pure cinematic realism created with PicPose AI.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an image of a woman with a face, hairstyle, body shape, and hair color 100% similar to the attached image. A patterned sarong, a beautiful figure, half-floating in the water, picking a large bunch of morning glory. A giant crocodile is floating behind her in the water. The scene is in the middle of a river, a morning glory grove, filled with morning glory. A gentle smile, a bright morning atmosphere, soft sunlight, beautiful light, a realistic image of a beautiful woman.\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771663725_c619d59fd6f4.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"CinematicReels\",\"AIPhotoMagic\",\"RiverFantasy\",\"8KRealism\",\"reelstrending\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-21 08:48:45', NULL, 0, 0),
(807, 'Flying on a Giant Sea Turtle 🐢🌊 | 8K Cinematic Fantasy', 17, 'Hyper-realistic 8K adventure above the deep blue ocean – powered by PicPose AI.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, 8k, photorealistic image captured with a 30mm lens, featuring a mid-shot composition with a slightly low-angle perspective, looking up at the main subject. The scene depicts a person riding a colossal, hyper-detailed sea turtle, flying high above a vast, deep blue ocean under a clear, bright blue sky. The person, with uploaded face as reference, is wearing a blue waterproof jacket over a white t-shirt, olive green cargo pants, and brown lace-up hiking boots, sitting astride the turtle\'s back, smiling and looking directly at the camera. The giant sea turtle features a highly detailed, textured shell partially covered in vibrant green moss and algae, with its powerful flippers extended as if in flight, showcasing intricate scale patterns. The turtle\'s head is slightly turned towards the camera, revealing detailed eyes and skin. The background consists of an expansive, calm ocean stretching to a clear horizon, with subtle ripples and a few distant whitecaps, beneath a brilliant, cloudless sky. The lighting is natural, bright daylight, with soft, cinematic illumination coming from the top-right, creating subtle shadows and highlights that emphasize the highly detailed textures of both the person\'s clothing and the turtle\'s shell and skin, giving the image a sense of depth and realism.\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771736991_047668a5dc7f.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"SeaTurtleRide\",\"8KCinematic\",\"FantasyReels\",\"OceanAdventure\",\"AIRealism\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-22 05:09:51', NULL, 0, 1),
(808, 'Neon Ghost Rider 🔥🏍️ | Cinematic AI Power', 27, 'Rainy neon city mein flaming anti-hero ka 8K hyper-realistic action shot – Made with PicPose AI.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, cinematic wide shot of a man with long brown hair, glasses, and a beard riding a classic black chopper motorcycle through a rain-slicked neon city street at night. He is a \"Ghost Rider\" style anti hero, with his arms and the motorcycle\'s wheels engulfed in roaring orange flames. He is swinging a glowing, heavy iron chain that is also on fire, leaving a trail of sparks and embers in the air. The atmosphere is gritty and moody, with steam rising from the pavement and blue and pink neon lights reflecting in the puddles. Action-packed, high contrast, 8k resolution, photorealistic textures.\r\n\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771737448_76eedda778de.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"GhostRiderVibes\",\"NeonCity\",\"CinematicReels\",\"8KRealism\",\"AIArtMagic\",\"FireChain\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-22 05:17:28', NULL, 0, 0),
(809, 'Love, War & Robots – Cinematic Night Story', 33, 'Jab duniya lad rahi ho… tab bhi coffee aur sandwich ka sukoon alag hi hota hai ☕🔥\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A cinematic, high-detail photo of a man in full military tactical gear eating a sandwich and a woman in an elegant black dress drinking coffee, sitting at a small round bistro table on a city sidewalk at night. In the background, two giant metallic transforming robots are mid-battle, clashing with sparks flying, next to a bright yellow Chevrolet Camaro. The lighting is a mix of warm street lamps and cool blue cinematic glows. High-resolution, realistic textures, 8k, photorealistic, depth of field focusing on the couple while the background action is slightly soft but clear.\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771737905_8640e322aaea.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"CinematicReels\",\"RobotBattle\",\"NightAesthetic\",\"8KRealism\",\"AIFantasy\",\"ViralReels\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-22 05:25:05', NULL, 0, 0),
(810, 'Golden Hour Couture Magic ✨ | Ultra Realistic AI Portrait', 18, 'Exact face preserved. High-fashion glow with cinematic golden studio lighting & editorial elegance.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Preserve my exact face with zero modifications — identical facial features, proportions, skin tone, and identity. Maintain natural skin texture and beauty marks. Create a cinematic, ultra-realistic, high-fashion portrait with lifelike lighting, crisp detail, editorial clarity, and sharp focus. Only change hairstyle, outfit, styling, color palette, background, props, lighting, and overall artistic mood. Shot type: Half-body / Three-quarter body / Full-body. Expression may vary (soft, confident, dreamy, serene), pose harmonizes with theme and setting. Ultra-detailed textures, digital camera realism, high-resolution clarity, natural but elevated tones.\r\nArt Direction:\r\nStudio with golden-hour simulated lighting, warm highlights and soft shadows.\r\nBubbly, playful, chic, youthful editorial pose, perched slightly elevated, twisting gently to showcase gown and leg.\r\nFashion: Gradient couture gown with layered poppy petals, high slit, plunging neckline.\r\nHair: Long straight Gray Blonde, light waves, playful volume.\r\nNail art: red glossy nails with gemstone accents reflecting golden light.\r\nAccessories: subtle rings and gemstone earrings.\r\nProps: scattered petals, gentle shadow patterns.\r\nLighting: warm cinematic glow, soft rim highlights.\r\nCamera: full body shot, shallow depth of field, cinematic focus on subject.\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771738424_8607d37045c0.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"GoldenHourGlow\",\"CouturePortrait\",\"8KRealism\",\"AIFashion\",\"LuxuryReels\",\"EditorialVibes\",\"trendingnow\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-22 05:3