(811, 'Botanical Butterfly Glam', 18, 'Crystal-embroidered chiffon elegance with untouched natural skin texture and cinematic clarity.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-photorealistic 8K editorial portraits.Use the uploaded face with absolute fidelity,eyes,lips,jaw,pores,hairline, skin texture unchanged. Replicate attached floral saree/lehenga hybrid: ivory-red sheer & full body pictures.height 5 fit 6 enchi.chiffon/georgette, botanical & butterfly prints (green,pink, coral, lilac), crystal/sequin embroidery.Multi-tier ruffle skirt,pleated godets; translucent printed pallu/cape.Blouse:V-neck,short sleeves,dense bead and crystal edging.backgraund.\r\n\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771746880_53abad5e170d.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"ButterflyPrint\",\"HighFashionAI\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"LuxuryStyle\",\"ReelsTrending\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-22 07:23:24', NULL, 0, 0),
(812, 'Golden Street Swagger ✨', 17, 'ellow Jacket Vibes with Ultra-Real Face Precision | PicPose AI\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Stylish handsome young man sitting outdoor staircase, both wearing matching bright yellow jackets and sweaters, black pants, and trendy sneakers. Man with voluminous styled hair with yellow square sunglasses, and confident expression; highlighted hair, relaxed pose. Use reference image for 100% face matching and outfit accuracy. Modern railing and greenery in background, soft natural light, creamy DSLR bokeh, high-definition, ultra-realistic.signature AHA khan creation.\r\n\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771746812_0105a64a8140.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"StreetStyleKing\",\"YellowAesthetic\",\"DSLRBokeh\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"MensFashionReels\",\"TrendingNow\",\"aifashion\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-22 07:53:32', NULL, 0, 0),
(813, '🔥 Action Hero Mode ON | PicPose AI Cinematic Blast', 17, 'Golden hour explosion, flying car, ultra-realistic 8K action poster style – created with PicPose AI.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A stylish man stands confidently in the foreground, wearing a black leather jacket, dark sunglasses, and rugged boots. He smokes calmly while a massive fiery explosion erupts behind him, illuminating the scene with intense orange and yellow flames. A car is dramatically thrown into the air by the blast, adding a high-energy action-movie vibe. The ground reflects the explosion in wet puddles, creating vivid reflections. Golden-hour lighting, ultra-realistic details, cinematic composition, sharp focus, dramatic atmosphere, action-film poster style, 8K.\r\n\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771749386_9e9692c8b932.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"ActionReels\",\"CinematicVibes\",\"8KRealism\",\"ExplosionScene\",\"HeroEntry\",\"ViralReels\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-22 08:33:27', NULL, 0, 0),
(814, 'Hollywood Vanity Glow ✨', 18, 'Turn your photo into a cozy cinematic beauty portrait with flawless identity preservation.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A beautiful young blonde woman with a high wavy ponytail and soft makeup, smiling warmly. Wearing an oversized brown knit sweater with horizontal white stripes. Standing in front of a professional vanity mirror with bright round Hollywood-style light bulbs. Warm, cozy indoor lighting, high-quality photography, soft depth of field.\r\nUse my uploaded face image as the ONLY facial and identity reference. No other faces, models, datasets, or references are allowed.\r\n\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771750351_1786bc3b57b8.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"VanityMirrorGlow\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"AIBeauty\",\"8KRealism\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-22 08:52:31', NULL, 0, 2),
(815, 'Luxury Penthouse Tattoo Night ✨', 23, 'Ultra-realistic AI couple scene with cinematic party vibes & stunning saree elegance.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra realistic 23-year-old couple in luxury penthouse party room. Woman in stylish black saree tattooing a portrait-style female face on man\'s chest. Colorful ambient LED lights, blurred party background, high detail, cinematic mood.\r\n\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771760162_213203fa8e4c.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"LuxuryReels\",\"PenthouseVibes\",\"AITattooArt\",\"CinematicMood\",\"UltraRealisticArt\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-22 11:36:02', NULL, 0, 0),
(816, 'Luxury Selfie Glow – Magazine Cover Vibes 💎', 18, 'A stylish 40-year-old diva captured in ultra-realistic fashion artistry.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'digital photo of a stylish and realistic selfie of a beautiful 40-year-old woman with a voluptuous figure, perfect for a magazine cover, set in either a luxurious background or a serene natural environment, with customizable age, scene, props, and fashion style, ensuring elegance and vibrant personality suitable for lifestyle imagery, brand creation, artistic portraits, and high fashion photography.\r\n\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771830192_a8840e5a44db.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"MagazineCoverLook\",\"AIModel\",\"LuxuryVibes\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"DigitalBeauty\",\"TrendingReels\",\"FashionAI\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-23 07:03:12', NULL, 0, 2),
(817, 'Villain’s Wrath Unleashed ⚡', 29, 'Angry Face Close-Up with DC Legends | Ultra HD Vertical\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an ultra-realistic high-angle close-up portrait in 9:16 featuring movie villain [Justice League] show the face with angry face and pose, surrounded by Superman, Batman, Aquaman, Flash, Wonder Woman, Cyborg and [man from attached image] dressed as Green Lantern without mask in coordinated scene-inspired outfits. Everyone should display intense expressions. Set the scene against the villain Steppenwolf in movie final battle scene background.\r\n\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771831365_2b85082ce3fb.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"DCComics\",\"Superman\",\"Batman\",\"WonderWoman\",\"Aquaman\",\"Flash\",\"Cyborg\",\"GreenLantern\",\"EpicScenery\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-23 07:22:45', NULL, 0, 1),
(818, 'Midnight Ferrari Fantasy 🚗✨', 17, 'High-budget superhero movie look created in seconds.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A high-resolution, cinematic wide shot at night in a neon-lit city. In the center, a young Asian man with dark hair, wearing a black leather jacket, white t-shirt, and ripped black jeans, leans confidently against a sleek, glossy red Ferrari. Surrounding him are five women dressed in high-quality, realistic superhero costumes reminiscent of Wonder Woman, Black Widow, and Captain Marvel. The lighting is dramatic and moody, with city streetlights and glowing billboards creating reflections on the car\'s surface. The overall style is photorealistic with a high-budget action movie aesthetic.\r\n\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771831912_fb5eeddc6d0f.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"FerrariNight\",\"HeroStyle\",\"AICinematic\",\"LuxuryReels\",\"UrbanGlow\",\"TrendingNow\",\"ReelsIndia\",\"photorealistic\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 2, 2, '2026-02-23 07:31:52', NULL, 0, 4);
