(819, 'Jungle Temple Warrior – 8K Cinematic Power Look', 17, 'Ancient ruins, neon jungle vibes & unstoppable attitude | Created with PicPose AI\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, 8k, cinematic full-body shot, captured with a 50mm prime lens at eye level, featuring the same muscular male character in a commanding pose. The character, with uploaded face as reference, sports his signature short fade haircut and well-trimmed beard, sweat glistening on his forehead. He is sitting confidently on a stack of moss-covered military ammunition crates inside the ruins of a stone temple, surrounded by hanging vines and giant fern leaves. He wears a torn, sleeveless olive-drab tactical vest revealing intricate tribal tattoos on his arms, layered over a dirty white tank top. A golden AK-47 with colorful grip tape rests across his lap, and he holds a lit cigar in his left hand. He wears camouflage cargo pants tucked into heavy combat boots, with the distinctive red knee pad with a yellow \'X\' still visible on his right knee. The background creates a stark contrast between the ancient grey stone and the vibrant, neon-green jungle foliage. A macaw parrot flies blurred in the distance. The lighting is dramatic, with shafts of sunlight (god rays) piercing through the canopy, illuminating smoke swirling around him, creating high-contrast shadows and emphasizing the grit on his skin and the metallic texture of the weapon.\r\n\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771835360_11ec7221f73b.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"JungleWarrior\",\"8KCinematic\",\"TacticalVibes\",\"AIPortrait\",\"ReelsTrending\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 4, 3, '2026-02-23 08:29:20', NULL, 0, 9),
(820, 'Salt Desert AI Chase | 8K Cinematic Action', 17, 'Hyper-real dune buggy escape in a brutal salt flat showdown – powered by PicPose AI.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic 8k cinematic medium shot, captured with a wide angle lens from a slightly low angle, depicts an intense high-speed chase across desolate salt flats. The central figure is a person, with uploaded face as reference, wearing a black short-sleeve t-shirt with \"AI TRENDS\" printed in white, distressed blue jeans, and red and black sneakers, actively driving a rusted, custom-built dune buggy with exposed engines. The buggy\'s paddle tires are kicking up massive plumes of highly detailed white salt crystals and fine dust, creating a dynamic, blinding white haze. Surrounding and aggressively chasing the vehicle are multiple hyper-realistic heavily armored raiders in weaponized, spike-covered vehicles, dressed in detailed leather, metal scraps, and dust goggles, shouting aggressively, contributing to the chaotic scene. Two prominent raider vehicles flank the buggy in the foreground, with several more visible in the mid-ground and background, all kicking up their own trails of salt. The setting is a vast, cracked white salt desert with distant, hazy mountain ranges under a dramatic, cloudless sky with harsh, bright daylight tones. Cinematic lighting from the unforgiving midday sun casts harsh, sharp shadows and intense highlights on the metal and salt, enhancing the gritty textures and the volumetric dust. The composition is dynamic and action-packed, with sharp focus on the rider and the pursuing vehicles, and a slightly shallower depth of field for the endless horizon.\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771909202_c31e1fcfeff0.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"8KCinematic\",\"AITrends\",\"DesertChase\",\"ActionReels\",\"viralshorts\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-24 05:00:02', NULL, 0, 0),
(821, 'Walking on a Flying Military Plane 😱 | 8K AI Cinematic Shot', 17, 'Hyper-realistic 8K wide-angle tracking shot – Surreal sky adventure powered by PicPose AI.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, 8k, cinematic tracking shot captured with a 24mm wide-angle lens attached to the fuselage, showing a mind-bending surreal scene where a person is casually strolling upright along the leading edge of the wing of a massive, in-flight military cargo plane. The subject, wearing the signature blue t shirt with \"AI TRENDS\" printed in white, black cargo shorts, a red belt, red socks, black sneakers, and silver chain, leans slightly forward against the wind. The character\'s face should be rendered using the uploaded face as reference. The dark grey, riveted metal texture of the massive wing and one large turboprop engine dominate the left side. Below and behind them is a stunning, highly detailed cloudscape with patches of ocean visible far below through the gaps, all heavily blurred by intense speed. The lighting is bright, harsh high-altitude sunlight from above, creating strong contrasts and emphasizing the sheer scale and speed of the aircraft.\r\n\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771909802_1644304c987d.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"AICinematic\",\"8KRealism\",\"SkyAdventure\",\"ViralReels\",\"aitrends\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-24 05:10:02', NULL, 0, 0),
(822, 'Legend of the Fire Monkey King | PicPose AI Cinematic Fantasy', 27, 'Epic 8K high-fantasy action shot of a legendary Chinese warrior wielding the blazing Ruyi Jingu Bang, with a colossal flaming Monkey King spirit rising behind a thunderous waterfall.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Cinematic, high fantasy action shot of a legendary Chinese warrior leaping through the air in front of a massive water fall. He wears intricate gold and crimson imperial silk armor with dragon motifs. He wields a glowing, ornate golden staff (Ruyi Jingu Bang) that radiates intense fire and sparks. Looming behind him is a gargantuan, ethereal Great Sage Monkey King spirit made entirely of swirling orange flames and smoke, roaring with glowing eyes. The background features ancient stone monkey statues and misty mountain cliffs. Intense lighting, hyper-realistic textures, 8k resolution, epic scale, martial arts mastery. \r\n\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771910439_3564c1c7c281.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"MonkeyKing\",\"CinematicFantasy\",\"8KVisuals\",\"EpicWarrior\",\"aireels\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-24 05:20:39', NULL, 0, 0),
(823, 'Elegant White Floral Portrait ✨ | Laiba Khan Inspired Look | PicPose AI', 18, 'Soft natural light, graceful smile, and timeless white embroidery — create stunning celebrity-style portraits instantly with PicPose AI.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'create a image for a beautiful portrait of indian actress Laiba Khan, wearing a white long-sleeved dress with black and grey floral embroidery on the cuffs, neckline, and hem. She is seated on a white sofa with her hair down in soft waves, smiling gently while looking away from the camera. The background is a bright, outdoor setting with a hint of greenery and a table with flowers. The lighting is soft and natural.\r\n\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771910983_406e469fcd25.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"LaibaKhanInspired\",\"ElegantPortrait\",\"IndianActressStyle\",\"CinematicReels\",\"aiphotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-24 05:29:43', NULL, 0, 0),
(824, 'Ramadan Kareem ✨ Peaceful Lantern Portrait | PicPose AI', 17, 'A magical Ramadan night with glowing lanterns, crescent moon & spiritual vibes 🌙 Ultra-realistic 4K HDR portrait powered by PicPose AI.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️u5;', 'A realistic portrait of 22 year old young Muslim boy standing outdoors at night with a peaceful smile, holding a glowing lantern in hands, wearing white kurta and cap (for boy) / pastel abaya and hijab (for girl). Ramadan night atmosphere with golden hanging lanterns, bokeh lights, crescent moon and sparkling stars in the sky, soft warm lighting on face, magical sparkles around lantern, emotional Islamic festive vibe. Text “Ramadan Kareem” written in beautiful Arabic calligraphy glowing softly in the background, cinematic dreamy look, ultra realistic 4K HDR, high detail, smooth skin tones, peaceful spiritual feeling, depth of field, professional photography style.  keep original face and hairstyle 100% reference face\r\n\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771915432_ffa2677d78f8.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"RamadanKareem\",\"IslamicVibes\",\"LanternGlow\",\"SpiritualPortrait\",\"4KHDR\",\"cinematicreels\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-24 06:43:52', NULL, 0, 2),
(825, 'Ultra Realistic 34K Cinematic Rooftop Fashion Portrait | PicPose AI', 17, 'Ultra-realistic 34K cinematic fashion portrait featuring a modern rooftop aesthetic with luxury styling. Sharp details, DSLR depth, warm tones and premium AI realism powered by PicPose.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'An Ultra-realistic, 34k, cinematic fashion portrait of a young man, messy hair styled and leaning casually against a gold geometric railing on a modern rooftop. Light men\'s white and black floral long-sleeve casual shirt, Snitch Men Floral Slim Fit Shirt, dark grey ripped looe jeans, white High-top sneakers and one in hand js pocket on leg, apple watch, dark Rectangular sunglasses. Eyes-camera, Soft natural dark, warm cinematic tones, skin tone,  DSLR quality, face 100% same as reference image.\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771916743_46d52a3e3e1b.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"CinematicFashionn\",\"34KRealism\",\"LuxuryRooftop\",\"AIPortrait\",\"UrbanStyle\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-24 07:05:43', NULL, 0, 1),
(826, 'Golden Hour Airfield Muse ✈️ | Ultra Realistic Cinematic Portrait', 18, 'Bohemian elegance meets vintage adventure — shot in dreamy golden backlight with timeless cinematic vibes. Powered by PicPose AI.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic full-body photograph of an elegant woman (upload image) walking confidently across a rustic airfield at golden hour. Her long, wavy dark brown hair flows naturally in the warm breeze. She wears a cream-colored bohemian-style midi dress with intricate brown and rust floral prints, a modest V neckline, and soft layered ruffled tiers that move gently as she walks. A wide dark brown leather belt with a bronze buckle cinches her waist, accentuating her silhouette.\r\nIn her right hand, she carries a vintage rectangular dark brown leather suitcase with brass clasps. On the dry, dusty gravel ground beside her lie an olive green canvas duffel bag, a straw fedora hat, and another old-fashioned suitcase.\r\nBehind her, a silver single-propeller airplane is parked slightly out of focus, reflecting the amber sunlight. The atmosphere glows with warm, cinematic tones — golden light, long shadows, and soft dust particles in the air.\r\nShot on a full frame DSLR with an 85mm lens at f/1.8, capturing shallow depth of field and creamy bokeh. The lighting is natural backlight, with the sun low on the horizon, creating a halo effect around her hair. The mood is adventurous yet refined, timeless, and photographically cinematic.\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771917731_b351ddce99d6.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"GoldenHourGlow\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"BohoElegance\",\"VintageVibes\",\"reelstrending\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-24 07:22:11', NULL, 0, 0),
(827, 'Goldilocks Restaurant Fantasy with Three Bears | PicPose AI Realistic Scene', 17, 'A photorealistic magical dinner inside a Filipino Goldilocks restaurant – warm vibes, authentic food, and cinematic AI realism powered by PicPose.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a photorealistic scene inside a Goldilocks restaurant in the Philippines. The user (use uploaded photo), wearing a white polo shirt, sits in the middle of a table together with Goldilocks, sitting side by side. Goldilocks is a realistic human woman with bright, golden, long curly hair, blue eyes, wearing a blue dress and a light blue ribbon headband. The Three Bears sit naturally around the table: Papa Bear gentle and protective, Mama Bear kind and cheerful, Baby Bear playful and curious, interacting realistically with the user, Goldilocks, and the food. The Chaman Bahar Masale logo (use uploaded photo) is attached to the wall—enhance the design visually but keep the original colors unchanged. On the table, place realistic Filipino dishes such as adobo, sinigang, lechon kawali, pancit, and rice, along with drinks like soft drinks or iced tea. Make the restaurant interior authentic, with proper lighting, shadows, and Filipino décor details. Emphasize a warm, lively, and inviting atmosphere. The scene should look fully realistic, like a photograph, not animated.\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding. ', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771918485_7194be8e9ac1.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"GoldilocksFantasy\",\"ThreeBearsScene\",\"FilipinoFoodVibes\",\"CinematicReels\",\"AIRealism\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-24 07:34:45', NULL, 0, 2),
(828, 'Festival of Colors – Ultra Real 8K Portrait by PicPose AI', 39, 'Experience Holi like never before in ultra-hyper-realistic 8K cinematic detail. Pure festive energy, vibrant gulal burst, natural skin texture, and magazine-quality realism — powered by PicPose AI. 🌈🔥\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-hyper-realistic 8K vertical 9:16 cinematic Holi portrait, 85mm f/1.8 shallow DOF. Use ONLY uploaded face (100% identical, no alteration). Young woman in vibrant hot-pink bandhani dress with subtle mirror-work details, mid-action throwing bright green gulal with right hand, silver thali in left filled with red, yellow, blue, green, and pink powders. Joyful open-eyed expression, dynamic powder burst frozen in air, realistic color splashes across cheeks, forehead, dress, and environment. Natural glowing skin with visible pores and authentic pigment texture. Background layered with rich red, pink, and deep black drapes trimmed with golden lace, subtle powder splatter accents. Soft natural daylight balanced with festive warm highlights, high dynamic range, sharp facial focus, cinematic color grading, energetic celebratory vibe, magazine-quality photorealism, no CGI, no illustration.\r\n\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771930464_cbdc87d588fc.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"Holi2026\",\"8KPortrait\",\"CinematicReels\",\"FestivalOfColors\",\"AIRealism\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-24 10:52:04', NULL, 0, 1),
(829, 'Roses to Reality 🌹 | Ultra Realistic 8K Cinematic Transformation – PicPose AI', 18, 'An elegant fine-art portrait where roses bloom, vanish, and reveal pure beauty — powered by PicPose AI in stunning 8K realism.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create an ultra realistic photo with 8k sharp details, cinematic quality, natural light, soft focus of the woman in the attached photo. Copy her face and hair 100%, do not change any of the facial features.\r\nAppearance: Elegant adult woman (30+), Wearing glasses, Hair neatly tied back, Soft cherry lipstick Beautiful curvy feminine figure with defined narrow waist. Natural, graceful proportions.\r\nShe is wearing a white spaghetti-strap midi dress with a soft, flowing fabric that moves gently with the air.\r\nHer entire body is enveloped or covered with roses(do not cover all her white dress), red, yellow, white, and orange roses wrapping around her figure like living petals. The roses also covered her hair and around her neck, back and front forming an elegant floral aura.\r\nOnly her face remains fully visible and unobstructed, natural, calm, and beautiful, with a soft closed-lip smile.\r\nA single monarch butterfly, noticeably larger than normal, hovers delicately close to her nose, its wings moving slowly and gracefully, as if drawn to her presence.\r\nLighting is soft, natural, and cinematic, with warm highlights and gentle shadows that enhance skin texture, fabric folds, and flower petals.\r\nBackground is minimal, dreamy, and softly blurred—neutral tones or subtle garden haze—keeping full focus on her form.\r\nStyle: photorealistic, cinematic fine-art portrait, ultra-high detail, realistic skin texture, natural proportions, professional color grading, 8K quality\r\nFinal reveal: Gradually all roses have vanished, She remains standing in her white spaghetti-strap midi dress, hair neatly tied back, clean and untouched, She is now holding a single yellow rose gently in her hand, The monarch butterfly continues flying calmly, circling or hovering nearby. Motion remains graceful, and emotionally warm throughout—no sudden cuts. Do not change her face from beginning to the end.\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1771999661_f97c7be0ed2c.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"8KCinematic\",\"FloralFantasy\",\"AIRealism\",\"CinematicReels\",\"ultrahdportrait\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-25 06:07:41', NULL, 0, 0),
(830, '16K Ultra Realistic Cinematic Portrait | PicPose AI Magic', 17, 'Luxury vibes, Canon EOS R5 realism & next-level AI detailing — created with PicPose AI.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic 16K cinematic portrait of a burly man (facial features identical to the original), sitting comfortably on a plush elegant white chair with one leg crossed over the other.\r\nHe is wearing an olive-green puffer jacket over a white undershirt, black loose pants, white Nike Air Force 1 sneakers, and red-orange rectangular sunglasses.\r\nHis hair is disheveled and messy, and he has a relaxed, confident gaze directed to the right.\r\nThe lighting is soft, natural, and cinematic, revealing fine skin and fabric textures with perfect depth and clarity.\r\nBackground: a tasteful, color-coordinated setting with warm neutral tones and soft blurred lighting that complements the outfit and adds a modern, elegant atmosphere.\r\nCaptured with a Canon EOS R5 Mark II camera, 85mm f/1.2 lens, HDR, shallow depth of field, realistic tone mapping, lifelike details.\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1772001076_301089d35a0c.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"16KCinematic\",\"UltraRealisticPortrait\",\"LuxuryAesthetic\",\"AIFashion\",\"CanonEOSStyle\",\"ReelsTrending\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 3, 0, '2026-02-25 06:31:16', NULL, 0, 2),
(831, 'Cinematic Forest Warrior | Ultra Realistic 8K Action Portrait', 29, 'Mist-filled forest, tactical combat gear, flowing hair & intense warrior vibes – powered by PicPose AI.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic cinematic portrait of a young female warrior in a misty forest. She is crouching in a dynamic action pose on a muddy forest path, wearing black tactical combat gear with straps, knee pads, gloves, and heavy boots. Her long dark brown hair is flowing in the wind. She holds a sharp sword in one hand raised behind her, while her other hand is extended forward toward the camera in a powerful, dramatic gesture.\r\nThe atmosphere is foggy with soft natural forest lighting, shallow depth of field and subtle floating sparks in the air. Highly detailed textures on clothing with dirt and mud stains. Intense, confident facial expression. Cinematic composition, dramatic perspective, 8K resolution, sharp focus, realistic skin texture, professional color grading, action movie still, high detail, photorealistic, depth of field, dynamic lighting.\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1772003333_ae2cf3859e38.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"CinematicWarrior\",\"8KRealism\",\"ForestAction\",\"AICinematic\",\"UltraRealPortrait\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 3, 0, '2026-02-25 07:08:53', NULL, 0, 1),
(832, 'Ramadan Moonlight Prayer | Hyper Realistic AI Portrait 🌙✨', 35, 'Emerald Abaya, Golden Embroidery & A Surreal Crescent Moon – Crafted with PicPose AI in Ultra HD 8K Detail.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic photograph captures [INSERT YOUR FACE REFERENCE METHOD HERE] a beautiful woman with a curvaceous feminine figure, wearing a flowing, modest dark emerald green Ramadan abaya with intricate gold thread embroidery. She is kneeling in prayer on a surreal prayer mat woven from glowing constellations and stardust, floating above a desert landscape where ancient mosques sprout from the dunes like giant glowing flowers. Her face is serenely focused, sharply illuminated by the soft light of a giant crescent moon that hangs directly in front of her, seemingly made of solid water. Technical: Shot on Leica M10-R, Leica-Vibrant color profile, Vivid filter, Ultra-HD 8k detail, photographic-realistic, sharp focus on eyes, cinematic lighting, deep shadows.\r\n\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1772003997_fb975231079e.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"RamadanVibes\",\"8KRealism\",\"CinematicReels\",\"IslamicAesthetic\",\"aiphotography\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-25 07:19:57', NULL, 0, 1),
(833, 'Rose Garden Royal Look 🌹', 17, 'Morning light, calm vibes & luxury fashion aesthetics — photoreal magic by PicPose AI.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'An ultra-realistic HD full-body photo of the young man from the uploaded image. He is standing in a lush, vibrant rose garden, wearing a stylish yellow V-neck sweatshirt with a subtle \'CK\' logo, dark blue jeans, and a classic wristwatch. He has a calm, serene expression and is gently touching a cluster of red, yellow, and pink roses. The scene is bathed in soft, natural morning light, with a background of dense greenery and blooming rose bushes. Photorealistic style, maintaining the exact facial features, hairstyle, and beard grooming from the original photo.\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1772009431_478967f56ecb.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"RoseGardenShoot\",\"UltraRealisticHD\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"AIPhotography\",\"reelstrending\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-25 08:50:31', NULL, 0, 1),
(834, 'Little Soul in Prayer', 19, 'A peaceful Ramadan-inspired moment captured in golden light — purity, faith, and serenity in one frame.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A high-resolution, cinematic portrait of a young boy with fair skin sitting cross legged on a prayer rug in a grand, softly lit hallway. He is wearing a crisp white traditional thobe (kandura) and a white embroidered prayer cap (kufi), with a silver smartwatch on his left wrist. The background features a long, elegant corridor with golden pillars and a series of warm, glowing bokeh lights stretching into the distance, creating a shallow depth of field. The atmosphere is serene and peaceful, with soft, diffused lighting hitting his face as he looks thoughtfully to the side. Keep original face and hairstyle 100% reference\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1772016126_a1413373e9ed.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"RamadanVibes\",\"8KRealism\",\"SpiritualAesthetic\",\"reelstrending\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 3, 1, '2026-02-25 10:42:06', NULL, 2, 6),
(835, 'Midnight Guitar Vibes 🎸', 17, 'Moody jazz tavern lighting, vintage Gibson Les Paul aur warm bokeh ambiance ke saath ek soulful performance moment.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A high-resolution, cinematic full-body shot of a male guitarist sitting on a wooden stool in a dimly lit, intimate jazz club or tavern. He is playing a vintage sunburst Gibson Les Paul electric guitar. He is wearing a blue denim jacket over a dark graphic t-shirt and black jeans. To his right, a glowing Vox tube amplifier head sits atop a rugged black road case, with a clear water bottle nearby. In the foreground, a black stage monitor wedge is visible. The background is softly blurred with warm bokeh from Edison-style hanging light bulbs and empty bistro tables. The lighting is moody and focused, highlighting the musician’s concentration and the warm wood grain of the guitar.\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1772083637_7fb8a0341880.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"JazzClubVibes\",\"GibsonLesPaul\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"MoodyLighting\",\"GuitaristLife\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-26 05:27:17', NULL, 0, 0),
(836, 'Parisian Sunrise Look', 17, 'Trocadéro sunrise with Eiffel Tower elegance – powered by PicPose AI ✨\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper realistic 8k cinematic photograph captured during the golden hour sunrise at the Trocadéro viewing platform in Paris. The subject, with uploaded face as reference, short neatly styled dark hair, and a well-groomed dark beard, is featured in a medium shot using a portrait lens (e.g., 85mm) with a shallow depth of field. He is dressed in a stylish camel-colored wool trench coat over a crisp white collared shirt and dark tailored trousers, leaning casually with one elbow on the stone balustrade, looking slightly off-camera with a gentle, confident smile. The lighting is warm and soft, catching the dew on the stone and the texture of the wool coat. The background is dominated by the iconic Eiffel Tower rendered in sharp detail against a pastel sky of soft oranges and pinks. Crucially, a large French tricolor flag (blue, white, red) is visible in the mid-ground, fluttering from a flagpole near the tower\'s base, perfectly clear despite the slight background bokeh. Highly detailed textures are visible on the ancient stone balustrade and the fabric fibers of the coat.\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1772084255_64a420452aad.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"ParisCinematic\",\"GoldenHourPortrait\",\"EiffelTowerView\",\"8KRealism\",\"luxuryrealestate\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-26 05:37:35', NULL, 1, 1),
(837, 'Mediterranean Luxury Vibes in Nice 🌊✨', 17, 'Promenade des Anglais, Nice 🇫🇷 | 8K Ultra Realistic Summer Style with PicPose AI\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic 8k vibrant seaside portrait captured on the Promenade des Anglais in Nice. The subject, with uploaded face as reference, short dark hair, and a well-groomed dark beard, strolls casually along the famous seafront walkway. He is dressed in a chic Mediterranean summer outfit: a light blue tailored linen suit over a crisp white t-shirt, and suede loafers. He wears sunglasses and is smiling relaxed towards the ocean. The lighting is bright midday Mediterranean sun, making the azure water and the white pebble beach sparkle intensely. The background features the sweeping curve of the bay and the grand Belle Époque hotels like Le Negresco. A French flag (Tricolore) is clearly visible waving vigorously from a tall flagpole on the beach near a lifeguard station in the mid-ground. The texture of the linen suit and the palm tree trunks is sharp.\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1772084760_5687c4fefea9.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"8KRealism\",\"MediterraneanVibes\",\"NiceFrance\",\"LuxuryLifestyle\",\"cinematicreels\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-26 05:46:00', NULL, 0, 0),
(838, 'Luxury Twilight Moment with Samoyed✨🐶', 18, 'Elegant marble patio, soft evening glow & pure joy captured in hyper-realistic cinematic style ✨\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create 9:16 image with ultra-high resolution ultra realistic details. Use same face and figure 100 percent as uploaded image  Of a captive shot of  A hyper-realistic, low-angle lifestyle photograph of a woman with long, voluminous brunette waves lying on her back on a polished marble patio. She is wearing a simple, form-fitting white spaghetti-strap tank top and matching white shorts. She is looking up with a joyful, gentle expression at a large, fluffy white Samoyed dog that stands near her head and is leaning over her. One of her hands is raised to playfully pet the dog\'s neck. Her hair is fanned out elegantly across the patterned stone floor. Environment: An upscale outdoor estate at twilight. In the background, tall palm trees are silhouetted against a deep blue dusk sky, and warm architectural lighting illuminates a nearby villa with stone columns. 8k resolution, cinematic wide-angle lens, natural skin textures, soft evening glow.\r\n\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1772085898_246a7d6fb07e.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"8KRealism\",\"LuxuryEstate\",\"SamoyedLove\",\"CinematicReels\",\"UltraHDPortrait\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 1, 0, '2026-02-26 06:04:07', NULL, 0, 1),
(839, 'Cyberpunk Rooftop Showdown with Mewtwo | Ultra Realistic 8K AI Art', 17, '📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic cinematic full-body shot of a man with long dark hair standing next to the Pokémon Mewtwo on a futuristic city rooftop at night. The man is wearing high-end techwear: a long grey hooded parka with purple accents, a black tactical shirt featuring a glowing circular purple power core on the chest, black cargo joggers, and custom grey and purple high-top sneakers. Mewtwo is life-sized with a realistic skin texture, standing in a powerful pose. The background is a blurred cyberpunk cityscape with glowing neon lights and skyscrapers. Cinematic lighting with purple and blue hues, 8k resolution, highly detailed textures, urban atmosphere.\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1772086733_06eece64cc56.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"MewtwoVibes\",\"CyberpunkCity\",\"8KRealism\",\"AICinematic\",\"TechwearStyle\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-26 06:18:53', NULL, 0, 0),
(840, 'Desert Sunset Vibes 🐪', 17, 'Golden sand dunes, peaceful sunset, and a calm camel companion — cinematic desert storytelling powered by PicPose AI.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic cinematic desert portrait of a traveler sitting on warm golden sand dunes beside a calm camel during sunset. The man same as uploaed photo is wearing a black t-shirt, olive cargo pants, brown hiking boots, round sunglasses, a wristwatch, and a black-and-white keffiyeh scarf wrapped around his head and neck. He sits relaxed on the sand looking peacefully toward the horizon while the camel sits next to him.\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1772095374_accf906a8518.png', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"DesertCinematic\",\"CamelVibes\",\"GoldenHourMagic\",\"AIRealism\",\"TravelPortraitSoPro\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 1, 1, '2026-02-26 08:42:17', NULL, 0, 1),
(841, 'The CEO Mindset in Rosso Red', 17, 'Leadership isn’t loud — it’s calculated. Powered by PicPose AI.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-luxury corporate hero shot, hyper-detailed 8K realism, crystal-clear daylight clarity.\r\nA calm yet powerful CEO leaning confidently against a Rosso Corsa red Ferrari SF90 Stradale.\r\nBright morning sunlight illuminating the entire scene evenly — no golden hour tones, pure neutral daylight.\r\nSlim LED headlights subtly visible, sharp sculpted aerodynamic lines of the SF90 clearly defined under crisp natural light.\r\nGlossy red paint reflecting a modern glass city skyline under a clear blue sky.\r\nCEO wearing a perfectly tailored charcoal suit, relaxed but commanding posture, one arm lightly resting on the car roof.\r\nExpression composed, focused, strategic — the look of someone already three moves ahead.\r\nCamera: cinematic medium shot, shallow depth of field but brighter exposure.\r\nLighting: clean high-key daylight, sharp natural shadows on the ground, ultra-clear reflections on glass and paint.\r\nEnvironment: modern financial district plaza with polished stone flooring and sleek skyscrapers.\r\nMood: precision leadership, forward-thinking innovation, unstoppable future empire energy.\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1772255748_0cfaefce08fb.jpg', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"FerrariSF90\",\"CorporateHeroShot\",\"CEOEnergie\",\"UltraLuxuryVibes\",\"8KRealism\",\"FinancialDistrict\",\"ModernEmpire\",\"PowerPortrait\",\"aireels\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-28 05:15:48', NULL, 0, 0),
