(843, 'Milk Dragon Chase – Arctic Madness 🐉🥛', 17, 'Futuristic jet ski, frozen ocean aur milk dragon ka ultimate cinematic showdown!\r\n\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A high-action, cinematic surrealist shot of a smiling man with curly hair and a beard, wearing a light blue tactical life vest and white futuristic gear, riding a high-speed jet ski made from a giant silver milk can. The front of the jet ski is custom-molded into a sleek, metallic cow head with horns. He is racing through a frozen arctic landscape with massive icebergs and floating ice cubes in the water. Emerging behind him is a colossal, majestic dragon made entirely of splashing white liquid milk, with glowing eyes and a powerful, roaring expression. The lighting is bright and crisp, with realistic water droplets, lens flares, and a dynamic sense of motion. Ultra-realistic, 8k resolution, commercial photography style.\r\n\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1772261824_7083a3bc2b45.jpg', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"MilkDragon\",\"ArcticAction\",\"SurrealCinematic\",\"8KRealism\",\"JetSkiMadness\",\"AIFantasy\",\"CinematicReels\",\"ViralReels\",\"UltraHDVisuals\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-28 06:57:04', NULL, 0, 0),
(844, 'Neon Holi Night – Ultra Real Portrait 🔥', 18, 'Green & hot pink powder streaks with neon reflections – powered by PicPose.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic Holi night portrait using my uploaded photo as the face reference, 45-degree side angle, mid-action candid pose, wearing a fitted white crew-neck t-shirt under an open charcoal denim jacket, sleeves slightly rolled, round silver sunglasses reflecting neon lights, vibrant green and hot pink Holi powder streaked across cheeks and jawline, right hand brushing powder through hair creating upward motion,dark background with blurred red and cyan festival lights, gritty urban mood, high.\r\n\r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1772262096_73d78ee9851b.jpg', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"HoliNight\",\"NeonPortrait\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"FestivalVibes\",\"CinematicReels\",\"AIPhotography\",\"ColorSplash\",\"TrendingReels\",\"urbanmood\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-28 07:01:36', NULL, 0, 0),
(845, 'Moonlit Archer Queen', 18, 'Low-angle cinematic portrait in a mystical forest – strength, focus & motion captured with PicPose AI.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'use my photo to create an ultra-realistic fine art low-angle portrait of a young woman in a dense, moonlit forest, captured in dynamic motion. The camera looks up slightly, emphasizing her poised strength as she leaps off the ground, one leg bent, the other extended behind her. Her long, thick blonde curls fly wildly from a half messy bun, lifted dramatically by the wind. She draws a sleek wooden bow to full extension, arrow aimed precisely at her target, eyes locked with fierce focus. Her strapless, floor-length tube dress with a high slit billows around her mid-air, shimmering in an earth-tone ombré gradient of bronze, moss green, and soft brown, blending subtly with the forest surroundings. A delicate gold accent wraps around one arm, catching glimmers of moonlight. Mist swirls near the ground, leaves flutter in the breeze, and fireflies hover faintly, creating a cinematic, ethereal, and intense atmosphere. \r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1772263111_92d0b3458fd7.jpg', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"ForestAesthetic\",\"FineArtAI\",\"CinematicFantasy\",\"EarthToneGlow\",\"MotionCapture\",\"AIRealism\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-28 07:18:31', NULL, 0, 0),
(846, 'Shah Rukh Khan ke Saath Luxury Mumbai Selfie 😍✨', 29, 'Ek dream moment – Mumbai ki luxurious street par SRK ke saath realistic AI selfie!\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A realistic selfie of a young indian man (based on the reference image) taking a selfie on a luxurious street in mumbai. Standing beside him is bollywood superstar shah rukh khan, wearing a stylish black coat, black sunglasses, and sporting a light beard. Both are smiling and looking at the camera. Behind shah rukh khan royce car is parked.\r\nAdd a small, elegant “PicPose” logo at the bottom-left corner, aligned and padded perfectly for a professional, clean finish.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1772265004_382bf2476868.jpg', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"ShahRukhKhanVibes\",\"MumbaiLuxury\",\"BollywoodStyle\",\"AIRealism\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-28 07:50:04', NULL, 0, 0),
(847, 'Fearless Street King on Ducati 🖤🏍️', 17, 'Calm confidence meets raw power. PicPose AI brings attitude and machine together in cinematic perfection.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Create a hyper-realistic full-body shot of a stylish man with a modern hairstyle exuding calm confidence and effortless cool.\r\nHe is sitting casually on a customized white-and-black Ducati XDiavel V4 motorcycle, positioned in a way that highlights both his style and the bike’s sleek design.\r\nHe wears a khaki hoodie, black cargo pants, white sneakers, and sleek black sunglasses, embodying a refined yet rugged street style.\r\nA glossy black helmet rests on the bike’s fuel tank, with his hands placed firmly on it, symbolizing control and readiness.\r\nHis gaze is direct and composed, looking straight ahead with a focused, fearless expression.\r\nThe lighting is dramatic yet natural, emphasizing the textures of his clothing, the gleam of the motorcycle, and the matte finish of the helmet.\r\nUse 8K photorealistic rendering, UHD clarity, and a cinematic tone with soft shadows and subtle reflections to enhance depth and realism.\r\nThe environment should complement the subject — clean background, moody tones, or a minimalist street or studio setup to keep focus on the man and the machine.\r\nBranding: Add “PicPose” seal or subtle text overlay in the bottom-left corner with proper padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1772266845_a1cd2c4d91ad.jpg', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"DucatiXDiavelV4\",\"StreetStyleVibes\",\"8KRealism\",\"CinematicReels\",\"AIPhotography\",\"BikeLifestyle\",\"UrbanConfidence\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"LuxuryRide\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-28 08:20:45', NULL, 0, 1),
(848, 'Giant vs Mini Human 😱', 17, 'Wide-angle cinematic perspective mein ek colossal giant aur uski palm par khada miniature human — ultra detailed 8K realism by PicPose AI.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper realistic, 8k, high-fidelity photograph captured with a wide-angle lens and shallow depth of field, creating a dramatic forced perspective. The composition features a colossal human face and hand on the right side, filling the frame, with the hand extended palm-up towards the left. The giant person, with a full beard and mustache, has their mouth slightly agape in an expression of surprise or speech, looking down towards their palm. On the palm of this giant hand stands a miniature person, appearing tiny in comparison, wearing a black short-sleeved t-shirt and light khaki pants, with dark curly hair. This miniature figure is captured mid-action, with arms slightly bent and legs in a dynamic, running or reacting pose, also with an open mouth as if shouting or speaking. The background is an extremely blurred, warm toned indoor setting, suggesting an office or study with hints of wooden shelves and a blue binder, providing a soft bokeh effect. Cinematic lighting illuminates the scene with soft, warm light, highlighting the highly detailed texture of the skin, hair, and clothing, while maintaining a natural, diffused quality. The character\'s face for both the giant and the miniature person is: uploaded face as reference. \r\nAdd “PicPose” seal or subtle text overlay in the bottom-left corner with proper padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1772345163_06eec485c352.jpg', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"GiantVsMini\",\"8KRealism\",\"ForcedPerspective\",\"HyperRealistic\",\"CinematicShot\",\"AIPhotography\",\"ReelViral\",\"MiniatureWorld\",\"VisualIllusion\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-03-01 06:06:03', NULL, 0, 0),
(849, 'Cartoon Multiverse Magic in 3D', 33, 'Jab iconic characters milte hain ek cinematic 3D world me – pure nostalgia + fun vibes!\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A high quality 3D digital illustration of a smiling young man with wavy dark hair and white-rimmed sunglasses, peeking out from behind a weathered blue wooden door. He is surrounded by a group of iconic cartoon characters in a modern 3D render style, including Tom the cat, Bugs Bunny holding a carrot, Mario, Doraemon, Jerry the mouse, and the Tasmanian Devil. The background features a whimsical, vibrant forest with giant glowing mushrooms and magical bokeh lighting. The composition is vertical, with characters stacked playfully, featuring cinematic lighting, sharp details, and a fun, energetic atmosphere.\r\nAdd “PicPose” seal or subtle text overlay in the bottom-left corner with proper padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1772345900_2005012c8708.jpg', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"3DIllustration\",\"CartoonMultiverse\",\"CinematicReels\",\"TomAndJerry\",\"BugsBunny\",\"MarioStyle\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-03-01 06:18:20', NULL, 0, 1),
(850, 'Holi 8K Ultra Realistic Portrait 🌸', 39, 'Freeze the joy of colors in stunning DSLR 85mm cinematic detail 🌸🎨\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic 8K vertical 9:16 DSLR portrait, 85mm f/1.8, use uploaded face only (100% identical facial structure, no alteration), young woman mid-Holi celebration, eyes closed with joyful smile, head slightly tilted downward, both hands raised softly as if stopping color dust, long brown hair flowing naturally with subtle motion. Wearing vibrant yellow saree with elegant drape and white blouse, minimal traditional jewelry, delicate earrings and bangles, fabric splashed with pink, purple, blue, orange, and yellow gulal. Bright daylight, high shutter speed freezing ultra-sharp flying powder particles, soft cinematic shadows, shallow depth of field, festive crowd softly blurred in background, visible natural skin pores, realistic texture, HDR vibrant color grading, photorealistic capture, no anime/CGI/oversmooth/face change. \r\nAdd a small elegant “PicPose” logo at bottom-left corner with clean padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1772427537_a5d19cab0115.jpg', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"Holi2026\",\"8KPortrait\",\"UltraRealistic\",\"DSLRShot\",\"85mmLens\",\"ColorFestival\",\"GulalVibes\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-03-02 04:57:59', NULL, 0, 0);
