(851, 'AI Trends: The Power Portrait', 27, 'Deep red cinematic background + multi-pose portrait collage powered by PicPose AI ✨\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, 8k, cinematic high-resolution collage image featuring a deep red monochrome background with a large, subtly faded, close-up shot of a person\'s eyes and forehead, occupying the upper two-thirds of the frame. Layered over this background are five smaller, rectangular portrait images of a person, uploaded face as reference, in various poses and expressions, rendered in muted tones or grayscale, arranged dynamically around a central, larger figure. The central figure is a waist-up shot of the person, uploaded face as reference, wearing a brown collared shirt, pointing directly forward towards the viewer with a confident expression, and is prominently outlined with a crisp white glow. The smaller portraits include poses such as a smiling headshot, a profile looking left, a thoughtful pose with a hand to the chin, and a relaxed pose wearing a classic different suits . The overall composition uses a wide-shot perspective, with soft, cinematic lighting highlighting the central figure and providing subtle depth to the background. The bottom center of the image features the white, stylized, handwritten script text \"AI Trends\". The entire composition is meticulously arranged to create a layered, graphic design effect with highly detailed textures and sharp focus on the foreground elements.\r\n\r\nAdd “PicPose” seal or subtle text overlay in the bottom-left corner with proper padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1772428041_1c81919fbd5b.jpg', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"AITrends\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"8KRealism\",\"CreativeCollage\",\"DigitalArtStyle\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-03-02 05:07:21', NULL, 0, 0),
(852, 'Fries Throne Fantasy 🍟', 17, 'Relaxing inside a colossal fry box in a hyper-real 8K cinematic fast-food dreamscape.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic, 8k, medium shot photograph captured with a standard lens and shallow depth of field, showcasing a surreal indoor scene with cinematic lighting. The composition features a normal-sized person, uploaded face as reference, relaxing comfortably inside a colossal, iconic red McDonald\'s French fry box that serves as a deep armchair, leaning against massive, hyper-textured golden fries that act as a plush backrest. The giant red box features the classic yellow arches logo and precise cardboard textures. The person wears a black t-shirt with a subtle \"AI Trends\" logo and white shorts, holding a normal sized paper cup with a straw, looking relaxed. To the left in the foreground, on a highly detailed retro diner table, rests a gigantic, hyper-textured glossy ketchup packet. To the right of the box\'s base, miniature props: a tiny salt shaker and a miniature burger box. The lighting is soft, warm, and directional from the right, casting subtle shadows and highlighting the crispy texture of the fries, the red cardboard, and the person\'s clothing. The background is a softly blurred, 1980s fast-food restaurant interior, creating a pleasing bokeh effect. \r\nAdd “PicPose” seal or subtle text overlay in the bottom-left corner with proper padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1772428969_cef6eb52ca0c.jpg', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"FriesThrone\",\"8KCinematic\",\"SurrealPortrait\",\"FastFoodFantasy\",\"AIRealism\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-03-02 05:22:49', NULL, 0, 0),
(853, 'Flamebound Sorcerer', 17, 'A powerful East Indian sorcerer stands amid blazing embers as a towering spectral Grim Reaper rises behind him in dark, cinematic fantasy.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A cinematic, high-fantasy digital painting of a powerful East Indian sorcerer standing defiantly amidst swirling embers and orange flames. He wears heavy, ornate dark robes with draconic leather textures and silver chains. Towering behind him is a giant, spectral Grim Reaper made of grey smoke and shadows, wielding a massive curved scythe. The atmosphere is dark and gritty with hyper-realistic details, dramatic chiaroscuro lighting, and glowing sparks filling the air.\r\nAdd “PicPose” seal or subtle text overlay in the bottom-left corner with proper padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1772432710_80a1c9d68f85.jpg', NULL, '[\"DarkFantasy\",\"CinematicArt\",\"SorcererVibes\",\"EpicDigitalPainting\",\"GrimReaper\",\"FantasyIllustration\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-03-02 06:25:10', NULL, 0, 0),
(854, 'Neon Streetfighter Nights', 17, 'A hyper-realistic 8K cyberpunk portrait of a man with his matte-black streetfighter motorcycle in a rain-soaked neon alley, wrapped in electric blue smoke and cinematic shadows.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic 8k cinematic photograph captures a man and a custom matte-black streetfighter motorcycle in a narrow, rain-slicked cyberpunk-style alleyway at night. The man, with uploaded face as reference, sits casually on the edge of the motorcycle seat, wearing everyday casual clothes: a simple grey pullover hoodie, faded blue denim jeans, and classic white sneakers. The sleek motorcycle is angled slightly, its single piercing LED headlight slicing through the dark. Vibrant electric blue smoke billows dramatically from a dropped flare on the wet cobblestone floor, swirling around the motorcycle\'s tires and the man\'s feet. The alley walls are covered in dense piping and illuminated by glowing neon signs—one subtly reading \"AI Trends\" casting vibrant pink and cyan reflections onto the wet ground and the motorcycle\'s metallic surfaces. The scene is lit with striking low-key cinematic lighting, emphasizing the contrast between the deep shadows of the alley and the intense volumetric glow of the blue smoke and neon lights, creating a moody, high-contrast editorial aesthetic with sharp focus.\r\nAdd “PicPose” seal or subtle text overlay in the bottom-left corner with proper padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1772515868_57b5f99ae8bd.jpg', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"CyberpunkVibes\",\"StreetfighterStyle\",\"NeonNoir\",\"8KCinematic\",\"moodyportrait\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-03-03 05:31:08', NULL, 0, 0),
(855, 'Midnight Gamer: Giant & Mini Me', 17, 'A surreal 8K cinematic scene where a man and his miniature self relax on a midnight sofa, glowing in neon gaming light.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'A hyper-realistic 8k cinematic photograph captures a giant man and a miniature version of himself relaxing and playing video games on a plush, dark grey living room sofa at midnight. The giant man, with uploaded face as reference, is leaning back, wearing a comfortable, everyday casual outfit: a faded burgundy t-shirt and loose black shorts. He holds a large gaming controller. Resting right beside him on the edge of the sofa cushion is the tiny version of himself, wearing identical casual clothes, intensely watching the glowing screen off-camera. In the background, a subtle neon light on the wall softly glows with the \"AI Trends\" logo. The room is lit with striking, low-key cinematic lighting coming from the dynamic blue and magenta glow of the unseen television, casting dramatic, colorful shadows across both characters. Masterpiece composition, highly detailed textures, sharp focus, and stunning surreal scale details.\r\n\r\nAdd “PicPose” seal or subtle text overlay in the bottom-left corner with proper padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1772516454_a57f995ab492.jpg', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"SurrealScale\",\"MiniMeVibes\",\"8KCinematic\",\"MidnightGaming\",\"AITrends\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-03-03 05:40:54', NULL, 0, 0),
(856, 'Pandora Selfie Moment', 17, 'A cinematic 8K photorealistic selfie with the Na’vi in the glowing jungles of Pandora, blending human realism with bioluminescent fantasy.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Full-body shot of a young man with dark hair and a beard, wearing a denim jacket, white t-shirt, and khaki cargo pants, holding up a smartphone to take a selfie. He is standing in the center of a group of Na\'vi characters from Avatar who are smiling and posing for the photo. The setting is a lush, vibrant jungle on Pandora with glowing alien plants, hanging vines, and a large floating Hallelujah Mountain in the misty background. The lighting is cinematic and soft, blending realistic human textures with the blue, bioluminescent skin of the Na\'vi. High detail, 8k resolution, photorealistic style.\r\n\r\nAdd “PicPose” seal or subtle text overlay in the bottom-left corner with proper padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1772516870_a86b476d6e37.jpg', NULL, '[\"PicPoseAI\",\"PandoraVibes\",\"AvatarInspired\",\"NaViWorld\",\"CinematicFantasy\",\"8KRealism\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-03-03 05:47:50', NULL, 0, 0),
(857, 'Holi Glow in Golden Light', 39, 'A candid Indian couple celebrating Holi in a sunlit village courtyard, wrapped in vibrant gulal and cinematic warmth.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Ultra-realistic 8K cinematic medium shot, vertical 9:16, candid happy Indian couple celebrating Holi in a soft-focus village courtyard under golden afternoon light. Both in white cotton outfits heavily splashed with pink, yellow, and green gulal. Woman laughing brightly holding brass pichkari, man beside her smiling with decorated wooden pichkari. Warm backlight creating soft rim glow on hair and powder mist, marigold-decorated tree blurred in background, vibrant color clouds frozen mid-air, realistic skin texture, sharp focus on faces, shallow depth of field, DSLR 85mm look, HDR, no CGI, no anime.\r\n\r\nAdd “PicPose” seal or subtle text overlay in the bottom-left corner with proper padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1772524564_70e437801a91.jpg', NULL, '[\"HoliVibes\",\"GoldenHourMagic\",\"IndianCouple\",\"CinematicPortrait\",\"ColorSplash\",\"PicPoseAI\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-03-03 07:56:04', NULL, 0, 0),
(858, 'Neon Samurai Requiem', 17, 'A cybernetic warrior kneels in a misty forest shrine, glowing with lime energy under the rain-soaked ancient trees.\r\n📝 Step-by-Step Guide:\r\n1️⃣ Open 👉 Google Gemini\r\n2️⃣ Upload your photo 📷\r\n3️⃣ Copy & paste this prompt ⬇️', 'Full-body shot of a young Japanese man in intricate matte-black bio-mechanical samurai power armor, kneeling on a wet stone path in a misty ancient forest shrine. The armor features glowing neon lime-green accents and complex hydraulic joints. He has large, mechanical wing-like thrusters on his back with glowing translucent green blades. He holds a serrated katana with a glowing lime-green energy blade. The background shows weathered stone lanterns and moss-covered guardian lion statues (komainu) under towering cedar trees. Cinematic lighting, hyper-realistic, 8k resolution, moody atmosphere, rainy day aesthetic.\r\n\r\nAdd “PicPose” seal or subtle text overlay in the bottom-left corner with proper padding.', 'uploads/ai_posts_pic/1772535510_65fb62fe2cf1.jpg', NULL, '[\"NeonSamurai\",\"CyberArmor\",\"BioMechanical\",\"Cinematic8K\",\"RainyAesthetic\",\"PicPoseAI\"]', NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 'FREE', 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-03-03 10:58:30', NULL, 0, 0);
